#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/00_The_Great_Continent.cfg:176
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:933
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:939
