#. [message]: speaker=Dverag-Kukai
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:489
msgid "Are all the fishmen in cages yet?"
msgstr "鱼人们都关进笼子里了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Managa'Gwin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:493
msgid "Almost."
msgstr "快了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Managa'Gwin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:495
msgid ""
"UP, SEA LICE! Drag your slimy hides from the deep! Drop the pearls, then "
"scuttle back to your cages!"
msgstr "给我起来,海虱子!把你们黏糊糊的皮从深海里拖出来!把珍珠交出来,然后缩回你们的牢笼里去!"

#. [floating_text]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:515
msgid "+120 gold"
msgstr "+120金币"

#. [floating_text]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:515
msgid "+160 gold"
msgstr "+160金币"

#. [floating_text]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:515
msgid "+40 gold"
msgstr "+40金币"

#. [floating_text]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:515
msgid "+80 gold"
msgstr "+80金币"

#. [message]: speaker=Gwaba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:532
msgid "Nepba, it’s noon. The orcs are groggy and sleepy. This is our moment!"
msgstr "内巴,现在是正午。兽人昏昏欲睡。就是我们的机会!"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:536
msgid "Let’s just take a look around for now. We must not act rashly."
msgstr "我们只是先四处看看。不能鲁莽行事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Gwaba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:540
msgid ""
"I looked this morning and the door to the cave with the Trident of Storms is "
"open! When the others see that we’ve reclaimed it, they’ll rise up and we’ll "
"finally drive out the orcs!"
msgstr "我今早看过,存放风暴三叉戟的洞穴门开着!等其他人看到我们夺回了它,他们就会起义,我们终于能把兽人赶出去!"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:544
msgid ""
"I don’t like our odds. Someone could shoot us from the castle while we swim "
"to the entrance."
msgstr "我不看好我们的胜算。我们游向入口的途中,城堡里可能有人向我们射箭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Gwaba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:548
msgid ""
"Let’s try swimming around the cave. There are cliffs and kelp that are easy "
"to hide in."
msgstr "我们试试绕着洞穴游。那里有悬崖和海藻,很容易藏身。"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:554
msgid "Gwaba, wait!"
msgstr "格瓦巴,等一下!"

#. [message]: speaker=Bugg
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:577
msgid ""
"Chief, I went to throw some trash in the sea and shot a fishman creeping up "
"on the Trident!"
msgstr "首领,我去扔点垃圾进海里,结果把一个偷偷靠近三叉戟的鱼人给捅了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Dverag-Kukai
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:581
msgid ""
"They’re planning an uprising! Drasha, have you managed to harness the power "
"of the Trident yet?"
msgstr "他们在策划起义!德拉莎,你驾驭三叉戟的力量了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Drasha
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:585
msgid "Not yet, no."
msgstr "还没有。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dverag-Kukai
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:589
msgid ""
"Lock yourself in the cave until you can get the Trident to send a storm that "
"destroys their villages. They need to be punished."
msgstr "把自己关在洞穴里,直到能让三叉戟掀起一场风暴,摧毁他们的村庄。他们必须受到惩罚。"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:649
msgid ""
"Your Highness! Thank you for answering our plea for help. I am Nepba. We are "
"all grateful you have come, but you must hurry!"
msgstr "殿下!感谢您响应我们的求援。我是内巴。我们都很感激您的到来,但您必须抓紧!"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:653
msgid ""
"The orcs have stolen our Trident of Storms and are now trying to harness its "
"power to destroy our villages. They already killed my cousin Gwaba!"
msgstr "兽人偷走了我们的风暴三叉戟,现在正试图驾驭它的力量摧毁我们的村庄。他们已经杀了我的堂兄格瓦巴!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:658
msgid "Delfador, can you do anything to stop them?"
msgstr "德法多,你能做什么来阻止他们吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:662
msgid ""
"I feel the magic of the Trident... it is old, and powerful. Perhaps my "
"spells could break it, but the power unleashed would do immeasurable damage "
"to this place."
msgstr "我感受到了三叉戟的魔法……它古老而强大。或许我的法术能击破它,但释放出的力量会对这个地方造成无法估量的破坏。"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:667
msgid ""
"We can take the Trident back from the orcs, but it is locked away in a cave. "
"They keep the key on land, where my kind cannot easily go."
msgstr "我们可以从兽人手里夺回三叉戟,但它被锁在洞穴里。他们把钥匙放在岸上,我的族人不容易去的地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:674
msgid "We’ll help you, Nepba. Let’s get the key and reclaim your Trident."
msgstr "我们来帮你,内巴。我们去拿钥匙,夺回你的三叉戟。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:683
msgid "Get the key on 32,28; then attack the Orcish Shaman"
msgstr "取得32,28处的钥匙;然后攻击兽人萨满"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:690
msgid "Attack the Orcish Shaman"
msgstr "攻击兽人萨满"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:715
msgid ""
"Konrad, we merfolk are eager to fight for our freedom. My people will join "
"you when you liberate our villages."
msgstr "康拉德,我们河族渴望为自由而战。一旦你解放我们的村庄,我的族人就会加入你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bugg
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:733
msgid "But chief, why are we only using bats and nagas?"
msgstr "不过老大，为什么我们只用蝙蝠和娜迦？"

#. [message]: speaker=Dverag-Kukai
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:737
msgid ""
"Because we need to control the seas and the merfolk, and nagas and bats are "
"best for doing that!"
msgstr "因为我们得控制海洋，而人鱼、娜迦和蝙蝠在这方面最在行了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Bugg
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:741
msgid "But orcs are the most powerful race in all of..."
msgstr "可我们兽人天下最强……"

#. [message]: speaker=Dverag-Kukai
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:745
msgid "Shut up, worm! I’m the boss!"
msgstr "住口，蠢货！我才是老大！"

#. [message]: speaker=Bugg
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:755
msgid "Look at me!"
msgstr "看着我!"

#. [message]: speaker=Bugg
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:765
msgid "Ha ha ha! Now orcs will rule over land and sea!"
msgstr "哈哈哈！以后兽人将会统治陆地和海洋！"

#. [message]: speaker=Dverag-Kukai
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:772
msgid "(Sigh) Will someone kill this fool for me, please?"
msgstr "（叹）谁能帮我杀了这个白痴？"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:781
msgid "But... but... how can this be happening to me?"
msgstr "但……但……这怎么会在我身上发生？"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:791
msgid "That’s for Gwaba!"
msgstr "这是为格瓦巴的!"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:805
msgid "Who was that fool?"
msgstr "那白痴是谁？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:822
msgid ""
"We have the key to the cave now! Let’s stop the shaman before it’s too late."
msgstr "我们现在拿到洞穴的钥匙了!趁还来得及,去阻止萨满。"

#. [message]: speaker=Drasha
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:849
msgid "Arrgh! No! They broke my concentration — the Trident is out of control!"
msgstr "嗬啊!不!他们打乱了我的专注——三叉戟失控了!"

#. [message]: race=merman
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:855
msgid "It was never rightfully yours."
msgstr "它从来就不该属于你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:861
msgid "I am sure the Trident will yield to <i>me</i> much more readily."
msgstr "我确信三叉戟会更轻易地屈服于<i>我</i>。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:896
msgid ""
"We’re running out of time. If we cannot reclaim the Trident of Storms soon, "
"the orcs will use it to wreak great destruction upon the merfolk!"
msgstr "我们的时间不多了。如果我们不能尽快夺回风暴三叉戟,兽人将用它对河族降下巨大的破坏!"

#. [message]: speaker=Drasha
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:912
msgid "Finally!"
msgstr "终于!"

#. [message]: speaker=Drasha
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:914
msgid "The trident has yielded to my power!"
msgstr "三叉戟屈服于我的力量了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Nepba
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:920
msgid "No!"
msgstr "否！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:936
msgid ""
"We were too slow, and the merfolk’s villages have been destroyed! How could "
"I let this happen?"
msgstr "我们太迟了,河族的村庄被毁了!我怎么会让这种事发生?"

#. [message]: race=merman
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:978
msgid ""
"Your Royal Highness, Prince Konrad, protector of the oppressed! Thank you "
"for saving us from our enemies and helping us to reclaim our sacred Trident!"
msgstr "尊敬的殿下,康拉德王子,受压迫者的保护者!谢谢您从敌人手中救下我们,并帮助我们夺回神圣的三叉戟!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:982
msgid "From now on, your pearls belong to you and you alone."
msgstr "从现在起,你们的珍珠只属于你们自己。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:984
msgid ""
"Konrad can now recruit Merman Fighters, Hunters, Brawlers, and Initiates!"
msgstr "康拉德现在可以招募人鱼斗士、猎人、搏斗手和见习者!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:987
msgid "Can we take the Trident with us? It seems like it could be very useful."
msgstr "我们能把三叉戟带走吗?它看起来会非常有用。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:992
msgid ""
"No, Konrad. It is set firmly in the rock. And for good reason, too! The "
"Trident of Storms helps maintain the delicate balance of the Bay of Pearls "
"and protects the merfolk from the fierce power of the sea."
msgstr "不,康拉德。它深深嵌在岩石里。而且有充分的原因!风暴三叉戟维持着珍珠湾微妙的平衡,保护河族免受大海狂暴之力的侵害。"

#. [message]: race=merman
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:998
msgid ""
"If it were that easy, the orcs would have looted it long ago. But no hand "
"can pry it from the rock in which it is embedded. It is just as well, for "
"its power protects my people from the often terrible power of the sea."
msgstr "如果那么容易,兽人早就抢走了。但没有任何手能把它从嵌着的岩石里撬出来。这倒也好,因为它的力量保护着我族人,免受大海时常可怕之力的侵扰。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/04_The_Bay_of_Pearls.cfg:1003
msgid "(sigh) I knew it wouldn’t be that easy."
msgstr "(叹气)我就知道不会那么顺利。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:10
msgid "scenario name^The Isle of Alduin"
msgstr "奥渡因岛"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:50
msgid "Yaerby"
msgstr "亚尔比"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:191
msgid "Alyra"
msgstr "艾莉拉"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2lieutenant
#. ship can't be from Weldyn, because Elensefar might still be held by Maddock right now.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:215
msgid ""
"They’re all locked up? Good. The ship from Fort Tahn will be here any day "
"now, and then we can finally get these troublemakers off the Isle."
msgstr "他们都被关起来了?很好。塔恩要塞的船很快就要到了,然后我们终于能把这些惹事的人赶出岛了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:219
msgid ""
"Is all this really necessary? I mean— back in my day... Just a few drunken "
"words... Hardly worth being press-ganged, I don’t think..."
msgstr "这些真有必要吗?我是说——在我当年……不过是几句醉话而已……我可不觉得值得被抓起来……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:223
msgid ""
"If we let a few apprentices speak ill of the queen, how long until they all "
"do? Don’t forget whose royal endorsement secured you your position, Seimus."
msgstr "如果我们放任几个学徒说女王的坏话,要不了多久他们就会全都这么说。别忘了,是你的哪位王室恩主保住了你的位置,塞缪斯。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:242
msgid ""
"Hail, scholars of Alduin! I’ve heard much about your home! I’ve even heard "
"that there are some of you brave enough to stand up to the dark queen."
msgstr "奥德温的学者们,你们好!我听说过很多关于你们家园的事!我还听说,你们当中有些人勇敢到敢起来对抗暗之女王。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:246
msgid ""
"Who’re you to ask, stranger? That kind of talk can be dangerous. Did you see "
"what happened to our locked-up friends?"
msgstr "你是谁,凭什么问,陌生人?说那种话很危险。你看到我们那些被关起来的朋友下场了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:250
msgid ""
"Who am I? I am Konrad, son of Prince Arand and heir to the throne of "
"Wesnoth! I am Asheviere’s sworn enemy, and would welcome to my cause all who "
"would oppose her!"
msgstr "我是谁?我是康拉德,阿兰德王子之子,韦诺特王位的继承人!我是艾什薇尔的宿敌,欢迎所有与她为敌的人加入我的事业!"

#. [message]: speaker=Alyra
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:254
msgid ""
"Konrad? The one they call “the false prince”! I— I wasn’t even sure you "
"existed!"
msgstr "康拉德?就是他们所说的“假王子”?我——我甚至都不确定你真实存在!"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:258
msgid ""
"Do you really think you can beat the queen? Is your whole rebel army here?!"
msgstr "你真觉得你能打败女王?你的整支叛军都在?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:262
msgid ""
"Now now, everybody just calm down. We don’t want any trouble. If you really "
"are Konrad then you’d best leave right now, before the queen’s soldiers "
"catch you."
msgstr "好了好了,大家冷静点。我们不想惹事。如果你真的是康拉德,趁女王的士兵没抓到你,你最好马上离开。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:266
msgid ""
"Don’t listen to him, Konrad. Soldiers from Wesnoth have locked up our "
"friends. They dared to criticize the throne, and now they’ve been both "
"expelled and imprisoned."
msgstr "别听他的,康拉德。韦诺特的士兵把我们朋友锁起来了。他们敢于批评王座,结果不仅被开除了,还被关进监狱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:270
msgid ""
"You have to help us rescue them! Many of the older apprentices here think "
"like Seimus, but my friends and I will fight with you!"
msgstr "你一定要帮我们救他们!这里很多年纪大的学徒都跟塞缪斯一个想法,但我和我的朋友们愿意跟你一起战斗!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:274
msgid "You can now advance Mages to Red Mages!"
msgstr "现在可以将法师升阶为红袍法师!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:275
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Mages, and advance them to (only) Red Mages!"
msgstr "康拉德现在可以招募法师,并且只能把他们升阶为红袍法师!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:279
msgid "Of course I will help. To battle!"
msgstr "当然我会帮忙。上战场!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:287
msgid "Reach the prisoner mages, then move one near Konrad’s keep."
msgstr "找到被俘法师,然后将其中一名移到康拉德的城楼附近。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:296
msgid "Move any prisoner mage to one of the marked hexes."
msgstr "将任意一名被俘法师移动到标记的六角格之一。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:306
msgid "(gain a loyal Arch Mage)"
msgstr "(获得一位忠诚的大法师)"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:314
#| msgid "Death of Konrad"
msgid "Death of all prisoner mages"
msgstr "科纳德死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:341
msgid ""
"Seimus! My old colleague, what has come over you? There are soldiers "
"occupying the Isle and you do nothing?"
msgstr "塞缪斯!我的老同事,你怎么了?士兵们占领了整座岛,你却什么都不做?"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:345
msgid ""
"Delfador!? You’re here too? ...well, surely you know that Alduin is in no "
"position to oppose the crown. I mean, we’re not all cut out to be rebels "
"like you."
msgstr "德法多!?你也在这里?……好吧,你肯定知道奥德温没有条件对抗王冠。我是说,我们可不是每个人都像你一样天生就是当叛军的料。"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:349
msgid ""
"And those chained up apprentices really are troublemakers. Really! It’s not "
"that I wouldn’t like to help. I would! But Alduin has a future to think "
"about!"
msgstr "那些被锁起来的学徒确实是在惹事。真的是!不是我不想帮忙。我是想!但奥德温有未来要顾!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:353
msgid ""
"You’ll recall that I was a troublemaker once. How many atrocities will "
"happen because good men like you stay silent?"
msgstr "你会想起来,我曾经也是个惹事的人。因为你们这些正人君子保持沉默,还会有多少暴行发生?"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:357
msgid "Ignore him, Seimus. Attack, or I will have you charged with treason!"
msgstr "别理他,塞缪斯。攻击,否则我将以叛国罪逮捕你!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:361
msgid ""
"The Seimus I knew would never stoop so low! What good is a master who "
"abandons his apprentices!"
msgstr "我认识的塞缪斯绝不会堕落到这种地步!一个抛弃自己学徒的导师,还有什么资格!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:365
#| msgid "Well, we... we..."
msgid "Oh... well..."
msgstr "恩，我们……我们……"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:375
msgid ""
"Alright. Okay! Lieutenant, I will not assist you against our own students. "
"If I am to be branded a rebel, so be it."
msgstr "好吧。好!中尉,我不会协助你对付我们自己的学生。如果因此要给我扣上叛徒的帽子,那就扣吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:379
msgid "Traitor!"
msgstr "叛徒!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:383
msgid ""
"Delfador, I cannot fight alongside you now, but neither will I fight against "
"you. I must assemble the faculty and make clear Alduin’s new allegiance."
msgstr "德法多,我现在不能与你并肩作战,但也不会与你为敌。我必须召集教职员工,明确奥德温的新立场。"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:387
msgid ""
"And, if you can clear Asheviere’s soldiers off the Isle entirely, I promise "
"to personally join your army!"
msgstr "而且,如果你能把艾什薇尔的士兵从岛上彻底赶出去,我保证亲自加入你的军队!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Seimus, don’t just stand there. There are rebels on the Isle! Put that magic "
"training to good use and throw some fireballs!"
msgstr "塞缪斯,别干站着。岛上有叛军!把你学的那点魔法派上用场,扔几个火球!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:409
msgid ""
"Rebels? Well... I mean... the worst of the trouble is more or less "
"apprentices, isn’t it? You can hardly expect faculty to fight students!"
msgstr "叛军?呃……我是说……闹事最凶的大多是学徒,不是吗?你总不能指望教职员工跟学生打仗吧!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:413
msgid ""
"That’s precisely what I expect, provost. There are no students in Konrad’s "
"army — only rebels. Prove your loyalty to the queen."
msgstr "这正是我所期望的,院长。康拉德的军队里没有学生——只有叛军。向女王证明你的忠诚。"

#. [message]: id=Elrian,Alyra
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:426
msgid ""
"Academy housing is down this way, Konrad. There’re many other students "
"there, but I think most of them are trying to keep their heads down."
msgstr "学院宿舍在这边,康拉德。那里还有许多其他学生,但我觉得大多数都在试图夹着尾巴做人。"

#. [message]: type=Shackled Mage, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:441
msgid "I hear sounds of fighting outside! Should we do something?"
msgstr "我听到外面有打斗声!我们应该做点什么吗?"

#. [message]: type=Shackled Mage, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:446
msgid "I would if I could get out of these manacles..."
msgstr "要是能摆脱这些手铐,我愿意……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:458
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:268
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:759
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:808
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1867
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "呃……"

#. [message]: type=Shackled Mage
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:481
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:498
msgid "Who are you! What’s going on?"
msgstr "你们是谁!发生什么事了?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:485
msgid ""
"I’m a friend. We have to go — there’s no time to cut loose your shackles. "
"Are you willing to help us fight Asheviere?"
msgstr "我是朋友。我们必须走了——没时间解开你的锁链了。你愿意帮我们一起对抗艾什薇尔吗?"

#. [message]: type=Shackled Mage
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:489
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:506
msgid "Better than rotting in here. Come on, everyone, we’re leaving!"
msgstr "总比在这里烂掉强。大家,我们走!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:502
msgid ""
"I’m a friend. Come — let us cut loose your shackles. Are you willing to help "
"us fight Asheviere?"
msgstr "我是朋友。来——我们解开你的锁链。你愿意帮我们一起对抗艾什薇尔吗?"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:541
#| msgid "We need to make it into the caves of the dwarves."
msgid "We need more gold! Send in the reserves."
msgstr "我们需要想办法到矮人的洞穴里去。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. the speaker is a level 1 "Shackled Mage", who's just received an AMLA
#. Shackled Mages are very weak, but when this scenario ends he/she will transform into a regular Mage, keeping the AMLA (including the downside: +20% XP cost)
#. this mechanic is a little silly, but not at all important to winning/losing this scenario, so we lampshade it with this line of dialogue
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:562
msgid "I’m going to be so strong if I ever get out of these shackles..."
msgstr "要是能摆脱这些锁链,我一定会变得很强……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:563
msgid "female^I’m going to be so strong if I ever get out of these shackles..."
msgstr "要是能摆脱这些锁链,我一定会变得很强……"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:592
msgid "Wait! Stop! Please don’t kill me!"
msgstr "等等!住手!求你别杀我!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:596
msgid ""
"I’m not going to kill you, provost. But I can see that you’re a coward. Run. "
"And as long as you live, never forget what would’ve happened to your "
"apprentices had I not been here to help."
msgstr "我不会杀你,院长。但我看得出你是个胆小鬼。滚吧。只要你还活着,就永远不要忘记,要不是我赶到,你的学徒们会有什么下场。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:626
msgid "Asheviere’s armies are defeated! We’ve won!"
msgstr "艾什薇尔的军队被击败了!我们赢了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:634
msgid ""
"You... you really did it! Incredible! Alduin is in your debt, Delfador. And "
"Konrad. And you apprentices too!"
msgstr "你……你真的做到了!不可思议!奥德温欠你们人情,德法多。康拉德。还有你们这些学徒!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:638
msgid ""
"And, well, I made a promise to join you if you wiped those soldiers out. And "
"I intend to keep it. I place myself at your service, young master."
msgstr "还有,呃,我说过,如果你歼灭了那些士兵,我就会加入你。我打算信守承诺。我愿听候你的差遣,年轻的领袖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:657
msgid ""
"We’ve done well to defeat Asheviere’s leaders on the isle, but we still need "
"to rescue the prisoners and escape before reinforcements arrive."
msgstr "我们顺利击败了艾什薇尔岛上的首脑,但在援军抵达之前,我们还必须救出俘虏并撤离。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:673
msgid ""
"We set out to save lives, but we lost many more than we helped. I’m sorry we "
"couldn’t do better, but at least we’ve shown the people here that Asheviere "
"can be beaten."
msgstr "我们出发去救人性命,结果失去的远比救下的多。很抱歉我们没能做得更好,但至少,我们向这里的人证明了,艾什薇尔是可以被打败的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:679
msgid "We’ve saved everyone we could! Now it’s time for us to save ourselves."
msgstr "我们救了所有能救的人!现在,该救我们自己了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:686
msgid ""
"Live not in fear, Alduin! Once I’m king I will return here to set things "
"right."
msgstr "别活在恐惧里,阿尔德温!等我登基为王,我会回来,把一切理顺。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:692
msgid ""
"Live not in fear, Alduin, for today proves that Asheviere can be beaten! "
"Once I’m king I will return here to set things right."
msgstr "别活在恐惧里,阿尔德温,因为今天证明了,艾什薇尔是可以被打败的!等我登基为王,我会回来,把一切理顺。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:713
msgid ""
"All of the prisoners we set out to rescue are dead! This has been a "
"disaster..."
msgstr "我们本来要去救的所有俘虏,全都死了!这是一场灾难……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:727
msgid ""
"Asheviere’s soldiers spoke of a royal ship coming to take the imprisoned "
"mages away. If we take too long to finish our work here, that ship will "
"surely arrive with reinforcements and defeat us."
msgstr "艾什薇尔的士兵提到,有一艘王家船只要来,把被囚禁的法师们带走。如果我们在这里耽搁太久,那艘船必定带着援兵赶到,击败我们。"

#. [message]: role=ship
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:736
msgid ""
"Hail, Alduin! We’re here on schedule with a fresh rotation of guards for the "
"garrison. It looks like you need them!"
msgstr "阿尔德温,你们好!我们按时到了,带来一批轮值守卫替换守军。看来你们正需要他们!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/06_The_Isle_of_Alduin.cfg:740
msgid ""
"Oh no! Asheviere’s soldiers have been reinforced! We cannot flee while their "
"ship controls the waters, and we cannot afford the time to stop and fight..."
msgstr "哦,不!艾什薇尔的士兵得到增援了!她的船控制着水面,我们无法逃走,也没时间停下来作战……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:18
msgid "scenario name^Muff Malal’s Peninsula"
msgstr "玛夫·玛拉尔的半岛"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:236
msgid "What’s going on here? Stop attacking that helpless man!"
msgstr "这里发生了什么事?别再攻击那个手无寸铁的人了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Muff Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:240
msgid ""
"I warned you not to interrupt! I’m BUSY! And for the record, HE attacked ME, "
"while I was peacefully minding my own business killing innocent townsfolk."
msgstr "我警告过你,别来打断!我很忙!而且说清楚了,是他先攻击我的,我不过是安安静静地、忙着屠杀无辜的市民而已。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#. vague reference to the events of UtBS
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:245
msgid ""
"For at the end of days, the texts prophesy a great destruction, yea, the sun "
"itself shall rain down from the heavens as sulfur and fire!"
msgstr "因为世界末日之日,经文预言了一场浩劫,是的,太阳本身将化作硫磺与火焰,从天空坠落!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:249
msgid ""
"And lo! The unclean dead shall be smitten down, and lo! There shall be peace "
"eternal for all men. So readeth the texts."
msgstr "看哪!污秽的死者将被诛灭,看哪!所有人都将获得永恒的安宁。经文如此记载。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:253
msgid "Yet until then, it falls to those such as me to do the smiting!"
msgstr "而在那之前,就由我这样的人来挥剑讨伐!"

#. [message]: speaker=Muff Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:258
msgid ""
"Such an annoyance. Just stay out of my way until I’ve dealt with these "
"newcomers, will you? I’ll have plenty of time to finish you off later!"
msgstr "真碍事。在我收拾完这些新来的之前,别挡我的路,行吗?我待会儿有的是时间慢慢收拾你!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:264
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:265
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:269
msgid ""
"We must make haste if we wish to save that warrior, Konrad! I sense magical "
"power in him, but one man alone will not prevail against the hordes of "
"undead that roam this peninsula."
msgstr "如果我们想救那位战士,必须加快速度,康拉德!我感觉到他体内有魔法力量,但一个人,无法战胜游荡在这片半岛上的死者大军。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:266
msgid ""
"20 against 1 is pretty long odds, Konrad. If we’re goin’ to help that "
"warrior before he’s overwhelmed, we’d better hurry things up."
msgstr "二十比一,这赔率可不小,康拉德。如果我们想在他被淹没之前赶到,帮他一把,最好加快点。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:267
msgid ""
"We must ride swiftly if we wish to save that warrior, Konrad! He looks to be "
"a skilled fighter, but one man alone will not prevail against the hordes of "
"undead that roam this peninsula."
msgstr "如果我们想救那位战士,必须快马加鞭,康拉德!他看起来是个武艺高强的战士,但一个人,无法战胜游荡在这片半岛上的死者大军。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:268
msgid ""
"We should hurry if we’re hoping to save that warrior, Konrad! I sense "
"magical power in him, but one man alone will not prevail against the hordes "
"of undead that roam this peninsula."
msgstr "如果我们想救那位战士,最好抓紧,康拉德!我感觉到他体内有魔法力量,但一个人,无法战胜游荡在这片半岛上的死者大军。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:270
msgid ""
"20-’gainst-1 fer that warrior, now them’s long odds e’en if he were a dwarf! "
"Tha’ long-staff sixpenny sorcerer’ll be having a change o’ heart — "
"literally! — once we’re through with ’im!"
msgstr "二十比一,对付那位战士,那赔率可太高了,哪怕他是个矮人!我们收拾完那个拿长杖的六便士法师,他的心就会——字面意义上的——改变过来啦!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:271
msgid ""
"Oh, oh my. That magical warrior looks rather, err, powerful, doesn’t he? But "
"that’s also a lot, really quite many undead surrounding him. We’d better "
"hurry if we want to save him."
msgstr "哦,天哪。那个会魔法的战士看起来相当,呃,强大,不是吗?但包围他的死者也真的很多,相当多。如果我们想救他,最好抓紧。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:272
msgid ""
"Dat holy man be lookin’ mighty strong, but Dosh is thinking there’s too many "
"o’ dem undead e’en for him. We’d better be helpin’ him out, Konrad."
msgstr "那位神圣之人看起来真厉害,但道什觉得,那些死者太多了,连他一人也未必应付得了。我们最好去帮他,康拉德。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:273
msgid ""
"We’d better move quickly and help fight! That warrior looks powerful, but "
"the necromancer has the advantage of numbers."
msgstr "我们最好赶紧行动,加入战斗!那位战士看起来很强,但亡灵法师占着人数上的优势。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:277
msgid "Get ready for battle, everyone!"
msgstr "准备战斗,各位!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:285
msgid "Defeat Muff Malal"
msgstr "击败玛夫·玛拉尔"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:299
msgid "Moremirmu will join you if you move any unit adjacent to him."
msgstr "若你移动任意单位到莫里姆相邻处,他会加入你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:314
msgid ""
"I read about this place in Delfador’s books. The peninsula of pearls was "
"once home to several small towns, thriving off of the pearl trade. Farmers, "
"fishers... Muff Malal must have killed them all, while the queen’s armies "
"did nothing to help."
msgstr "我在德法多的书里读到过这个地方。珍珠半岛曾是几个小镇的家园,靠珍珠贸易繁盛。农民、渔民……马夫-玛拉尔一定把他们全都杀了,而女王的军队对此无所作为。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:317
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:318
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:319
msgid ""
"More of her politicking, I fear. By allowing necromancy to flourish in the "
"kingdom’s western regions, Asheviere forces us to devote time and resources "
"to protecting the townsfolk — time we can no longer spend fighting her "
"directly."
msgstr "恐怕又是她的一套政治手腕。任由亡灵魔法在王国西部地区蔓延,艾什薇尔就逼着我们把时间和资源用来保护市民——而这些时间,我们已经无法再用于直接对抗她了。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:320
msgid ""
"At Alduin I’ve seen students expelled just for speaking the word "
"“necromancy”. And here Asheviere won’t even act when an entire town is "
"destroyed. She’ll work with anyone she finds useful."
msgstr "在阿尔德温,我亲眼见过学生因为说出“亡灵魔法”这个词就被开除。而这里,一整个镇子被毁,艾什薇尔却连装都不装。她跟任何她觉得有用的人合作。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:321
msgid ""
"Hmmph. At Alduin we’ve expelled students just for speaking the word "
"“necromancy”. And here Asheviere won’t even act when an entire town is "
"destroyed. She’ll work with anyone she finds useful."
msgstr "哼。在阿尔德温,学生光是说出“亡灵魔法”这个词就会被开除。而这里,一整个镇子被毁,艾什薇尔却连装都不装。她跟任何她觉得有用的人合作。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:322
msgid ""
"Aye, tha’ human-queen ’o yers is a filthy, white-livered, chicken-hearted "
"skinflint o’ a poltroon, she is! Dinnae you worry son, when we git our hands "
"on her ah’ll tear her queenly flesh t’ shreds!"
msgstr "是,你们那位人类女王,是个肮脏的、白心子的、没胆量的、一毛不拔的窝囊废!别担心,孩子,等我们把她抓住,我要把她的女王皮撕个粉碎!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:323
msgid ""
"She’s a real piece of work, isn’t she? I’ll bet she let this happen on "
"purpose, to keep all us rebels busy while she be livin’ luxury up in Weldyn. "
"If’n not for Baldras and Relana, one o’ these dead folk could’ve been me..."
msgstr "她可真够能耐,不是吗?我打赌她是故意放任这事发生的,好让我们这些反叛者全都自顾不暇,而她在维尔帝那边过尽奢华的生活。要不是有巴尔德拉斯和蕾拉娜,其中一个死者本来可以是我的……"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:324
msgid ""
"I’ve visited this place before, to buy supplies from the fishermen... It’s "
"rather terrible to see what’s become of it now."
msgstr "我以前来过这里,向渔民们买过补给……看到它如今变成这样,实在惨不忍睹。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:344
msgid ""
"Lo and behold! I stood in need of aid, and so aid has come! What brings you "
"to Muff Malal’s peninsula, pilgrims?"
msgstr "看哪!我正当急需援助之际,援助便来了!是什么风把你们这些朝圣者,吹到了马夫-玛拉尔的半岛?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:348
msgid ""
"I am Konrad, heir to the throne of Wesnoth, and seeking to reclaim my seat "
"from the evil queen Asheviere! Who are you?"
msgstr "我是康拉德,韦诺特王位的继承人,誓要从邪恶女王艾什薇尔手中夺回我的王座!你是谁?"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:352
msgid ""
"Brother Moremirmu, wandering warrior, at your service. Rejoice, for it seems "
"the strands of fate have brought us here together, that we may unite in arms "
"towards the vanquishing of evil!"
msgstr "莫里姆兄弟,漂泊的战士,听候你的差遣。欢欣吧,看来命运的丝线把我们带到了一起,让我们联合起来讨伐邪恶!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:357
msgid ""
"Aid me in my quest against this foul necromancer, and I shall ever-more be "
"your loyal companion in the eternal war against the darkness!"
msgstr "助我讨伐这个污秽的亡灵法师,我将永远是你在对抗黑暗这场永恒战争中的忠诚伙伴!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:373
msgid ""
"The Light rebukes you, foul creature of the night! In a blaze of brilliance "
"shall you be purged!"
msgstr "光明责备你,夜间的污秽生物!你将在这辉煌的烈焰中被净除!"

#. [message]: speaker=Muff Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:388
msgid "Curse you all! The queen promised I would be left in peace here..."
msgstr "你们都要遭殃!女王答应让我在这里安生……"

#. [message]: speaker=Muff Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:404
msgid ""
"Ugh, forget this! I’m not wasting any more time here with you — time for my "
"dashing escape!"
msgstr "唉,算了吧!我可不想再浪费时间和你在这里——该上演我的风流逃脱了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Muff Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:422
msgid ""
"Gah, where did all these piranhas come from? There’s too much rotting meat "
"in the water!"
msgstr "嘎,这些食人鱼都是从哪儿冒出来的?水里腐烂的肉太多了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Muff Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:429
msgid "(Gurgle gurgle gurgle...)"
msgstr "(咕噜咕噜咕噜……)"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:444
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:452
msgid ""
"The necromancer is defeated, and the countryside is safe once more! Good "
"work, everybody."
msgstr "亡灵法师被击败了,乡间重归安宁!干得好,各位。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:456
msgid ""
"The Light shall always find the Light, and so have I found you! Let us quest "
"on together in opposition to the dark queen!"
msgstr "光明总会找到光明,而我找到了你!让我们一同踏上征程,对抗黑暗女王吧!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/07_Muff_Malals_Peninsula.cfg:461
msgid ""
"The necromancer is defeated, and the countryside is safe once more! I am "
"sorry that Moremirmu has perished, but at least he did not die in vain. Now "
"we must continue onwards!"
msgstr "亡灵法师被击败了,乡间重归安宁!很抱歉莫里姆死了,但至少他没有死得毫无意义。现在我们必须继续前进!"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:8
msgid "scenario name^Isle of the Damned"
msgstr "被诅咒者之岛"

#. [side]: type=Bone Shooter, id=leader3
#. [side]: type=Necrophage, id=leader4
#. [side]
#. [side]: type=Deathblade, id=leader3
#. [side]: type=Skeleton Archer, id=leader4
#. [side]: type=Revenant, id=leader5
#. [side]: type={TYPE}, id={ID}
#. [side]: type=Death Knight, id=Lionel
#. [side]: type={ON_DIFFICULTY4 Necrophage Necrophage Ghast Ghast}, id=leader2
#. [side]: id=leader2, type=Death Knight
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:51
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:70
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:55
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:73
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:74
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:92
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:109
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:59
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:46
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:50
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:69
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:50
msgid "Undead"
msgstr "亡灵"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:143
msgid "Hello? Is anybody here?"
msgstr "哈罗？有人吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:153
msgid ""
"I’m nearly blind in this fog, but I think I see a hovel off in the distance."
msgstr "在这浓雾里我几乎什么都看不见,但我觉得远处隐约有一座棚屋。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:181
msgid "Freeze! Drop the sword, or we won’t hesitate to run ye through."
msgstr "站住!放下剑,不然我们毫不犹豫地捅穿你们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:185
msgid "(This keeps getting worse...)"
msgstr "(事情越来越糟……)"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:189
msgid "How many of ye are there? How did she find out about us! Speak, vermin!"
msgstr "你们有多少人?她是怎么找到我们的!说话,虫子!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:191
msgid "This is the worst timing... an’ us fighting without Harper too..."
msgstr "真是最糟的时机……而且我们还得在没有哈珀的情况下作战……"

#. [message]: type=Thug
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:195
msgid ""
"I dunno, Delurin. They’re a mean lot, but they don’t much look like "
"Asheviere’s. It’s been a long time since we ’ad to put down any of her goons."
msgstr "不知道,德鲁林。他们是一伙狠角色,但看起来不像艾什薇尔的人。我们已经很久没收拾过她的走狗了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:199
msgid ""
"Peace, friends! I mean you no harm, and I’m no servant of Asheviere’s! My "
"name is Konrad. I’m a prince, nephew of Garard, son of Arand and rightful "
"heir to Wesnoth!"
msgstr "和平,朋友们!我没有恶意,我也不是艾什薇尔的走狗!我叫康拉德,我是王子,伽拉德的外甥、阿兰德之子,韦诺特的合法继承人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:203
msgid ""
"Konrad? I’ve heard of Prince Konrad... You might be he, or you mightn’t."
msgstr "康拉德?我听说过康拉德王子……也许你就是他,也许不是。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:211
msgid "You say you’re a friend, an’ that’s worth something at least."
msgstr "你说你是朋友,至少这一点还算有点分量。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:215
msgid ""
"I’ll give you a chance to prove yerself, boy. We’ve been havin’ trouble with "
"some bestial undead on the isle. Our leader is missing, and without ’er "
"we’re struggling to fight back."
msgstr "我给你一个证明自己的机会,小子。岛上有些野兽般的亡灵,一直让我们头疼。我们的领袖失踪了,没有她,我们很难反击。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:219
msgid ""
"But the real Konrad’d be a great general; he’d have no trouble beating down "
"the dead. Lead us against the corpses, prince, and we’ll see just how "
"genuine you are. I’ll be watching."
msgstr "但真正的康拉德一定会是位伟大的将军;他不会有困难,就能把死人打倒。王子,带我们去对付那些尸体吧,我们就会看看你到底是不是真货。我会盯着。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:264
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Thugs and Footpads!"
msgstr "科纳德现在可以征募暴徒和走卒了！"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:292
msgid "Death of Delurin"
msgstr "德鲁林死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:319
msgid ""
"Undead in th’ heart o’ town! I’m glad Baldras didn’t live to see this..."
msgstr "亡灵跑到镇子中心了!还好巴德拉斯没看到这一幕……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:335
msgid ""
"This crypt was once grand, but now all has gone to rot. There’s nothing of "
"value here."
msgstr "这个墓穴曾经宏伟,但现在一切都腐烂了。这里没有值钱的东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:347
msgid "This crypt is shallow and dry, and there’s 20 gold inside!"
msgstr "这个墓穴又浅又干燥,里面有20金币!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:364
msgid ""
"This crypt is deep, and a foul stench wafts up from below. There’s something "
"near the entrance."
msgstr "这个墓穴很深,一股恶臭从下面飘上来。入口附近有什么东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:372
msgid "Gah, undead!"
msgstr "啊,亡灵!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#. hint to the player that one crypt contains gold, but another contains undead
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:425
msgid ""
"Watch out around those crypts, Konrad. This whole undead problem only "
"started after our leader went down into one of them looking for treasure."
msgstr "小心那些墓穴,康拉德。这整个亡灵问题,只是在我们领袖下到其中一个找宝藏之后才开始的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:429
msgid ""
"She’s still down in there, somewhere. But we can’t do much to help now, not "
"till we deal with them that’s up here an’ fightings us."
msgstr "她还在下面某处。但现在我们帮不上什么忙,在解决了上面这些跟我们打的之前,什么都做不了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:448
msgid ""
"Not bad, prince. Maybe you is who you says you is after all. But there’s "
"still more of ’em out there to fight."
msgstr "不错,王子。也许你真的是你所说的那个人。但外面还有更多等着我们去打的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:462
msgid ""
"That’s the last of ’em! The Three Sisters is safe. You done well, kid — I’m "
"sorry we threatened you."
msgstr "这是最后一个了!三姐妹岛安全了。你干得不错,小子——抱歉我们威胁了你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:466
msgid ""
"Your threats would have been your end, had you tried to carry them out. But "
"I understand: you’ve been out here so long that you’ve forgotten what a "
"friendly face looks like."
msgstr "如果你真的敢付诸行动,那些威胁就是你的末日了。但我理解:你在这里待得太久了,以至于忘了友善的面孔是什么样子。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:470
msgid ""
"Ain’t that the truth. Been nigh on 20 years since we fled our homes, since "
"that stinker Asheviere warned us to swear fealty or die. We ain’t no friends "
"of hers, and we’d be honored to join you on the rest of yer journey."
msgstr "可不是嘛。我们逃离家园已经将近20年了,自从艾什薇尔那个臭女王警告我们要么宣誓效忠,要么等死。我们可不是她的朋友,很荣幸能加入你的旅途,一起走完接下来的路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:488
msgid "Some leader you are. I’m glad Baldras didn’t live to see this..."
msgstr "你可真算个领袖。还好巴德拉斯没看到这一幕……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:502
msgid ""
"Hurry it up, “Prince Konrad”! There’s friends of mine in trouble, and we "
"can’t do naught about it until these undead are finished!"
msgstr "快点,康拉德“王子”!我这里有朋友遇到了麻烦,在这些亡灵被解决之前,我们什么都做不了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delurin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08a_Isle_of_the_Damned_part1.cfg:509
msgid ""
"This is taking too long. ’s what I get for trusting a “prince”; we should’ve "
"dealt with these dead by ourselves from the beginning."
msgstr "这也太慢了。这就是信一个“王子”的下场;我们本应从一开始就自己解决这些死人。"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:98
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:33
msgid "Beasts"
msgstr "野兽"

#. [scenario]: id=08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:151
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:167
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:183
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:199
msgid "Midnight Queen"
msgstr "午夜女王"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:282
msgid ""
"Here we are: the entrance to the island catacombs. The source of the undead "
"must be down here somewhere... and the outlaw leaders, if they’re still "
"alive."
msgstr "我们到了:岛屿墓穴的入口。亡灵的源头一定在下面某处……还有那些亡命之徒的首领,如果他们还活着的话。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:286
msgid ""
"If Delurin’s guess is correct, this place goes on for miles. We may have to "
"split up if we want to search the whole thing in decent time."
msgstr "如果德洛林的猜测没错,这个地方绵延数里。如果想在合理的时间把这里全部搜一遍,可能得兵分几路。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:294
msgid "Find and destroy the source of the undead"
msgstr "找到并摧毁亡灵的源头"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. saying "500 years" is important, as the vampire lady says it takes her 500 years to regenerate after being destroyed. 500 years ago is when Haldric arrived and destroyed her the first time
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:314
msgid ""
"I wonder who built this place, and for what purpose? The handiwork doesn’t "
"look dwarvish, but it’s far too old to have been tunneled by men. Their— "
"err, our kind has barely been on the Great Continent for 500 years!"
msgstr "我好奇这个地方是谁建造的,又是为了什么目的?这工艺看起来不像矮人的,但又太古老了,不可能是人类挖出来的地道。他们——呃,我们人类,在大陆上也才500年!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:317
msgid ""
"Aye, ain’t no dwarf-tunnels, that’s for sure. Jus’ look at them ugly, lumpy "
"walls! Whoever made this place weren’t no troll, neither."
msgstr "是啊,肯定不是矮人的地道,这一点是肯定的。瞧瞧那些丑陋、凹凸不平的墙!建造这个地方的人也不是巨魔。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:318
msgid ""
"I have heard stories of this place; the isle of Lilanas. Elves once lived "
"here. But that was long ago, before even my time."
msgstr "我听过关于这个地方的传说;利拉纳斯岛。精灵曾在这里生活。但那已是很久以前的事了,早在我诞生的年代之前。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:319
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:320
msgid ""
"I detect powerful magic down in these tunnels, Konrad, very old magic. But I "
"can’t speak as to its origin."
msgstr "我感觉到这些地道深处有强大的魔法,康拉德,非常古老的魔法。但它的来源,我无法说清。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:321
msgid ""
"There is a dark presence here, Konrad, foul; something that has rejected the "
"Light and hides deep within this place. Beyond that I cannot say."
msgstr "这里有一种黑暗的存在,康拉德,污秽;一个背弃了光明、深藏在这片地方深处的东西。除此之外,我无法断言。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:322
msgid ""
"Well, err — the architecture is... ah, old. Mermish? Elvish, perhaps? But "
"these caves are certainly natural. Someone found the caves and took up, err, "
"residence?"
msgstr "嗯,呃——这建筑是……呃,很古老。海民的风格?也许是精灵的?但这些洞穴肯定是天然形成的。有人发现了这些洞穴,然后……呃,住了下来?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:323
msgid ""
"Dis not a troll hole, Konrad. But not a dwarf hole neither. An’ Dosh dunno "
"who else be livin’ in caves."
msgstr "这里不是巨魔的洞,康拉德。但也不是矮人的洞。而且多什不知道还有什么别的东西会住在洞穴里。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:343
msgid ""
"I smell clean fresh air, and spray laced with salt! Nearby lies the ocean; "
"we will find no undead this way."
msgstr "我闻到了清新的空气,还有夹着盐味的浪花!附近就是大海;从这个方向走,我们不会遇到亡灵。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#. tell the player that they don't need to fight the giant spiders to win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:358
msgid ""
"A nest of giant spiders! I’ve heard terrible stories about the awful danger "
"of these creatures. There’s certainly no undead anywhere inside their lair; "
"perhaps if we keep our distance they will leave us alone."
msgstr "一个巨型蜘蛛的巢穴!我听过很多关于这些生物可怕危险的恐怖故事。它们的巢穴里肯定不会有亡灵;也许只要我们保持距离,它们就会放过我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:370
msgid ""
"A revenant! That thing is a capable fighter, but such a mindless creature "
"could not have cast the spells needed to raise his fellows. There must be a "
"necromancer or lich somewhere else within these caverns."
msgstr "一具亡者!这东西是个能打的战士,但如此无脑的生物,不可能施展出召唤同伴的法术。在这些洞穴的某个地方,一定还潜伏着死灵法师或巫妖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:378
msgid ""
"Well done, everyone! We’ve beaten one group of undead, but the source behind "
"this dark magic is still at large."
msgstr "干得好,大家!我们击败了一组亡灵,但隐藏在黑暗魔法背后的源头仍然逍遥法外。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:391
msgid ""
"That’s the last of the spider! A difficult fight, but we’ve gained valuable "
"experience."
msgstr "这是最后一只蜘蛛了!一场艰难的战斗,但我们收获了宝贵的经验。"

#. [message]: speaker=Vampire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:410
msgid ""
"Welcome, strangers, to the boudoir of the midnight queen. It’s been so many "
"years since I’ve had such handsome visitors."
msgstr "欢迎来到午夜女王的闺房,陌生人。多少年来,我都没有接待过这么英俊的客人了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Vampire
#. exactly what she says to Haldric in TRoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:417
msgid "You will be made to serve... Come admire me. Feel my love."
msgstr "你们将被驱使……来崇拜我吧。感受我的爱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:422
msgid "She’s... She’s beautiful..."
msgstr "她……她真美……"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:427
msgid ""
"Knock it off, lady! Don’t any of you listen to her, she’s nothing but an "
"illusion!"
msgstr "别管她,女士!你们谁也别听她的,她不过是个幻影!"

#. [message]: speaker=Vampire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:443
msgid ""
"Insolent man-lings! I was immortal queen of this isle since before your kind "
"had learned to walk! You will learn to show proper respect!"
msgstr "无礼的人类崽子们!在你们的种族学会走路之前,我早已是这座岛不朽的女王!你们会学会表现出应有的敬意的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:459
msgid "Hey. I’m Harper. Aren’t you a sight for sore eyes."
msgstr "嘿。我是哈珀。你们可真够让人眼前一亮啊。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:463
msgid ""
"You’re the leader of the outlaws? Err, we came to rescue you, and to put an "
"end to the undead threat on the isle. What happened in this place?!"
msgstr "你就是那帮亡命之徒的首领?呃,我们是来救你们的,也是来终结岛上亡灵威胁的。这里发生了什么?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:467
msgid ""
"Well... some weeks ago I led some hunters down here lookin’ fer magic, "
"treasure, anythin’ that could help really make a difference ’gainst that "
"stinker Queen Asheviere. Really thought I’d found somethin’ too."
msgstr "呃……几周前,我带了一群猎人下来这里,想寻找魔法、宝藏,任何能帮我们把艾什薇尔那个臭女王赶下去的东西。我还真以为找到了呢。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:471
msgid ""
"’stead all my hard work just got people killed. I awoke that “Midnight "
"Queen”, an’ now I’m the last one of us who came down here what’s left "
"alive..."
msgstr "结果我的所有努力反而害死了人。我唤醒了那个“午夜女王”,而现在,我成了下到这里来的人里最后一个还活着的……"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:475
msgid ""
"But there be no time for talk. C’mon, we gots to finish her off afore she "
"gets her glamour put back on!"
msgstr "但现在没工夫说话。快点,我们得在她把魔法披回身上之前干掉她!"

#. [message]: speaker=Vampire
#. This is an elven druid from long, long ago, now turned to a lich. "Lilanas" is her name for "The Three Sisters"
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:492
msgid ""
"Fools! You mayflies cannot kill me! I am the greatest of the druids of "
"Lilanas; my spirit is the isle’s wind, my bones its earth, my blood its "
"beasts!"
msgstr "蠢货们!你们这些朝生暮死的虫子,杀不了我!我是利拉纳斯最强大的德鲁伊;我的灵魂是这座岛的风,我的骨骼是它的泥土,我的鲜血是它的野兽!"

#. [message]: speaker=Vampire
#. it's been a little over 500 years since Haldric arrived, fought, and killed her. Now she's back - and killed again for another 500 years
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:497
msgid ""
"You may destroy me now, but in 500 years I shall return! So long as the isle "
"stands... I shall always return..."
msgstr "你也许能摧毁现在的我,但500年后我会回来!只要这座岛还在……我就总会回来……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:505
msgid "Death to tyrants, now and forevermore!"
msgstr "暴君该死,此刻如此,永远如此!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:509
msgid "... do you think she meant what she said about returning in 500 years?"
msgstr "……你觉得她说500年后会回来,这话是真的吗?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:512
msgid ""
"Sure, aye, when trolls fly! Ah ain’t never heard such a lot o’ "
"ninnyhammerin’ tripe since th’ last time my pa’ got too deep in ’is drink. "
"We got nothin’ to worry about."
msgstr "当然,是啊,等巨魔长出翅膀飞起来的时候吧!自从我老爸上次喝得烂醉之后,我就没听过这么多废话。我们没什么好担心的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:513
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:514
msgid ""
"Whatever powers she had in life or undeath, there’s no magic that can revive "
"the dead. I don’t think we have anything to worry about."
msgstr "无论她生前或死后有什么力量,没有任何魔法能复活死者。我想我们没什么好担心的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:515
msgid ""
"An accursed curse by an accursed creature, Konrad! Even in death, she still "
"aims to beguile us with her foul lies."
msgstr "被诅咒的生物发出的被诅咒的诅咒,康拉德!即使在死后,她仍在用她污秽的谎言诱惑我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:519
msgid ""
"C’mon, let’s be gettin’ back to the village. And on the way, you boys better "
"be tellin’ me just who exactly you all are."
msgstr "走吧,咱们回村子。顺便,你们几个,最好跟我说清楚,你们到底都是谁。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:536
msgid ""
"We musn’t take too long down here. The air is foul and growing fouler by the "
"minute; if we cannot defeat the leader of the undead, we shall soon be "
"forced to return to the surface."
msgstr "我们不能在下面耽搁太久。空气污浊,而且一分钟比一分钟更糟;如果我们不能击败死者首领,我们就很快被迫回到地面。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/08b_Isle_of_the_Damned_part2.cfg:543
msgid ""
"I can barely continue to breathe in air so foul, much less fight. I am sorry "
"to flee, but if we stay here any longer we shall surely suffocate."
msgstr "我几乎无法在这污浊的空气中呼吸,更别提战斗了。我很抱歉要撤退,但如果我们在这里再待下去,肯定会窒息而死。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:83
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:54
msgid "Agadla"
msgstr "阿伽德拉"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:84
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:55
msgid "Drodrish"
msgstr "德罗德里什"

#. [event]
#. "Daneth" is the name of Lord Maddock's late son, as referenced in Liberty. This ship also appears in Liberty's S04, with the same name.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:419
msgid "The Daneth"
msgstr "达尼丝号"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:420
msgid "Elyn's Folly"
msgstr "伊琳的妄言"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:421
msgid "Charlock"
msgstr "查洛克"

#. [message]: speaker=wesnoth4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:504
msgid ""
"Push, you blaggards! We take the isle or it’s back to the gallows for us all!"
msgstr "上啊,你们这些混蛋!拿下这座岛,不然咱们就全得回去上绞架!"

#. [message]: speaker=wesnoth4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:525
msgid ""
"Damnations, still no progress! The defenders can’t keep this up forever — "
"prepare another assault."
msgstr "该死,还是没有进展!守军不可能永远撑下去——准备又一次进攻。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:585
msgid ""
"Welcome to Elensefar, young master. Delfador has told me a great deal about "
"you over the years! If you truly possess the potential that he claims, now "
"is the time to start living up to it."
msgstr "欢迎来到艾尔森法尔,年轻人。多年来,德法多跟我谈过你的许多事!如果你当真有他所声称的潜力,现在就该开始兑现了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:591
msgid ""
"As you can see we’re hard-pressed, for Asheviere’s loyalists besiege the "
"south bridge while orcs push in from the north. Every attack has been "
"repelled, but that lieutenant of theirs is right about one thing — we can’t "
"keep it up forever."
msgstr "你可以看到,我们处境艰难:艾什薇尔的忠臣围攻南桥,兽人则从北面压入。每一次进攻都被击退了,但他们那个中尉有一句话说对了——我们不可能永远撑下去。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:595
msgid ""
"Sir Kaylan sends his regards, Lord Maddock. Konrad has brought the knights "
"of Blackwater Port to stand with you."
msgstr "凯兰大人向我致意,麦多克大人。康拉德带来了黑水港的骑士,与你并肩而立。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:596
msgid ""
"Got yourself into trouble again, Maddock? Ain’t no cursed soldiers this "
"time, but we’re still here to help."
msgstr "又惹上麻烦了,麦多克?这次没有该死的士兵,但我们还是会来帮你。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:597
msgid ""
"Ah’m not afraid! Jus’ give the word an’ I’ll see them chicken-hearted pox "
"wrinklers clear back to Weldyn!"
msgstr "我才不怕!只要一声令下,我就把那些鸡肠小肚、面皮起皱的家伙一路撵回维尔帝!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:598
msgid ""
"The dark queen’s shadow spreads, but the Light shall burn her back! We shall "
"stand together against the darkness!"
msgstr "黑暗女王的阴影在蔓延,但光明会将她灼退!我们将共同对抗黑暗!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:599
msgid ""
"We’re here to help, Lord Maddock. Elensefar has long been a bastion of "
"freedom against Asheviere’s tyranny. We can’t let it fall!"
msgstr "我们来帮你,麦多克大人。艾尔森法尔一直是反抗艾什薇尔暴政的自由堡垒。我们绝不能让它陷落!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:603
msgid ""
"Exposing yourself here is a great risk, Master Konrad. But your position "
"behind enemy lines does afford us opportunity for a counterattack."
msgstr "在这里暴露自己,是很大的风险,康拉德大师。但你在敌军后方的位置,也给了我们反击的机会。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:607
msgid ""
"If you can defeat enough of their leaders to break the siege, the remainder "
"will most certainly be forced to withdraw."
msgstr "如果你击败足够多的敌军首领,瓦解他们的围攻,剩下的部队肯定会被迫撤退。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:611
msgid "I won’t let you down, Delfador. Prepare for battle!"
msgstr "我不会让你失望,德法多。准备战斗!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:622
#| msgid "Defeat all enemy leaders"
msgid "Defeat any $leaders_to_kill enemy leaders"
msgstr "击败所有的敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. $leaders_to_kill is always 3. $leaders_killed will be either 1 or 2.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:630
msgid "Defeat any $leaders_to_kill enemy leaders ($leaders_killed defeated)"
msgstr "击败$leaders_to_kill位敌方首领(已击败$leaders_killed位)"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:642
msgid "Death of Lord Maddock"
msgstr "马多克领主死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:661
msgid "It’s good to see you again, Delfador. I’m glad you’re still okay!"
msgstr "见到你真好,德法多。你没事就好!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:665
msgid ""
"Alive and kicking indeed, young master. But there is no time for idle "
"chatter."
msgstr "确实生龙活虎,年轻人。但我们没有工夫闲聊。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:679
msgid ""
"Tried t’ tell you this would happen, Maddock. You shoulda fought with us "
"back when the going was better."
msgstr "我早跟你说过会这样,麦多克。你应该在形势还好的时候就加入我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:683
msgid ""
"You’ll recall that I did, through my son. It is not by mere chance that "
"Elensefar has been kept free thus far, and nor is it by chance that it will "
"stay that way today."
msgstr "你记得我做到了——通过我的女儿。艾尔森法尔之所以至今保持自由,绝非偶然;今天它依然自由,同样绝非偶然。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:717
msgid ""
"What’s this? Lord Maddock, Master Konrad, I scry many small ships coming "
"down the river! An ill tiding indeed, for they carry fresh fighters from "
"Weldyn."
msgstr "这是什么?麦多克大人,康拉德大师,我看到许多小船顺河而下!这可不是吉兆,因为它们载着来自维尔帝的新兵。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:721
msgid ""
"Impossible! What remains of the royal fleet already withdrew to the "
"blockade; they don’t have the numbers for another amphibious attack."
msgstr "不可能!王家舰队残存的部分早已退守封锁线;他们的兵力,不足以再发动一次两栖进攻。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:762
msgid ""
"Damn... converted smallcraft. I shouldn’t have committed so many warships to "
"the bridge defense."
msgstr "该死……改装的小型船艇。我本不该把那么多战舰调去守桥。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:764
msgid ""
"Charlock, move to intercept! Those transports must not be allowed to land on "
"the isle!"
msgstr "查洛克,出击拦截!绝不能让那些运兵船登上岛屿!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:801
msgid ""
"Elensefar Isle. Good work everyone — they weren’t ready for us to press the "
"Carcyn fishers into service. But our fight’s not done yet."
msgstr "艾尔森法尔岛。干得好,各位——他们没料到我们会迫使卡辛渔民为我们所用。但战斗还没结束。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:810
msgid ""
"Secure a beachhead and prepare to receive the rest of the boats. We must act "
"swiftly, before they can pivot their defenses."
msgstr "占领滩头,准备接收剩下的船只。我们必须迅速行动,在他们调整防御之前。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:820
msgid ""
"We meet again, princess! I’ve beaten you before, and I’ll do so again. "
"Elensefar deserves a better ruler than you."
msgstr "又见面了,公主!我击败过你,也会再次击败你。艾尔森法尔值得一个比你好得多的统治者。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:824
msgid ""
"Konrad. I underestimated you once before — never again. You should have "
"picked a different battle, princeling."
msgstr "康拉德。我曾经低估过你一次——绝不会再有第二次。你该挑一场不同的仗才对,小王子。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:829
msgid ""
"Your Highness, we meet at last! I’ve heard stories about the battles you’ve "
"won in your mother’s name. I won’t let Elensefar be one of them!"
msgstr "殿下,我们终于见面了!我听过关于你在母亲麾下赢得的那些战斗的故事。我绝不会让艾尔森法尔成为其中之一!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:833
msgid ""
"Hello, “Konrad.” I think you’re a little out of your depth, pretender — the "
"battlefield is no place for a con man."
msgstr "你好,“康拉德”。我觉得你有点自不量力了,冒牌货——战场可不是骗子的地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:837
msgid ""
"Your lies have sown enough discord and chaos among my people. How convenient "
"that you’re here; I can capture both you and Maddock at the same time."
msgstr "你的谎言在我的子民中煽起了足够的纷争与混乱。你来得真巧;我可以同时拿下你和麦多克。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:849
msgid ""
"Elensefar has weathered countless storms, Your Highness. Your queen will be "
"neither the first nor the last that breaks upon our shores."
msgstr "艾尔森法尔经历过的风暴,不知凡几,殿下。你的女王,不会是第一个撞碎在我们海岸上的,也不会是最后一个。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:853
msgid ""
"You’ve been a capable lord, Maddock, and from what I can tell you truly care "
"about your city. If it’s any consolation, when all’s said and done I intend "
"to make sure you stand a fair trial."
msgstr "你是一位有能力的领主,麦多克,从我所见,你确实关心你的城市。如果这能安慰你,等一切尘埃落定,我会确保你得到公正的审判。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:857
msgid ""
"As for you, Delfador... you’re going to regret what you did to my brother."
msgstr "至于你,德法多……你会后悔你对我兄长所做的一切。"

#. [floating_text]
#. $gold will be between 10 and 40.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:889
msgid "$gold gold"
msgstr "$gold 黄金"

#. [message]: role=lisar_skiff
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:935
msgid "—how did you know?! It seems I’m not half so clever as I thought."
msgstr "——你怎么知道?!”看来我并没有自己想的那么聪明。"

#. [message]: role=lisar_skiff
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:941
msgid ""
"You win this round, Konrad. I need to get out of here before this boat takes "
"any more damage."
msgstr "这一局,康拉德,你赢了。我得在这艘船再吃下什么打击之前离开这里。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:960
msgid ""
"My last landed boat is badly damaged! I hate to retreat, but I can’t risk "
"being trapped here and captured."
msgstr "我的最后一艘登陆船严重受损!我讨厌撤退,但我不能冒被困在这里被俘的风险。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:977
msgid ""
"You prove your skills once again, cousin. A worthy foe indeed... Elensefar "
"survives another day."
msgstr "你又证明了自己的身手,堂弟。确实是个强大的对手……艾尔森法尔又撑过了一天。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:982
msgid ""
"I underestimated you, “cousin” — it seems you’re more than just a good actor "
"and a pretty face. I may be forced to flee the field today, but this isn’t "
"over."
msgstr "我低估你了,“堂弟”——看来你不只是个演技好、长得好看的家伙。今天我或许被迫撤退,但事情还没完。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1018
msgid ""
"That’s the first of the besieging leaders defeated! Keep pressing the attack!"
msgstr "围攻方的第一位首领被击败了!继续追击!"

#. [message]: race=orc
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1049
msgid ""
"Forget this! I was promised an easy fight full of plunder, not a flank and a "
"rout! Deal with your problems yourselves, pink-skins."
msgstr "算了!你们答应的是轻松的战斗和满地的掠夺,不是侧翼被包抄然后大败!你们自己收拾你们的烂摊子吧,粉皮子们。"

#. [message]: id=(self.hitpoints>0)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1055
msgid ""
"They’ve gone. I hate to retreat, but without support I can’t risk being "
"trapped here and captured. We came so, so close to taking the city!"
msgstr "他们撤走了。我讨厌撤退,但没有支援,我不能冒被困在这里被俘的风险。我们离拿下这座城市,只差那么一点!"

#. [message]: id=(self.hitpoints>0)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1060
msgid ""
"They’ve gone. I hate to retreat, but without support I can’t risk being "
"trapped here and captured. We already pushed dangerously hard just to get "
"this far."
msgstr "他们撤走了。我讨厌撤退,但没有支援,我不能冒被困在这里被俘的风险。我们已经冒险拼杀,才走到这一步。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1072
msgid "Useless orcs! You were hired for a siege, not a rout!"
msgstr "没用的兽人!你们是被雇来围攻的,不是来溃逃的!"

#. [message]: id=Lisar {OR( side=2,3,4 {AND canrecruit=yes} )}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1077
msgid ""
"I hate to retreat, but we’re already overextended pushing this far into the "
"city. With the north shore fallen, I can’t risk the whole army any further. "
"We came so, so close to taking the city!"
msgstr "我不愿意撤退,但我们推进到城里这么深的地方,已经兵力透支了。北岸一失守,我就不能再冒险把整支军队都押上了。我们离夺取这座城市,就差那么一点点!"

#. [message]: id=Lisar {OR( side=2,3,4 {AND canrecruit=yes} )}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1082
msgid ""
"I hate to retreat, but with the north shore fallen we have little hope of "
"taking the city. We already pushed dangerously hard just to get this far — I "
"can’t risk things any further."
msgstr "我不愿意撤退,但北岸一失守,我们就几乎没有夺取这座城的可能了。能推进到这个地步,我们已经拼到了危险的极限——不能再冒险了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1101
msgid "We’ve driven them back! The siege of Elensefar is over!"
msgstr "我们把他们打退了!伊伦斯法尔的围攻结束了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1105
msgid ""
"Well done, Konrad. I was worried when you decided to join the fight, but "
"Maddock and I could not have carried the day without your help. Together we "
"have won a great victory over tyranny."
msgstr "干得好,康拉德。你决定参战时我很担心,但如果没有你的帮助,我和马多克不可能赢得今天。我们一起,对暴政取得了伟大胜利。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#. "pigs will fly" is an expression indicating that something is very unlikely toh appen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1110
msgid ""
"Pigs will fly before the silver city bows to any queen. After the thrashing "
"we gave them, they won’t return anytime soon."
msgstr "猪会飞,也不如银城向哪位女王低头来得容易。被我们痛打之后,他们短期内不会再来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1114
msgid ""
"Konrad, Elensefar is in your debt today. What soldiers I can spare are now "
"yours to command — as well as many of the Elensefar thieves’ guild’s more "
"enterprising young robbers."
msgstr "康拉德,伊伦斯法尔欠你人情。我现在能腾出来的士兵,归你调遣——此外,伊伦斯法尔盗贼公会里,还有不少年轻、有闯劲的强盗。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1116
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Swordsmen, Pikemen, and Thieves!"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1119
msgid "May they serve you well. Keep up the good fight, my lord."
msgstr "愿他们能为你们所用。继续打好这场仗,我的主人。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1141
msgid ""
"Sirs, we’re running low on supplies. We have only a few more chances to take "
"Elensefar castle’s storerooms before we’ll be forced to retreat!"
msgstr "将军们,我们的补给快见底了。在被迫撤退之前,我们只剩几次机会去夺取伊伦斯法尔城堡的储藏室了!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1145
msgid ""
"Bah, this is starting to get ridiculous. I’m not sticking around forever, no "
"matter what your queen promises me!"
msgstr "呸,这事越来越荒唐了。不管你们的女王许诺我什么,我都不会一直待下去!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1156
msgid ""
"Forget this! I was promised an easy fight full of plunder, not this siege "
"that never ends! Deal with your problems yourselves, pink-skins."
msgstr "算了吧!我答应的是轻松的战斗和满满的战利品,可不是这场没完没了的围攻!你们自己的麻烦自己解决,粉皮子。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1160
msgid ""
"I hate to retreat, but we’re already overextended pushing just this far. We "
"already exerted ourselves dangerously hard — I can’t risk things any further."
msgstr "我不愿意撤退,但能推进到这个地步,我们已经兵力透支了。我们已经拼到了危险的极限——不能再冒险了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Maddock
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1174
msgid "I surrender! I am beaten!"
msgstr "我投降!我被击败了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/10_Elensefar_Before.cfg:1178
msgid "Alas, Maddock has capitulated. Elensefar is lost!"
msgstr "唉,马多克投降了。伊伦斯法尔完了!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:230
msgid "Fine, you idiots can keep the north shore! Orcs, retreat to the city."
msgstr "算了,蠢货们,北岸就留给你们了!兽人们,撤回城里。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:236
msgid "Fine, you idiots can keep the south shore! Orcs, retreat to the city."
msgstr "算了,蠢货们,南岸就留给你们了!兽人们,撤回城里。"

#. [message]: speaker=foxtail1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:291
msgid ""
"Hahaha, this town is great! Top-quality slaves, houses made with real "
"shingles, and all the gold and silver in the world!"
msgstr "哈哈哈,这地方太棒了!顶级品质的奴隶,用真正的木瓦盖的房子,还有全世界的金银财宝!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:323
msgid ""
"If Asheviere has truly given Elensefar to the orcs like they claim, it can "
"only be because she expects them to ravage it."
msgstr "如果艾什薇尔真的像他们声称的那样把伊伦斯法尔交给了兽人,那只能说明她指望他们洗劫这座城。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:327
msgid ""
"She must believe the people will never submit to her rule, and would rather "
"ruin them entirely than risk another revolt. How awful."
msgstr "她一定相信人们永远不会臣服于她的统治,宁可让他们彻底完蛋,也不愿再冒一次暴动。太可怕了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:331
msgid "We can’t let that happen. To arms, warriors!"
msgstr "我们不能让那种事发生。拿起武器,战士们!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:337
msgid "Five"
msgstr "五个"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:337
msgid "Four"
msgstr "四个"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:337
msgid "Three"
msgstr "三个"

#. [note]
#. $thief_count will be the word "Three" "Four" or "Five"
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:351
msgid ""
"$thief_count thieves/rogues will join your attack once you capture any "
"village on one of Elensefar’s islands."
msgstr "一旦你攻占伊伦斯法尔任何岛屿上的村庄,$thief_count 名盗贼/流氓将加入你的进攻。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:368
msgid ""
"Look, Konrad! I see a human fording the river, sneaking out of the city "
"towards us."
msgstr "看,康拉德!我看到一个人正在渡河,从城里偷偷朝我们过来。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:369
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:370
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:371
msgid ""
"Look, Konrad! A man is fording the river, sneaking out of the city towards "
"us."
msgstr "看,康拉德!有个人正在渡河,从城里偷偷朝我们过来。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:372
msgid ""
"Look there, boy! One o’ ’em city-folk’s gone yellow. I think he’s sneakin’ "
"out to see us."
msgstr "看那边,小子!城里人中的一个脸色发黄。我觉得他是偷偷溜出来找我们的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:373
msgid ""
"Look, Konrad! Someone’s fording the river, sneakin’ out to see us. How is he "
"movin’ across the deep water?!"
msgstr "看,康拉德!有人在渡河,偷偷溜出来找我们。他怎么能穿过这片深水区?!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:374
msgid ""
"Hark, Konrad! One of the cityfolk steals across the river towards our shore!"
msgstr "听,康拉德!城里人中的一个偷偷渡河朝我们这岸过来了!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:375
msgid ""
"Oh, hello? Err... I think I see — yes, Konrad, someone’s sneaking across the "
"river towards us."
msgstr "噢,你好?呃……好像看到什么——是的,康拉德,有人正偷偷穿过河朝我们过来。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:376
msgid ""
"Look there, Konrad. Dosh is seein’ a softskin sneakin’ across dis river "
"towards us."
msgstr "看那里,康拉德。多什看到一个软皮子正偷偷穿过这条河朝我们过来。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:377
msgid ""
"Look, someone’s fording the river! I think he’s sneaking out of the city "
"towards us."
msgstr "看,有人在渡河!我觉得他是从城里偷偷溜出来找我们的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:388
msgid "Halt! Who goes there, friend or foe?"
msgstr "站住！什么人？是敌是友？"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:392
#| msgid ""
#| "Greetings, friend. We are from the Elensefar Thieves’ Guild. We would "
#| "like to help you against the orcs!"
msgid ""
"Greetings, friend. I am Reglok, guildmaster of the Elensefar thieves. We "
"would like to help you against the orcs."
msgstr "幸会，朋友。我们来自埃仁撒伐的盗贼公会。我们愿意帮助你们对抗兽人！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:396
msgid ""
"I know the sort of aid offered by a thief, Reglok. We do not trust you and "
"we do not need you."
msgstr "我知道盗贼提供的是哪种帮助,雷洛克。我们不信你,也不需要你。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:397
msgid ""
"Is that so? What honor is there among thieves? We do not trust you and we do "
"not need you."
msgstr "是吗?盗贼中有什么荣誉可言?我们不信你,也不需要你。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:398
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:399
msgid ""
"I don’t like the idea of working with thieves. Who says we can trust you? We "
"should send him on his way, Konrad."
msgstr "我不喜欢和盗贼合作这种想法。谁说这种人可以信任?我们应该让他走,康拉德。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:400
msgid ""
"Aye, sure ye do. An’ as soon as our backs are turned we’ll find yer fingers "
"down our purses an’ yer knives stickin’ out o’ our spleens! What sort o’ "
"chucklehead do ye take me for?"
msgstr "是啊,我相信。等我们一转过身,就会发现你们的爪子伸进我们的钱包,刀子扎进我们的肠子!你以为我是个什么样的榆木脑袋?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:401
msgid "Uh huh. I’ve dealt with thieves before. What’s in it for you, Reglok?"
msgstr "嗯嗯。我以前跟盗贼打过交道。你想从中得到什么,雷洛克?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:402
msgid ""
"There is no Light within you, thief. You lie and you steal and you kill. Who "
"says we can trust such as you?"
msgstr "你的心中没有光明,盗贼。你撒谎、偷窃,还杀人。谁说这种人可以信任?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:403
msgid ""
"That’s very kind of you to offer! But, well, you’re a thief? The lying and "
"stealing and... killing kind of thief?"
msgstr "你提出这个真是好意!不过,呃,你是个盗贼?是说谎、偷窃、还有……杀人的那种盗贼?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:404
msgid ""
"Dosh not be trustin’ any thief. Dosh know what thieves do. Lie and steal and "
"kill."
msgstr "多什不信什么盗贼。多什知道盗贼会干什么。说谎、偷窃、杀人。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:405
msgid "Thieves, hmmm? Who says we can trust such as you?"
msgstr "盗贼，嗯？让我如何相信你们？"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:409
#| msgid ""
#| "We would understand if you didn’t trust us, of course, but it is in our "
#| "mutual interest to rid the city of the orcs!"
msgid ""
"We would understand if you didn’t trust us, of course, but it is in our "
"mutual interest to rid the city of the orcs. Since Lord Maddock was dragged "
"off in chains, our new overlords have done nothing but riot and steal. That "
"infringes on our monopoly."
msgstr ""
"你不相信我们，我们当然也能理解。不过把兽人从城市里赶出去，对我们双方都有好"
"处！"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:413
msgid ""
"You shall find that there is honor, even among thieves. We served Maddock "
"well, and if you can liberate Elensefar we shall do the same for you."
msgstr "你会发现,即使在盗贼中也有荣誉。我们好好辅佐过马多克,如果你能解放伊伦斯法尔,我们也会为你效力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:417
msgid "Yes, but where is your fighting force? How can you help us?"
msgstr "好，但是你们的部队在哪里？你们会如何帮助我们呢？"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:423
msgid "five"
msgstr "五个"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:423
msgid "four"
msgstr "四个"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:423
msgid "three"
msgstr "三个"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:429
#| msgid ""
#| "We survive by stealth. We can help you sneak into the city and surround "
#| "the orcs. Alternatively, we can lay in wait until you give us a signal "
#| "then ambush the orcs’ rear."
msgid ""
"There is a hidden ford on the southwest side of the city, but coming from "
"the north that shall be of little use. Instead, we shall lay in wait until "
"you give us a signal then ambush the orcs’ rear."
msgstr ""
"我们靠着匿踪生存。我们可以帮助你溜进城里，把兽人团团包围。或者，我们也可以等"
"待你的信号，然后从兽人的背后偷袭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#. $thief_count will be the word "three" "four" or "five"
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:434
#| msgid ""
#| "Very well. When you raise your red banner over any building in the city "
#| "proper, we will see the sign and attack from the city’s northern gate."
msgid ""
"When you raise your blue banner over any village in the city proper, we will "
"see the sign and attack from the city’s center. Expect $thief_count of us to "
"join the attack."
msgstr ""
"很好。公子只需要把红旗挂在城内任意一栋建筑上作为信号，我们看到后，就从城市的"
"北门攻入。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:438
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:523
msgid "Agreed. But, will you be able to see our flag if it’s dark?"
msgstr "就这么说定了。不过黑灯瞎火的，你们能看到我们的旗帜吗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:442
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:527
msgid ""
"Yes, we will see it. In fact, we prefer to fight at night. I pray you do not "
"lead us into slaughter."
msgstr ""
"呵呵，我们会看到的。事实上，我们更喜欢在夜间战斗。不过我祈祷公子不会把我们陷"
"进屠杀之中。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:446
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:531
msgid ""
"Do not fear, friends. There will be a slaughter here, but it will be orcish "
"blood staining the streets."
msgstr ""
"不用怕，朋友们。这里的确即将有一场屠杀，血洗街头，不过，那将是兽人的血。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:458
msgid ""
"Information, child. There is a hidden ford on the southwest side of the "
"city. Very few people know about it, least of all the orcs. I can show you "
"how to cross."
msgstr "情报,孩子。城市西南侧有一个秘密的渡口。知道它的人很少,兽人就更不知道了。我可以带你们过去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#. $thief_count will be the word "three" "four" or "five"
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:463
msgid ""
"Alternatively, we can lay in wait until you give us a signal then ambush the "
"orcs’ rear. Expect $thief_count of us to join the attack."
msgstr "或者,我们可以埋伏起来,等你发出信号,再去伏击兽人的后方。预计我们会有 $thief_count 人加入进攻。"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:472
msgid "Help us infiltrate the city. We can do the rest."
msgstr "帮我们潜入城中。剩下的事情交给我们处理。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:476
msgid "Very well. Watch exactly where I step."
msgstr "好吧。仔细看我的脚步。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:505
#| msgid ""
#| "To Konrad’s surprise, they quickly made their way across the river’s "
#| "mouth. The turbulent waters hid a nearly invisible ford, wide enough for "
#| "two soldiers to march shoulder-to-shoulder."
msgid ""
"You see? When the tide is at its lowest, the turbulent waters reveal a ford "
"wide enough for two soldiers to march shoulder-to-shoulder. The orcs know "
"not where to step. Now you do."
msgstr ""
"出乎科纳德的意料，那几人飞速渡过河口。滚滚河水之下竟藏有一处几乎看不到的浅"
"滩，宽度足够两名士兵肩靠肩前行。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:509
msgid "Good luck. You shall see me again if you succeed."
msgstr "祝你好运。如果你成功,你就会再见到我。"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:515
msgid "I want you to reinforce us once we break through their line."
msgstr "我军冲破他们的防线后，希望你们前来增援。"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:519
#| msgid ""
#| "Very well. When you raise your red banner over any building in the city "
#| "proper, we will see the sign and attack from the city’s northern gate."
msgid ""
"Very well. When you raise your blue banner over any village in the city "
"proper, we will see the sign and attack from the city’s center."
msgstr ""
"很好。公子只需要把红旗挂在城内任意一栋建筑上作为信号，我们看到后，就从城市的"
"北门攻入。"

#. [message]: speaker=foxtail1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:551
#| msgid "What in the world are you doing here?"
msgid "What!? How are you walking on water?"
msgstr "又是你！你在这里做什么？"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:571
#| msgid "Let’s expel these invaders! Today, the city is ours again!"
msgid ""
"That’s their banner! Let’s expel these invaders. Today, the city is ours "
"again!"
msgstr "驱逐这些侵略者！今天，我们要光复这座城市！"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:614
msgid ""
"We tried t’ tell Maddock this would happen. We had a real chance after "
"Halstead fell, back when his son helped us fight."
msgstr "我们试着告诉过马多克,事情会变成这样。哈尔斯特德陷落之后,我们本来是有机会的,就是当年他儿子帮我们打仗的时候。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:618
msgid ""
"I suppose he kept his city safe for a while. But were it worth it in the end?"
msgstr "我想他确实把城市守护了一段时间。但到头来,这一切值得吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:640
msgid "Arrgh! Lousy humans..."
msgstr "嗬嗬!该死的人类……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. I say that the orc wasn't actually wearing the sandals, because otherwise we'd have to change his behavior in-game
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:652
msgid ""
"Look — that orc had in his pouch some strange, magical-looking sandals, "
"likely looted from some wealthy merchant or ship captain. They seem oddly "
"dry, despite the water all around."
msgstr "看——那个兽人的袋子里有双奇怪的、看似附有魔法的凉鞋,多半是从某位富商或船长身上抢来的。尽管周围全是水,它们却异常干燥。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:659
msgid "Seafarer’s Sandals"
msgstr "海行者的凉鞋"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:660
msgid ""
"This enchanted footwear repels nearby water, allowing\n"
"its wearer to walk on water, swamp, or snow as if standing on solid ground."
msgstr "这件附魔的鞋可以排斥近处的水,使穿着者能在水面、沼泽或雪地上行走,如同踏在实地一般。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:666
msgid ""
"Magic of this caliber is most rare and hard-to-come-by! I shall wear them "
"myself, and be grateful for the boon. Now, to finish off the remaining "
"orcish leader."
msgstr "这种等级的魔法,稀有而难得!我要亲自穿上,感激这份福祉。现在,去收拾剩下的兽人首领。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:680
msgid "I’m not dying! Orcs never die! I just... need a moment..."
msgstr "我才没死!兽人不会死!我只是……需要缓一缓……"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:688
msgid ""
"Well done, well done! Elensefar is finally rid of those loathsome beasts."
msgstr "干得好,干得好!艾尔森法尔终于摆脱了那些令人作呕的野兽。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:692
msgid ""
"You walk free once more! But for how long? Once we leave, who will remain to "
"defend the bridges?"
msgstr "你们又自由了!但能自由多久?我们离开后,谁来守桥?"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:696
msgid ""
"They say the best defense is a good offense, no? I place the thieves of "
"Elensefar in your service, your exaltedness, ready to take the fight to the "
"dark queen."
msgstr "俗话说最好的防御就是进攻,对吧?我把艾尔森法尔的窃贼们交到你麾下,大人,随时准备向黑暗女王开战。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:698
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Thieves!"
msgstr "科纳德现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Reglok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:701
msgid ""
"I myself must of course remain behind to oversee the city. You understand."
msgstr "我自己当然得留下来看管这座城市。你懂的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:705
msgid ""
"All too well. Rule wisely, ambitious Reglok, for I shall return to Elensefar "
"once Asheviere is defeated and I am king. Prove yourself a better lord than "
"the orcs."
msgstr "我自然心知肚明。愿你智慧地统治,野心勃勃的雷格洛克,因为待我击败艾什薇尔、登基为王,我会回到艾尔森法尔。证明你自己是个比兽人更好的领主。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:724
msgid ""
"Between the siege and our attack, Elensefar has been badly damaged. "
"Countless townsfolk will die if we cannot finish things off soon!"
msgstr "在围攻与进攻之下,艾尔森法尔已严重受损。若我们再不快点结束,无数市民将命丧于此!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/11_Elensefar_After.cfg:731
msgid ""
"Our battle has dragged on too long; Elensefar is all but destroyed. Even if "
"we defeat these orcs, the city will never-again return to its former "
"splendor..."
msgstr "我们的战斗拖得太久了;艾尔森法尔几乎被毁了。即便我们击败这些兽人,这座城市也永远无法重现往日的辉煌……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:18
#| msgid "scenario name^Blackwater Port"
msgid "scenario name^Fort Tahn"
msgstr "黑水港"

#. [side]: type=Master Bowman, id=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:47
msgid "Fort Tahn Garrison"
msgstr "塔恩要塞守军"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:160
msgid ""
"Villains! You have pillaged a great treasure from the halls of my home. "
"Return it at once, and your lives may yet be spared!"
msgstr "恶人!你们从我家的殿堂里劫走了大量珍宝。立刻还回来,或许还能饶你们一命!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:164
msgid "You— you’re Konrad! The false prince himself, here?!"
msgstr "你——你是康拉德!伪王子本人亲自来了?!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:168
msgid ""
"I’m not about to surrender myself nor my property to a rebel! To arms, "
"loyalists, and make ready to repel the invaders!"
msgstr "我绝不会把自己和我的财物交给叛军!拿起武器,忠臣们,准备击退入侵者!"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:172
msgid ""
"It is war, then. Such an insult against my Aethenwood kin shall not go "
"unpunished."
msgstr "那就开战吧。对我艾瑟森林族人的这种侮辱,绝不能不受到惩罚。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:180
msgid "Defeat the Master Bowman"
msgstr "击败首席弓手"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:214
msgid ""
"Seeing all this stolen gold and broken treasures kindles a great coldness in "
"my heart. Asheviere has much to pay for..."
msgstr "看着这些被盗的黄金和破碎的珍宝,我心中升起一股彻骨的寒意。艾什薇尔欠下的债,多到要还……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:239
msgid ""
"You dare use that bow against us? The Moonbows belong to the elves; you know "
"nothing about them and have no right to lay a hand on one!"
msgstr "你竟敢用那把弓对付我们?月弓属于精灵;你对它们一无所知,也无权碰它们!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:243
msgid ""
"I know enough: I’ve trained in archery my entire life and never seen a bow "
"to rival this one. Fighting with it is my best chance at beating you!"
msgstr "我知道得够多了:我一生都在练箭,从未见过能与这把弓相媲美的弓。用它作战,是击败你的最好机会!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:274
msgid "One leader has been defeated, but he is not the one who holds the bow."
msgstr "一位首领被击败了,但持弓的不是他。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:294
msgid ""
"The rebels are too powerful! Mercy, Konrad! I’m just doing my duty to defend "
"my country, as ordered by my sovereign, the queen!"
msgstr "叛军太强大了!饶命吧,康拉德!我不过是在尽我的职责,保卫我的国家,奉我的君主、女王的命令!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:298
msgid ""
"Surrender your elven weapon, and swear an oath to never again take up arms "
"against me or my allies. I am the true sovereign in Wesnoth, and will give "
"you but one chance at redemption."
msgstr "交出你的精灵武器,并发誓永不向我和我的盟友举兵。我是韦诺特的真正君主,我只给你一次赎罪的机会。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:302
msgid ""
"But Asheviere will kill me! ...I suppose you will too. If you really are the "
"heir, and an elf-lover besides, then I suppose our pillage does most "
"rightfully belong to you. Here, take it, and leave the rest of us alive!"
msgstr "但艾什薇尔会杀了我的!……我想你们也会。如果你真的是继承人,还是个喜欢精灵的家伙,那我们劫掠来的东西理当归你所有。给你,拿走,放过我们!"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:328
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:501
msgid "You have gained 300 gold!"
msgstr "你获得了300枚金币！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:351
msgid ""
"As for the rest of you — begone! Return to your homes in Westin and never "
"again trouble my people, lest the wrath of the elves fall upon you!"
msgstr "至于你们其他人——滚吧!回到西斯坦的家里,永远别再骚扰我的族人,否则精灵之怒将降于你们!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:352
msgid ""
"Your master has fled — now begone, servants of the false queen! Return to "
"your homes in Westin, and trouble the true heir no more."
msgstr "你们的主人已经跑了——现在滚吧,伪女王的仆从们!回到西斯坦的家里,别再麻烦真正的继承人了。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:353
msgid ""
"Hah! Yeah, you’d better run! And that goes for the rest of you, too, now "
"that your leader has fled!"
msgstr "哈!对,你最好跑!而且既然你们的首领已经跑了,你们其他人也该跑了!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:354
msgid ""
"An’ that goes for th’ rest o’ you too! Get out o’ here, an’ tell Westin we "
"sent you!"
msgstr "这对你们其他人也一样!滚出这里,并告诉西斯坦,是我送你们回去的!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:355
msgid ""
"And the rest of you — begone! For lo! The Light stands with Konrad, and only "
"those of darkness dare to oppose him."
msgstr "至于你们其他人——滚吧!看哪!光明与康拉德同在,唯有黑暗之人才敢与他为敌。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:356
msgid ""
"An’ that goes for th’ rest o’ you too, ye horse-faced sons o’ elves! Run "
"back to Westin afore I boil yer kneecaps inside yer skulls!"
msgstr "这对你们其他人也一样,你们这些马脸的精灵崽子!趁我没把你们的膝盖骨在脑袋里煮烂之前,滚回西斯坦去吧!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:358
msgid ""
"Da rest of you better be leavin’ now too. Konrad good troll-friend. You don’ "
"wanna see what troll do to you if you keep fightin’ Konrad."
msgstr "你们其他人最好现在就走。康拉德是伟大的巨魔之友。你们可不想看见,要是再跟康拉德打下去,巨魔会对你们干什么。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:359
msgid ""
"And that goes for the rest of you too! Return to your homes in Westin, and "
"trouble the Aethenwood no more."
msgstr "这对你们其他人也一样!回到西斯坦的家里去吧,别再打扰艾瑟森林。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Konrad is level 1, and does not have a bow attack. Once he reaches level 2 and gains a bow attack, the Moonbow will strengthen it.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:371
msgid ""
"With that, Fort Tahn is ours, the Aethenwood’s gold reclaimed, and this "
"Moonbow recaptured! Once my archery improves I shall take it for my own, and "
"someday wield it in battle against the dark queen. May its silver never "
"tarnish."
msgstr "如此,塔恩要塞归我们所有,艾瑟森林的黄金被夺回,这把月弓也重获!等我的弓术有所精进,我便将它据为己有,终有一日挥舞它与黑暗女王作战。愿它的银光永不褪色。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:376
msgid ""
"With that, Fort Tahn is ours, the Aethenwood’s gold reclaimed, and this "
"Moonbow recaptured! Once peace is restored this weapon belongs back in the "
"Aethenwood, but for now I choose to wield it in battle against the dark "
"queen. May its silver never tarnish."
msgstr "如此,塔恩要塞归我们所有,艾瑟森林的黄金被夺回,这把月弓也重获!待和平恢复,这件武器理应归还艾瑟森林,但眼下我选择挥舞它,与黑暗女王作战。愿它的银光永不褪色。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:385
msgid "Elvish Moonbow"
msgstr "精灵月弓"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:386
msgid ""
"This magical weapon adds 3 strikes, the <i>slows</i> special, and the "
"<i>arcane</i> special to Konrad’s bow attacks."
msgstr "这件魔法武器使康拉德的弓攻击增加3次打击,并获得<i>减速</i>特殊能力和<i>神秘</i>特殊能力。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:401
msgid ""
"The false prince is proving a more difficult foe that I had expected. Some "
"soldiers left for Westin not long ago — I’d better send a messenger and call "
"them back to help."
msgstr "这个伪王子比我想的要难对付。不久前,一部分士兵被调去西斯坦——我最好派人去召回他们来增援。"

#. [message]: role=reinforcement
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:416
msgid ""
"You called for aid, Castellan? We’ve come to fight, and the Westin militia "
"is not far behind!"
msgstr "堡主大人,你在求援?我们来战斗了,西斯坦的民兵也不远!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/13_Fort_Tahn.cfg:420
msgid ""
"We’ve taken too long to sack the fort, and now more soldiers have arrived! "
"Even if we defeat them all, we’ll suffer greatly from the delay..."
msgstr "我们洗劫这座堡垒花的时间太长了,现在又有更多士兵赶到了!即便我们击败他们所有人,这场耽搁也会让我们损失惨重……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:8
msgid "scenario name^Gryphon Mountain"
msgstr "狮鹫山"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:37
msgid "Burlin’s Crew"
msgstr "布凛的队伍"

#. [side]: type=Gryphon, id=Mother Gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:65
msgid "Mother Gryphon"
msgstr "狮鹫之母"

#. [side]: type=Gryphon, id=Mother Gryphon
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:72
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:109
msgid "Gryphons"
msgstr "狮鹫"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:167
msgid ""
"The fabled Gryphon Mountain! It’s not the tallest mountain in Wesnoth, nor "
"the widest, but is held in renown by poets and scholars alike for the "
"beautiful gryphons who come here to nest. It’s nice to take a break from all "
"our fighting and experience nature."
msgstr "传说中名满天下的狮鹫山!它不是韦诺特最高的山,也不是最宽的,但诗人与学者都对这里的狮鹫推崇备至——因为它们来这里筑巢。暂时停下所有的战斗,领略一下大自然,真是件美事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:172
msgid "Hey! Hey, kid!"
msgstr "嘿!嘿,小子!"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:177
msgid ""
"You look like a strapping young lad! What do you say about doin’ a bit o’ "
"work for old uncle Burlin?"
msgstr "你看着挺壮实的年轻人!愿不愿意给老叔叔布凛干点活?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:181
msgid "I might be interested. What kind of work?"
msgstr "我或许会感兴趣。什么样的活?"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:185
msgid ""
"The <b><i>best</i></b> kind o’ work: well-paying! I’s got a contract to "
"collect fifty gryphon eggs, see? But I ain’t excited to risk my crew’s lives "
"on the job."
msgstr "<b><i>最</i></b>棒的那种活:工资高!我手头有个合同,要收集五十枚狮鹫蛋,懂吗?但我可不想让弟兄们的命搭在这上头。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:189
msgid ""
"So, I say you an’ I make a deal. You kill off the gryphons for me, an’ when "
"I make my sale t’ the queen I’ll split the profit with ye’, 70-30."
msgstr "这样,我说咱俩做笔买卖。你替我把那些狮鹫宰了,等我把货卖给女王,我就跟你分成,七三开。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:193
msgid ""
"The queen? You’re working for Asheviere?! I’d never ally myself with such a "
"villain!"
msgstr "女王?你在给艾什薇尔干活?!”我绝不会跟这种恶人结盟!"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:197
msgid ""
"... well aye, o’ course I’m workin’ for her! Ain’t this the middle o’ "
"Wesnoth? Who else would be in charge, that good-for-nothin’ rebel Konrad? Hey"
"— did I say 70-30? I meant 50-50!"
msgstr "……是嘛,我当然替她工作!这不是韦诺特的心脏地带吗?还能是谁当家,那个不成器的叛军康拉德?嘿——我说的是70比30?我是说50比50!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:202
msgid ""
"Tha’s a ripe load o’ tripe if ah’ve e’er heard one! What kind o’ dwarf-"
"traitor slackjaw gives up ’is own kind? An’ this IS Prince Konrad, you "
"numbskull! Show some respect!"
msgstr "这是我有生以来听过最扯淡的话!什么样的矮人叛徒才会抛弃自己的族人?而且这位就是康拉德王子,你这个榆木脑袋!有点敬意好不好!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:207
msgid ""
"I <b><i>am</i></b> Konrad, heir to the throne of Wesnoth and a sworn enemy "
"of Asheviere’s! No amount of money will turn my blade. Raise your axe and "
"make ready for battle, villain!"
msgstr "我<b><i>就是</i></b>康拉德,韦诺特王位的继承者,艾什薇尔的宿敌!再多的金子也买不动我的刀。举起你的斧头,准备战斗吧,恶棍!"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:212
msgid ""
"Err... look, Your Highness, this is just business. I’ve got nothin’ ’gainst "
"neither you nor Asheviere, but I do want to keep my word an’ do my job."
msgstr "呃……喂,殿下,这只是生意。我对你和艾什薇尔都没意见,但我不想食言,也不想误了自己的事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:216
msgid ""
"Work together with me now, an’ once I’ve cleaned out the nests I’ll let you "
"have your pick of the eggs. Gryphons’re worth somethin’ fierce in a scrap, "
"ye ken?"
msgstr "现在跟我合作,等我把巢穴清空了,就让你挑最好的蛋。狮鹫打起仗来可了不得,你知道吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:218
msgid ""
"I’ll even send some o’ my crew with you, to help you train your gryphons "
"once they hatch!"
msgstr "我还会派一些手下跟你走,帮你驯服那些狮鹫,等它们孵化出来!"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:222
msgid ""
"You get yer rebel army, an’ I get my big sack o’ gold from the queen. "
"Everyone wins, an’ nobody has to die."
msgstr "你得到你的叛军,我从女王那里拿到一大袋金子。大家都有好处,谁也不用死。"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:228
msgid ""
"Agree to Burlin’s deal: Konrad learns to recruit Gryphon Riders and Dwarvish "
"Scouts"
msgstr "同意布林的交易:康拉德学会招募狮鹫骑士和矮人侦察兵"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:235
msgid ""
"Fight Burlin: Asheviere loses $s50_burlin_income_penalty income and cannot "
"recruit Gryphon Riders in the final scenario"
msgstr "与布林战斗:艾什薇尔损失 $s50_burlin_income_penalty 收入,在最终场景中无法招募狮鹫骑士"

#. [message]: type=Young Ogre
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:263
msgid "Uhh... who you? You squishy! Me squish you!"
msgstr "呃……你是谁?你软绵绵的!我要捏死你!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:298
msgid ""
"Very well. I don’t like aligning myself in any way with the dark queen, but "
"you make a valid point. I’ll need gryphons and dwarves if I want my army to "
"be victorious."
msgstr "好吧。我不想以任何形式与黑暗女王合作,但你说得有道理。如果我想让我的军队取得胜利,就需要狮鹫和矮人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:302
msgid ""
"Great! I knew ye’d come round. Tha’ big gryphon in the middle is the "
"matriarch — kill her off an’ we’ll have no trouble gettin’ the eggs we need."
msgstr "太好了!我就知道你能想通。中间那只大狮鹫就是母狮鹫——干掉她,我们就能轻松拿到我们需要的蛋了。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:314
msgid "Defeat the gryphon leader"
msgstr "击败狮鹫首领"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:320
#| msgid "Death of Kalenz"
msgid "Death of Burlin"
msgstr "卡雷兹死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=Mother Gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:337
msgid "Krawww! Krawww..."
msgstr "卡哇!卡哇……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:348
msgid ""
"With the matriarch dead, the rest of them have fled! The mountain is silent "
"once again."
msgstr "母狮鹫死了,剩下的都逃走了!群山又恢复了沉寂。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:353
msgid "Twenty..."
msgstr "二十个……"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:358
msgid "Forty..."
msgstr "四十个……"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:363
msgid ""
"Fifty! That’s all I need. As promised, the rest of the eggs are yours. And "
"here’s some o’ my crew to help you ride ’em once they hatch. Great work, kid."
msgstr "五十个!这就是我需要的数量。如约所约,剩下的蛋都归你。这里还有我的手下,可以帮你驯服它们,等它们孵化出来。干得好,小子。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:365
#| msgid "You can now recruit fearsome Gryphon Riders!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Gryphon Riders and Dwarvish Scouts!"
msgstr "您现在可以征募令人闻风丧胆的狮鹫骑士了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:381
msgid "Ack! So much fer my gold..."
msgstr "啊!我的金子……"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:395
msgid ""
"Oy, can ye hurry it up? Time is money, an’ I ain’t makin’ any standin’ "
"around!"
msgstr "喂,你能不能快点?时间就是金钱,我可没时间干站着!"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:402
msgid ""
"Ah, forget it, yer takin’ too long. I’ll deal with this meself — an’ keep "
"all the reward for meself too!"
msgstr "啊,算了,你太慢了。这事我自己办——赏金也全归我!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:425
msgid ""
"I said raise your axe, villain! Any friend of Asheviere’s is a foe of mine!"
msgstr "我说过,举起你的斧头,恶棍!艾什薇尔的友军,就是我的敌人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:429
msgid "Well, I tried. It’s yer funeral, kid."
msgstr "算了,我也试过。你自己看着办吧,小子。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:436
msgid ""
"Hey boys, wake up an’ set up camp! Looks like we’re gonna need to fight fer "
"it after all!"
msgstr "嘿,兄弟们,起床扎营!看来最后还是得靠打才能办成!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:451
msgid "Defeat Burlin"
msgstr "击败巴尔林"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:471
msgid ""
"You’d think these gryphons would show a little more gratitude, instead of "
"trying to kill us..."
msgstr "你以为这些狮鹫会表现一点感恩之心,而不是试图把我们杀死吗……"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:483
msgid ""
"Ah, humbug. Now the queen’ll ne’er get her gryphons... an’ I’ll ne’er get my "
"gold..."
msgstr "啊,真丢人。这下女王再也得不到她的狮鹫了……我的金子也没了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:490
msgid "Even on his deathbed, money is all he cares about."
msgstr "哪怕到了弥留之际,他关心的也只有钱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:498
msgid ""
"That’s why we have to fight her. Not for my sake, but for all the people "
"suffering under Asheviere’s lash."
msgstr "这就是我们必须与她战斗的原因。不是为了我自己,而是为了所有在艾什薇尔铁蹄下受苦的人们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:517
msgid ""
"Argh, this is takin’ too long. I’d better send a messenger to Dan’Tonk an’ "
"call for help."
msgstr "啊,这也太慢了。最好还是派个信使去塔恩要塞叫援军。"

#. [message]: role=messenger
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/14_Gryphon_Mountain.cfg:533
msgid ""
"Ah’m back, Burlin! An’ I’ve brought a whole army with me — th’ queen’s "
"pretty excited to finally capture the rebel prince!"
msgstr "我回来了,布林!这次我带了一整支军队——女王总算能把那个叛军王子活捉了,真是兴奋得不得了!"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:7
msgid "scenario name^Valley of Death"
msgstr "scenario name^亡魂谷"

#. [side]: type=Shock Trooper, id=Kaelor
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:37
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:100
msgid "Warrior Monks"
msgstr "战斗僧侣"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:233
msgid ""
"Hail, strangers! The seals are failing, and the sister senior sent us to "
"find aid. You must return with us to help our home, else all may soon be "
"lost!"
msgstr "你们好,陌生人!封印正在失效,大修道院派我们寻找援助。你必须跟我们回去帮助家园,否则一切都将很快毁于一旦!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:237
msgid ""
"Don’t worry, warrior, we’ve already been to your home and fought to restore "
"the seals! Your people are safe."
msgstr "别担心,战士,我们已经去过你们的家园,并肩作战以修复封印!你们的族人安全了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:241
msgid ""
"Can it be true? Joyous news! You have my deepest gratitude, young one. Aid "
"us in battle against these undead stragglers, and my warriors and I shall be "
"glad to join you."
msgstr "可能是真的吗?真是好消息!年轻人,我感激不尽。帮我们一起对抗这些落单的亡灵,我和我的战士很乐意加入你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:247
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:281
msgid "Hail, strangers! How have these undead come to trouble you?"
msgstr "你们好,陌生人!这些亡灵是怎么来招惹你们的?"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#. "brother" is not literal, instead referring to fellow warrior monks (heavy infantry) of Moremirmu's order
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:252
msgid ""
"Strangers? No, Konrad, these are my brethren! Kaelor, it is good to once "
"again lay eyes upon a fellow brother of the faith. But what are undead doing "
"so near to our hallowed home?"
msgstr "陌生人?不,康拉德,他们是我的兄弟!卡埃洛,再次见到同信仰的兄弟,真好。但亡灵为什么会在我们神圣的家园附近?"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#. "brother" is not literal, instead referring to fellow warrior monks (heavy infantry) of Kaleor's order
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:257
msgid ""
"Grim tidings, brother Moremirmu! The seals are failing, and the sister "
"senior sent us to cut through these restless dead and find aid for our home!"
msgstr "噩耗,莫瑞米尔穆兄弟!封印正在失效,大修道院派我们劈开这些躁动的亡者,为家园寻找援助!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#. "brother" is not literal, instead referring to fellow warrior monks (heavy infantry) of Moremirmu's order
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:262
msgid ""
"The seals? By the Light! I have been away from home for far too long, "
"brother. Yet now have I returned — and with me comes a lost prince and his "
"warriors most righteous, ready to aid you!"
msgstr "封印?光明在上!兄弟,我离家已经太久了。但如今我回来了——随我而来的,还有失散多年的王子和他正直勇敢的战士,他们随时准备援助你!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:267
msgid "I don’t understand. Moremirmu, what’s going on?"
msgstr "我不明白。莫瑞米尔穆,发生了什么事?"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:271
msgid ""
"These are fellow servants of the light, Konrad. Men from my home — a "
"monastery, some days travel northwards. There is a powerful magic protecting "
"my home, yet Kaelor reports that it is weakening. Undead have begun to slip "
"through."
msgstr "康拉德,这些都是同样侍奉光明的同伴。他们来自我的家园——北边数日路程外的修道院。有一种强大的魔法守护着家园,但卡埃洛报告说,那种魔法正在衰弱。亡灵已经开始渗透进来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:275
msgid ""
"We must fight through these undead and go at once to their aid, for without "
"our help they may soon lose all!"
msgstr "我们必须突破这些亡灵,立刻去支援他们,因为如果没有我们的帮助,他们很快就会一无所有了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:285
msgid ""
"Nay, ’tis we who have come to trouble them! The seals are failing, and the "
"sister senior sent us to cut through these restless dead and find aid for "
"our home! But who are you to ask, stranger of the south?"
msgstr "不,是我们去打扰他们!封印正在失效,大修道院派我们劈开这些躁动的亡者,为家园寻找援助!不过,南方的来客,你又是谁呢?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:289
msgid ""
"Well met. I am Konrad. But I don’t understand — you said you’re looking for "
"help?"
msgstr "幸会。我是康拉德。但我不明白——你说你在寻找帮助?"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:293
msgid ""
"Indeed. I come from a monastery, some days travel northwards. A powerful "
"magic that once protected my home has weakened, and I was sent to seek aid."
msgstr "正是如此。我来自北边数日路程之外的修道院。曾守护我们家园的强力魔法已经衰弱,所以我被派出来寻求援助。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:297
msgid ""
"But if you serve the light and not the darkness, then that aid is you! Fight "
"alongside me to vanquish these undead now, then return with us north and "
"help our home. Otherwise, all shall soon be lost!"
msgstr "但如果你侍奉的是光明而非黑暗,那么你所提供的帮助,就是你本人!现在与我并肩作战,击败这些亡灵,然后随我们北归,帮助我们的家园。否则,一切都将很快毁于一旦!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: description=<span strikethrough='true' color='#A9A9A9'>, condition=win
#. if Kaelor is protected, Konrad will learn to recruit Heavy Infantrymen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:313
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:321
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "Protect Kaelor: recruit Heavy Infantrymen"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:349
msgid "Kaelor, who are you people? How did all these undead come to be here?"
msgstr "卡埃洛,你们是什么人?这些亡灵是怎么跑到这里来的?"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:353
msgid ""
"The hills to the north — now the home of my order — were once a wholly "
"accursed place, blighted by necromancy and consumed by darkness."
msgstr "北边的山丘——如今是我们教团的家园——曾经是彻头彻尾的受诅咒之地,被死灵魔法所侵蚀,被黑暗所吞噬。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:357
msgid ""
"We know not from whence the evil came. Some think the necromancers to be "
"lich-lords, survivors of their invasion from the west; others believe they "
"are stragglers of Ras-Tabahn’s. We only know that centuries ago, the crown "
"used the ruby to seal them underground with powerful magic."
msgstr "我们不知道这股邪恶究竟来自何方。有人认为那些死灵法师是巫妖君主,是从西边入侵的幸存者;也有人认为他们是拉斯·塔班手下的残兵败将。我们只知道,几个世纪以前,王冠曾利用红宝石,用强大的魔法将他们封印在地底。"

#. [message]: speaker=$speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:361
msgid ""
"Men and women of our order, servants of the light, have made it our mission "
"to cleanse this place of evil. We built our monastery here to ensure that "
"the darkness never escapes."
msgstr "我们教团的男女,光明的仆从,早已把净化这片土地的邪恶作为自己的使命。我们在这里建起修道院,就是为了确保黑暗永远不会逃走。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:365
msgid ""
"But it has been decades since the Crown sent to us men or supplies, and the "
"power of our order has waned. Now the seals are beginning to fail..."
msgstr "但是几十年以来,王冠再也没有向我们派遣过士兵或物资,我们教团的力量也在不断衰退。如今封印已经开始失效……"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:380
msgid "My light fades..."
msgstr "我的光明正在消退……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:384
msgid ""
"Those armored warriors would surely have been of great help in our fight for "
"the crown. If only we could have protected them..."
msgstr "那些身穿铠甲的战士,在我们争夺王位的战斗中,本可以帮上大忙。要是我们能保护好他们就好了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:408
msgid ""
"This ruined skeleton bears a curious amulet. Magical, perhaps? There is an "
"inscription explaining its function..."
msgstr "这具残破的骷髅戴着一枚奇怪的护符。是魔法的?上面有一行铭文,解释着它的功能……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:420
msgid ""
"How odd. In death, this skeleton was a puppet. But in life, he or she must "
"have been a craftsman of legendary skill. Fortune has smiled upon us today — "
"I will take this artifact for myself."
msgstr "真奇怪。死亡中,这具骷髅是个傀儡。但生前,他或她必定是技艺传奇的匠人。今天幸运眷顾我们——我要把这件遗物据为己有。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:439
msgid ""
"Lo, our victory is won! And with the seal already restored and our home "
"already rescued, there is nothing to prevent my brothers and I from joining "
"you on your quest, Konrad."
msgstr "看,我们胜利了!而且封印已修复,家园已得救,再没有什么能阻止我和我的弟兄们加入你的征程,康拉德。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#. "brother" is not literal, instead referring to fellow warrior monks (heavy infantry) of Kaleor's order
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:445
msgid ""
"Lo and behold! We have won a bright victory against the forces of darkness, "
"good warrior. My brothers and I would be honored to continue fighting by "
"your side."
msgstr "看哪!我们战胜了黑暗势力,取得了辉煌的胜利,勇敢的战士。我和我的弟兄们,将很荣幸继续与你并肩战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:449
msgid ""
"Yet these few abominations were but a moth, drawn to the dark flame that "
"stems from what lies to the north! I implore you, brave Konrad, travel north "
"and rescue my home!"
msgstr "然而这些寥寥的可憎之物,不过是只飞蛾,被北方深处那黑暗火焰所吸引!勇敢的康拉德,我恳求你,向北而去,拯救我的家园!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:454
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Heavy Infantrymen!"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:461
msgid ""
"The undead have been defeated! Yet with the leader of the warrior monks "
"slain, we have lost the opportunity to gain a new ally in our fight for the "
"crown."
msgstr "死者已被击败!但僧兵领袖战死,我们失去了在王座争夺战中获得一位新盟友的机会。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:484
msgid ""
"Make haste, Konrad! Should we tarry too long, the seals shall surely break "
"and our home shall surely be destroyed!"
msgstr "抓紧,康拉德!若我们耽搁太久,封印必然破碎,我们的家园必然被毁!"

#. [message]: speaker=Kaelor
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15a_Valley_of_Death_part1.cfg:495
msgid ""
"Alas, we have tarried too long. Even should we yet win the battle today, "
"surely the seals have already broken, destroying our home...."
msgstr "唉,我们耽搁太久了。即便我们今天赢得了这场战斗,封印恐怕也已经破碎,我们的家园将被毁灭……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:20
msgid "scenario name^Valley of Death II"
msgstr "scenario name^亡魂谷 II"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:67
msgid "Aimucasur"
msgstr "艾姆卡苏尔"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:77
msgid "Selda-Mana"
msgstr "希尔达-玛纳"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:129
msgid "Sister Kenara"
msgstr "肯娜拉修女"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:131
#| msgid "Northern Winter"
msgid "Brother Vinrar"
msgstr "北国之冬"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:132
msgid "Sister Miryan"
msgstr "米尔娅修女"

#. [message]: speaker=$speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:176
msgid ""
"Lo and behold, Konrad: my home! At last I return... but we are too late! "
"Undead! The seal has already broken!"
msgstr "看哪,康拉德:我的家园!我终于回来了……但我们来晚了!死者!封印早已破碎!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:182
msgid ""
"Lo and behold, Konrad! Fate has brought us to my home; the monastery of my "
"order."
msgstr "看哪,康拉德!命运把我们带到了我的家园;我们教团的修道院。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:186
msgid "... but what calamity is this? Undead! The sacred seal has broken!"
msgstr "……但这是何等灾祸?死者!神圣的封印破碎了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#. "Brother" is not literal. Rather, the speaker and the "brother" are both members of a monastic society
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:205
msgid ""
"Brother, you return to us! And with aid from the outside! Yet your arrival "
"is but a silver lining, too little too late, for our strength has failed."
msgstr "兄弟,你回来了!而且带来了外界的援助!可你的到来只是黑暗中的一抹亮色,为时已晚,因为我们的力量已经衰竭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:210
msgid ""
"Stranger, we welcome you to our home! Long have we awaited aid from the "
"outside... Yet your arrival is but a silver lining, too little too late, for "
"our strength has failed."
msgstr "陌生人,欢迎你来到我们的家园!我们早已在等待外界的援助……可你的到来只是黑暗中的一抹亮色,为时已晚,因为我们的力量已经衰竭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:215
msgid ""
"Dark magic streams forth from the underlevels, granting terrible un-life to "
"things sprung from the deepest nightmares of humanity. With the spell broken "
"that once sealed them below, the undead emerge to destroy us all!"
msgstr "黑暗魔法从地底涌出,赋予了源自人类最深噩梦之物的可怕不死生命。随着曾经把死者封印在下的咒术破碎,死者破土而出,要毁灭我们所有人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:227
msgid ""
"Don’t give up hope! You sent Kaelor to find help, and he found me — Konrad, "
"heir to the throne of Wesnoth. If there are undead here then it is my duty "
"to help you stop them."
msgstr "别放弃希望!你派卡埃洛去求援,他找到了我——康拉德,韦诺特王位的继承人。如果这里有死者,那么帮助你们阻止他们,就是我的职责。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:231
msgid ""
"You say there was once a spell that sealed these dead underground. Can you "
"cast it again?"
msgstr "你说这里曾经有一个法术,把这些死者封印在地下。你们能重新施展吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:236
msgid ""
"Don’t give up hope! I am Konrad, heir to the throne of Wesnoth, and if there "
"are undead here then it is my duty to help you stop them."
msgstr "别放弃希望!我是康拉德,韦诺特王位的继承人。如果这里有死者,那么帮助你们阻止他们,就是我的职责。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:240
msgid ""
"But what is this place? You say there was once a spell that sealed these "
"dead underground. Can you cast it again?"
msgstr "但这是什么地方?你说这里曾经有一个法术,把这些死者封印在地下。你们能重新施展吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:245
msgid ""
"Without the ruby? No. There are none alive today, save perhaps the great "
"Delfador, with the might to again from-naught weave such a seal."
msgstr "没有红宝石?不行。如今活着的人中,除了伟大的德法多那样的人,没有人有能力凭空编织出这样的封印。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:247
msgid ""
"But the pieces of our shattered spell still linger. With time, it could be "
"repaired."
msgstr "但被打碎的咒术碎片仍在残留。假以时日,它可以被修复。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:251
msgid ""
"We have tried before, nearly to our doom. The attempt brought the full "
"horrors of the undead crashing down upon our humble home, and many perished. "
"Light save them."
msgstr "我们试过,险些因此招来灭亡。那一次尝试,让死者的恐怖全面压向我们简陋的家园,许多人丧生。愿光明庇佑他们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:255
msgid ""
"I understand — alone, you could not defend yourself. But now I am here. I "
"will help you."
msgstr "我懂了——独自一人,你根本无力自保。但现在我来了。我会帮你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:263
msgid "You are a blessing, Konrad. With your help, perhaps it is possible."
msgstr "你是祝福,康拉德。有你的帮助,或许还有希望。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:294
msgid ""
"There are only four of us left who have the power to repair the seal. The "
"rest of us — the novices — I entrust into your command."
msgstr "只剩我们四个人,还拥有修复封印的力量。其余的人——那些见习修士——我交给你的指挥。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:298
msgid ""
"Defend our monastery while the seniors and I work. In forty-eight hours’ "
"time our ritual shall complete, and the seal shall be repaired, trapping the "
"undead back underground."
msgstr "在我和前辈们进行仪式时,请守住我们的修道院。四十八小时后,仪式完成,封印将被修复,死者将被重新封回地下。"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:314
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "You can now advance Mages to White Mages!"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [else]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:317
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Mages, and advance them to (only) White Mages!"
msgstr "康拉德现在可以招募法师,并可将他们升为(仅)白袍法师!"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:356
#| msgid "Death of Sir Kaylan"
msgid "Death of Myrilell or Kenara"
msgstr "凯兰爵士死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:365
msgid "Your allies will not move, but can attack adjacent enemies."
msgstr "你的盟友不能移动,但可以攻击相邻的敌人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:379
msgid ""
"Myrilell, how can our magic have weakened so? Where is Sister Tristia, my "
"mentor? What of Brother Percy, keeper of the ancient texts? They should have "
"stopped this."
msgstr "迈瑞蕾,我们的魔法怎么会衰弱成这样?特里丝提亚修女,我的导师,在哪儿?还有掌管古卷的珀西修士呢?他们应该能阻止这一切的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:383
msgid ""
"Dead, both. Fallen to the swelling tide of undead. You have been sorely "
"missed, Moremirmu, away on your quest to spread light across the wider world."
msgstr "都死了,两人皆亡。被不断涌来的死者之潮击倒。莫里姆,你一直在外奔波,四处传播光明,大家都想你想得厉害。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:387
msgid "Dead!? So many dead."
msgstr "死了!?”死了这么多人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:393
msgid ""
"The seal shattered, my home imperiled, my friends slain. This is the work of "
"a dozen lifetimes undone."
msgstr "封印碎裂,家园岌岌可危,朋友战死。这是一生的功业被摧毁的时刻。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:397
msgid ""
"Konrad, I am overcome by grief. I am brought to tears. The very foundation "
"of my faith is shaken."
msgstr "康拉德,我被悲伤淹没。我忍不住落泪。我信仰的根基在动摇。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:405
msgid ""
"I am sorry. I cannot battle today. I must meditate, and ponder on my "
"emotions."
msgstr "对不起,我今天无法作战。我必须冥想,审视自己的情绪。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:409
msgid ""
"Ponder your emotions? Moremirmu, I know it’s a shock to see your home in "
"crisis, but we’re about to fight a battle!"
msgstr "审视你的情绪?莫里姆,我知道看到你的家园陷入危机会令人震惊,但我们马上要打仗了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:413
msgid ""
"I am a warrior of the Light, Konrad. My Light cannot shine while there "
"within me beats a heart touched by the Dark."
msgstr "我是光明的战士,康拉德。我心中跳动着被黑暗触碰过的心脏,我的光明便无法闪耀。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:424
msgid "He’s gone!"
msgstr "他跑了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:439
msgid ""
"Myrilell, what is this place we now defend? How did you all come to be here?"
msgstr "迈瑞蕾,我们现在守着的这个地方是什么?你们怎么来到这里的?"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:443
msgid ""
"These hills — now our home — were once a wholly accursed place, blighted by "
"necromancy and consumed by darkness."
msgstr "这些山丘——如今我们的家园——曾经是一处彻头彻尾的受诅之地,被亡灵魔法侵蚀,被黑暗吞没。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:447
msgid ""
"We know not from whence the evil came. Some think the necromancers to be "
"lich-lords, survivors of their invasion from the west; others believe they "
"are stragglers of Ras-Tabahn’s. We only know that centuries ago, the crown "
"sealed them underground with powerful magic."
msgstr "我们不知道这邪恶从何而来。有人以为是巫妖诸主——从西方入侵时的幸存者;也有人认为是拉斯-塔班残党的溃兵。我们只知道,几个世纪前,王室用强大的魔法把他们封印在了地下。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:451
msgid ""
"Men and women of our order, servants of the Light, have made it our mission "
"to cleanse this place of evil. We built our monastery here to ensure that "
"the darkness never escapes."
msgstr "我们教团中的男士与女士,光明的仆从,以净化此地的邪恶为使命。我们在此修建修道院,确保黑暗永远无法逃出。"

#. [message]: speaker=Vinrar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:455
msgid ""
"But it’s been decades since the Crown last sent to us men or supplies, and "
"the power of our order has waned. And now even the seal has fallen..."
msgstr "但王室上一次给我们送人送物资,已经是几十年前的事了,我们教团的力量日渐衰弱。而如今,连封印也破碎了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:467
msgid "Look out! They’re preparing another assault."
msgstr "小心!他们正在准备又一次进攻。"

#. [message]: type=Lich
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:471
msgid ""
"For too long have we been trapped by your accursed seal! The undertunnels "
"shall be thrown open and our followers shall flood across the land! You "
"cannot stop the eternal life that we bring!"
msgstr "我们被你那该死的封印困了太久!地下通道将被敞开,我们的追随者将涌入这片大地!你们挡不住我们带来的永生!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:475
msgid ""
"Eternal life is no blessing, lich, but a curse. I have tasted from the cup "
"of which you offer, and we will not allow such poison to spread."
msgstr "永生不是祝福,巫妖,而是诅咒。我尝过了你递来的这杯,我们绝不允许这样的毒药继续蔓延。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:476
msgid ""
"For too long has the crown neglected this place. Now, the spirit of Garard "
"comes to put things right."
msgstr "王室忽视这里太久了。如今,伽拉德的精神降临,来纠正这一切。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:477
msgid ""
"As tempting as the thought may be, I’ve heard more than a few stories of "
"promising young magi tempted by necromancy. It never ends well."
msgstr "尽管这想法很有诱惑力,但我听过不止一两个关于前途无量的年轻法师被亡灵魔法诱惑的故事。这从来不会有好的结局。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:478
msgid ""
"As tempting as the thought may be, I’ve seen more than a few promising young "
"magi tempted by necromancy. It never ends well."
msgstr "尽管这想法很有诱惑力,但我见过不止一两个前途无量的年轻法师被亡灵魔法诱惑。这从来不会有好的结局。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:479
msgid ""
"Fancy talk comin’ from a stick-handed sixpenny skull, ye soused gurnet! Jus’ "
"wait ’til ah stick my axe through one o’yer wrinklin’ ribs!"
msgstr "从一个手比木棍还粗的六便士脑袋嘴里,倒说得挺好听,你这泡烂了的软皮子!等着,等我把我这把战斧插进你皱巴巴的肋骨里!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:480
msgid ""
"You’re not the first lich we’ve fought. Want to hear what we did to the last "
"one?"
msgstr "你们不是我们打过的第一个巫妖。想听听我们是怎么对待上一个的吗?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:482
msgid ""
"Really, eternal life? I’d love to discuss some of my alchemical theories "
"with you! ...wait, ah, no, you mean undeath, don’t you."
msgstr "真的吗,永生?我倒很乐意跟你探讨一下我的炼金理论!……等等,啊,不,你是说不死,对吧。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:483
msgid ""
"Ya ya ya. Dosh heard dis all before. Always someone be thinkin’ dey know "
"what’s best for everyone else."
msgstr "行行行。多什以前听过这套了。总有个人觉得他最知道什么对别人好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Vinrar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:520
msgid "At last, I see the light..."
msgstr "终于，我见到光了…"

#. [message]: speaker=Miryan
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:528
#| msgid "Plunging into the Darkness"
msgid "Yield not one inch to the darkness..."
msgstr "突入黑暗"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:540
msgid ""
"This body is merely a puppet! You cannot stop us from enlightening your "
"world to the bliss of eternal un-life!"
msgstr "这具身体不过是个傀儡!你们无法阻止我们,用永生的极乐来启迪你们的世界!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:547
msgid ""
"Your fighting only delays the inevitable! There are more of us than you "
"could ever imagine!"
msgstr "你们的战斗只是在延缓必然的结局!我们的数量比你能想象的还要多!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:551
msgid "One fewer now."
msgstr "又少了一个。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:570
msgid "Lo! My faith has been tested! And lo! It has endured!"
msgstr "看哪!我的信仰受到了考验!看哪!它经受住了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:607
msgid "In the crucible of the Light, evil shall be purged!"
msgstr "在光明的熔炉之中,邪恶必被净化!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:626
msgid ""
"Moremirmu has returned! He has gained +2 damage, +20 hitpoints,\n"
"and the powerful “smite” ability!\n"
"\n"
"Smite: each time Moremirmu strikes a finishing blow, he will deal\n"
"30 arcane damage to all adjacent enemies."
msgstr "莫瑞米尔穆回来了!他的攻击提升了 2,生命值提升了 20,\n并且获得了强力的“惩戒”能力!\n\n惩戒:每次莫瑞米尔穆使出致命一击时,\n都会对相邻的所有敌人造成 30 点奥术伤害。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:651
msgid "Nearly done, Konrad! Hold strong and we shall yet be victorious!"
msgstr "快结束了,康拉德!坚持住,我们终将胜利!"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:659
msgid "Light save us all! It is finished."
msgstr "光明庇佑我们!结束了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:689
msgid "They’re gone!"
msgstr "他们走了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:695
msgid ""
"With the seal restored, the undead have once more been banished underground. "
"We are in your debt, Your Highness."
msgstr "随着封印的修复,亡灵再次被驱逐回地底。殿下,我们欠你一个人情。"

#. [message]: speaker=Myrilell
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:699
msgid ""
"The seniors and I must remain here, to continue strengthening our magic and "
"to ensure the undead never again escape. But into your hands I entrust our "
"young mages, and the nascent Light that they nurture within. May they serve "
"you well as you journey on to reclaim your throne."
msgstr "长老们和我必须留在这里,继续强化我们的魔力,确保亡灵永远不会再次逃出。但我要把我们的年轻法师,以及他们体内孕育中的初生光明,托付给你。愿他们在你踏上夺回王位的旅途上,好好辅佐你。"

#. [message]: id=Myrilell,Kenara
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:729
msgid "No! Without her help, I have no hope of restoring the seal."
msgstr "不!没有她的帮助,我没有希望修复封印。"

#. [message]: id=Myrilell,Kenara
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/15b_Valley_of_Death_part2.cfg:733
msgid ""
"The undead will continue to pour forth and pour forth, until we are all "
"overwhelmed..."
msgstr "亡灵还会源源不断地涌出来,直到把我们全部淹没……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:14
msgid "scenario name^Crossroads"
msgstr "scenario name^交叉路口之战"

#. [side]: type=Knight, id=knight
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:58
msgid "Raery"
msgstr "莱丽"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. Lisar has prisoners, and is trying to lure Konrad into an ambush. The player has just decided to play this scenario.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:206
msgid ""
"He’s taken the bait. Quick, get down into the mines and alert the others."
msgstr "他上钩了。快,下到矿道里,去通知其他人。"

#. [message]: speaker=knight
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:215
msgid ""
"What about the prisoners, m’lady? Shall we execute them before the imposter "
"arrives?"
msgstr "那些俘虏怎么办,夫人?要不要在冒牌货到来之前把他们处决了?"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. Ulfdain throws lots of hard-to-understand old-fashioned insults at Li'sar. This is his usual way of speaking.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:220
msgid ""
"C’mere and try it, ye yellow-bellied, cow-handed blunderbuss of a princess! "
"Jus’ gimme the chance an’ I’ll rip that head right off yer ninnyhammerin’ "
"neck, ye white-livered gasser!"
msgstr "来,让我试试你这黄肚脐、牛脑袋的破炮筒公主!只要给我机会,我就把你的榆木脑袋从你那白心肠的脖子根上拧下来!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:224
msgid ""
"As tempting as the thought may be, Raery, I’m not about to kill innocents in "
"cold blood. But we do need to get the dwarves out of here — both for their "
"own safety and to keep them out of the rebels’ hands."
msgstr "这个念头固然诱人,莱丽,但我不可能冷血地杀害无辜之人。不过我们确实得把矮人们从这里带走——既为了他们自身的安全,也为了不让落入叛军手中。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:234
msgid "Too late, Konrad has come! Forget the prisoners and prepare for battle."
msgstr "太迟了,康拉德来了!别再管那些俘虏,准备战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:260
msgid ""
"I’ve come to face you, princess! Only a true villain would threaten "
"innocents to force someone into a fight."
msgstr "我是来与你正面对决的,公主!只有真正的恶徒才会以无辜者的性命相威胁,逼人与他开战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:264
msgid ""
"Oh please, the dwarves were never in any danger. You on the other hand, "
"“prince” — I will not allow you to sow any more discord and chaos among my "
"people. Your rebellion ends here."
msgstr "拜托了,矮人们从未处于任何危险之中。倒是你,“王子”——我不会再允许你在我的子民中播撒更多的纷争与混乱。你的反叛到此为止。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:272
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:462
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:889
msgid "Defeat Li’sar"
msgstr "击败莉莎"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:279
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:469
msgid "Defeat Yrogin"
msgstr "击败尤罗金"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:287
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:477
msgid "Rescue Ulfdain"
msgstr "救出乌尔夫戴恩"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:312
msgid "Look! Someone approaches from the eastern road."
msgstr "看!有人从东边的道路过来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:314
msgid "Yrogin"
msgstr "尤罗金"

#. [message]: speaker=Yrogin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:319
msgid ""
"Message from the queen, Your Highness! The boats are ready, but there is "
"only a short window in which to act before Elensefar recovers."
msgstr "殿下的消息!船已经准备好了,但趁伊伦斯法尔恢复过来,只有一小段行动窗口。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:323
msgid "Poor timing; I’m a little busy at the moment..."
msgstr "真不巧;我现在有点忙……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:327
msgid ""
"Still, Elensefar is too important a prize to let slip. I cannot risk Maddock "
"regaining his footing before we have a chance to deal the finishing blow."
msgstr "不过,伊伦斯法尔是一个太过重要的目标,不能让它溜走。我不能冒险让马多克在我们有机会给予致命一击之前稳住阵脚。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:331
msgid ""
"I’ll depart immediately. Yrogin, you assume command here. It shouldn’t take "
"much to defeat this con-man now that we’ve lured him into battle."
msgstr "我马上离开。尤罗金,这里由你指挥。我们已经把这个骗子引入了战场,击败他应该不成问题。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:436
msgid "For Her Highness! Kill the imposter!"
msgstr "为了殿下!杀了那个冒牌货!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:439
msgid ""
"Caution, Konrad! These hills are full of old mineshafts, their entrances "
"overgrown with grass and weeds. Li’sar must be using them to ambush us."
msgstr "小心,康拉德!这片群山里到处是旧矿道,入口都长满了杂草。莉莎一定是在利用它们埋伏我们。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:440
msgid ""
"Look out, Your Highness! Your cousin has stationed ambushers across the "
"hills, lurking in old mineshafts."
msgstr "小心,殿下!你的表妹把伏兵布置在这片群山里,潜伏在旧矿道中。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:441
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:442
msgid ""
"Where did you come from?! Careful, Konrad, I think there are ambushers "
"hiding in old mineshafts all across these hills."
msgstr "你们从哪冒出来的?!小心,康拉德,我觉得这片群山里的旧矿道里藏着伏兵。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:443
msgid ""
"Lo! The forces of evil ambush us at every turn — even the very ground itself "
"succors our foes within its old mines."
msgstr "看哪!邪恶的力量步步为营,处处设伏——连大地本身都在它的旧矿道里庇护着我们的敌人。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:446
msgid ""
"Those ambushers burst right out of the ground! There must be old mineshafts "
"everywhere in these hills, overgrown with grass and weeds."
msgstr "那些伏兵直接从地底冲出来!这片群山里到处都应该有长满杂草的旧矿道。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:450
msgid "Wait, stop! I’m not an imposter, I’m the real Konrad!"
msgstr "等等,住手!我不是冒牌货,我是真正的康拉德!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:454
msgid "... there’s nothing I can say to save these woodsmen, is there?"
msgstr "……说什么也救不了这些伐木工,是吧?"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:490
msgid "Invisible ambushers hide throughout the hills."
msgstr "隐身的伏兵遍布群山。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:513
msgid ""
"He’s slain nearly the last of our ambushers, Your Highness! What do we do?"
msgstr "他几乎杀光了我们的伏兵,殿下!我们该怎么办?"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:518
msgid "He’s slain nearly the last of our ambushers, lieutenant! What do we do?"
msgstr "他几乎杀光了我们的伏兵,中尉!我们该怎么办?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar,Yrogin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:523
msgid "This isn’t over. Keep up the fight!"
msgstr "还没结束。继续打!"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:539
#| msgid "Protect the Princess!"
msgid "Free the prisoners"
msgstr "保护公主！"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:545
msgid "Wait"
msgstr "等等"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:555
msgid ""
"Here are the prisoners! We can set them free, but if they join our side they "
"will certainly come under attack."
msgstr "这些是俘虏!我们可以放他们走,但如果加入我们,他们肯定会遭到攻击。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. Ulfdain is still locked up, and challenges Konrad's unit who's come nearby
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:560
msgid ""
"Come an’ git some, ye nigmenog bolting-hutch of beastliness! Ah dare ye to "
"square up an’ fight me, dwarf-to-dwarf!"
msgstr "来尝尝这个,你这头满身污秽的臭牛栏!我跟你打赌,堂堂正正地跟我打一场,矮人对矮人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:564
msgid "Wait a minute! I don’t want to fight you. I’m here to rescue you!"
msgstr "等一下!我不想跟你们打。我是来救你们的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. Ulfdain asks Konrad to let him and his dwarf miner allies out of their cages so they can help fight Li'sar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:569
msgid ""
"Oh, what’s that? Seems ah misjudged ye, son. Hurry up then, ye spoony cub, "
"lemme an’ my boys out o’ these here cages so we can get to th’ fight!"
msgstr "噢,怎么回事?看来我看走眼了,小子。快点,你这愣头青,把我和我手下的家伙们从这些笼子里放出来,让我们去打这一仗!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:580
msgid "You’re free now! How did you come to be imprisoned?"
msgstr "你们自由了!你们怎么会被关在这里的?"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. Much better, thank you for freeing us. That's the last time I dig a mine for your human queen, let me tell you.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:585
msgid ""
"Much better, thank ye for freein’ us! Tha’s the last time I dig a mine for "
"yer human queen, lemme tell you. “Clean up the old crossroads mines”, she "
"says. “The princess needs ’em for somethin’!”"
msgstr "好多了,谢谢你来救我们!我跟你讲,我再也不给你们人类的女王挖矿了。“清理一下十字路口的旧矿道,”她说,“公主用得上!”"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. All we do is insult the queen a few times, in a friendly manner, and she gibbeted us. You humans just don't appreciate a good insult.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:590
msgid ""
"All we do is insult th’ queen a few times, all friendly-like and such, an’ "
"it was straight to the gibbet! You beanpoles jus’ dinnae appreciate a good "
"insult!"
msgstr "我们不过是恭恭敬敬地讽刺了女王几句,我们就立刻被押上了绞架!你们这些豆芽菜,根本不懂什么是好的挖苦!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. And now my job is gone; guess I have nothing left for me now but revenge. So if you're out to beat the queen, me and my boys are with you. (after this line, the player gains dwarvish miners as a recruit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:595
msgid ""
"An’ now tha’s my job gone; guess I got naught left fer me now but revenge. "
"So if yer out to beat the queen, me an’ my boys are with ye!"
msgstr "如今我的差事也没了;看来我除了复仇,已无他事。所以你要打倒女王,我和我的弟兄们跟你一起上!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:597
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Miners!"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:606
msgid ""
"... hey, what the— that axe! That axe you’re holdin’, that’s my father’s!"
msgstr "……嘿,什么鬼——那把战斧!你手里拿着的那把战斧,是我父亲的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:610
msgid ""
"Give it back, ye obscene trunk of tallow-keech! You milksop, you coward, "
"give it back or I’ll cut it from yer steamin’ corpse!"
msgstr "还给我,你这块涂着烛脂的臭木头!你这软蛋,你这懦夫,再不还回来,我就从你冒烟的尸体上把它剁下来!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:614
msgid ""
"Calm down, calm down! I found this axe in the ruins of west Knalga. If it "
"truly is your father’s, of course you’re entitled to it. Here."
msgstr "冷静,冷静!这把战斧是我在西纳尔迦的废墟里找到的。如果它真是你父亲的,你当然有权拿到它。给你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:636
msgid "Com’ere you chicken-faced by-blow! Fight me like a dwarf!"
msgstr "过来啊,你这张吓得脸都发白的废物!像个矮人一样跟我打一场!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:655
msgid ""
"Oy princess! Ah got an axe right ’ere with yer name on it! By Thursagan’s "
"beard, ah’ll teach you and yer men to lock me up!"
msgstr "嘿,公主!我这儿正好有一把写了你名字的血斧!以图萨根的胡子起誓,我要让你和你的手下尝尝把我关起来的滋味!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:669
msgid ""
"Where is Isolde? This battle is not so one-sided as I had hoped, but if "
"Konrad cannot defeat us soon he shall surely be trapped once my "
"reinforcements arrive."
msgstr "伊索尔德在哪儿?这场战斗并没有我预期的那么一边倒,但如果康拉德再打不赢我们,等我的援兵一到,他必将被困死。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:681
msgid "We're finally here, Your Highness! Apologies for the delay."
msgstr "殿下,我们终于到了!抱歉来晚了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:697
msgid ""
"More of them have come from behind! Even if we manage to defeat Li’sar, we "
"have no hope of escaping this battle alive..."
msgstr "后面又有更多的援兵杀到!即便我们侥幸击败莉莎,我们也不可能活着逃出这场战斗……"

#. [message]: speaker=knight
#. [message]: speaker=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:713
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:997
#| msgid "Fight on against the undead without me, friends!"
msgid "Fight on without me, Your Highness!"
msgstr "朋友，我死之后，你们一定要继续和亡灵作战！"

#. [message]: speaker=knight
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:718
#| msgid "Fight on against the undead without me, friends!"
msgid "Fight on without me, friends!"
msgstr "朋友，我死之后，你们一定要继续和亡灵作战！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#. Lisar might not exist here, in which case nothing is said.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:726
msgid "You’ll pay for that, cousin!"
msgstr "你会付出代价的,堂弟!"

#. [message]: speaker=Yrogin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:739
msgid "Aaargh! They said you were just a pretender... a puppet..."
msgstr "啊——!他们说你只是个冒名者……一个傀儡……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:771
msgid ""
"Not so tough now, are ye princess? Got any las’ words b’fer I bury m’ axe in "
"tha’ hollow skull, ye grubby wisenheimerin’ blockhead?"
msgstr "现在硬气不了了吧,公主?我一把战斧插进你那空洞的脑袋之前,还有什么遗言要讲,你这块装模作样的朽木脑袋?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:775
msgid ""
"Get off me, dwarf! I can’t fall here; there’s too much left to do. I may be "
"forced to flee the field today, “cousin”, but I will not rest until you face "
"justice for all the chaos you have caused."
msgstr "从我身上下来,矮人!我不能在这里倒下;还有太多事没做完。今天,“堂弟”,我或许被迫撤退,但在你为造成的所有混乱付出正义的代价之前,我不会休息。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:783
msgid ""
"So, Delfador “the Great” draws the blood of his betters once more. Do not "
"expect me to repeat the mistakes of my brother, old man — I shall flee the "
"field today, but I will not rest until you and your puppet face justice for "
"all the chaos you have caused."
msgstr "原来,德法多“伟大”又流了他上级们的血了。老头,别指望我会重蹈我兄长的覆辙——今天我或许会撤退,但在你和你的傀儡,为你们造成的所有混乱付出正义的代价之前,我不会休息。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:790
msgid ""
"So “cousin”, it seems you’re more than just a good actor and a pretty face. "
"No matter — I may be forced to flee the field today, but I will not rest "
"until you and your puppetmaster face justice for all the chaos you have "
"caused."
msgstr "哦,“堂弟”,看来你不只是个演技好、长得好看的家伙。无所谓——今天我或许被迫撤退,但在你和你那个操纵木偶的主人,为你们造成的所有混乱付出正义的代价之前,我不会休息。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/17_Crossroads.cfg:807
msgid ""
"We carried the field, but the princess escaped! I doubt this is the last "
"we’ve seen of her..."
msgstr "我们赢了这一场,但公主逃掉了!我怀疑这不会是她的最后一次露面……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:19
msgid "scenario name^The Highwaymen"
msgstr "拦路大盗"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:181
msgid "En garde!"
msgstr "全军戒备！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:202
msgid ""
"Our timing is perfect: the first of our several targets is approaching the "
"city. Our scouts spotted several convoys nearby, but the others must not "
"have arrived yet."
msgstr "我们的时机恰到好处:我们多个目标中的第一支,正接近城市。我们的斥候在附近发现了数支车队,但其他的应该还没到。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:207
msgid ""
"Each caravan will be brimming with supplies and weapons, so the more we "
"plunder, the more new types of soldiers we’ll be able to equip!"
msgstr "每支车队都满载着补给与武器,所以我们劫掠得越多,就能装备的新兵种类就越多!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:210
msgid ""
"Aye, an’ good fer us that rain an’ fog ’ave come in. Those mole-eyed chicken-"
"city buffoons will have no idea we’re here, as long as we keep our distance "
"from th’ walls."
msgstr "是,而且这场雨和雾来得正及时。那些眼瞎的、鸡肠小肚的城里傻瓜,只要我们离城墙保持距离,就根本不知道我们在这儿。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:211
msgid ""
"Back in the day I remember doin’ something like this with Baldras an’ "
"Helicrom. Lucky for us that the fog’s out. As long as we’re careful an’ keep "
"our distance, th’ city won’t know we’re here."
msgstr "想当年,我记得跟巴尔德拉斯和赫利克罗姆干过类似的事。幸运的是雾来了。只要我们小心、保持距离,城里就不会知道我们在这儿。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:212
msgid ""
"Hark and behold! The Light provides, for rain and fog have come to shroud us "
"from our foes. As long as we keep our distance from the city, Dan’Tonk shall "
"surely remain ignorant of our presence."
msgstr "听啊,看啊!光明赐予了我们,因为雨与雾已为我们遮天蔽日,挡住了敌人。只要离城市保持距离,丹·冬克必然不会察觉我们的存在。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:213
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:214
msgid ""
"And look at all this fog! Well, that’s probably a good thing for us. If we "
"keep our distance from the city itself, I’m sure it’ll be some time before "
"the garrison is alerted."
msgstr "再看看这满天的雾!好吧,对我们来说这大概是好事。只要离城市本体保持距离,我敢打赌守军很久都不会察觉。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:215
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:216
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:217
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:218
msgid ""
"It is lucky for us that this rain has come with a thick fog. As long as we "
"keep our distance from the city proper, it may be some time before the "
"garrison is alerted to our presence."
msgstr "对我们来说幸运的是,这场雨伴着浓雾。只要离城市本体保持距离,守军恐怕很久都不会察觉我们的存在。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. $dead_wagons is a number; probably between 0 and 15
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:230
msgid ""
"Intercept enemy wagons before they reach Dan’Tonk ($dead_wagons destroyed so "
"far)"
msgstr "在敌方马车抵达丹·冬克之前拦截它们(目前已击毁$dead_wagons辆)"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true'>
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:235
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:242
msgid "5+ destroyed: recruit Fencers"
msgstr "击毁5辆以上:可招募花剑剑士"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true'>
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:250
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:257
msgid "8+ destroyed: recruit Spearmen"
msgstr "击毁8辆以上:可招募枪兵"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:265
msgid "all 11 destroyed: recruit Bowmen"
msgstr "击毁全部11辆:可招募弓手"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:274
msgid ""
"The scenario will end once any caravan reaches Dan’Tonk and alerts the "
"garrison, or if any of Konrad’s units move within 4 hexes of the the "
"Dan’Tonk city walls (the unwalkable castle hexes)."
msgstr "任何一支车队抵达丹·冬克并示警守军,或任何康拉德一方的单位移动到距丹·冬克城墙(不可通行的城堡格)4格之内,情景即告结束。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:303
msgid "Outlaws, here?! I warn you, I’m armed!"
msgstr "亡命之徒,竟然在这儿?!”我警告你,我有武器!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:316
msgid ""
"I hate being stuck all the way out here on observation duty. What’s the "
"point?"
msgstr "我讨厌被派到这么偏远的地方站岗。这有什么意义?"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. this helps tell the player that they can safely fight these guards without alerting Dan'Tonk
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:321
msgid ""
"Even if some bandits were to foolishly come this near to Dan’Tonk, what does "
"the lieutenant expect me to do? It’s not as if I have any way to warn the "
"city..."
msgstr "就算有些匪徒蠢到敢跑到丹·冬克这么近,中尉指望我做什么?我根本没有办法向城市示警……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:345
msgid ""
"Bandits in the fog! We’re under attack! It’s too far to warn the city — grab "
"your weapons!"
msgstr "雾里有匪徒!我们被攻击了!离城市太远,来不及示警——抄起你们的武器!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:359
msgid ""
"We are approaching the walls of Dan’Tonk! Careful — if we come much closer, "
"the guards will spot us and we’ll be forced to abandon our mission."
msgstr "我们正接近丹·冬克的城墙!小心——若再靠近些,守卫就会发现我们,我们只能放弃任务了。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:373
msgid ""
"I’m sure I see shapes moving in the rain nearby, but with so much fog it’s "
"hard to tell exactly who it is. Hopefully one of our convoys."
msgstr "我隐约看到附近雨中有身影在动,但雾气太重,很难确切判断是谁。希望是其中一支我们的车队。"

#. [message]: role=wagons_mid
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:452
msgid "It’s an ambush! How did Maddock’s mercenaries get this far inland?!"
msgstr "这是伏击!麦多克的雇佣兵怎么渗透到内陆这么远的?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:464
msgid ""
"That’s the first caravan destroyed! Well done, everyone — now we must stop "
"the second, too!"
msgstr "第一支车队被毁了!干得好,各位——现在我们还得毁掉第二支!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:469
msgid ""
"That’s the first caravan destroyed! Well done, everyone. We should continue "
"expanding our control over this area — there will be more caravans soon."
msgstr "第一支车队被毁了!干得好,各位。我们应当继续扩大对这个地区的控制——很快还会有更多车队。"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:482
msgid ""
"Lieutenant, weren’t we expecting a weapons convoy some hours ago? I hope "
"they haven’t gotten into any trouble."
msgstr "中尉,我们不是几个小时前就该收到武器车队了吗?希望他们没遇到什么麻烦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:487
msgid ""
"The fog’s been causing delays for schedules all around the city, ma’am. The "
"shipment’s probably just stuck in some mud."
msgstr "夫人,雾气让城里所有地方的行程都延误了。这批货大概只是陷在某处的泥里了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:515
msgid ""
"Another caravan is approaching the city, this time from the northern path!"
msgstr "又一支车队正朝城市驶来,这次是从北面道路!"

#. [message]: role=wagons_top {FILTER_ADJACENT side=1}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:526
msgid ""
"Outlaws on the road! Fighting elves in that awful forest was bad enough, and "
"now this?"
msgstr "公路上有亡命之徒!在那片可怕的森林里跟精灵打一场已经很够呛了,现在又来这事?"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:531
msgid ""
"You speak in the presence of High Lord Kalenz of the elves, human! The wrath "
"of elf-kind falls upon you today!"
msgstr "人类,你正站在精灵大领主卡兰兹面前!今日,精灵之怒将降于你!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:536
msgid ""
"Vengeance for the Aethenwood! You should never have left your city to come "
"burn my home!"
msgstr "为艾瑟森林复仇!你们本不该离开城市,来烧我的家!"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:553
msgid ""
"Still no word from the wagon trains? Something’s wrong. Lieutenant, dispatch "
"a squad to patrol the area — we may be dealing with roadside bandits."
msgstr "车队还没有消息吗?出了点问题。中尉,派一队人马出去巡逻——我们可能遇到的是沿途的匪徒。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:556
msgid "Teory"
msgstr "泰奥瑞"

#. [message]: speaker=squad_leader
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:594
msgid ""
"Ah ha, found you! We aren’t dealing with just any petty bandits — these are "
"Konrad’s rebels! I’ll see you hang for your crimes!"
msgstr "啊哈,找到你们了!我们可不只是在跟小毛贼打交道——这些是康拉德的叛军!我要让你们为你们的罪行上吊!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:627
msgid ""
"A third convoy, along the southern path this time! This one is larger than "
"the previous two. Better-defended. but also a more valuable prize!"
msgstr "第三支车队,这次沿南面的道路!这一支比前两支更大、防守更严,但也是更值钱的战利品!"

#. [message]: role=wagons_bot {FILTER_ADJACENT side=1}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:638
msgid "Look out! Bandits on the road!"
msgstr "小心!路上有匪徒!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:696
msgid ""
"The final convoy we’re waiting for has arrived — and this one approaches "
"from two directions at once!"
msgstr "我们等待的最后一条运输线已经到了——而这一支同时从两个方向逼近!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:700
msgid ""
"We shall have to split our forces if we want to stop both. Or, if we lack "
"the strength, even defeating only one will still provide us with many "
"valuable weapons!"
msgstr "如果我们想阻止这两股,就得兵分两路。或者,如果我们兵力不足,就算只击败其中一股,也能为我们赢得许多宝贵的武器!"

#. [message]: role=wagons_top {OR role=wagons_bot} {FILTER_ADJACENT side=1}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:712
msgid ""
"I knew I heard the sound of fighting in the fog! You’ll find we’re battle-"
"hardened veterans from Elensefar, and no easy prey for petty outlaws."
msgstr "我就说听到雾里有战斗的声音!你们会发现,我们是从伊伦斯法尔来的久经战阵的老兵,绝不是小毛贼能轻易猎杀的猎物。"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:731
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:764
msgid ""
"Enough! Whether we see them or not, there’s clearly some capable enemy "
"lurking out in the fog. To arms, soldiers! This city is our place of "
"strength, and our armies far outnumber any petty bandits or rebels. "
"Whatever’s going on out there, it ends now."
msgstr "够了!不管我们看没看到,雾外显然潜伏着一些有实力的敌人。士兵们,拿起武器!这座城市是我们的坚固堡垒,我的兵力远超任何小毛贼或叛军。不管外面发生了什么,现在结束了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:735
msgid ""
"As we knew would happen eventually, Dan’Tonk has become aware of our "
"presence, and Wesnoth’s armies are mobilizing to surround us. Quick, "
"everyone, let us make our escape and tally our plunder!"
msgstr "正如我们预料的那样,塔恩要塞终于察觉到了我们的存在,韦诺特的军队正在动员包围我们。快,所有人,我们赶紧撤,清点一下我们的赃物!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:758
msgid ""
"That’s the last of these wagons! We’ve done well to capture so many supplies "
"and weapons. If we continue waiting here even more may yet arrive, but I "
"suspect we’ve pushed our luck staying as long as we have already."
msgstr "这是最后一辆马车!我们抢到了这么多物资和武器,已经相当不错了。如果我们继续在这里等,可能还会有更多到来,但我觉得我们已经够冒险了,待了这么久。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#. "speak of a lich" is a made-up saying, with the same meaning as "speak of the devil"
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:769
msgid ""
"Speak of a lich... As we knew would happen eventually, Dan’Tonk has become "
"aware of our presence, and Wesnoth’s armies are mobilizing to surround us. "
"Quick, everyone, let us make our escape and tally our plunder!"
msgstr "说曹操曹操到……正如我们预料的那样,塔恩要塞终于察觉到了我们的存在,韦诺特的军队正在动员包围我们。快,所有人,我们赶紧撤,清点一下我们的赃物!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:786
msgid ""
"I’ve reached the city walls! Alarm! Alarm! We spotted Konrad and his rebels "
"are lying in wait on the road!"
msgstr "我已经抵达城墙了!警报!警报!我们发现康拉德和他的叛军在路上设伏!"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:791
msgid ""
"The rebel army, here?! Those fools! To arms, soldiers! This city is our "
"place of strength, and I know us to far outnumber Konrad’s forces. We must "
"bring the false prince to justice!"
msgstr "叛军竟然到了这里?那群蠢货!士兵们,拿起武器!这座城市是我们的坚固堡垒,我的兵力远远多于康拉德的部队。我们必须将那个假王子绳之以法!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:795
msgid ""
"A caravan has reached Dan’Tonk, and Wesnoth’s armies are mobilizing to "
"surround us! Quick, everyone, let us make our escape and tally our plunder!"
msgstr "一支商队到达了塔恩要塞,韦诺特的军队正在动员包围我们!快,所有人,我们赶紧撤,清点一下我们的赃物!"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:813
msgid ""
"Look — there! That figure can only be one of Konrad’s rebels, foolishly come "
"to fight Dan’Tonk itself."
msgstr "看——那里!那个身影只能是康拉德的某个叛军,愚蠢地跑来攻打塔恩要塞本身。"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:817
msgid ""
"To arms, soldiers! This city is our place of strength, and I know us to far "
"outnumber Konrad’s forces. We must capture the false prince and bring him to "
"justice!"
msgstr "士兵们,拿起武器!这座城市是我们的坚固堡垒,我的兵力远远多于康拉德的部队。我们必须活捉那个假王子,将他绳之以法!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:821
msgid ""
"We’ve come too close to the city walls, and have been spotted! Quick, "
"everyone, let us make our escape and tally our plunder!"
msgstr "我们离城墙太近了,被发现!快,所有人,我们赶紧撤,清点一下我们的赃物!"

#. [message]: role=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:839
msgid ""
"What?! What sort of unseen enemy has attacked me without ever approaching "
"the city walls? I must flee!"
msgstr "什么?!是什么样的看不见的敌人,还没靠近城墙就袭击了我?我必须逃走!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/18_The_Highwaymen.cfg:846
msgid "Quick, everyone, let us make our escape and tally our plunder!"
msgstr "快,所有人,我们赶紧撤,清点一下我们的赃物!"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:12
msgid "scenario name^The Ford of Abez"
msgstr "雅碧滩"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:38
msgid "Clan Stoneskin"
msgstr "石皮部落"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:141
msgid ""
"Have you reconsidered, troll? Let us pass, and bloodshed may yet be averted."
msgstr "你考虑好了吗,巨魔?放我们过去,也许还能避免流血。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:145
msgid ""
"Sorry, I done already told you, softskin. You gots to pay if you wants to "
"cross. Stoneskins fight hard to own ford, kill lotsa other trolls ’n orcs. "
"Dosh kill you too, no big whoop."
msgstr "抱歉,我已经告诉过你了,软皮子。想过渡就得付钱。石皮部落为了夺下这个渡口,打败了很多其他巨魔和兽人。多什也会干掉你,没什么大不了的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:149
msgid ""
"The Ford of Abez was here long before you, and it will be here long after. "
"You have no more right to own it than do I, or any of the free peoples of "
"Wesnoth. Prepare for battle!"
msgstr "阿贝兹渡口在你们到来之前很久就已存在,在你们离去之后很久也仍将存在。你们没有比我、或韦诺特任何自由人民更拥有它的权利。准备战斗!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:157
#| msgid "Defeat Asheviere"
msgid "Defeat Dosh"
msgstr "击败艾什薇尔"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:175
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:176
msgid ""
"This is where the final betrayal took place. Where Eldred killed Garard and "
"his allies, opening the way for Asheviere’s domination. She has much to "
"answer for."
msgstr "最后的背叛就发生在这里。埃尔德雷德在这里杀死了伽拉德和他的盟友,为艾什薇尔的统治打开了道路。她有太多的罪要偿。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:177
msgid ""
"Many terrible battles were once fought at this ford, Konrad. May ours prove "
"itself less deadly."
msgstr "康拉德,这个渡口曾发生过许多惨烈的战斗。愿我们的这一战能少一些血腥。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:178
msgid ""
"Delfador told me about the many terrible battles that were fought here. I "
"hope ours won’t prove itself so deadly."
msgstr "德法多告诉过我,这里曾发生过许多惨烈的战斗。希望我们的这一战不会那么致命。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:201
msgid "Urgh... Dosh don’ feel so good. Maybe fight was mistake..."
msgstr "呃……多什感觉不太好。也许这场战斗是个错误……"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:210
msgid "Run away!"
msgstr "快跑!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:228
msgid ""
"The leader of the trolls is defeated, and we have secured safe passage "
"across the ford! Great work, everyone — onwards into the Northlands!"
msgstr "巨魔的首领已被击败,我们已确保渡口可以安全通行!干得好,各位——继续北上,前往北境!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:233
msgid ""
"The leader of the trolls is defeated, and we have secured safe passage "
"across the ford! Great work, everyone — we can now return to Wesnoth!"
msgstr "巨魔的首领已被击败,我们已确保渡口可以安全通行!干得好,各位——我们现在可以返回韦诺特了!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:248
msgid "Ormok"
msgstr "奥莫克"

#. [message]: speaker=Ormok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:256
msgid "Ha ha ha, what’s this? Someone’s trying to dethrone the Stoneskins!"
msgstr "哈哈哈哈哈,这是怎么回事?有人想推翻石皮部落的统治!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ormok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:260
msgid "Hope you don’t mind if we take over! C’mon, boys, let’s kill ’em all!"
msgstr "希望你们不介意我们接手!来,弟兄们,把他们都干掉!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/20_The_Ford_of_Abez.cfg:264
msgid ""
"We’ve taken too long to secure the ford! Now more orcs have arrived! Even if "
"we defeat them all, we’ll suffer greatly from the delay..."
msgstr "我们占领渡口花的时间太长了!更多的兽人已经赶到!就算我们全部击败他们,耽搁的代价也将是惨重的……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:18
#| msgid "scenario name^Blackwater Port"
msgid "scenario name^Glamdrol"
msgstr "黑水港"

#. [side]
#. [side]: type={TYPE}, id=leader{SIDE}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:45
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:63
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:47
msgid "Bloody Sword Clan"
msgstr "血剑部落"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:91
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:107
msgid "Stoneskin Clan"
msgstr "石皮部落"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:129
msgid "Hu-nash"
msgstr "胡-纳什"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:132
msgid "Vikkak the Old"
msgstr "老维卡克"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:204
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:205
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:206
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:207
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:208
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:209
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:210
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:211
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:212
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:213
msgid "150 gold"
msgstr "150 金币"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:233
msgid "Get lost, you troll-sniffing degenerates!"
msgstr "滚开,你们这些闻巨魔臭气的败类!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#. "Khazg" refers to Khazg Black-Tusk, the late leader of the Bloody Sword clan, mentioned in Northern Rebirth
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:238
msgid ""
"Khazg-worshipping tuskers! We come to trade and this is how you greet us? "
"Some hospitality."
msgstr "拜卡兹格的长獠牙家伙!我们是来做交易的,你们就这么迎接我们?可真够“热情”的。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:242
msgid ""
"Trade? You came here to sneak inside and slaughter us all in our sleep! I’m "
"not having it. Get lost!"
msgstr "交易?你们来这里就是打算溜进来,趁我们熟睡把我们杀光的!没门。滚!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:246
msgid "Oh yeah? Well— ...wait, do you see that?"
msgstr "哦,是吗?嗯——……等等,你们看到那个了吗?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:345
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:348
msgid ""
"Humans! What’s an army of boot-licking humans doing so close to Glamdrol?"
msgstr "人类!一群舔靴子的人类军队怎么敢靠近格朗德罗?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:346
msgid ""
"Elves! What’s an army of tree-shagging elves doing so close to Glamdrol?"
msgstr "精灵!一群树梢爬的精灵军队怎么敢靠近格朗德罗?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:347
msgid ""
"Dwarves! What’s an army of dirt-grubbing dwarves doing so close to Glamdrol?"
msgstr "矮人!一群掘土的矮人军队怎么敢靠近格朗德罗?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:349
msgid ""
"Invaders! What’s an army of boot-licking worms doing so close to Glamdrol?"
msgstr "入侵者!一群舔靴子的蠕虫军队怎么敢靠近格朗德罗?"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:353
msgid ""
"Grr... we can settle things between us later. Right now we work together and "
"kill the vermin."
msgstr "呜呜……我们之间的恩怨以后再说。现在先联手,把这些杂碎杀了。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:365
msgid "Pillage as much gold as you can before turns run out"
msgstr "在回合数耗尽前尽可能多地劫掠金币"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:373
msgid ""
"Fulfill your pledge: end the scenario with at least $bm_s22_gold_cost gold"
msgstr "履行你的承诺:场景结束时持有至少 $bm_s22_gold_cost 金币"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:382
msgid "Defeat the orcish shaman to claim the Horn of Glamdrol"
msgstr "击败兽人萨满,夺取格朗德罗之号角"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:390
msgid ""
"Fail your pledge: end the scenario with less than $bm_s22_gold_cost gold"
msgstr "未能履行承诺:场景结束时持有金币少于 $bm_s22_gold_cost"

#. [note]
#. "enemy" includes any enemy side. When one enemy dies, other enemies gain the "regenerates" ability for one turn.
#. The Horn of Glamdrol is an item, currently held by an enemy, that has this effect.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:404
msgid ""
"Horn of Glamdrol: Whenever you defeat one enemy, other enemies gain "
"regeneration for one turn"
msgstr "格朗德罗之号角:每当击败一个敌人时,其他敌人将获得一回合的再生能力"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:421
msgid ""
"We’re here for a quick raid, not to try to conquer the fortress outright. "
"Move swiftly, grab as much gold as we can, and get out!"
msgstr "我们是来快速劫掠的,不是来正面强攻这座要塞的。动作要快,抢走我们能抢的所有金子,然后撤离!"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:429
msgid "Konrad, look! Dem north side orcs be from da Stoneskin clan, like me."
msgstr "康拉德,你看!北面那些兽人是石皮部族的,跟道什一样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:433
msgid ""
"Dey ain’t so bad. No reason for us to be fighting. Dosh gona go talk to dem."
msgstr "他们没那么坏。我们跟他们没什么好打的。道什打算去跟他们谈一谈。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:453
msgid ""
"Hey, you! I recognize you; you’re the ford troll. What’re you doing working "
"for some lousy human?"
msgstr "嘿,你!我认得你;你就是渡口的巨魔。你给那种垃圾人类打工干什么?"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:457
msgid ""
"Konrad not some lousy human. He is a big prince, and a great troll-friend! "
"Konrad paid Dosh much money, and now Dosh helps Konrad. You should help "
"Konrad too."
msgstr "康拉德不是那种垃圾人类。他是个大王子,还是个伟大的巨魔之友!康拉德给了道什很多黄金,现在道什帮康拉德。你们也应该帮康拉德。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:461
msgid ""
"Hah. Well, sure, you tell your big prince to pay <i><b>me</b></i> big money, "
"and then maybe I will. It’s true that these Bloody Swords have owned "
"Glamdrol for long enough..."
msgstr "哈。嗯,行吧,你就去跟你的大王子说,让他先给我大笔大笔的钱,然后我说不定就答应。话说,这些血剑部族接管格朗德罗已经够久了……"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:470
msgid "Pledge 400 gold: negotiate a truce and learn to recruit Troll Whelps"
msgstr "承诺400黄金:谈判达成停战,并学会招募巨魔幼崽"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:475
msgid ""
"Want more fighters like that one, do you? Sure, 400 gold is worth at least a "
"few whelps. But I’m only offering because Dosh says you’re all right."
msgstr "想要更多那样的战士吗?当然,400黄金至少能换几个幼崽。但我这么做,是因为道什说你们还可以。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:479
msgid ""
"Trolls’re a bit dim, usually even more so than the one you’ve already got, "
"but you tell ’em who to smash and they’ll smash ’em good."
msgstr "巨魔一般都有点呆,通常比你已经有的那位还要呆,但你告诉它们该砸谁,它们会砸得很卖力。"

#. [command]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:481
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Troll Whelps!"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:484
msgid ""
"Have fun sacking the city. When all’s said and done, you pay us out of the "
"coin you’ve looted — or else."
msgstr "你们尽管去洗劫城市。等事情办完,你从抢来的金币里付给我们——否则,就休想好过。"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:496
msgid "Pledge 100 gold: negotiate a truce"
msgstr "承诺100黄金:谈判达成停战"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:501
msgid ""
"100 gold for a truce? Deal. We’ll stay out of your way while you raid the "
"fortress, and when all’s said and done you pay us out of the coin you’ve "
"looted — or else."
msgstr "100黄金换取停战?成交。你去围攻堡垒时我们袖手旁观,等事情办完,你从抢来的金币里付给我们——否则,就休想好过。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:517
msgid ""
"Hah! Some friend you’ve got there, Dosh. Don’t worry, we’ll take all the "
"gold we want from your treasury once we kill you!"
msgstr "哈!你这朋友可真够意思,道什。别担心,等你死了,我们就会从你的金库里拿走我们想要的黄金!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:530
msgid ""
"I knew it! Filthy human-lover! You want to ruin us so you can take over "
"Glamdrol!"
msgstr "我就知道!可耻的人类狗奴!你想毁掉我们,好接管格朗德罗!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:534
msgid "What can I say? I came to trade, and the human boy offered a good one!"
msgstr "我还能说什么?我来是做生意的,那个人类小子开出的条件很好!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:583
msgid ""
"I should be careful not to recruit too many extra units. While it’s tempting "
"to use the orcs’ gold to conquer their fortress, we’re ultimately here to "
"gather gold in preparation for our next battle. Clearing the fortress won’t "
"do us much good if we leave poorer than we arrived!"
msgstr "我得当心,不能招太多额外的单位。虽然用兽人的黄金去攻下他们的堡垒很有诱惑力,但我们最终是来筹集黄金,为下一场战斗做准备的。如果离开时比来的时候还穷,拿下堡垒又有什么用!"

#. [companion_message]
#. TRoW's Jessene says that when orcs game to the Green Isle, the lich-lords "built a great stone gate to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west"
#. TRoW's Aethyr says that when orcs came to the Great Continent, they "must have seized all remaining boats on the Green Isle", but that's a guess rather than an observation
#. here, we establish that while some ships were definitely involved (we see them in TRoW), at least one magical gate was also used to bring orcs to the Great Continent.
#. I think that's sensible behavior for the Lich-Lords, and also explains how so many orcs were able to reach Wesnoth so fast. Only 20 years after the orcs first arrive, they're so powerful as to rival all the elves combined (LoW)
#. TRoW's Jessene says that when orcs game to the Green Isle, the lich-lords "built a great stone gate to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west"
#. TRoW's Aethyr says that when orcs came to the Great Continent, they "must have seized all remaining boats on the Green Isle", but that's a guess rather than an observation
#. here, we establish that while some ships were definitely involved (we see them in TRoW), at least one magical gate was also used to bring orcs to the Great Continent.
#. I think that's sensible behavior for the Lich-Lords, and also explains how so many orcs were able to reach Wesnoth so fast. Only 20 years after the orcs first arrive, they're so powerful as to rival all the elves combined (LoW)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:610
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:615
msgid ""
"A foul odor. A blight upon the wind. Konrad, this is a gateway created by "
"the lich-lords of ages past, during their genocidal hunt for the Ruby."
msgstr "一股恶臭。风中飘着瘟疫。康拉德,这道门是远古的巫妖诸主,在它们灭绝红宝石的征讨中亲手创造的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:616
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:617
msgid ""
"A great orc-gate! To see one in person is... chilling. Konrad, this is a "
"gateway created by the lich-lords of ages past, during their genocidal hunt "
"for the Ruby."
msgstr "伟大的兽人之门!亲眼见到它,真是……令人毛骨悚然。康拉德,这道门是远古的巫妖诸主,在它们灭绝红宝石的征讨中亲手创造的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:618
msgid ""
"There must have been magic in this chasm once, but it’s still and dead now. "
"Whatever power once created it has been long since vanished."
msgstr "这道深渊里想必曾经有魔法,但如今已死寂沉寂。当年创造它的力量,早已消失得无影无踪。"

#. [companion_message]
#. TRoW's Jessene says that when orcs game to the Green Isle, the lich-lords "built a great stone gate to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west"
#. TRoW's Aethyr says that when orcs came to the Great Continent, they "must have seized all remaining boats on the Green Isle", but that's a guess rather than an observation
#. here, we establish that while some ships were definitely involved (we see them in TRoW), at least one magical gate was also used to bring orcs to the Great Continent.
#. I think that's sensible behavior for the Lich-Lords, and also explains how so many orcs were able to reach Wesnoth so fast. Only 20 years after the orcs first arrive, they're so powerful as to rival all the elves combined (LoW)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:627
msgid ""
"They say it was through a gate like this one that man first met orc, over "
"five hundred years ago. And when orc pursued man here to the Great "
"Continent, they came in such numbers as to nearly ruin my own people as well."
msgstr "传说正是从这样的门,人类与兽人五百年前首次相遇。而当兽人追猎人类来到伟大大陆时,它们数量之多,几乎也要把我们的族人毁掉。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:629
msgid ""
"But that is ancient history. This gate died long ago; died alongside the "
"foul powers that created it, when they were slain by the human-kings of old. "
"May it never again awaken."
msgstr "但那是远古的历史了。这扇门早已死去,和创造它的那些污秽力量一起死了——当年那些人类诸王把它们击败了。愿它永不再醒来。"

#. [companion_message]
#. TRoW's Jessene says that when orcs game to the Green Isle, the lich-lords "built a great stone gate to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west"
#. TRoW's Aethyr says that when orcs came to the Great Continent, they "must have seized all remaining boats on the Green Isle", but that's a guess rather than an observation
#. here, we establish that while some ships were definitely involved (we see them in TRoW), at least one magical gate was also used to bring orcs to the Great Continent.
#. I think that's sensible behavior for the Lich-Lords, and also explains how so many orcs were able to reach Wesnoth so fast. Only 20 years after the orcs first arrive, they're so powerful as to rival all the elves combined (LoW)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:635
msgid ""
"The elders record that it was through a gate like this one that man first "
"met orc, over five hundred years ago. Lo! Darkness drove us from our homes, "
"and lo! Our proud people became a band of refugees."
msgstr "老人们记载,正是从这样的门,人类与兽人五百年前首次相遇。看哪!黑暗把我们赶出了家园,看哪!我们骄傲的族人,变成了一群难民。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:637
msgid ""
"Yet the Light has delivered us, for today we stand whole and strong. This "
"gateway died long ago. May it remain so until the end of days, until the sun "
"itself rains down from the heavens as sulfur and fire and all the darkness "
"is cleansed from this world."
msgstr "但光明已把我们拯救,因为今天,我们依然完整而强大。这道门早已死去。愿它永远沉寂,直到世界末日,直到太阳本身化作硫磺与火焰从天上坠落,黑暗从此被这个世界荡涤干净。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:639
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:640
msgid ""
"If I remember my histories, it was through a gate like this one that the "
"lich-lords’ orcs first invaded the Green Isle. Luckily for us, that was a "
"very long time ago, and the gates have long-since gone quiet — hopefully for "
"good."
msgstr "要是我的史学知识没错,当年巫妖诸主的兽人正是从这样的门,首次入侵了绿岛。对我们来说幸运的是,那已经是很久以前的事了,那些门早已沉寂——但愿永远如此。"

#. [companion_message]
#. TRoW's Jessene says that when orcs game to the Green Isle, the lich-lords "built a great stone gate to the heart of the homeland of the orcs in the distant west"
#. TRoW's Aethyr says that when orcs came to the Great Continent, they "must have seized all remaining boats on the Green Isle", but that's a guess rather than an observation
#. here, we establish that while some ships were definitely involved (we see them in TRoW), at least one magical gate was also used to bring orcs to the Great Continent.
#. I think that's sensible behavior for the Lich-Lords, and also explains how so many orcs were able to reach Wesnoth so fast. Only 20 years after the orcs first arrive, they're so powerful as to rival all the elves combined (LoW)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:646
msgid ""
"Dis da great orc-gate, Konrad. Once, long ago, lots o’ dem used it to come "
"here from far away and fight you softskins. But dey didn’t build it, and now "
"dey don’t know how to turn it back on again. Maybe nobody ever will."
msgstr "这是伟大的兽人之门,康拉德。很久很久以前,有很多兽人从遥远的地方通过它来到这里,和你们这些软皮子打仗。但这扇门不是他们建的,如今他们也不知道怎么把它重新打开。也许没有人知道了。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:660
msgid "One of our horde is dead! Blow the horn, shaman."
msgstr "我们大军里有人死了!吹号角,萨满!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:697
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:698
msgid ""
"Urgh, my head! What kind of instrument could make such a sound? There’s "
"magic in that horn, Konrad, mark my words."
msgstr "呃,我的头!什么样的乐器能发出这样的声音?康拉德,我跟你打赌,那支号角里有魔法。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:699
msgid ""
"Urgh... that sound hurts my head somethin’ fierce. I’ve heard a lot o’ orc-"
"horns before, Konrad, an’ this one ain’t normal."
msgstr "呃……这声音疼得我头直晃。康拉德,我以前听过很多兽人号角,可这支不一样。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:700
msgid ""
"The air rings with power and might! Hark! I recognize orcish magic when I "
"hear it, Konrad."
msgstr "空气中回荡着力量与威势!听!我一听就能认出兽人的魔法,康拉德。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:701
msgid ""
"Gah! Now thar’s a sound to split an eardrum! Ah’ve heard plenty o’ scumbreed "
"half-dog warhorns before, Konrad, but this one ain’t normal."
msgstr "嘎!这才叫撕裂耳膜的声响!康拉德,我以前听过不少劣种半犬兽人的战号,但这支不一样。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:702
msgid ""
"Ow! Ow, ow, that hurts my ears, and sets my bones all a-shaking! That can’t "
"be a mundane, every-day warhorn, can it?"
msgstr "哎哟!哎哟哟,疼得我耳朵生疼,骨头都在打颤!这肯定不是普通的、天天都能听见的战号吧,对吧?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:703
msgid ""
"Dat’s a bad sound for us, Konrad. Dosh been hearin’ dis horn before — it’s "
"not no normal warhorn. It’s got some kind of orc-magic."
msgstr "这声音对我们不利,康拉德。道什以前听过这只号角——它不是普通的战号。上面有某种兽人的魔法。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:704
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:705
msgid ""
"From the fortress rings a piercing sound of sacrifice, death, and rebirth! "
"There is orcish magic at work here, Konrad."
msgstr "从堡垒里传来刺穿耳膜的声响,那是献祭、死亡与重生之音!这里有兽人的魔法在作祟,康拉德。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:706
msgid ""
"From the fortress rings a piercing sound of sacrifice, death, and rebirth! "
"There is orcish magic at work here."
msgstr "从堡垒里传来刺穿耳膜的声响,那是献祭、死亡与重生之音!这里有兽人的魔法在作祟。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:711
msgid ""
"Tremble before the Horn of Glamdrol, worms! Whenever one of us falls, the "
"rest shall be healed anew!"
msgstr "在格朗德罗号角面前颤抖吧,虫子们!我们每倒下一个,其余的人都会重获新生!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:727
msgid ""
"What’s this? That orc was carrying a strange horn with magical markings. I "
"will take it and examine it when I have time — for now we must continue to "
"fight."
msgstr "这是什么?那个兽人带着一支刻着魔法纹饰的奇怪号角。我要把它带走,有空再细看——眼下我们得继续战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:732
msgid ""
"The shaman is dead, and we’ve claimed her magical horn for ourselves! There "
"will be time to examine it later — for now we must continue to fight."
msgstr "萨满死了,我们夺下了她的魔法号角!回头有空再细看——眼下我们得继续战斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:751
msgid ""
"What are we doing fighting up here? The orcs’ gold is in their city, not "
"here among these trolls!"
msgstr "我们为什么要在这里打?兽人的黄金在他们的城市里,不在这些巨魔这里!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:769
msgid "The chiefs are dead! Run for the hills!"
msgstr "酋长们死了!快逃进山里去!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:783
msgid "I spit my last breath at you!"
msgstr "我把最后一口气啐给你们!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:792
msgid ""
"Let’s get out of here! Filthy invaders, I’m finding the high chief and "
"bringing his warriors back from their raid! You’d better not be here when he "
"gets back!"
msgstr "我们撤吧!可耻的入侵者们,我要去找大酋长,把他的战士们从劫掠中拉回来!等他回来的时候,你们最好不在了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:805
msgid ""
"We have defeated all of the orcs! An incredible challenge — well done, "
"everyone. Time to take our leave of this place, and to tally our plunder!"
msgstr "我们击败了所有兽人!了不起的挑战——干得好,各位。是时候离开这里了,清点我们的战利品吧!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:822
msgid ""
"We can afford to fight here only a little longer! This is orcish territory, "
"and every minute here only further risks our enemies being reinforced."
msgstr "我们只再能在这里坚持一小会儿了!这是兽人的地盘,在这里每多待一分钟,敌人的援军就多一分可能。"

#. [message]: speaker=$speaker_id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:837
msgid ""
"That’s it! You pinkskins are proving way too much of a nuisance. I’m finding "
"the high chief and bringing his warriors back from their raid!"
msgstr "够了!你们这些粉皮子实在太碍事了。我要去找大酋长,把他的战士们从劫掠中拉回来!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:844
msgid ""
"That sounds like our cue to leave. We can’t risk being pinned down and "
"eradicated. Quick, everyone, let us make our escape and tally our plunder!"
msgstr "这声音该是我们离开的时候了。我们不能有被围歼的风险。快,大家,让我们突围而去,清点我们的战利品!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:862
msgid "Hey, what about my gold? You made a pledge!"
msgstr "嘿,我的黄金呢?你立过誓的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:866
msgid ""
"I’m sorry, but we didn’t pillage enough from Glamdrol to cover all "
"$bm_s22_gold_cost gold. Can I pay you later?"
msgstr "很抱歉,但我们从格朗德罗抢来的黄金,不够支付全部$bm_s22_gold_cost。我晚点再付你,行吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/22_Glamdrol.cfg:870
msgid ""
"Oh, that’s no problem — we’ll just take what we’re owed off your corpse. "
"Attack! Don’t let them escape!"
msgstr "哦,没问题——我们直接从你的尸体上拿走欠我们的。进攻!别让他们跑了!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:105
msgid "Infirm Yeti"
msgstr "病弱雪人王"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:159
msgid ""
"Brrr... it may not be winter, but with the storm swirling about overhead it "
"certainly feels like it. This place is freezing!"
msgstr "哆……说不定不是冬天,可头顶上风暴呼啸,真像是冬天了。这地方冻死了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:164
msgid ""
"Hello! Are you all right? What’re you doing out here in the cold? ...she’s "
"still not paying attention."
msgstr "你好!你还好吗?大冷天跑出来干什么?……她还没注意到我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:176
msgid "Err, hello? HELLO!"
msgstr "呃,你好?你好?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:184
msgid ""
"Aaah! Don’t sneak up on a woman like that; the jump you gave me nearly "
"ruined three days’ work!"
msgstr "啊啊!别这样从背后偷袭一个女人;你这一下差点毁掉我三天的成果!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:188
msgid ""
"I’m sorry, I just wanted to see if everything is all right. What’re you "
"doing alone and unarmed all the way up here in these snows?"
msgstr "抱歉,我只是想看看你是否没事。你一个人、不带武器,跑到这里的雪地里来做什么?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:192
msgid ""
"Ah, I’m glad you asked! You see, I’m an — err, how should I say it — "
"alchemist, yes, yes, alchemist is right. A researcher!"
msgstr "啊,你问对了!你看,我是一名——呃,该怎么说呢——炼金术士,对,对,就是炼金术士。一名研究者!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:196
msgid ""
"You’re a mage? That explains why you’re not carrying any weapons. Are you "
"conducting some sort of magical experiment?"
msgstr "你是一名法师?难怪你身上没有任何武器。你在做什么魔法实验吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:200
msgid ""
"No, no! I’m not one of those stuffy bleary-eyed academics; I don’t make "
"magic, I cause chemistry! There’s all sorts of valuable alchemical reagents "
"here in the mountains. I’m certain my theories are correct, I just need the "
"ingredients to prove it!"
msgstr "不,不!我不是那种古板、眼睛模糊的学者;我不施展魔法,我引发的是化学变化!这里的山脉里有各种珍贵的炼金试剂。我确信我的理论是正确的,我只需要材料来证明它!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:204
msgid ""
"Most of the herbs, you see, I’ve had no trouble collecting. Err, but, well, "
"the local fauna — as you may surmise, the fauna has proven somewhat less "
"cooperative than for which I was prepared... Right! But now you’re here to "
"help!"
msgstr "大部分草药,你看,我已经毫不费力地收集好了。呃,不过,嗯,当地的动物——正如你可能猜到的,它们显然没有我预期的那么配合……没错!但现在你们来帮忙了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:208
msgid ""
"Here, take this leather pouch for the tongue... and yes, this glass jar for "
"the bile— No! Not that one, this one—"
msgstr "给,舌头用这个皮袋……还有,对,胆汁用这个玻璃瓶——不!不是那个,是这个——"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:216
msgid ""
"What is all this stuff? You... want me to gather some alchemy components for "
"you, is that right?"
msgstr "这些都是什么玩意儿?你……想让我帮你收集一些炼金材料,是吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:218
msgid ""
"I am Konrad, heir to the throne of Wesnoth, and on a quest to depose the "
"dark queen Asheviere. I’m happy to leave you with food or gold if you’re in "
"trouble, but I’m not sure my army and I can spare the time to stop and help "
"you collect ingredients."
msgstr "我是康拉德,韦诺特王位的继承人,此行的目的是推翻暗之女王艾什薇尔。如果你有困难,我很乐意留下食物或金子,但不确定我和我的军队是否抽得出时间停下来帮你收集材料。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:222
msgid ""
"Yes, ingredients, precisely! And if you did take the time to help me out, "
"I’d be very grateful. And... and! If you help me, I’ll help you in return "
"and come with you on your quest. A great chance to field-test my concoctions "
"against that queen of yours."
msgstr "是的,就是材料!如果你们愿意花时间帮我的忙,我会非常感激。而且……而且!你们帮了我,我会在你们的征途上帮你们,跟你们同行。这可是把我的药剂放到实战中,去对付你们那位女王的绝佳机会。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:226
msgid ""
"I only need three more ingredients to complete my experiments. Icemonax "
"bile. Giant Spider venom — that one’s a doozy. And, err, believe it or not, "
"Yeti tongue. If Yetis exist."
msgstr "我只要再收集三样材料就能完成实验了。冰魔纳克的胆汁。巨型蜘蛛的毒液——那个可不好弄。还有,呃,信不信由你,雪人舌头。如果雪人存在的话。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:230
msgid ""
"... and if we can collect all three of these, you’ll come with us to help us "
"fight against Asheviere? I suppose that sounds like a fair trade."
msgstr "……如果你们能把这三样都收集齐,你就跟我们一起去,帮我们对抗艾什薇尔?我想这笔交易还算公平。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:234
msgid ""
"Absolutely! I may not be of much use right now, but once you get my "
"ingredients for me I’ll be able to help you fight through the use of a "
"variety of alchemical concoctions. For now, the keep is yours — I’ve noticed "
"a very interesting species of beetle over here..."
msgstr "当然可以!我现在可能帮不上什么忙,但一旦你们帮我把材料收集齐,我就能通过各种炼金药剂帮你们战斗。眼下,这座城楼归你们了——我注意到这边有一种非常有意思的甲虫……"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:249
msgid "Gather as many ingredients as you can before turns run out:"
msgstr "在回合数耗尽前尽可能多地收集材料:"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true'>
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:254
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:261
msgid "Defeat a Great Icemonax"
msgstr "击败一只大冰魔纳克"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true'>
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:269
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:276
msgid "Defeat a Giant Spider"
msgstr "击败一只巨蛛"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objective]: condition=win, description=<span strikethrough='true'>
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:284
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:291
msgid "Defeat a Yeti"
msgstr "击败一个雪人"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:299
#| msgid "Death of Konrad"
msgid "Death of Jeniver"
msgstr "科纳德死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:307
msgid ""
"Springtime Storm: at the end of every third turn (1, 4, 7, etc), Konrad’s "
"forces will become slowed."
msgstr "春季风暴:每隔三个回合(第1、4、7……回合)结束时,康拉德的部队将进入减速状态。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:313
msgid ""
"Summer Storm: at the end of every fourth turn (1, 5, 9, etc), Konrad’s "
"forces will become slowed."
msgstr "夏季风暴:每隔四个回合(第1、5、9……回合)结束时,康拉德的部队将进入减速状态。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:319
msgid ""
"Autumn Storm: at the end of every third turn (1, 4, 7, etc), Konrad’s forces "
"will become slowed."
msgstr "秋季风暴:每隔三个回合(第1、4、7……回合)结束时,康拉德的部队将进入减速状态。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:325
msgid ""
"Winter Storm: at the end of every second turn (1, 3, 5, etc), Konrad’s "
"forces will become slowed."
msgstr "冬季风暴:每隔两个回合(第1、3、5……回合)结束时,康拉德的部队将进入减速状态。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:353
msgid ""
"Brr! This snowstorm is paralyzing me with cold! It’s springtime; surely the "
"weather should be warmer than this?"
msgstr "呵!这场暴风雪快把我冻僵了!现在是春天;天气总该比这暖和些吧?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:354
msgid ""
"Brr! This snowstorm is paralyzing me with cold! At least it’s summertime; "
"the weather would surely be far worse in winter."
msgstr "呵!这场暴风雪快把我冻僵了!至少现在是夏天;到了冬天天气肯定糟得多。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:355
msgid ""
"Brr! This snowstorm is paralyzing me with cold! It’s only autumn; surely the "
"weather should be warmer than this?"
msgstr "呵!这场暴风雪快把我冻僵了!这才秋天;天气总该比这暖和些吧?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:356
msgid ""
"Brr! This snowstorm is paralyzing me with cold! The weather here must be "
"especially bad in the winter months, like now."
msgstr "呵!这场暴风雪快把我冻僵了!这里的天气在像现在这样的冬季月份一定格外糟糕。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:364
msgid ""
"Hmm? Oh, ah, did I forget to mention the chill? Silly me — there’s, err, yes "
"there’s virtually always a storm blowing here; you’ll all be slowed down "
"quite often, trying to keep warm while trudging through the deepening "
"snowbanks. The local fauna are, of course, quite impervious to the cold."
msgstr "嗯?噢,啊,我忘了说这里的严寒?我的错——这里,呃,是的,这里几乎时时刻刻都有风暴;你们会经常因为要在越来越深的雪堆中跋涉、保持体温而减速。当地的动物当然对寒冷完全免疫。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:367
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:368
msgid ""
"Brrr... this is a far cry from the warm shores of Alduin. Unless we have "
"very fast warriors, we may have to split up if we want to collect all of "
"Jeniver’s ingredients before we run out of time and the cold drives us away. "
"The northeastern mountains look especially hard to reach."
msgstr "呵……这里跟奥德温温暖的海岸可差远了。除非我们有很快的战士,否则如果想在时间耗尽、严寒逼走我们之前收集齐珍妮弗所有的材料,可能就得兵分几路。东北方的群山看起来格外难以到达。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:369
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:370
msgid ""
"We will not be able to fight in this blizzard forever, Konrad. Unless we "
"have very fast warriors, we may have to split up if we want to collect all "
"of Jeniver’s ingredients before we run out of time and the cold drives us "
"away. The northeastern mountains look especially hard to reach."
msgstr "我们不可能在这场暴风雪里战斗到天荒地老,康拉德。除非我们有很快的战士,否则如果想在时间耗尽、严寒逼走我们之前收集齐你所有的材料,可能就得兵分几路。东北方的群山看起来格外难以到达。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:371
msgid ""
"We won’t be able t’ fight in th’ blizzard forever, Konrad. Unless we have "
"very fast warriors, we might want t’ split up to collect all o’ Jeniver’s "
"ingredients afore we run out o’ time and the cold drives us away. Them "
"northeastern mountains look ’specially hard t’ reach!"
msgstr "我们没法在这场暴风雪里一直打下去,康拉德。除非我们有很快的战士,否则我们可能得兵分几路,才能在时间耗尽、严寒逼走我们之前拿到珍妮弗所有的材料。东北方的群山看起来特别难到达!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:372
msgid ""
"The Light warms us, yet this chill blizzard takes its toll, Konrad. Unless "
"we have very fast warriors, we may have to split up should we hope to "
"collect all of Jeniver’s ingredients before our time runs short and the cold "
"drives us away. The northeastern mountains loom especially distant!"
msgstr "光明温暖着我们,可这场刺骨的风雪也在侵蚀着我们,康拉德。除非我们有很快的战士,否则若想在时间将尽、严寒逼走我们之前收集齐珍妮弗的全部材料,恐怕得兵分几路。东北方的群山显得格外遥远!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:373
msgid ""
"We ain’t prepared t’ fight ferever in a blizzard like this, Konrad. Lest "
"ye’ve got some very fast warriors, we may be havin’ to split up t’ get all "
"o’ Jeniver’s ingredients afore we run out o’ time and the cold drives us "
"away. Them northeastern mountains look ’specially hard t’ reach!"
msgstr "我们没打算在这场暴风雪里战斗到天荒地老,康拉德。除非你有一些跑得飞快的战士,不然我们可能得兵分几路,才能在时间耗尽、严寒逼走我们之前拿到珍妮弗所有的材料。东北方的群山看起来特别难到达!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:374
msgid ""
"Storm too cold, Konrad. Unless you got some fast fighters, Dosh is thinking "
"we’ve got no time get all da ’gredients unless you splits us up. Otherwise "
"we get too cold and den have to leave. Northeast mountains look ’specially "
"hard to be gettin’ to."
msgstr "暴风雪太冷了,康拉德。除非你有一些跑得快的战士,多什觉得我们没时间把那些材料都收集齐,除非你把我们分开行动。否则我们冻僵了就走不动,得走人。东北方的群山看起来特别难去。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:375
msgid ""
"We won’t be able to fight in this blizzard forever. Unless we have very fast "
"warriors, we may have to split up if we want to collect all of your "
"ingredients before we run out of time and the cold drives us away. The "
"northeastern mountains look especially hard to reach!"
msgstr "我们不可能在这场暴风雪里战斗下去。除非我们有很快的战士,否则如果想在时间耗尽、严寒把我们逼走之前收集齐你所有的材料,可能就得兵分几路。东北方的群山看起来格外难以到达!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:379
msgid ""
"True, true, but, well, you know, I suppose there’d really be no harm in "
"coming with you even if you don’t get them all— yes, I think I’ll join you "
"no matter what. You seem the nice sort, very chivalrous and all that."
msgstr "确实确实,不过,嗯,你知道,就算你们没能收集到全部,我也觉得跟着你们应该没什么坏处——是的,我想无论如何我都会加入你们。你们看起来是好人,非常骑士精神,诸如此类。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:383
msgid ""
"But— err, of course I suppose I wouldn’t really be of much use to you unless "
"you can gather at least some ingredients so that I can get my — you know — "
"alchemical concoctions prepared. The more the better!"
msgstr "不过——呃,当然,除非你们能收集到至少一些材料,让我能调配我的——你知道——炼金药剂,否则我恐怕帮不了你们什么忙。越多越好!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:422
msgid ""
"These are the Knalgan caves we exited from. No point going back, at least "
"not until we’ve finished helping Jeniver collect her ingredients."
msgstr "这是我们出来的纳尔迦洞穴。回去没有意义,至少在完成帮珍妮弗收集材料之前没有。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:427
msgid ""
"This cave must be an entrance to the great underground empire of Knalga! We "
"may decide to go that way later, but for now we should help Jeniver collect "
"her ingredients."
msgstr "这个洞穴一定是通往纳尔迦地下王国的入口!也许以后我们会决定走那条路,但现在我们应该帮珍妮弗收集材料。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:446
msgid ""
"I’ve defeated one of the young Icemonax, Jeniver! How do I get the bile you "
"wanted?"
msgstr "我击败了一只年轻的冰魔纳克,珍妮弗!怎么才能得到你需要的胆汁?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:450
msgid ""
"Oh, ah, I neglected to mention: only the Great Icemonax have the requisite "
"liver chemistry for producing bile. You’ll have to down one of the bigger "
"ones before I can collect what I need."
msgstr "噢,啊,我忘了说:只有大冰魔纳克的肝脏化学结构才能产生我需要的胆汁。你得先放倒一只体型较大的,我才能收集到我需要的东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:464
msgid "Oh, the Icemonax is dead! Yes, yes... allow me to extract the bile..."
msgstr "噢,冰魔纳克死了!对,对……请让我提取胆汁……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:469
msgid ""
"... there! Now add essence of wandweed... bone of the tyrant... a lit torch—"
"<i><b>stand back!</b></i>"
msgstr "……好了!现在加入魔草精液……暴君的骨头……一支点燃的火把——<i><b>退后!</b></i>"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:480
msgid ""
"Smoke! Yes, earth turned to air... most useful for befuddling and bewitching "
"the unprepared, and a validation of my theory of elemental humors!"
msgstr "烟雾!对,土化为气……最擅长让猝不及防者晕头转向,也验证了我的元素体液理论!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:486
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:555
msgid "New Attack"
msgstr "新攻击"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:487
msgid "Jeniver has gained a powerful <i>flashpowder</i> attack!"
msgstr "珍妮弗获得了一种强力的<i>闪光火药</i>攻击!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:506
msgid "Look out! That giant spider is furious, and it’s coming right at us!"
msgstr "小心!那只巨型蜘蛛暴怒了,正朝我们冲过来!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#. Jeniver is incorrect; the spider will mind. This message plays when spiders and Konrad's forces are about to engage in battle.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:511
msgid ""
"Oh, come now, I’m sure it just wants to make friends. No need for violence; "
"to get what I need, all you need to do is lever apart the front incisors and "
"gently massage the venom sacks. I’m sure the spider won’t mind."
msgstr "噢,拜托,我相信它只是想交朋友。不必动粗;要拿到我需要的东西,你只要掰开它的前门牙,轻轻按摩毒囊就行了。我敢肯定蜘蛛不会介意的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:522
msgid ""
"You have the spider venom! Fantastic! I shall just add a distillation of "
"euphoria... a dash of elf-hair, a few other bits and bobs..."
msgstr "蜘蛛毒液到手了!太棒了!我只需要再加一点狂喜蒸馏液……一点精灵毛发,以及其他一些东零碎……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:527
msgid "And... and! And my elixir of immortality is ready!"
msgstr "然后……然后!我的长生不老药已经完成了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:542
msgid "Blarghh!!!"
msgstr "嘎啦嘎啦!!!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:549
msgid ""
"Ugh... well, so much for my treatise on the life-extending properties of "
"venoms. Ah, well— well, setbacks are inevitable! At least the toxin, "
"properly prepared, may make for a useful weapon."
msgstr "呃……好吧,我那篇关于猛毒延寿特性的论文算是泡汤了。唉,好吧——挫折在所难免!至少毒素只要调配得当,就能成为一种有用的武器。"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:556
msgid "Jeniver has gained a poisoned <i>blowgun</i> attack!"
msgstr "珍妮弗获得了一种带毒的<i>吹箭</i>攻击!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:575
msgid ""
"They truly are real! This Yeti would be a majestic sight, if not for how "
"determined it is to beat our heads in with its bare fists!"
msgstr "它们竟然是真的!要是这头雪人王不那么执着于用拳头把我们的脑袋砸个稀碎的话,那真是一番壮观的景象!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:586
msgid "Fantastic, the Yeti is defeated! Let me take a look at that tongue..."
msgstr "太棒了,雪人王被击败了!让我看看那条舌头……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:591
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, now one dash of mugwort... essence of skyworm, heated under a cold "
"flame... and... and— And golden transmutation is achieved!"
msgstr "对,对,现在加一撮艾草……空蚯精,在冷焰下加热……然后……然后——黄金嬗变,大功告成!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:597
msgid ""
"Golden transmutation? You mean you can transmute other substances into gold? "
"That’s an incredible accomplishment!"
msgstr "黄金嬗变?你是说你能把其他物质点化成金?那可是了不起的成就!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:601
msgid ""
"Err, well, no, not quite. It’s more of a... distillation — yes, a process "
"for refining and extracting more value out of your existing coin. But "
"“transmutation” is a much more exciting word for alchemists. And etymology "
"aside, my discovery will certainly help boost your income!"
msgstr "呃,嗯,不,不完全是。它更像是一种……提纯——是的,一种从你现有的金币中提炼并榨取更多价值的工艺。但对炼金术士来说,“嬗变”是个激动人心的多得多。抛开词源不谈,我的发现一定能帮你提升收入!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:607
msgid "New Ability"
msgstr "新能力"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:608
msgid "Jeniver has gained the powerful <i>transmutation</i> ability!"
msgstr "詹妮弗获得了强大的<i>嬗变</i>能力!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:638
msgid ""
"And with that— yes, with that, I have everything I needed from the north! "
"Excellent! I wonder what substances I should turn my study to next..."
msgstr "那么——是的,这样我北方需要的东西就全齐了!太好了!我在想,接下来我该研究什么物质……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:642
msgid ""
"I’m glad to help! But don’t forget, you’d said you would join us if we "
"helped you here."
msgstr "我很乐意帮忙!但别忘了,你之前说过,只要我们在这里帮到你,你就会加入我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:646
msgid ""
"Hmm? Oh yes, yes, that’s quite right, of course. In fact I’ve got some new "
"ideas that I’m just longing to pursue; perhaps joining you on your travels "
"will provide me with a good opportunity for travel and research. I’d be glad "
"to accompany you on your travels, Konrad!"
msgstr "嗯?哦,是的,是的,你说得完全对,没错。事实上我有一些新想法,正迫不及待地想要着手研究;也许跟你们一同旅行,会给我一个好的游历与研究机会。我很乐意随你们一起旅行,康拉德!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:661
msgid ""
"We musn’t take too long helping Jeniver. The air is frigid and growing worse "
"by the minute; meanwhile Asheviere continues to grow stronger and stronger "
"unchecked."
msgstr "我们不能花太多时间帮詹妮弗。空气冰冷刺骨,而且一分钟比一分钟更糟;与此同时,艾什薇尔在无人牵制下越来越强大。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:665
msgid ""
"Jeniver has said she will still follow us even if we run out of time, but "
"without all three ingredients she also won’t be as useful as she might "
"otherwise have been."
msgstr "詹妮弗说她即便我们时间用尽也会跟着我们,但如果没有集齐全部三种原料,她也无法发挥原本应有的全部作用。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:672
msgid ""
"Jeniver, I know we’d promised to help gather your alchemical ingredients, "
"but between the cold and the threat of Asheviere we simply can’t spare any "
"more time to help you."
msgstr "詹妮弗,我知道我们答应过帮你收集炼金原料,但天寒地冻,加上艾什薇尔的威胁,我们实在抽不出更多时间帮你了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:676
msgid ""
"Oh, yes, no I understand; that’s quite all right. In fact I’ve got some new "
"ideas that I’m just longing to pursue; regardless of the remaining "
"ingredients here, perhaps joining you on your travels will provide me with a "
"good opportunity for travel and research. If you’ll have me, of course!"
msgstr "哦,好的,我懂了;完全没问题。事实上我有一些新想法,正迫不及待地想要着手研究;不管这里还剩多少原料,也许跟你们一同旅行,会给我一个好的游历与研究机会。如果你们不介意的话,当然!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:692
msgid ""
"Oh no! We promised to help Jeniver find her alchemical ingredients, but "
"instead we’ve let her die..."
msgstr "哦,不!我们答应过帮詹妮弗找到她的炼金原料,结果却让她死了……"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:701
msgid "scenario name^Northern Spring"
msgstr "北国之春"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:702
msgid "scenario name^Northern Summer"
msgstr "北国之夏"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:703
msgid "scenario name^Northern Autumn"
msgstr "北国之秋"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/23_Northern_Winter.cfg:704
msgid "scenario name^Northern Winter"
msgstr "北国之冬"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:8
#| msgid "scenario name^Blackwater Port"
msgid "scenario name^An Old Friend"
msgstr "黑水港"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:65
msgid "Deoran"
msgstr "德欧兰"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:136
msgid ""
"You have led us to a dark part of the jungle, great-granddaughter. And "
"undead? What are undead doing in Wesmere?!"
msgstr "曾孙女,你把我们带到了密林深处一片幽暗的地方。而且死者?不死者怎么会出现在威斯米尔?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:141
msgid ""
"Not any undead. That dark rider is our friend Deoran, risen anew as a wight "
"after Eldred so cruelly struck him down. He remembers nothing but echoes. It "
"is terrible, Kalenz!"
msgstr "不是普通的死者。那位黑暗骑士,是我们的朋友迪奥兰,在埃尔德残忍地刺倒他之后,以怨灵的形态重新站了起来。他不记得任何事,只有回声。太可怕了,卡兰兹!"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:145
msgid "Death... I lowered my sword... A blade in my chest..."
msgstr "死亡……我放下了剑……胸口被刺穿……"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:149
msgid ""
"I don’t know whether Deoran was turned to undeath as some insult of "
"Asheviere’s or by the dark magic of Eldred’s fall, but now he has come here "
"to Wesmere. He has sought me out..."
msgstr "我不知道迪奥兰变成不死者,是艾什薇尔的某种侮辱,还是埃尔德陨落时的黑暗魔法所致,但如今他已来到威斯米尔。他是在找我……"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:153
msgid ""
"Deoran was a good man, and deserved better than the end he met. I know you "
"and he were close, Chantal, and I am sorry."
msgstr "迪奥兰是个好人,他不该落得那样的下场。我知道你们曾十分亲近,香颂,我很抱歉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:157
msgid ""
"I had not the heart to kill him... one death was enough pain. But I know "
"that we cannot leave him to rampage through Wesmere. Now that you are here, "
"if his bones must be crushed and his body destroyed, so be it."
msgstr "我下不了手杀他……一次死亡已足以成痛。但我知道,我们不能放任他在威斯米尔横行。既然你已到来,若他的骨骼必须被碾碎、躯体必须被摧毁,那就如此吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:161
msgid ""
"Indeed, it would a mercy to put this cursed being out of his misery. But "
"perhaps it can be done without the violence that you would so abhor."
msgstr "的确,让这被诅咒的生灵摆脱痛苦,会是种慈悲。但或许,可以用你绝不愿看到的方式之外的办法做到。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:168
msgid ""
"Not far from here is a place of old magic; a burial ground once prepared for "
"one of our lords of old. It was never used, but remains a place of great "
"peace and rest. You say Deoran has sought you out; I believe he has sought "
"out this tomb."
msgstr "离这里不远,有一处古老魔法之地;那是当年为我们的一位领主准备的墓穴。它从未被使用,却仍是一片安宁与休憩之所。你说迪奥兰在找你;我相信,他找的是这座墓穴。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:172
msgid ""
"If we can lure him into the tomb without destroying him, his tired bones may "
"at last find the peace they have so long been denied. And your tired heart "
"may at last find closure, great-granddaughter."
msgstr "如果我们能在不摧毁他的情况下把他诱入墓穴,他疲惫的骨骼也许终于能找到长久以来被拒之门外的安宁。而你疲惫的心,也许终于能得到慰藉了,曾孙女。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:180
msgid "Lure undead Deoran into the burial chamber, and leave him alone inside."
msgstr "将不死的迪奥兰诱入墓室,把他独自留在里面。"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:184
msgid "Death of Deoran"
msgstr "德欧兰死亡"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:188
msgid "Death of Kalenz or Chantal"
msgstr "卡雷兹或香黛尔死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:196
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:539
msgid "In this scenario, you can neither gain nor spend gold."
msgstr "在本情景中,你既不能获得黄金,也不能花费黄金。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:199
msgid "Deoran will prefer to target Chantal."
msgstr "迪奥兰会优先攻击香颂。"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:211
msgid "Blackcrests... more, to the north... Rally! Form ranks..."
msgstr "黑冠军团……北边,还有更多……集结!列阵……"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:224
msgid ""
"You don’t remember me, do you, Deoran... We shared good memories together, "
"back in the Lintanir."
msgstr "你不记得我了,是吗,迪奥兰……我们在林塔尼尔的日子,曾一起拥有过许多美好的记忆。"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:228
msgid "... Chantal? No, not here... War is no... place for you..."
msgstr "……香颂?不,不是这里……战场不是……属于你的地方……"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#. Deoran references Mebrin from TSG, and Kalenz's lich-eye potion from LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:242
msgid ""
"Mebrin... I sense eye... of lich... Your time has come... once-wise sage..."
msgstr "梅布林……我感知到……巫妖的目光……你的时辰到了……曾经睿智的贤者……"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#. Deoran references Mebrin's line from TSG S06b: "I curse you, Deoran of Wesnoth! I curse you... may you one day know the same pain that your kind have inflicted on me..."
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:247
msgid "You cursed me... you cursed me... to know the same pain..."
msgstr "你诅咒了我……你诅咒了我……让我尝尝同样的痛苦……"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:259
msgid "He’s inside! Now we need to exit the tomb and leave him there."
msgstr "他进来了!现在我们需要离开墓穴,把他留在那里。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:318
msgid "There! Now shut the gate and the magic will begin to do its work."
msgstr "好了!现在关上大门,魔法就开始发挥作用了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:330
msgid "Is it working?"
msgstr "有用吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:334
#| msgid "My head?"
msgid "My... head..."
msgstr "我的头？"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:349
msgid "I died. How am I here? I remember better places... happier times..."
msgstr "我死了。我怎么会在这里?我记得更好的地方……更快乐的时光……"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:353
msgid "... goodbye, Chantal."
msgstr "……再见了,香颂。"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:359
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "再见。"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:381
msgid "Eldred—"
msgstr "埃尔德——"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:387
msgid "No! He has been broken to pieces..."
msgstr "不!他被打得粉碎了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:409
msgid "Argh! I am finished!"
msgstr "啊啊啊！我完了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:430
msgid ""
"The undead Deoran is beginning to cast his head wildly this way and that. If "
"we cannot complete our task, I fear he shall soon flee into the river, and "
"vanish to bring harm to some other land."
msgstr "不死者迪奥兰开始疯狂地四处张望。如果我们无法完成我们的任务,我恐怕他很快就会逃入河中,消失不见,再去祸害别的地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:437
msgid "You cannot... trap me, Mebrin... I see my escape..."
msgstr "你们困不住……我,梅布林……我看到我的生路了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/24_An_Old_Friend.cfg:443
msgid ""
"Deoran has gone! We’ve taken too long to seal him away, and now we may never "
"find him again..."
msgstr "迪奥兰不见了!我们没能及时将他封存,如今我们恐怕再也找不到他了……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:17
msgid "scenario name^The Dwarven Doors"
msgstr "scenario name^矮人之门"

#. [message]: role=angry_orc
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:209
msgid ""
"Back into your hovel, worms! Your masters will deal with this idiot attack."
msgstr "滚回你们的窝去,虫子们!你们的主人会收拾这次愚蠢的进攻。"

#. [message]: role=angry_orc
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:217
msgid ""
"And stay in there. Any pinkskin sticks its head out, it won’t have a head "
"for much longer!"
msgstr "给我老老实实待在里头!哪个粉皮子把脑袋探出来,它的脑袋可就没多久了!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:238
msgid ""
"Hark! The darkness fills this valley: orcs. More than even my light can "
"purify! Our crossing will be difficult, yet cross we must, if the dwarven "
"caverns we wish to exit."
msgstr "听!黑暗填满了这条山谷:兽人。比我的光所能净化的还要多!我们的穿越将十分艰难,但若要离开矮人洞穴,我们非渡不可。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:239
msgid ""
"There’s orcs here; lots of orcs. More than we can fight, I’m thinkin’. But "
"we’ve gots to get through if’n we want to get out o’ these dwarf tunnels!"
msgstr "这里有兽人;好多兽人。我猜比我们能打的还多。可要是想从这些矮人隧道里出去,咱们就非穿过去不可!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:240
msgid ""
"There are orcs here; many orcs, likely more than we can defeat. Yet we must "
"pass through this valley if we wish to exit the dwarven caverns."
msgstr "这里有兽人;很多兽人,恐怕比我们能击败的还要多。但若要离开矮人洞穴,我们必须穿过这条山谷。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:242
msgid ""
"Hark! The darkness fills this valley: orcs. More than even my light can "
"purify! Our crossing will be difficult, yet cross we must, if the dwarven "
"caverns we wish to enter."
msgstr "听!黑暗填满了这条山谷:兽人。比我的光所能净化的还要多!我们的穿越将十分艰难,但若要进入矮人洞穴,我们非渡不可。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:243
msgid ""
"There’s orcs here; lots of orcs. More than we can fight, I’m thinkin’. But "
"we’ve gots to get through if’n we want to into them dwarf tunnels!"
msgstr "这里有兽人;好多兽人。我猜比我们能打的还多。可要是想钻进那些矮人隧道,咱们就非穿过去不可!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:244
msgid ""
"There are orcs here; many orcs, likely more than we can defeat. Yet we must "
"pass through this valley if we wish to enter the dwarvish caverns beyond."
msgstr "这里有兽人;很多兽人,恐怕比我们能击败的还要多。但若要进入远处的矮人洞穴,我们必须穿过这条山谷。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:247
msgid ""
"Filthy white-livered orcish cowards, squatting here in the ruins o’ the city "
"o’ the dwarf-friends! Swallow-tiltin’ marmalade drinkers! I say we take an "
"axe to every last one o’ the wretches!"
msgstr "肮脏的胆小鬼兽人,蹲在矮人之友城市的废墟里!歪着脖子喝果酱的软骨头!我提议把斧头挥向每一个杂碎!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:250
msgid ""
"Oh! Oh wow, that’s really a lot of orcs! I mean I knew there would be a lot "
"but... wow! And slaves! I’d no idea there were so many humans living up in "
"the north."
msgstr "噢!噢天哪,好多的兽人啊!我是知道会有很多,但……哇!还有奴隶!我根本不知道北边居然住着这么多人。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:251
msgid ""
"Mmm... Konrad better be bein’ careful. Dese be da Bloody Sword orcs. Ever "
"since dey took over dis valley, dey’ve got really big and really strong. How "
"you thinkin’ we should fight?"
msgstr "嗯……康拉德得小心点。这些是血剑兽人。自从它们占了这条山谷,就长得又大又壮。你打算怎么打?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:258
msgid ""
"As much as I wish we could stay and liberate all these poor slaves, there "
"are just too many foes to fight. We’ve caught them by surprise right now, "
"but that won’t last long."
msgstr "尽管我很希望能留下来解放所有这些可怜奴隶,但敌人实在太多了。我们现在是打了他们一个措手不及,但不会持续太久。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:261
msgid ""
"We’ll have to focus on fighting our way through to the south exit, and free "
"as many slaves as we can along the way!"
msgstr "我们必须集中精力杀出一条通往南方出口的路,并在途中解放尽可能多的奴隶!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:263
msgid ""
"We’ll have to focus on fighting our way through to the north exit, and free "
"as many slaves as we can along the way!"
msgstr "我们必须集中精力杀出一条通往北方出口的路,并在途中解放尽可能多的奴隶!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:276
#| msgid "Move Konrad to the entrance of the dwarven tunnels"
msgid "Move Konrad to the marked tunnel entrance"
msgstr "移动科纳德至矮人坑道入口处"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:283
#| msgid "Move Konrad to the north side of the river"
msgid "Move Konrad to the southern edge of the map"
msgstr "移动科纳德至河北面"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:291
msgid "Rescue as many slaves as possible"
msgstr "尽可能多地解救奴隶"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:301
msgid ""
"Liberating a village will free the slaves inside. The more slaves are with "
"you, the fewer new ones will appear."
msgstr "解放一个村庄就会释放里面的奴隶。跟随你的奴隶越多,新出现的奴隶就越少。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:304
msgid "Each surviving slave increases your gold carryover by 10."
msgstr "每名存活的奴隶都会增加你 10 金币的结转收入。"

#. [modify_unit]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:352
msgid "Tanry"
msgstr "坦里"

#. [message]: role=freed_slave {NOT id=$unit.id}
#. the speaking peasant/woodsman refers to a time when Baldras and some allies tried to help the Doors, but got captured. The player may or may not know about at this point.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:361
msgid ""
"I— I can’t believe it. Have you come to rescue us? Others have tried "
"before..."
msgstr "我——我不敢相信。你们是来救我们的吗?以前也有人试过……"

#. [message]: id=$unit.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:366
msgid ""
"By the Lords of Light, we’re saved! Take us with you! I don’t care who you "
"are or where you’re going, as long as it’s away!"
msgstr "光明之主在上,我们得救了!带我们走吧!我不在乎你们是谁、要去哪里,只要能离开这里就行!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:370
msgid ""
"I am Konrad, son of Arand and rightful heir to the throne of Wesnoth. Words "
"cannot express my grief at the sorry state of you and your people here. Of "
"course you may come with us, as may any other slaves who we are able to free!"
msgstr "我是康拉德,阿兰德之子,韦诺特王位的正统继承人。言语无法表达我见到你们和这里的族人如此凄惨境况时的悲痛。你们当然可以跟我们一起走,任何我们所能解放的奴隶也一样!"

#. [message]: id=$unit.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:382
msgid ""
"You’re making for the dwarven caves? I heard the masters say the central "
"gate’s been collapsed for years — them dwarves did it to keep orcs out. "
"Maybe you could come up from underground through there, if you had time to "
"clear a path. But there’s no way down."
msgstr "你们要去矮人的洞穴?我听说主人说过,中央入口塌了好些年了——是那些矮人干的,为的是挡住兽人。要是你们有时间清出一条路,也许能从地底下通到那里。但要下去,是没路的。"

#. [message]: id=$unit.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:386
msgid ""
"They tried to knock down the eastern mineshaft too, but its since been "
"cleared. Lots o’ orcs and trolls go in, trying to finish off the last "
"dwarves and claim Knalga’s treasure for themselves. That’s the only way "
"underground now."
msgstr "他们也试图把东面的矿道堵死,但后来又被清通了。很多兽人和巨魔进去,想赶尽最后一点矮人,把纳尔迦的宝藏据为己有。现在这是唯一能走的地道了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:405
msgid "Who’s there? What’s goin’ on?"
msgstr "谁在那里?出什么事了?"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:413
msgid "... Uncle Somf? Is that really you? What’re you doing here!"
msgstr "……索姆夫舅舅?真的是你吗?你在这里做什么!"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:417
msgid "Harper!? Well, I never— my, how ye’ve grown!"
msgstr "哈珀!?哎呀,我从没想过——天哪,你都长这么大了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:421
msgid ""
"How did ye find me? When we left the Three Sisters to try an’ help these "
"people, Baldras ne’er told any o’ ye where we was goin’, fer fear o’ the "
"orcs catchin’ wind."
msgstr "你们是怎么找到我的?我们离开三姐妹岛去设法帮助这些人的时候,巴德拉斯从没告诉你们我们要去哪里,怕被兽人察觉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:425
msgid ""
"When you all didn’t come back, Delurin thought you was all dead, but I never "
"lost hope. Where’s Uncle Baldras? I’ve so many things to tell him!"
msgstr "你们一直没回来的时候,德洛林以为你们都死了,但我从没放弃希望。巴德拉斯叔叔呢?我有那么多话想告诉他!"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:429
msgid ""
"Ah... I’m sorry Harper, but he’s dead. Died a hero; saved us all when things "
"went bad."
msgstr "唉……抱歉,哈珀,他死了。死得很英勇;局面失控时,他救了我们所有人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:433
msgid ""
"Them orcs caught us soon as we got close, before we e’en got a chance to "
"start smugglin’ people out. Yer uncle took the blame fer the whole thin’; "
"said he was an escaped slave causin’ trouble, an’ that the rest of us were "
"jus’ innocents mixed up in it all."
msgstr "那些兽人刚靠近就把我们逮住了,我们连偷偷把人带出去的机会都没有。你舅舅把整件事都揽在自己身上;说他是个逃出来的奴隶在搞事,我们其余的只是被牵连的无辜之人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:437
msgid ""
"Orcs can’t hardly tell humans apart, you know; they believed every word he "
"said. The rest o’ us they chained up and whipped a few times, afore throwin’ "
"us into the fields to be slaves. But Baldras they made an’ example out of."
msgstr "兽人根本分不清人类谁是谁,你知道的;他说的每个字他们都信了。我们其余的人被锁上链子,挨了几鞭子,然后就被扔去地里做苦力。但巴德拉斯他们要拿他杀一儆百。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:441
msgid ""
"I was so sure he’d be okay... but I suppose it woulda been too good to be "
"true. At least you’ve survived, Somf."
msgstr "我一直以为他会没事……但想来那也太过美好了。你至少还活着,索姆夫。"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:449
msgid ""
"... Konrad, this is Somf — a friend from the Three Sisters. Somf, this is "
"His Royal Highness Konrad, Prince of Wesnoth. I’m fighting in his army, an’ "
"now you are too."
msgstr "……康拉德,这位是索姆夫——我在三姐妹岛的老朋友。索姆夫,这位是韦诺特王国的康拉德王子殿下。我在他的军队里作战,现在你也一样了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:458
msgid ""
"I am Konrad, heir to the throne of Wesnoth. I’m here to rescue you from "
"these slavers! Will you join me and help fight in my army?"
msgstr "我是康拉德,韦诺特王位的继承人。我来这里,是把你们从这些奴隶贩子手里解救出来!你愿意加入我,在我的军队里并肩作战吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:462
msgid ""
"That’s mighty fine of you to offer, boy; liberatin’ me from one master only "
"to offer yerself as my new one. Hah, I weren’t born yesterday!"
msgstr "你这提议真是太好了,小子;把我从一个主人手里解放出来,结果把自己当新主人推销给我。哈,我可不是今天才出生的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:468
msgid ""
"That man looked like he could’ve made a capable warrior! I am sorry to see "
"him go — but least we have given him the freedom to choose his own path."
msgstr "那家伙看起来本可以成为一名出色的战士!看着他离去,我很遗憾——但至少我们给了他选择自己道路的自由。"

#. [message]: type=Cuttle Fish,Kraken
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:488
msgid "Ruarrrrr!!!"
msgstr "呜啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:491
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:492
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:493
msgid "By Haldric! There’s some sort of monster in the lake!"
msgstr "哈尔德里克在上!湖里有什么怪物!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:494
msgid ""
"Aaah! There’s— it’s— well, I don’t mean to sound unscientific, but it’s a "
"monster!"
msgstr "啊啊!那里有——它是——呃,我不想显得不科学,但它就是一只怪物!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:495
msgid "Thursagan’s beard! There’s a great galumphing monster in the lake!"
msgstr "索萨甘的胡子!湖里有一只又高又大的怪物!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:496
msgid "By the Light! A monster most foul lurks within the waters!"
msgstr "光明在上!水里潜伏着一只极其可怖的怪物!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:497
msgid "Dere be some kind of monster in da lake!"
msgstr "湖里有怪物!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:498
msgid "Gah! Look out, there’s some kind of monster in the lake!"
msgstr "呃!小心,湖里有什么怪物!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:502
#| msgid ""
#| "The legend was true! There are always tentacled creatures hiding in the "
#| "lakes near the dwarven tunnels."
msgid ""
"The legend was true! They say there’s always tentacled creatures hiding in "
"lakes near dwarven tunnels."
msgstr "看来传说是真的！在矮人坑道旁边的湖里总是有长触手的生物。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:514
msgid ""
"Here stand the pillars of Thunedain. He were a great lord o’ my kind; the "
"last o’ the heroes o’ the Doors. Here did he stand, an’ here did he fall."
msgstr "这里立着图内戴因的柱石。他是我族中伟大的领主;矮人之门最后一位英雄。他在这里矗立,也在这里倒下。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:515
#| msgid ""
#| "The pillars of Thunedain. He was a legendary dwarvish lord who made his "
#| "last stand here. May we triumph where he fell."
msgid ""
"I think these to be the pillars of Thunedain, Konrad. He was a legendary "
"dwarvish lord who made his last stand here. May we triumph where he fell."
msgstr ""
"苏内达因之柱。他是一位传奇式的矮人领主，在这里他坚守直到最后一息。愿我们能在"
"他倒下的地方获胜。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:516
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:517
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:518
#| msgid ""
#| "The pillars of Thunedain. He was a legendary dwarvish lord who made his "
#| "last stand here. May we triumph where he fell."
msgid ""
"Is this— yes, these must be the pillars of Thunedain. I read about this. He "
"was a great dwarvish lord who made his last stand here."
msgstr ""
"苏内达因之柱。他是一位传奇式的矮人领主，在这里他坚守直到最后一息。愿我们能在"
"他倒下的地方获胜。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:544
msgid ""
"We’ve reached the southern exit to the valley, and have dealt a great blow "
"to these orcs! If only we could have truly liberated this place... but I "
"know that far more people are suffering under Asheviere."
msgstr "我们已经到达山谷的南方出口,并给了这些兽人沉重的一击!要是我们能彻底解放这个地方就好了……但我知道,还有更多的人在艾什薇尔的铁蹄下受苦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:548
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:569
msgid ""
"At least we did our best to help those who were enslaved here. To those who "
"remain; to those we could not save I say: <i>Hold fast your hope, for one "
"day you shall be free!</i>"
msgstr "至少我们已尽力帮助了那些在这里为奴的人。对留下来的人,对我们没能救下的人,我说:<i>坚守希望,因为总有一天你们会获得自由!</i>"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:565
msgid ""
"We’ve reached the entrance to the dwarven tunnels, and have dealt a great "
"blow to these orcs! If only we could have truly liberated this place... but "
"I know that far more people are suffering under Asheviere."
msgstr "我们已经到达矮人地道的入口,并给了这些兽人沉重的一击!要是我们能彻底解放这个地方就好了……但我知道,还有更多的人在艾什薇尔的铁蹄下受苦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:587
msgid ""
"As we were warned, the central tunnels have been collapsed. We shall have to "
"make for the eastern mineshaft instead."
msgstr "正如我们事先听说的,中央地道已经被堵塌了。我们只能改走东面的矿道。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:592
msgid ""
"The central tunnels are collapsed! Maybe some of the slaves knew about this, "
"but I freed so few... We shall have to make for the eastern mineshaft, and "
"hope that entrance is still open."
msgstr "中央地道塌了!也许有些奴隶知道这事,但我解放的人太少了……我们只能赶往东面的矿道,祈祷那个入口还开着。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:608
#| msgid "Death of Delfador"
msgid "Death to slavers!"
msgstr "德法多死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:620
msgid "This isn’t going so well..."
msgstr "事情进展得不怎么顺利……"

#. [message]: id=$last_leader.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:642
msgid ""
"Okay, forget this. I’m taking the rest of our slaves, getting the chief, and "
"bringing the horde! You invaders had better not be here when we get back!"
msgstr "算了,别怪我没提醒。我要带着剩下的奴隶去找首领,把大军带来!你们这些入侵者最好在我们回来之前滚蛋!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:663
msgid ""
"The orcs are escaping, along with many of their slaves! I cannot rescue you "
"all... but please, remember: <i>Hold fast your hope, for one day you shall "
"be free!</i>"
msgstr "兽人正在逃跑,许多奴隶也跟着一同逃走了!我无法救下你们所有人……但请你们记住:<i>坚守希望,因为总有一天你们会获得自由!</i>"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:692
#| msgid "You can now recruit fearsome Gryphon Riders!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Peasants and Woodsmen!"
msgstr "您现在可以征募令人闻风丧胆的狮鹫骑士了！"

#. [message]: role=freed_slave
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:695
msgid ""
"Thank you for helping me escape, Konrad! On our way out, each of those you "
"freed have grabbed as much of the orcs’ gold and supplies as we could."
msgstr "谢谢你帮我逃跑,康拉德!撤离的时候,被你解放的每个人都尽可能多地带走了兽人的金币和物资。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. $freed_slaves.length is more than 0, and probably less than 20. $carryover is more than 4, and probably less than 100
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:703
msgid ""
"You have rescued $freed_slaves.length slaves, and will have $carryover extra "
"gold in the next scenario!"
msgstr "你已救出 $freed_slaves.length 名奴隶,下一场景将获得 $carryover 金币的额外收入!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:718
msgid ""
"... not a single slave has escaped along with us. I had hoped that our good "
"deed here would help us gain new allies, but it seems my hopes were in vain. "
"We must press onwards alone."
msgstr "……没有一个奴隶跟我们一起逃出来。我曾希望我们在这里的好举动能帮助我们赢得新盟友,但看来希望落空了。我们只能独自继续前行。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:732
msgid ""
"Bah, when’s the chief getting back with the horde? These invaders are being "
"a real nuisance."
msgstr "呸,首领什么时候带着大军回来?这些入侵者真是够烦人的。"

#. [message]: role=warlord
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:755
msgid ""
"What’s goin’ on here? Slave revolt, is it? Hah! None o’ you’re getting out "
"o’ this valley alive!"
msgstr "这儿搞什么名堂?奴隶起义吗?哈!你们一个也别想活着走出这条山谷!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/26_The_Dwarven_Doors.cfg:759
msgid ""
"More orcs have arrived, and have positioned themselves to stop us "
"progressing! Even if we manage to win this fight, the cost will surely be "
"too great for our small army to bear..."
msgstr "更多的兽人到了,并布下阵势阻止我们前进!就算我们侥幸赢得这一战,付出的代价对我们这支小部队来说也必然太过沉重……"

#. [side]: type={TYPE}, id={ID}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:74
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr "巨魔"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:221
msgid ""
"From what Delfador has taught me, I recognize us to be in the ruins of the "
"great western hall of Knalga."
msgstr "根据德法多教我的知识,我能认出我们正处于纳尔迦的西部大厅的废墟之中。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:225
msgid ""
"It is a sad sight to see, but we may yet find here something of value that "
"was missed by the conquering orcs. We just have to drive off the local "
"trolls first."
msgstr "这景象令人伤感,但我们或许还能在这里找到被征服的兽人漏下的有价值的东西。只是我们得先把当地的巨魔赶跑。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:229
msgid ""
"Caves and crypts are no place for the fair folk, Konrad, and dwarvish "
"tunnels even less so. I am not eager to proceed, but what must be done must "
"be done."
msgstr "洞穴和墓穴可不是我们优雅子民该来的地方,康拉德,矮人的隧道就更不用说了。我并不想前进,但该做的事还是得做。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:230
msgid ""
"Cave and crypts are no place for cavalry, Konrad, and dwarvish tunnels even "
"less so. I am not eager to proceed, but what must be done must be done."
msgstr "洞穴和墓穴可不是骑兵该来的地方,康拉德,矮人的隧道就更不用说了。我并不想前进,但该做的事还是得做。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:231
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:232
msgid ""
"Well, this is a far cry from the sunny shores of Alduin. And it stinks of "
"troll excrement! Let’s do what needs to be done and get it over with."
msgstr "唉,这里跟阿尔德温的阳光海岸可差远了。还有股巨魔的臭味!我们赶紧把该做的事办了,早点收工。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:233
msgid ""
"Aye, an’ <b><i>I</i></b> may find me father’s defiled bones, or me "
"grandfather’s. Cheery thoughts all around, eh?"
msgstr "嗯,而且<b><i>我</i></b>说不定还能找到我父亲被玷污的遗骨,或者我祖父的。这想法可真是令人欢欣鼓舞,是吧?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:234
msgid ""
"Away in the deep darkness, we are cut off from the light. But hark! Not from "
"the Light, nor ever from the Light, for the Light shall always guide the "
"faithful."
msgstr "在深远的黑暗之中,我们与光明隔绝。但听!并非自光明,也永不出自光明,因为光明将永远指引信者。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:235
msgid ""
"Well, don’ this place be bringin’ back some bad memories. Jus’ hope we don’ "
"find no Midnight Queen down these caves this time."
msgstr "唉,这地方真能勾起一些糟糕的回忆。但愿这次在这些洞穴里,别再碰到什么午夜女王了。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:236
msgid ""
"You know, I’ve always wanted to meet a wild troll! Well, at least I think "
"I’ve always wanted to. Do you think they know how their regeneration works, "
"or does it just happen by instinct?"
msgstr "你知道吗,我一直都想知道野生的巨魔长什么样!好吧,至少我是这么觉得的。你觉得它们知道自己是怎么再生的,还是全凭本能?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:237
msgid ""
"Don’t be lookin’ at me, Konrad. Jus’ cuz Dosh is a troll don’t mean Dosh "
"knows all the trolls on da continent. An’ don’t get Dosh mixed up with one "
"o’ dem other trolls while we’re fighting, okay?"
msgstr "别看我,康拉德。道什是巨魔,不代表道什认识这片大陆上所有的巨魔。打架的时候,可别把道什跟其他巨魔搞混了,行吗?"

#. [message]: race=dwarf,gryphon {NOT id=Ulfdain}
#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:302
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:307
#| msgid "My uncle’s family drowned after the orcs flooded that cavern..."
msgid ""
"I remember that passageway. Me uncle’s whole family drowned here after th’ "
"orcs flooded th’ halls. I were young, very young..."
msgstr "在兽人们往洞穴里灌水之后，我舅舅一家淹死了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:344
msgid "Listen! Do you hear that?"
msgstr "听!你听到什么了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:350
msgid ""
"Kill the trolls... kill them all... scour the caverns... search the halls..."
msgstr "杀了那些巨魔……全部杀光……肃清洞穴……搜索大厅……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:393
msgid ""
"More orcs at the gates... Send Eller... for reinforcements. The west hall. "
"Where... are my dragoons?"
msgstr "门外又有兽人……派艾勒尔……去求援。西翼大厅。我的龙骑兵……在哪儿?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:400
msgid "No more recruits. I will lead the sortie... personally."
msgstr "不再有援军了。这一次,我亲自率军出击。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:412
msgid ""
"Look at the strange axe that death knight is holding! What an unusual weapon."
msgstr "看那个死者骑士拿着的奇怪战斧!好一把不同寻常的武器。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:417
#| msgid "I say that..."
msgid "I... that..."
msgstr "我认为……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:421
msgid "<i>THAT’S MY FATHER’S AXE!</i>"
msgstr "<i>那——是——我——父——亲——的——战——斧!</i>"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:425
msgid ""
"Give it back, ye beastly bag o’ bones! I’ll rip out yer ribs and stuff ’em "
"down yer eye sockets!"
msgstr "把它还回来,你这堆骨头堆成的野兽!我要把你的肋骨抽出来,塞进你的眼眶里!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:429
msgid ""
"I’ll boil yer teeth. I’ll invert your kneecaps. Death is too good for ye. UN-"
"death is too good fer ye!"
msgstr "我要煮烂你的牙。我要把你的膝盖骨翻过来。死都算你走运。不死也算你走运!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:433
#| msgid "Secret? What secret, Delfador? What are you talking about?"
msgid "Ulfdain, calm down! What are you talking about?"
msgstr "秘密？什么秘密，德法多？您究竟在说什么？"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:437
msgid ""
"That coward, that yaldson, that spawn of utter darkness is holdin’ my "
"father’s axe! His bloodaxe, one o’ the last few in the world!"
msgstr "那个懦夫,那个逆子,那个彻头彻尾的黑暗之子,竟然拿着我父亲的战斧!他的血斧,这世上仅存的几柄之一!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:441
msgid ""
"By Thursagan’s beard, we’re goin’ to get it back or we’re goin’ to die "
"tryin’! Charge!"
msgstr "以图萨根的胡子起誓,我们要夺回它,就算豁出命去!冲锋!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:456
msgid ""
"Lost? No... do not speak that word. We will... prevail. We will find... the "
"sceptre..."
msgstr "迷路了?不……别说那个字。我们会……取胜。我们会找到……权杖……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:460
msgid ""
"The Sceptre? Of Fire?! Who are you, foul creature that we fight? Speak your "
"name, that I may know the foe I slay!"
msgstr "权杖?火之权杖?!”你是谁,与我们为敌的污秽生物?报上你的名来,让我知道我要杀的是哪个敌人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#. Lionel repeats a line from TDG's S06
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:465
msgid "We swore our oaths... now we do our duty..."
msgstr "我们立下过誓言……如今,我们履行我们的职责……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:480
msgid ""
"I am Konrad, nephew of Garard, son of Arand and rightful heir to the throne "
"of Wesnoth! And in their names, I end your undead suffering."
msgstr "我是康拉德,伽拉德的外甥、阿兰德之子,韦诺特王座的合法继承人!而在他们的名义之下,我终结你这不死者的苦痛。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#. Lionel foreshadows the reveal that Konrad is not in fact the heir
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:485
msgid "Arand? You look... nothing like Arand..."
msgstr "阿兰德?你看起来……一点都不像阿兰德……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:496
msgid ""
"So this vile creature was once a man, searching for the Sceptre of Fire. "
"Neither in life nor un-life could he find the object of his quest — but it "
"seems he still gathered many other riches and things of value."
msgstr "原来这个可鄙的生物曾是人,一生都在寻找火之权杖。无论生前死后,他都没能找到他追寻的目标——但他似乎还是积攒了许多其他财宝与有价值的东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:518
msgid ""
"His gold will be useful to us, but his axe may be even more so. The runes "
"carved into it look dwarvish, and ancient..."
msgstr "他的黄金对我们有用,但他的战斧可能更有用。上面雕刻的符文是矮人的,而且十分古老……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:533
msgid ""
"Aye... like I said ’twere my father’s, but ’tweren’t he who forged it. Been "
"with us dwarves since times o’ legend, have th’ bloodaxes. I never thought "
"I’d again see such a sight! Not since th’ dark days began..."
msgstr "嗯……就像我说的,它曾是我父亲的,但锻造它的并不是他。血斧与我们矮人相伴,自传说时代起就传承至今。我万万没想到还能再看到这样的景象!黑暗年代开始以来,就没见过……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:541
msgid ""
"Perhaps th’ spirit o’ Knalga ain’t so dead an’ buried after all. Ah’m a "
"Bloodaxe now, like my father an’ his father an’ his father afore him! Ah’m "
"in yer debt once again, Konrad. Ye given me hope."
msgstr "也许纳尔迦的精神并没有彻底埋进黄土里。我现在也有一柄血斧了,像我父亲、他的父亲、还有他们之前的父亲一样!我又欠你一个人情了,康拉德。你给了我希望。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:556
msgid ""
"A weapon worthy of a king — or a prince. I shall personally wield this axe "
"against the dark queen."
msgstr "一件配得上国王——或者王子的武器。我要亲自挥起这把战斧,对抗黑暗女王。"

#. [event]
#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Bloodaxe, race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:561
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:4
msgid "Dwarvish Bloodaxe"
msgstr "矮人血斧"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:562
msgid ""
"This runic axe increases Konrad’s melee damage by 3, and grants him the "
"<i>drains</i> special on his melee attacks."
msgstr "这把符文战斧使康拉德的近战伤害提高3,并使其近战攻击获得<i>汲血</i>特殊能力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:594
msgid ""
"I am glad; the halls of your ancestors are at peace once more, Ulfdain. Now "
"it is time for us to move on."
msgstr "那就好,乌尔夫戴恩;你祖先的大厅又重归安宁了。现在是我们继续前进的时候了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:599
msgid ""
"More trolls will move in soon, but for now, the caverns are empty. Time for "
"us to move on."
msgstr "更多的巨魔很快就会涌进来,但眼下洞穴里空了。轮到我们继续前进了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:626
msgid ""
"These halls are old, and our fighting is damaging the walls and pillars. If "
"we cannot finish soon, the whole cavern might collapse on us!"
msgstr "这些大厅很古老了,我们的激战正在损坏墙壁与廊柱。如果再不快点结束,整个洞穴都会塌在我们头上!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/28_The_Lost_General.cfg:640
msgid ""
"Our fighting has caused too much damage to these old ruins! The whole "
"mountain is falling down on us!"
msgstr "我们的激战给这片古老的遗迹造成了太大的破坏!整座山都在向我们塌下来!"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:51
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:71
#| msgid "Galga"
msgid "Knalgans"
msgstr "伽尔伽"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:170
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:179
msgid ""
"The Knalgans led Konrad and his men, blindfolded, through a maze of twisting "
"tunnels and passageways."
msgstr "纳尔迦人蒙住康拉德一行人的双眼,穿过迷宫般曲折交错的隧道与通道。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:172
msgid ""
"The sound of hammers echoed through the stale cave air, then pickaxes, then "
"the quiet murmur of low dwarvish voices, interspersed with louder remarks "
"from the still-seeing dwarves of Konrad’s own party. And at long last, "
"silence."
msgstr "锤声在闷热的洞穴空气中回响,接着是镐声,再之后是矮人低沉话语的轻声低语,其间还夹杂着康拉德队伍中那些仍能视物的矮人更大的动静。终于,一片寂静。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:181
msgid ""
"The sound of hammers echoed through the stale cave air, then pickaxes, then "
"the quiet murmur of low dwarvish voices. And at long last, silence."
msgstr "锤声在闷热的洞穴空气中回响,接着是镐声,再之后是矮人低沉话语的轻声低语。终于,一片寂静。"

#. [message]: speaker=Geldar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:195
msgid ""
"Here we are. The start o’ the cave-in. Somewhere beyond here, past all "
"manner of beasts and vermin, lie our trapped miners. Rescue them, and you’ll "
"be rewarded."
msgstr "我们到了。坍塌就在这里开始。在这之后的某处,隔着各种各样的野兽和害虫,我们的矿工被困在那里。把他们救出来,我们必有重赏。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:199
msgid ""
"It’s just a solid wall of rock. How am I supposed to get through and find "
"your comrades?"
msgstr "这是一堵实心的岩壁。我该怎么穿过它,找到你们的同伴?"

#. [message]: speaker=Geldar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:203
msgid "Dig, human. I must return to my guard duties."
msgstr "挖吧,人类。我得回去尽守夜之责了。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:214
#| msgid "Find the dwarves"
msgid "Find the missing dwarves"
msgstr "找到矮人"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:234
msgid ""
"Ulfdain, the Knalgans here have been very evasive about what’s going on. Do "
"you have any insights?"
msgstr "乌尔夫戴恩,这里的纳尔迦人说话很绕,不肯明说发生了什么。你了解些什么吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. [message]: race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:238
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:249
msgid ""
"Aye, I think I can guess. But I cannae tell an outsider, Konrad, not even "
"you."
msgstr "嗯,我想我能猜到。但我不能对外人讲,康拉德,哪怕是对你也不行。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:244
msgid ""
"Friend dwarf, the Knalgans here have been very evasive about what’s going "
"on. Do you have any insights?"
msgstr "矮人朋友,这里的纳尔迦人说话很绕,不肯明说发生了什么。你了解些什么吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:324
msgid ""
"The walls here are weak enough for swords and spears to break down. It’ll be "
"slow going, but we’ll be able to dig our way through the cave-in. That must "
"be what Geldar meant."
msgstr "这里的岩壁已经够松了,剑和矛可以把它凿穿。进展会慢,但我们可以凿穿这片坍塌的岩层开路。格达尔指的应该就是这个。"

#. [message]: type=Dwarvish Miner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:343
msgid "Mining’s a lot easier when you’ve got the proper equipment, aye?"
msgstr "有了趁手的家伙,挖矿可就轻松多了,是吧?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:393
msgid ""
"Look out! The cavern beyond this wall is filled with water, and it’s "
"flooding into our caves!"
msgstr "小心!这堵墙另一侧的洞穴灌满了水,正在涌进我们的洞穴!"

#. [message]: speaker=Angarthing
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:448
msgid "<i>(cough)</i> Who’s there?"
msgstr "<i>（咳）</i>谁在那里？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:452
msgid ""
"I am Prince Konrad of Wesnoth, and a friend of Knalga. I’ve come to rescue "
"you!"
msgstr "我是韦诺特的康拉德王子,纳尔迦的朋友。我来救你们了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Angarthing
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:456
msgid ""
"Aye, that so? ...ye weren’t who I was expectin’. <i>(cough)</i> But I’m not "
"about to turn down help."
msgstr "哦,是吗……你不是我料想来的那个。<i>(咳嗽)</i>不过我可不会拒绝帮忙。"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:464
msgid "Yer alive! Quick, git ’im to th’ great hall."
msgstr "你还活着!快,把他抬到大厅里去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:471
msgid ""
"All this, Relgorn, for just a single dwarf? I understand the value of life, "
"but I was led to believe there was a whole posse trapped down here. What’s "
"the meaning of this?"
msgstr "瑞尔戈尔,这一切,就为了区区一个矮人?我明白生命的价值,但我此前一直以为,底下困着的是一整队人。这是怎么回事?"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:475
msgid ""
"Never ye mind, human. But you did right by us, so we’ll do right by you."
msgstr "别客气,人类。但你帮过我们,我们也当帮你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:479
msgid ""
"I know ye’ll be wantin’ all of our warrior types, but we dinnae have enough "
"o’ everyone to spare. But those we do have are tough, and well-practiced in "
"the art of battle."
msgstr "我知道你想要我们所有的兵种,但我们的每种兵种都不够多,实在拿不出多少。不过我们手上这些,个个皮糙肉厚,战阵经验十足。"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:481
msgid ""
"Choose two — Fighters, Guardsmen, Thunderers, or Ulfserkers — an’ we’ll send "
"ye’ enough Knalgans to make a difference in yer quest."
msgstr "任选两种——战士、卫兵、雷锤手或乌尔弗雷克——我们会派出足够多的纳尔迦战士,为你的征途助一臂之力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:494
msgid ""
"It shall be done, Konrad. May you someday reclaim your birthright — and us "
"ours."
msgstr "就这么办吧,康拉德。愿你有朝一日夺回你的王位——也愿我们夺回属于我们的一切。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:509
msgid "Choose Dwarvish Fighters and Guardsmen"
msgstr "选择矮人战士和矮人卫兵"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:510
#| msgid "You may now recruit the legendary dwarvish guardsmen!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Fighters and Guardsmen!"
msgstr "您现在可以征募传奇般的矮人卫兵了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:515
msgid "Choose Dwarvish Fighters and Thunderers"
msgstr "选择矮人战士和矮人雷锤手"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:516
#| msgid "You can now recruit fearsome Gryphon Riders!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Fighters and Thunderers!"
msgstr "您现在可以征募令人闻风丧胆的狮鹫骑士了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:521
msgid "Choose Dwarvish Fighters and Ulfserkers"
msgstr "选择矮人战士和乌尔弗雷克"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:522
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Fighters and Ulfserkers!"
msgstr "康拉德现在可以招募矮人战士和乌尔弗雷克了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:527
msgid "Choose Dwarvish Guardsmen and Thunderers"
msgstr "选择矮人卫兵和矮人雷锤手"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:528
#| msgid "You can now recruit fearsome Gryphon Riders!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Guardsmen and Thunderers!"
msgstr "您现在可以征募令人闻风丧胆的狮鹫骑士了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:533
msgid "Choose Dwarvish Guardsmen and Ulfserkers"
msgstr "选择矮人卫兵和乌尔弗雷克"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:534
#| msgid "You can now recruit fearsome Gryphon Riders!"
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Guardsmen and Ulfserkers!"
msgstr "您现在可以征募令人闻风丧胆的狮鹫骑士了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:539
msgid "Choose Dwarvish Thunderers and Ulfserkers"
msgstr "选择矮人雷锤手和乌尔弗雷克"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:540
msgid "Konrad can now recruit Dwarvish Thunderers and Ulfserkers!"
msgstr "康拉德现在可以招募矮人雷锤手和乌尔弗雷克了!"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:545
msgid "Ask for more"
msgstr "再要一些"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:552
msgid ""
"Once I defeat Asheviere and reclaim my throne, I would be more than happy to "
"send aid to Knalga. I understand you have little to give, but right now it "
"is in both of our best interests to work together!"
msgstr "等我击败艾什薇尔、夺回王位,我会非常乐意向纳尔迦提供援助。我理解你们能提供的有限,但眼下合作对双方都是最有利的事!"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:556
msgid ""
"Aye, an’ I thought I’d live out a peaceful life in th’ west halls, but here "
"we both are. We can’t spare any more, Konrad, not even for a prince."
msgstr "是啊,我还以为能安安稳稳地在西大厅过一辈子,可咱俩都落到这步田地了。我们实在腾不出人手了,康拉德,就算你是王子也不行。"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:562
msgid "Refuse payment"
msgstr "拒绝酬谢"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:566
msgid ""
"Friend dwarf, you need all the fighters you can get. What right do I have to "
"demand bread from a starving man? Keep your warriors for Knalga, and may "
"Knalga one day prosper again."
msgstr "矮人朋友,你需要所有能找到的战士。我有什么权利要求一个饥饿的人拿出面包?把你们的战士留给纳尔迦吧,愿纳尔迦有朝一日重焕繁荣。"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:570
msgid ""
"You’re a good lad, Konrad. Thank ye, an’ I’m sorry we were so suspicious "
"when ye first showed up."
msgstr "你是个不错的年轻人,康拉德。谢谢你,也很抱歉你刚来时我们对你的戒备。"

#. [message]: speaker=Relgorn
#. this is a hint to the player that there's a special event if they also complete "Lost General" and entirely wipe out the orcs in "Dwarven Doors"
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:575
msgid ""
"Whether you get yer throne back or not, you’ll always be welcome in Knalga — "
"what remains o’ it, at least. Between the trolls in the west an’ the orcs in "
"the Doors we’re just spread too thin. Mebbe if those were gone..."
msgstr "不管你能不能夺回王位,纳尔迦永远欢迎你——至少是它还剩下的部分。西边是巨魔,矮人之门又是兽人,我们实在被分散得太薄了。要是能把他们赶跑就好了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:603
msgid ""
"We must hurry. We promised Relgorn we would rescue his lost kin, but every "
"hour we wait is an hour in which some misfortune may befall them."
msgstr "我们得加快速度。我们答应过瑞尔戈尔去救他失散的族人,但我们每多等一小时,就多一小时他们可能遭遇不幸。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/29_Digging_for_Dwarves.cfg:610
msgid ""
"We have taken so long to search for the missing dwarves! Even should we "
"eventually find them, we will surely find only their corpses..."
msgstr "寻找失踪的矮人竟然花了这么长时间!就算我们最终找到他们,恐怕也只能找到他们的尸体……"

#. [side]: type=Fire Ant Queen, id=ant_leader
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:62
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:92
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:77
msgid "Monsters"
msgstr "怪兽"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:259
#| msgid ""
#| "The last dwarvish settlement far behind them, the party descended into "
#| "the deepest parts of the hewn caverns. Except for disturbances caused by "
#| "the occasional goblin, the air in the lower passages was still and "
#| "tomblike."
msgid ""
"The last dwarvish ruin far behind them, the party descended into the deepest "
"parts of the hewn caverns. Except for disturbances caused by the occasional "
"rodent, the air in the lower passages was still and tomblike."
msgstr ""
"一行人已然把最后的矮人定居点远远地甩在背后，下到了这些粗凿洞穴的最深处。除了"
"偶尔有地精骚扰之外，坑道中十分寂静，如同坟墓一般。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:265
#| msgid ""
#| "Stepping through a low corridor, Konrad and Delfador emerged from the "
#| "maze-like catacombs into icy blackness. Darkness seemed to crush them. "
#| "Lights flickered and went out. Even the staff of the elder mage struggled "
#| "to produce enough light to see by."
msgid ""
"Stepping through a low corridor, Konrad and Delfador emerged from the maze-"
"like catacombs into icy blackness. Darkness seemed to crush them. Lights "
"flickered and went out. Even the staff of the elder mage struggled to "
"produce enough light to see by."
msgstr ""
"科纳德和德法多穿越低廊，从迷宫一样的地下墓穴中来到一处冰冷漆黑之地。黑暗向他"
"们袭来，光亮只是闪烁了一下，便再无踪迹。甚至连老法师的魔杖都要花很大力气才能"
"产生出一点光来照路。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:271
#| msgid ""
#| "A cavernous void stretched out ahead, across which no ceiling or walls "
#| "were visible. Wind howled and whipped over narrow ledges bridging the "
#| "depths, almost as if animated by powerful nearby magic... and newly "
#| "awoken evil."
msgid ""
"A cavernous void stretched out ahead, across which no ceiling or walls were "
"visible. Wind howled and whipped over narrow ledges bridging the depths, "
"almost as if animated by powerful nearby magic... and approaching evil."
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的空穴在面前延展开来，里面看不到任何的天花板或者墙壁。风旋转着迅速穿"
"过连接着洞穴深处的平台，几乎就像是被附近强大的魔法所操控着……或者说，被刚苏醒"
"的邪恶造物所操控着。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:295
msgid ""
"We’ve been traveling for days upon days. Surely the Sceptre is getting close!"
msgstr "我们已经走了好些天了。权杖应该快到了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:299
#| msgid ""
#| "The Sceptre... the earth... the molten lava... the fire... the air around "
#| "us... everything. It calls out to the heir — I can barely hold it back in "
#| "my mind. It was forged here, not far north of where we now stand. The "
#| "sheer power of it!"
msgid ""
"Yes, I feel it is near here. It calls out to be freed... it is near; very "
"near! The Sceptre was forged here, not far where we now stand. The sheer "
"power of it!"
msgstr ""
"这权杖……这土地……这熔岩……这烈焰……这四周的气息……所有这一切。圣火权杖正在呼唤着"
"王座的继承人——我几乎不能将这种感觉压在心底了。它是在这里铸造的，就在我们北边"
"不远的地方。那绝对的力量！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:302
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:303
msgid ""
"It is the fault of my people — Landar’s rebels — that the Sceptre was lost. "
"It is only fair that I help get it back. Which way should we go, Delfador?"
msgstr "权杖之所以会失落,是我们族人的错——兰达尔的叛军。我帮你们把它找回来,是理所当然的。我们该往哪个方向走,德法多?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:304
msgid ""
"Growin’ up they used to tell me fairytales about the Sceptre... Never "
"thought I might actually be seein’ it in person. Which way do we go, "
"Delfador?"
msgstr "小时候,人们总给我讲关于权杖的童话……我从没想过有一天真能亲眼见到它。我们往哪个方向走,德法多?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:305
msgid ""
"Yea, the hallowed fire shall bring Light to the places of darkness! So "
"proclaim the texts, and so shall it be. Whither shall we go to find the "
"Sceptre, scholar?"
msgstr "是的,神圣之火必将把光明带到黑暗之地!经文如此宣告,它便会如此应验。我们去哪里寻找权杖,学究?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:306
msgid ""
"’twere my people who made it fer ye humans, and ’twere my people who lost "
"it, long ago. Now ’tis only right that I help ye get it back. Where be the "
"Sceptre, scholar?"
msgstr "权杖是我们的族人替你们人类打造的,很久以前也是我们的族人弄丢了它。现在我帮你们把它找回来,天经地义。学究,权杖在哪里?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:307
msgid ""
"I’ve read so much about the lost Sceptre of Fire! I never though I would, "
"well, actually help <i>find</i> it. Where do we go, Delfador?"
msgstr "我读过太多关于失落火焰权杖的记载!我从没想过自己真会,呃,实际参与<i>寻找</i>它。我们去哪里,德法多?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:308
msgid ""
"At long last, Garard’s edict will be fulfilled. You shall seize the Sceptre, "
"Konrad, and right the many wrongs of Asheviere. Whither shall we go, "
"Delfador?"
msgstr "终于,伽拉德的遗命即将实现。康拉德,你将夺得权杖,纠正艾什薇尔犯下的种种错误。我们去哪里,德法多?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:309
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:310
msgid ""
"I feel the power! It’s overwhelming! I never— well, Delfador, thank you for "
"trusting me to be here with you. Where shall we start the search?"
msgstr "我感受到那股力量了!太惊人了!我从没——好吧,德法多,谢谢你信任我,让我与你同处此地。我们从哪里开始寻找?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:311
msgid ""
"Dis cave good place for troll, but no good place for softskins. Better find "
"your scep-tar an’ get back to sun-lit places. Which way should we start?"
msgstr "这个山洞对巨魔来说是块宝地,但对你们软皮子来说可不是好地方。赶紧找到你们的权杖,回阳光照得到的地方去吧。我们从哪个方向开始?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:312
msgid "Very well — then where? How do we find it?"
msgstr "很好——那么,它在哪里?我们怎么找?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:316
msgid ""
"North and east. More than that, I cannot tell. Whatever beasts, monsters, "
"and other denizens of the dark lurk ahead, I know that we shall prevail."
msgstr "北方和东方。再具体,我也说不清。前方无论潜伏着什么样的野兽、怪物,抑或其他黑暗的居民,我都相信我们终将获胜。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:324
msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgstr "击败敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. this is deliberately vague, and foreshadows Li'sar's appearance in part two of this scenario
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:329
msgid "Then, fight to claim the Sceptre"
msgstr "那么,为了夺取权杖而战"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:339
msgid ""
"The longer you take to defeat the enemy leader, the more time your other "
"enemies will have to accrue gold."
msgstr "你击败敌方领袖所用的时间越长,其他敌人积累金币的时间就越充裕。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:351
msgid ""
"Delfador, you’ve told me the importance of the Sceptre of Fire. And I "
"believe you! A powerful magical artifact, and the fabled symbol of the kings "
"of Wesnoth. With the Sceptre in my hand even Asheviere would struggle to "
"deny my claim to the throne."
msgstr "德法多,你告诉过我火焰权杖的重要性。我相信你!一件强大的魔法神器,韦诺特诸王传说中的象征。只要权杖在我手中,就连艾什薇尔也难以否认我对王位的继承权。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:355
msgid ""
"Yet it pains me to know that while we delve deep under these mountains, "
"countless people back home are suffering. Elves, men, dwarves; people we’ve "
"missed out helping because we had to come here instead. I hope it’ll be "
"worth it in the end."
msgstr "但想到当我们深入地底之时,家乡的无数人正在受苦,我心里很不是滋味。精灵、人类、矮人——都是因为我们来到这里,才没能去帮助的人。我希望这一切最终是值得的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:366
msgid ""
"Delfador... other than the prophecy about the Sceptre, you haven’t been "
"keeping any other secrets from me “for my own good”, have you?"
msgstr "德法多……除了关于权杖的预言,你没有为了“对我好”而对我隐瞒别的什么吧?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:370
msgid ""
"One. But I ask you to restrain your curiosity, for I hope it will never have "
"to come to light. Here and now, we must focus on finding the Sceptre if you "
"are ever to become king."
msgstr "有一件。但我请你压抑住你的好奇心,因为我希望它永远不会曝光。此时此刻,如果你想成为国王,我们必须集中力量寻找权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:407
msgid ""
"What a strange rock formation. Could this be the resting place of the "
"Sceptre?"
msgstr "多么奇特的岩石构造。这里会是权杖的安息之所吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:411
msgid ""
"There is some power about it, to be sure. But we must clear out the leader "
"of the local fauna before we can investigate further."
msgstr "这里确实有些力量。但我们必须先赶尽此地野兽的首领,才能进一步调查。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:426
msgid ""
"We’ve been wandering for so long, and we still haven’t cleared our way to "
"the Sceptre."
msgstr "我们已经到处转了这么久,却还没能打通前往权杖的道路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:430
msgid ""
"Even if it really is somewhere here, I fear it is beyond our power to "
"obtain..."
msgstr "就算它真的就在附近,恐怕也不是我们能力所及……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:454
msgid ""
"That wasn’t so bad! The vermin are defeated, and the way is clear to explore "
"further."
msgstr "还算顺利!那些杂碎已被歼灭,前方的道路畅通,可以继续深入探索。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:458
msgid ""
"I sense great power emanating from the chasm nearby. Everyone, gather round."
msgstr "我感受到附近深谷中散发出的强大力量。大家,靠拢过来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:560
msgid "55 gold"
msgstr "55 金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:560
msgid ""
"Li’sar’s soldiers have stockpiled some gold here! We’ll put it to better use."
msgstr "莉莎的士兵在这里囤积了一些金子!我们要把它用在更有价值的地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:599
#| msgid ""
#| "Across the chasm, the air almost crackled with magical energy. It also "
#| "became steadily warmer. The floor was smooth and glassy in places, and a "
#| "faint glow provided a small reprieve from the thick blackness. Volcanic "
#| "fumes drifted up from cracks in the floor."
msgid ""
"Near the chasm, the air almost crackled with magical energy. It also became "
"steadily warmer. The floor was smooth and glassy in places, and a faint glow "
"provided a small reprieve from the thick blackness. Volcanic fumes drifted "
"up from cracks in the floor."
msgstr ""
"整个洞穴中的空气都几乎要被魔法能量挤裂了，给人带来一丝暖意。有的地面如同玉石"
"一样光滑，散发着点点光芒，仿佛能够缓解这厚重的黑暗。地下的火山烟灰从地面裂缝"
"处喷薄而出。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:603
#| msgid ""
#| "Distant rumbles and earthquakes made it difficult to keep steady footing. "
#| "The very earth had come alive, heaving, struggling to be relieved of its "
#| "centuries-old burden..."
msgid ""
"Distant rumbles and earthquakes made it difficult to keep steady footing. "
"The very earth had come alive, heaving, struggling to be relieved of its "
"centuries-old burden..."
msgstr ""
"远方大地轰隆隆地震颤着，令众人几乎难以站稳。脚下的土地活了，不断地起伏着、挣"
"扎着，想要抛却身上这背负了数百年的重担……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:616
#| msgid ""
#| "The Sceptre... the earth... the molten lava... the fire... the air around "
#| "us... everything. It calls out to the heir — I can barely hold it back in "
#| "my mind. It was forged here, not far north of where we now stand. The "
#| "sheer power of it!"
msgid ""
"We are here. The Sceptre... the earth... the fire... the air around us... "
"everything! It calls out to be freed — I can barely hold it back in my mind."
msgstr ""
"这权杖……这土地……这熔岩……这烈焰……这四周的气息……所有这一切。圣火权杖正在呼唤着"
"王座的继承人——我几乎不能将这种感觉压在心底了。它是在这里铸造的，就在我们北边"
"不远的地方。那绝对的力量！"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:619
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:620
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:621
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:622
msgid ""
"I sense it too... there is a strangeness in the air. A fire in the soul of "
"this place. But where? The cave is empty!"
msgstr "我也有所感应……空气中有种异样的气息。这片土地的灵魂深处燃烧着火焰。但它在哪儿?这洞穴是空的!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:623
msgid ""
"Aye, tha’s nice... except there’s nothin’ here, ye cloud-headed flapdragon! "
"It’s an empty cave!"
msgstr "是啊,挺好……只是这里什么都没有,你这脑子进浆的蝙蝠飞龙!这是个空山洞!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:624
msgid ""
"But where is it, o’ great Delfador? The cave here is empty. Do we stand in "
"the wrong place?"
msgstr "但它究竟在哪里,伟大的德法多?这里的洞穴是空的。难道我们站错了地方?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:625
msgid ""
"Err... is this one o’ those confusing wizard things? Where’s the Sceptre? "
"Th’ cave looks pretty empty to me."
msgstr "呃……这是不是那些让人头晕的法师把戏?权杖在哪儿?我觉得这洞穴挺空的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:626
msgid ""
"Yea, truly there is a strangeness in the air here... not of the Light, but "
"of something else entirely. But where is the source? The cave stands empty."
msgstr "嗯,这里的空气中确实透着古怪……不是光明的气息,而是全然不同的某种东西。但源头在哪儿?洞穴空荡荡的。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:627
msgid ""
"Err... it— it does? I don’t see anything... Oh! Is this a metaphor? The real "
"treasure is the friends we made along the way?"
msgstr "呃……它——它真的会挖出宝物吗?我啥也看不见……噢!这是比喻吗?真正的宝物,是我们一路结交的朋友?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:628
msgid ""
"Dey say trolls are slow, but even Dosh can see dere’s nothing here. Flat and "
"empty. Nothing for us to take, is dere?"
msgstr "大家都说巨魔磨蹭,可就连道什也看得出来,这里啥也没有。光秃秃,空荡荡。没什么能让我们拿的,是不是?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:629
msgid "But where is it? I don’t see a thing!"
msgstr "但它在哪里?我什么都看不见!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:633
msgid ""
"On the contrary! My research leads me to believe that we stand in the center "
"of a dormant volcano, which erupted centuries ago and buried the Sceptre in "
"rock. It is indeed here, under the cave floor."
msgstr "恰恰相反!我的研究让我相信,我们正站在一座休眠火山的中部,它几百年前爆发过,把权杖埋进了岩石里。它确实就在这里,在洞顶之下。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:659
msgid "It shall take time, but my magic can dig the Sceptre out."
msgstr "这需要些时间,但我的魔法可以把权杖掘出来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:695
msgid ""
"A sound like that can mean only one thing: Konrad and his handler have "
"reached the Sceptre of Fire."
msgstr "那样的声音只可能意味着一件事:康拉德和他背后的人,已经到达了火之权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:699
msgid ""
"Princess Li’sar! Villain! Asheviere’s greed must extend far if she would "
"risk her last child this far from Wesnoth, deep under the northern mountains."
msgstr "莉莎公主!你这个恶人!艾什薇尔的贪婪一定深不可测,才会不惜把她的最后一个孩子,从韦诺特如此遥远地押到北方群山深处。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:721
msgid ""
"Loyalists, this is it. Within these caves lurks my usurping cousin; the "
"false prince; the puppet of Delfador."
msgstr "忠臣们,就是现在。在这些洞穴里,潜伏着我的篡位堂弟;那个伪王子;德法多的傀儡。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:741
#| msgid "Escape down the road to Elensefar"
msgid "your comrades dead at Elensefar"
msgstr "沿着通往埃仁撒伐的道路奔逃"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:742
msgid "Elensefar ruled by thieves"
msgstr "艾尔森法尔被窃贼把持"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:743
msgid "supplies pillaged at Fort Tahn"
msgstr "塔恩要塞的物资被劫掠一空"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:744
msgid "convoys aflame outside Dan’Tonk"
msgstr "丹·冬克外的运输车队陷入火海"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:745
msgid "zombified townsfolk at the peninsula"
msgstr "半岛上的居民变成了僵尸"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:746
#| msgid "The Dwarven Doors"
msgid "dead slaves at the Dwarven Doors"
msgstr "矮人之门"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:747
msgid "libraries aflame at Alduin"
msgstr "阿尔德温的图书馆烈焰熊熊"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:748
#| msgid "Blackwater Port"
msgid "rebels at Blackwater Port"
msgstr "黑水港"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:749
#| msgid "The Bay of Pearls"
msgid "riots at the Bay of Pearls"
msgstr "珍珠湾"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:750
msgid "undead amok in the hills"
msgstr "山丘上死者横行"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:751
msgid "elvish criminals escaping into the south"
msgstr "精灵罪犯逃往南方"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:752
msgid "trouble with the orcs at Glamdrol"
msgstr "格朗德罗的兽人骚乱"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:753
msgid "corpses clogging up the Ford"
msgstr "尸体堆满了渡口"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:754
#| msgid "That is the fabled Gryphon Mountain."
msgid "blood-stained slopes on Gryphon Mountain"
msgstr "这就是传说中的“狮鹫山”。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:756
msgid ": $lisar_speech."
msgstr ": $lisar_speech。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:757
msgid ""
". You have heard the lies he tells, misleading those who would otherwise "
"oppose him"
msgstr "。你听到了他编造的谎言,那些话正误导着本应反对他的人"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#. several of the strings above are joined to create $lisar_speech.
#. For example, this message might read something like "in his wake: dead slaves at the Dwarven Doors, zombified townsfolk at the peninsula... Today, we put a stop to it."
#. If translating a dynamic string like this is difficult or impossible in your language, you can replace $lisar_speech with ". You have heard the lies he tells, misleading those who would otherwise oppose him."
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:764
msgid ""
"You know the blood and chaos that follow in his wake$lisar_speech|... Today, "
"we put a stop to it. Is everyone in position?"
msgstr "你知道他走过的地方,留下的是鲜血与混乱$lisar_speech|……今天,我们到此为止。大家都就位了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:784
msgid "Northern company ready and reporting, ma’am."
msgstr "北翼部队已就位并报告了情况,大人。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:788
msgid "Yrridyn"
msgstr "伊瑞迪恩"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:800
msgid ""
"We’ve burned the trolls out of the eastern tunnels. Our way forward is clear."
msgstr "我们把巨魔赶出了东边的隧道。前进的道路已经畅通。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:804
msgid "Arynnoc"
msgstr "阿瑞诺克"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:805
msgid "Gwytharyn"
msgstr "格瓦哈利恩"

#. [message]: speaker=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:817
msgid ""
"My bowmen and I are ready and waiting at the far passage. They won’t get "
"through us, Your Highness."
msgstr "我和我的弓手已在远端的通道里就位,恭候大驾。他们是过不了我们这关的,殿下。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:825
msgid ""
"Good. And Mirya — scout around for any other exits we’ve missed. We must not "
"allow Konrad to escape with the Sceptre of Fire."
msgstr "很好。还有,米娅——四处搜索一下,看看有没有我们遗漏的出口。绝不能让康拉德带着火之权杖逃掉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:861
msgid ""
"Li’sar expects us to try to escape? No, I will not yield so easily. Hold "
"strong, friends. We must guard Delfador while he unearths the Sceptre, or "
"perhaps even attack and defeat Li’sar herself!"
msgstr "莉莎料定我们会试图逃跑?不,我才不会这么轻易屈服。挺住,朋友们。德法多掘出权杖期间,我们必须守卫他,或者干脆发起进攻,击败莉莎本人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:865
msgid ""
"The Sceptre is valuable, but your life is even more so, Konrad. If our "
"forces are not yet strong enough to confront the army of Wesnoth, do not be "
"afraid to swallow your pride and flee. I feel fresh air coming from the "
"north."
msgstr "权杖固然珍贵,但你的生命更珍贵,康拉德。若我们的兵力尚不足以迎战韦诺特的大军,别不好意思放下身段逃跑。我感觉到北边有新鲜空气飘来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:869
msgid "Of course, fleeing would surely mean leaving the Sceptre behind..."
msgstr "当然了,逃跑无疑意味着把权杖留下……"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:877
msgid "Cowardly Victory:"
msgstr "怯懦的胜利:"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:878
#| msgid "Move Konrad to the north side of the river"
msgid "Move Konrad to any edge of the map"
msgstr "移动科纳德至河北面"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:882
msgid "Normal Victory:"
msgstr "正常胜利:"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:883
#| msgid "The Sceptre of Fire"
msgid "(gain the Sceptre of Fire)"
msgstr "圣火权杖"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:883
msgid "Protect Delfador until he unearths the sceptre"
msgstr "保护德法多,直到他掘出权杖"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:888
msgid "Heroic Victory:"
msgstr "英雄胜利:"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:889
msgid "(gain the Sceptre of Fire, and special armor for Konrad)"
msgstr "(获得火之权杖,以及康拉德的专属盔甲)"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:913
msgid ""
"You know I am here to claim the Sceptre as my birthright, Li’sar. Is your "
"hatred so great that you would rather chase after us than even <b><i>try</"
"i></b> to save Wesnoth from the ruin it has fallen to at the hands of your "
"mother?"
msgstr "你知道我来此,是为我与生俱来的继承权,莉莎。你的仇恨竟如此之深,宁愿追着我们,也不肯<b><i>尝试</i></b>拯救韦诺特,不让它继续在你的母亲手中走向毁灭吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:918
msgid ""
"I <i>am</i> trying to save it — from you. Do you have any idea how much "
"chaos you and your little gang of ruffians have caused?"
msgstr "我<i>正在</i>拯救它——把你除掉。你知道你和你那群粗人小团伙制造了多少混乱吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:922
msgid ""
"Asheviere took control of Wesnoth with violence, and violence has filled "
"every part of her reign. All she knows is blood! And all she cares about is "
"power."
msgstr "艾什薇尔靠暴力夺取了韦诺特的控制权,而暴力也填满了她的整个统治。她所知道的只有鲜血!她在乎的只有权力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:926
msgid ""
"You really are just a child. Maybe the Aethenwood runs on friendship and "
"flowers, but here in the real world sometimes people get hurt. And yes, "
"sometimes that means unsavory decisions, like the kind the queen has to make "
"every day."
msgstr "你真的只是个孩子。也许艾瑟森林靠友谊和鲜花运转,但在这真实的世界里,人们有时会受伤。是的,有时这就意味着不光彩的决定——就像女王每天不得不做的那样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:930
msgid ""
"Perhaps you truly think you’re acting for the best. But know this: with me "
"today stand free peoples from all corners of Wesnoth, united as one against "
"the tyranny of Asheviere. Whether we defeat you now or never, Wesnoth will "
"never stop fighting for what is right!"
msgstr "也许你真的以为自己在做最好的选择。但请听好:今天站在我身边的,是来自韦诺特四面八方、追求自由的子民,我们团结一心,对抗艾什薇尔的暴政。无论我们此刻是否击败你,韦诺特都不会停止为正义而战!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:935
msgid ""
"... not bad, as hero speeches go. We’ll see how the palace dungeons change "
"your tune."
msgstr "……作为英雄演讲,还不赖。我们倒要看看,宫殿地牢怎么改变你的腔调。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:953
msgid ""
"I am making progress, Konrad! We are perhaps half of the way to the Sceptre."
msgstr "我已经有了进展,康拉德!我们大概挖到权杖所在的一半路了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:960
msgid "Almost done, Konrad. We shall soon hold the Sceptre in our hands!"
msgstr "快挖出来了,康拉德。用不了多久,权杖就将握在我们手中!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:967
msgid ""
"I see red and gold poking though the earth! We shall have the Sceptre in but "
"another moment!"
msgstr "我看到红光与金光从地底透出来了!再过片刻,权杖就要到手了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:979
msgid "Argh! He’s more powerful than we thought. I have to get away!"
msgstr "啊!他比我们想的更强。我必须赶紧逃!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:989
msgid "Decades of study and practice, only to die in a cave..."
msgstr "几十年的研习与修行,却要死在一个洞穴里……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader7b
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1005
msgid "Ack! I’m sorry, Your Highness, I couldn’t stop them..."
msgstr "嗬!对不起殿下,我没拦住他们……"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1024
msgid "For the Aethenwood! For Wesnoth! For all the world!"
msgstr "为了艾瑟森林!为了韦诺特!为了整个世界!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1026
msgid "The wrath of the elves falls upon you, girl!"
msgstr "精灵的怒火已降临在你头上,姑娘!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1027
msgid "Your mother has much to answer for. We shall start with you."
msgstr "你的母亲有太多的罪要偿。先从你开始。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1028
msgid ""
"Ah’ll teach you and yer men to cage me up, ye obscene trunk of tallow-keech!"
msgstr "我要让你和你的手下尝尝把我关起来的滋味,你这堆恶臭的烂油蜡!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1029
msgid ""
"The blood of traitors runs in your veins, girl. In Garard’s name, I strike "
"you down!"
msgstr "你的血管里流淌着叛徒的血,姑娘。以伽拉德之名,我要将你斩杀!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1030
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1031
#| msgid "The Isle of Alduin"
msgid "Behold the flames of Alduin!"
msgstr "奥渡因岛"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1032
msgid "By the Light we were made! Lo, and by the Light shall you be un-made!"
msgstr "凭造就我们的光明之名!看哪,凭光明之名,我将将你粉碎!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1033
msgid "This is for Baldras!"
msgstr "这一击,是为了巴德拉斯!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1034
msgid "Sorry about this, but it has to be done!"
msgstr "对不起了,但这是非做不可的!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1035
msgid "You done made wrong enemy, softskin!"
msgstr "你惹错敌人了,软皮子!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1124
msgid ""
"I have found an exit from the cavern! Quick, everyone, follow me and we may "
"yet evade Li’sar within the twisting tunnels!"
msgstr "我找到洞窟的出口了!快,所有人跟紧我,也许我们还能在蜿蜒的地道中甩开莉莎!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1150
msgid ""
"Did you hear that? An earthquake! What sorcery of yours is this, Delfador? "
"Are you collapsing this whole cavern?"
msgstr "你听到了吗?地震!这是什么咒法,德法多?你要把整个洞窟都塌了不成?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1155
msgid ""
"I am not the cause of these tremors — what does that fool mage of yours "
"think she is doing? The volcano is awakening! Is she trying to kill us and "
"you both!?"
msgstr "这些震动不是我引起的——你们那个蠢法师在想干什么?火山苏醒了!她难道想把我们和你一起杀了吗!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1159
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1232
msgid ""
"Sorry, Your Highness, queen’s orders. Better that nobody leaves than Konrad "
"does."
msgstr "对不起了,殿下,这是女王的命令。谁都不让离开,总好过让康拉德离开。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1163
msgid ""
"What?! Mirya, there’s no need for this! They’ve left without the Sceptre, "
"and it is a long way to the surface. We’ll have plenty of time to chase them "
"down!"
msgstr "什么?!米尔娅,没必要这么做!他们没有拿到权杖就走了,离地面还很远。我们会有大把时间追上去!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1171
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1244
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1356
msgid ""
"We are all in terrible danger! Konrad, stay close. You and I must flee with "
"great haste — my spells shall speed our steps!"
msgstr "我们都处在极度的危险中!康拉德,靠近我。我们必须拼命逃亡——我的魔法会让我们的脚步更快!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1197
msgid ""
"It is here! We have found it! The Sceptre of Fire; the Ruby of the Wesfolk; "
"the staff of kings. Konrad, you must come at once!"
msgstr "它在这里!我们找到了!火焰权杖;韦诺特人的红宝石;王者之杖。康拉德,你必须马上过来!"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1202
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1299
#| msgid ""
#| "The Sceptre, initially dulled from decades of dust and debris, began to "
#| "glow from the ruby’s inner fire. Dwarvish runes on the golden handle lit "
#| "up in pulsating blue. The heat and light were comforting in the pitch-"
#| "black."
msgid ""
"The Sceptre, initially dulled from centuries of dust and debris, began to "
"glow from its ruby’s inner fire. Dwarvish runes on the golden handle lit up "
"in pulsating blue as Konrad’s fingers wrapped around the staff."
msgstr ""
"由于数十年的积尘与碎石，圣火权杖最初显得有些暗淡，而现在却因红宝石中的圣火而"
"开始发散出光芒。黄金杖柄上的矮人符文显现出脉动的蓝色。这热度与光亮在这漆黑一"
"片的世界里很是鼓舞人心。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1209
msgid ""
"The Sceptre is ours! It is not just a great weapon, but also a symbol; a way "
"to convince the people that I would truly belong as king. Now we finally "
"have the upper hand against Asheviere."
msgstr "权杖是我们的了!它不仅是一件强大的武器,更是一个象征;能让人们相信,我才是真正名正言顺的国王。如今,我们终于在艾什薇尔面前占了上风。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1219
msgid ""
"An earthquake!? Delfador, is this your doing? Has removing the Sceptre "
"somehow damaged the cavern?"
msgstr "地震!德法多,这是你搞的鬼?取下权杖难道把洞窟损坏了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1224
msgid ""
"I am not the cause of these tremors — what does that fool mage of Li’sar’s "
"think she is doing? The volcano is awakening! Is she trying to kill us and "
"the princess both!?"
msgstr "这些震动不是我引起的——莉莎那个蠢法师在想干什么?火山苏醒了!她难道想把我们和公主一起杀了吗!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1228
msgid ""
"What?! Mirya, you’re supposed to be scouting the tunnels, not destroying "
"them."
msgstr "什么?!米尔娅,你本该去侦察地道的,不是去把它们炸塌。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1236
msgid ""
"What?! Mirya, there’s no need for this! Konrad may have the Sceptre, but we "
"have them surrounded. Even if they escape to the surface we’ll have plenty "
"of time to chase them down!"
msgstr "什么?!米尔娅,没必要这么做!康拉德虽然拿到了权杖,但我们已经把你们团团围住了。就算你们逃到地面,我们也会有大把时间追上去!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1248
msgid "But we have only just taken hold of the Sceptre! What about—"
msgstr "但我们才刚刚拿到权杖!那——"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1252
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1364
msgid "There is no time! Run, Konrad, run!"
msgstr "没时间了!快跑,康拉德,快跑!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1272
msgid ""
"You are beaten, villain! With your defeat, we have severed the right hand of "
"Asheviere!"
msgstr "你被击败了,恶徒!随着你的倒下,我们斩断了艾什薇尔的右臂!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1276
msgid ""
"I can’t believe it. Bested so far from home, and during my own ambush. "
"Embarrassing... Make it quick, then."
msgstr "难以置信。在离家这么远的地方被打败,还正是在我亲自设下的伏击里。真是丢人……要杀就快点。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1281
msgid ""
"No. You are to be my prisoner, and we shall ransom you to your mother in "
"exchange for her abdication; a better and more merciful use of your head "
"than petty vengeance. Delfador, do you have the Sceptre yet?"
msgstr "不。你将成为我的人质,我们将拿你去和你的母亲交换她的退位;与其做小肚鸡肠的复仇,不如这样仁慈地“使用”你的脑袋。德法多,权杖拿到了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1292
msgid ""
"I do! It is here — the Sceptre of Fire; the Ruby of the Wesfolk; the staff "
"of kings. Konrad, I shall bring it to you at once."
msgstr "找到了!它在这里——火焰权杖;韦诺特人的红宝石;王者之杖。康拉德,我马上把它带到您面前。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1305
msgid ""
"The Sceptre is ours. It is not just a great weapon, Konrad, but also a "
"symbol; more proof of your kingship. And with Li’sar defeated, I wonder if "
"we might add yet another symbol to your claim..."
msgstr "权杖是我们的了。康拉德,它不仅是一件强大的武器,更是一个象征;是你王位的又一证明。而莉莎已经被击败,我想知道,我们是不是还能给你的王权再添一件信物……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1319
msgid ""
"What have you done, old man? You hold something that looks exactly like my "
"armor, finely crafted and inscribed with symbols of royalty, yet what I "
"still wear is intact. How is this possible?"
msgstr "你干了什么,老头?你手里拿着的东西看起来跟我的盔甲一模一样,工艺精湛,还刻着王室纹章,可我还穿着的这套却完好无损。这怎么可能?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1323
msgid ""
"A magical copy, with some improvements and details adjusted for Konrad! It "
"will exist only for a year and a day, but that will be more than enough time "
"to overthrow Asheviere."
msgstr "一份魔法复制品,附带一些改良,细节也已按康拉德的身材调整!它只能存在一年零一天,但要推翻艾什薇尔,这时间绰绰有余了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad # no variation, so we can see him with both the sceptre and the chainmail
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1329
msgid ""
"Thank you, Delfador. This is truly a great boon! Now, to bind our prisoner "
"and once more ascend to the surface."
msgstr "谢谢你,德法多。这真是天赐的良机!现在,把我们的阶下囚绑好,再次上升到地面。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1339
msgid ""
"An earthquake!? Delfador, is this also your doing? Has removing the Sceptre "
"somehow damaged the cavern?"
msgstr "地震!德法多,这也是你搞的鬼?取下权杖难道把洞窟损坏了吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1344
msgid ""
"I am not the cause of these tremors — what does that fool mage of Li’sar’s "
"think she is doing? The volcano is awakening! Is she trying to kill us and "
"her princess both!?"
msgstr "这些震动不是我引起的——莉莎那个蠢法师在想干什么?火山苏醒了!她难道想把我们和她的公主一起杀了吗!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1348
msgid ""
"Sorry, Li’sar, queen’s orders. You had your chance and you failed. Now it’s "
"time for the backup plan."
msgstr "对不起了,莉莎,这是女王的命令。你已经有机会了,而你失败了。现在该轮到备用方案了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/30_The_Sceptre_of_Fire.cfg:1360
msgid "I have the princess tied up! But what about—"
msgstr "公主我已经绑好了!但那——"

#. [time]: id=underground
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:17
msgid "Underground"
msgstr "地下"

#. [generator]: id=cavegen
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:97
#| msgid "Plunging into the Darkness"
msgid "Plunging Into Darkness Caves"
msgstr "突入黑暗"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:327
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward plunged "
"into the corrosive water with supernatural haste, resurfacing moments later "
"inside a larger chamber."
msgstr "法师的法杖上迸出蓝色火花,他与年轻的受监护人以超凡的速度冲入腐蚀性的水中,片刻之后在一间更大的洞室里浮出水面。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:329
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:339
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:359
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:369
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:379
msgid ""
"The sounds of rupturing earth behind rose to a crescendo, then faded into "
"the distance, as meanwhile an uncomfortable heat pressed close at their "
"backs."
msgstr "身后的崩裂声渐渐高涨,随后又消失在远方,与此同时,一股令人不适的灼热贴上了他们的后背。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:337
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The few veterans able to "
"follow dashed madly through the cave, then passed alongside Konrad into a "
"larger chamber."
msgstr "法师的法杖上迸出蓝色火花,他与年轻的受监护人以超凡的速度逃离上涨的熔岩。少数跟得上的老兵们像发疯一样穿过洞穴,随后与康拉德并肩进入一间更大的洞室。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:347
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste, leaving both their brave "
"volunteers and Li’sar’s distracted soldiers far behind as they passed into a "
"larger chamber."
msgstr "法师的法杖上迸出蓝色火花,他与年轻的受监护人以超凡的速度逃离上涨的熔岩,将勇敢的志愿者们和分心的莉莎的士兵远远甩在身后,随后进入一间更大的洞室。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:349
msgid ""
"The sounds of rupturing earth rose to a crescendo, then faded into the "
"distance, as meanwhile an uncomfortable heat pressed close at their backs."
msgstr "大地崩裂的声响渐渐高涨,随后又消失在远方,与此同时,一股令人不适的灼热贴上了他们的后背。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:357
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers plunged "
"deeper and deeper into the smothering darkness, further and further from the "
"light of the sun."
msgstr "法师的法杖上迸出蓝色火花,他与年轻的受监护人以超凡的速度逃离上涨的熔岩。惊慌的士兵们越陷越深,沉入令人窒息的黑暗,离阳光越来越远。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:367
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers held back "
"vomit as they beat a path through the horrifying squalor filling their "
"tunnel, then passed thankfully into a larger chamber."
msgstr "法师的法杖上迸出蓝色火花,他与年轻的受监护人以超凡的速度逃离上涨的熔岩。惊慌的士兵们强忍着恶心,在充满骇人污秽的地道中开路前行,随后如蒙大赦般进入一间更大的洞室。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:377
msgid ""
"Blue sparks leapt from the wizard’s staff as he and his young ward sped away "
"from the rising lava with supernatural haste. The harried soldiers rushed "
"thankfully through the miraculously opened passage."
msgstr "法师的法杖上迸出蓝色火花,他与年轻的受监护人以超凡的速度逃离上涨的熔岩。惊慌的士兵们感恩地冲过那奇迹般被打开的通道。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:460
msgid ""
"Faster, faster! My speeding spells begin to fade, but the fires continue to "
"rise! Hurry, Konrad; we must keep ahead of the lava until it recedes! Is Her "
"Highness secure?"
msgstr "快些,再快些!我的加速魔法正在消退,但火焰还在上涨!快点,康拉德;我们必须赶在熔岩退去之前一直跑在它前面!殿下她安全吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:464
msgid ""
"I have chained her wrist to mine, Delfador. But are our friends and allies "
"all with us? We can’t leave anyone behind!"
msgstr "德法多,我已经把她的腕和我铐在了一起。但我们的朋友和盟友都在吗?我们不能丢下任何人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:468
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:494
msgid ""
"Yes, they’re all still here. But everyone is running willy-nilly, and I "
"doubt we will find a keep in which to rally. If we do not hurry we shall "
"surely be caught by the lava, or else by some pursuing ally of Li’sar’s!"
msgstr "是的,他们全都在。但人人都慌不择路,我怀疑我们未必能找到一座可以集结的城楼。再不快些,我们要么被熔岩追上,要么被莉莎追来的盟友逮住!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:472
msgid ""
"No! Surely those we did not defeat have burned to death. This has been a "
"tight thing for us even with your magic to help!"
msgstr "不!我们没赶上的那些人,肯定都葬身火海了。就算有你的魔法相助,这一路也已经够惊险了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:476
msgid ""
"Perhaps so, perhaps not. In any case I cannot imagine our prisoner’s army "
"has fared well — and the same fate will meet us too if you do not <i><b>stop "
"talking and start running</b></i>!"
msgstr "也许吧,也许不是。无论如何,我想象不出我们那位阶下囚的军队能有什么好下场——如果你不<i><b>闭上嘴、撒开腿跑</b></i>,同样的命运也将降临到我们头上!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:486
msgid ""
"Faster, faster! My speeding spells begin to fade, but the fires continue to "
"rise! Hurry, Konrad; we must keep ahead of the lava until it recedes!"
msgstr "快些,再快些!我的加速魔法正在消退,但火焰还在上涨!快点,康拉德;我们必须赶在熔岩退去之前一直跑在它前面!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:490
msgid ""
"Are our friends and allies all with us, Delfador? We can’t leave anyone "
"behind!"
msgstr "德法多,我们的朋友和盟友都在吗?我们不能丢下任何人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:498
msgid ""
"No! Surely Li’sar and her loyalists have burned to death. This has been a "
"tight thing for us even with your magic to help!"
msgstr "不!莉莎和她的部下肯定都葬身火海了。就算有你的魔法相助,这一路也已经够惊险了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:502
msgid ""
"Perhaps so, perhaps not. In any case I cannot imagine her army has fared "
"well — and the same fate will meet us too if you do not <i><b>stop talking "
"and start running</b></i>!"
msgstr "也许吧,也许不是。不管怎样,我很难想象她的军队能落得什么好——而若你不<i><b>闭嘴快跑</b></i>,我们也会落得同样的下场!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:511
#| msgid "Move Konrad to the north side of the river"
msgid "Move Konrad or Delfador to the east edge of the map"
msgstr "移动科纳德至河北面"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:516
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:663
msgid "Death of Li’sar"
msgstr "莉莎死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:527
msgid ""
"Lava expands 1 hex in every direction each turn, and will kill Konrad if it "
"reaches him."
msgstr "熔岩每回合向各个方向扩展1格,一旦蔓延到康拉德,他会死亡。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:529
msgid ""
"Lava expands 2 hexes in every direction each turn, and will kill Konrad if "
"it reaches him."
msgstr "熔岩每回合向各个方向扩展2格,一旦蔓延到康拉德,他会死亡。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:533
msgid "Li’sar is chained to Konrad, and will follow one hex behind him."
msgstr "莉莎被锁链拴在康拉德身上,将紧跟在他身后一格处。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:586
msgid ""
"What are we doing? Li’sar is a prisoner of great value! I have no desire to "
"execute an unarmed woman, enemy though she may be."
msgstr "我们在干什么?莉莎是位价值连城的俘虏!我无意处决一个手无寸铁的女人,哪怕她是敌人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:629
msgid ""
"Undead! What are such things doing down here? They will surely try to stop "
"us — and with no regard for their own safety!"
msgstr "死者!它们到这儿来干什么?它们一定会试图阻挡我们——而且压根不顾自己的安危!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:633
msgid ""
"Then give me my sword and I will cut them down. Or are you too afraid to let "
"me out of these chains?"
msgstr "那就把我的剑给我,我来砍倒他们。还是说,你怕解开我身上的枷锁?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:637
msgid ""
"Hmph. We cannot afford to become bogged down fighting. At least one good "
"thing comes of all this flame: it is easy to summon fire elementals!"
msgstr "哼。我们负担不起被战斗缠住的代价。至少这么多火焰里还有点好事:召唤火元素生物太容易了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:658
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1425
#| msgid "I can’t believe it should end like this!"
msgid "Aaaaah! I can’t believe it should end like this..."
msgstr "我不相信居然会这样结束！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:664
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1431
msgid ""
"Our prisoner has perished! She was an enemy, but I cannot shake the feeling "
"that Her Highness yet had a role to play in all this..."
msgstr "我们的俘虏死了!她虽是敌人,但我始终有一种挥之不去的感觉——殿下在这整件事中,本该扮演更重要的角色……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:683
msgid ""
"The cave here slopes sharply upwards, and the lava behind is slowing! We’ve "
"done it, Delfador; we have escaped — and with Li’sar as our prisoner! The "
"gambit of that mage of Asheviere’s has failed."
msgstr "这里的洞穴急剧向上倾斜,身后的熔岩正在减速!我们做到了,德法多;我们逃出来了——而且莉莎还是我们的俘虏!艾什薇尔那个法师的算计,失败了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:688
msgid ""
"The cave here slopes sharply upwards, and the lava behind is slowing! We’ve "
"done it, Delfador; we have escaped! The gambit of that mage of Asheviere’s "
"has failed."
msgstr "这里的洞穴急剧向上倾斜,身后的熔岩正在减速!我们做到了,德法多;我们逃出来了!艾什薇尔那个法师的算计,失败了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:699
msgid ""
"Failed in part, but not in whole. While we gathered many low-quality weapons "
"during our escape, much of our veterans’ equipment suffered serious damage. "
"Repairing them may prove costly."
msgstr "一部分失败了,但并非全部失败。虽然我们在逃生途中拾得了许多低劣的武器,但老兵们的许多装备已严重受损。修复它们恐怕代价不菲。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:706
msgid ""
"Failed in part, but not in whole. My mind feels oddly sharp, but what of our "
"trainees? I sense some magical malady upon them, sapping their intellect. "
"Training more veterans may prove difficult."
msgstr "一部分失败了,但并非全部失败。我的头脑出奇地清明,可我们的新兵们呢?我察觉他们身上染了某种魔法的怪病,正在侵蚀他们的智力。再训练出更多老兵,恐怕不容易。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:714
msgid ""
"Failed in part, but not in whole. While thus far we have been fortunate "
"enough to evade the lava, we are still lost deep underground, with the bulk "
"of our stores and rations lost to flame."
msgstr "一部分失败了,但并非全部失败。迄今为止我们足够幸运,躲开了熔岩,但我们仍迷失在深深的地下,大部分储备和口粮已毁于火焰。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:718
msgid ""
"Indeed, hunger and weakness already gnaw at my stomach. We must find a way "
"to the surface soon, or these caves may yet prove our doom..."
msgstr "确实,饥渴与虚弱已经在啃噬我的胃。我们必须尽快找到通往地表的道路,否则这些洞穴终究会成为我们的葬身之地……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/31_Plunging_into_Darkness.cfg:733
msgid ""
"Even worse, the bulk of our stores and rations have been lost to the lava! "
"Hunger and weakness already gnaw at my stomach. We must find a way to the "
"surface soon, or these caves may yet prove our doom..."
msgstr "更糟的是,我们大部分储备和口粮都毁在熔岩里了!饥渴与虚弱已经在啃噬我的胃。我们必须尽快找到通往地表的道路,否则这些洞穴终究会成为我们的葬身之地……"

#. [scenario]: id=32_The_Swamp_of_Dread
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:7
#| msgid "scenario name^Blackwater Port"
msgid "scenario name^The Swamp of Dread"
msgstr "黑水港"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:412
#| msgid ""
#| "Delfador led his young charges through lonely corridors and abandoned "
#| "tunnels for four days. For the first time Konrad saw signs of fatigue in "
#| "the old wizard’s normally inscrutable face. Finally, fresh air greeted "
#| "the party..."
msgid ""
"Konrad, Delfador, and their army wandered for days, lost in lonely corridors "
"and abandoned tunnels under the trackless mountains. What few foodstuffs had "
"been salvaged from the lava dwindled, then vanished entirely. For the first "
"time Konrad saw signs of fatigue in the old wizard’s normally inscrutable "
"face."
msgstr ""
"德法多带领着自己照看的孩子们穿越无数走廊与废弃的坑道，艰难前行了整整四天。有"
"生以来，科纳德第一次在老巫师通常高深莫测的表情里看到了疲惫。终于，新鲜空气迎"
"接了众人……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:416
msgid ""
"Finally, weakened and battered by their ordeal, the exhausted rebels emerged "
"into an unknown valley..."
msgstr "终于,那些被磨难削弱、被疲惫压垮的反叛者,现身于一条陌生的山谷中……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:428
msgid ""
"Oh, my old bones! Long has it been since I exerted myself so, especially on "
"an empty stomach. We were most fortunate we have at last found our way to "
"the surface."
msgstr "噢,我这把老骨头!好久没有这么剧烈地活动过了,尤其是在空着肚子的情况下。我们真是幸运,终于找到了通往地表的道路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:434
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. And with both Li’sar and the Sceptre in our "
"hands!"
msgstr "但重要的是你活着,康拉德,而且我们逃出了洞穴,重见了天日。而且莉莎和权杖,现在都在我们掌中了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:439
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. And although Li’sar has escaped us, at least "
"we still have the Sceptre in our hands."
msgstr "但重要的是你活着,康拉德,而且我们逃出了洞穴,重见了天日。虽然莉莎从我们手中逃脱了,至少权杖仍在我们掌中。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:446
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. And we have the Sceptre as well! Despite our "
"difficulties, our quest has been a success."
msgstr "但重要的是你活着,康拉德,而且我们逃出了洞穴,重见了天日。我们还带着权杖!尽管困难重重,我们的征程已算成功。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:452
msgid ""
"But what matters is that you are alive, Konrad, and that we have escaped the "
"caves and found daylight again. If only we had the Sceptre with us... it is "
"surely now buried beyond all hope of reclamation."
msgstr "但重要的是你活着,康拉德,而且我们逃出了洞穴,重见了天日。要是权杖也跟我们在一起就好了……它现在多半已被埋葬得再也无从寻回了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:457
msgid "Yes, but look! We are not the only army to have escaped the caves!"
msgstr "是,可是你看!从洞穴中逃出来的军队,不止我们这一支!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:475
msgid ""
"My expeditionary company! Or at least a small fragment of it, with a "
"precious few survivors. And fighting many undead?!"
msgstr "我的远征军!或者至少是其中的一小支残部,只剩寥寥几名幸存者。而他们在与大批死者作战?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:480
msgid ""
"That’s a grim look, but even embattled they’re more than a match for your "
"rebels, Konrad, weakened and gold-deprived as you are from your long days "
"underground."
msgstr "你神色凝重,可即便他们已身陷苦战,对付你那些反叛者依然是绰绰有余——你们在地下待了那么久,又缺钱又衰弱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar # default portrait, so that if she has her Sceptre it's shown in her portrait
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:485
msgid ""
"Keep moving. Don’t get pinned. I know this looks bad, but there is no choice "
"but to fight! Fight, fight or die!"
msgstr "继续前进。别被围死。我知道这形势不妙,但没有别的选择,只能打!打啊,打啊,不然就是死!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:489
msgid ""
"Even if others have escaped the lava elsewhere, we’ve no chance of finding "
"them unless we can first evade these undead!"
msgstr "即便别处也有人在熔岩中逃生,除非我们先甩脱这些死者,否则我们根本没有机会找到他们!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:503
msgid ""
"I shouldn’t be surprised that some part of your army has survived, princess; "
"you surely trained them well."
msgstr "公主,你的军队有一部分竟然还幸存下来,我本不该惊讶;你的训练一定很出色。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:505
msgid ""
"But from what I can see, they stand both outnumbered and surrounded. If we "
"keep our distance the soldiers may not notice us, and will surely perish at "
"the hands of the zombies!"
msgstr "不过就我所见,他们既寡不敌众,又被团团围住。只要我们保持距离,那些士兵也许不会注意到我们,而必然死于僵尸之手!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:509
msgid ""
"On the other hand... you are right that we ourselves are weakened from long "
"days of hunger and travel, and these undead will only become stronger with "
"the addition of the bodies of the royal soldiers — I see many fresh corpses "
"among their numbers already."
msgstr "但话说回来……你说得对,我们自己也在连日的饥渴与奔波中元气大伤,而这些死者还会因王国士兵尸体的加入而变得更加强大——我已经在他们的行列中看到许多新鲜的尸体了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:513
msgid ""
"I have seen firsthand the dangers of the spawn of Asheviere, Konrad, and I "
"have learned the harm that comes from lending ear to their lies. This may be "
"our only chance to vanquish these soldiers and still keep our prisoner! I "
"think it best that we ensure their defeat first, and only afterwards give "
"thought to our escape."
msgstr "我亲眼见识过艾什薇尔爪牙的危险,康拉德,也深知听信他们谎言的危害。这可能就是我们击败这些士兵、同时保住俘虏的唯一机会!我认为最好先确保击溃他们,之后再考虑我们自己的逃脱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:521
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:604
msgid "Maybe... but no food, no shelter, little gold..."
msgstr "也许吧……但没有食物,没有住处,也几乎没有黄金……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:525
msgid ""
"I have no love for the villains who tried to take my life, but neither am I "
"willing to doom my comrades just to spite them. That is how Asheviere "
"fights; more invested in the death of enemies than the life of friends — or "
"daughters. Did you yourself not tell me <i>“be forgiving, be wise, be kind”</"
"i>?"
msgstr "我并不喜欢那些试图取我性命的恶人们,但我也无意仅仅为了气他们,就让我的同伴们陪葬。艾什薇尔就是这么打仗的;比起朋友的活命,她更在乎敌人的死亡——哪怕是女儿。您不是亲口对我说过<i>“宽恕,睿智,仁慈”</i>吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:529
msgid ""
"Unless all the living stand together against the dead, I fear things shall "
"end badly for us all — and from her palace safe in Weldyn, Asheviere will "
"laugh."
msgstr "除非所有生者团结起来对抗死者,我恐怕我们所有人都会落得悲惨的下场——而远在维尔帝那座安全的宫殿里,艾什薇尔只会冷嘲热讽。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:533
msgid ""
"No. Li’sar, my cousin and prisoner, I offer you a trade. We shall make "
"ourselves known to your army, and you will command them to ally with us "
"against the undead. In return, once this place is cleansed, they will be "
"free to leave."
msgstr "不。莉莎,我的堂亲,也是我的俘虏,我向你提出一笔交易。我们向你的军队亮明身份,而你命令他们与我们结盟对抗死者。作为交换,等这片地方被净化之后,他们便可自由离去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:537
msgid "Perhaps. And I would be free to leave along with them?"
msgstr "也许吧。而我也能和他们一起自由离开吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:541
msgid ""
"This is not a negotiation. You are my prisoner and at my mercy, and I still "
"mean to ransom you back to your mother in exchange for her abdication."
msgstr "这不是谈判。你是我的囚犯,命悬我手,而我仍打算把你赎回去交给你母亲,换取她的退位。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:545
msgid ""
"Do not be a fool; neither we nor your soldiers can prevail alone. And if we "
"fall to the undead, you will surely perish with us. Choose: will you command "
"your allies to aid us, or are we all to fight and bleed and die until our "
"bodies cold are buried under crimson snow?"
msgstr "别犯傻了;无论是我们还是你的士兵,单独都难以取胜。而若我们死在这些死者手里,你也一定会随我们一同灭亡。选吧:是下令让你的盟友援助我们,还是我们所有人战斗、流血、死到尸体冰冷,被埋进血色的雪里?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:553
msgid ""
"I’m not excited to join forces with the enemy, but neither do I want to "
"watch my friends and comrades lose a hopeless battle on two fronts. I agree "
"to your deal. I’ll remain prisoner while my soldiers fight as your allies."
msgstr "我并不热衷于与敌人结盟,但我也看不得我的朋友和同伴在两线作战中输掉一场必败之仗。我接受你的提议。我继续当囚犯,而我的士兵则作为你们的盟友参战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:557
msgid ""
"But once these undead are finished, there will be no leaving peacefully. "
"Prisoner or not, this battlefield still has loyalists ready to fight for "
"their queen — and you and I have a score to settle."
msgstr "但等这些死者被收拾干净,就没有和平离开的可能了。是囚犯也好不是也好,这片战场上仍有许多忠臣,誓为女王而战——而你和我,也有一笔旧账要算。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:571
msgid ""
"So, the princess has survived — and she has the Sceptre of Fire! I shouldn’t "
"be surprised; villains often seem hard to finish off, don’t they?"
msgstr "哦,原来公主终究还是活了下来——而且她拿到了火之权杖!我本不该惊讶;恶人往往总是很难一了百了,不是吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:573
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:580
msgid ""
"And what’s more, she is fighting a great horde of undead! If we keep our "
"distance she may not notice us, and will surely perish at the hands of the "
"zombies!"
msgstr "而且,她正在与一大群死者激战!只要我们保持距离,她也许不会注意到我们,而必然死于僵尸之手!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:578
msgid ""
"So, the princess has survived after all. I shouldn’t be surprised; villains "
"often seem hard to finish off, don’t they?"
msgstr "哦,原来公主终究还是活了下来。我本不该惊讶;恶人往往总是很难一了百了,不是吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:585
msgid ""
"On the other hand... we ourselves are weakened from long days of hunger and "
"travel, and these undead will only become stronger with the addition of the "
"bodies of Li’sar’s men — I see many fresh corpses among their numbers "
"already."
msgstr "但话说回来……我们自己也在连日的饥渴与奔波中元气大伤,而这些死者还会因莉莎士兵尸体的加入而变得更加强大——我已经在他们的行列中看到许多新鲜的尸体了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:590
msgid ""
"I have seen firsthand the dangers of the spawn of Asheviere, Konrad, and I "
"have learned the value of swift action against them. Li’sar has already "
"escaped us once! I think it best that we ensure her defeat first, and only "
"afterwards give thought to our escape."
msgstr "我亲眼见识过艾什薇尔爪牙的危险,康拉德,也深知迅速出手对付他们的价值。莉莎已经逃脱过一次了!我认为最好先确保击溃她,之后再考虑我们自己的逃脱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:595
msgid ""
"I have seen firsthand the dangers of the spawn of Asheviere, Konrad, and I "
"have learned the value of swift action against them. This may be our only "
"chance to vanquish Li’sar! I think it best that we ensure her defeat first, "
"and only afterwards give thought to our escape."
msgstr "我亲眼见识过艾什薇尔爪牙的危险,康拉德,也深知迅速出手对付他们的价值。这可能就是我们击败莉莎的唯一机会!我认为最好先确保击溃她,之后再考虑我们自己的逃脱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:608
msgid ""
"I have no love for the villain who tried to take my life, but neither am I "
"willing to doom my comrades just to spite her. That is how Asheviere fights; "
"more invested in the death of enemies than the life of friends — or "
"daughters. Did you yourself not tell me <i>“be forgiving, be wise, be kind”</"
"i>?"
msgstr "我并不喜欢那个试图取我性命的恶人,但我也无意仅仅为了气她,就让我的同伴们陪葬。艾什薇尔就是这么打仗的;比起朋友的活命,她更在乎敌人的死亡——哪怕是女儿。您不是亲口对我说过<i>“宽恕,睿智,仁慈”</i>吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:612
msgid ""
"Unless all the living stand together against the dead, I fear things shall "
"end badly for us all — and from her palace safe in Weldyn, Asheviere will "
"laugh. No, we should approach Li’sar and offer a brief alliance, at least "
"until these undead are defeated."
msgstr "除非所有生者团结起来对抗死者,我恐怕我们所有人都会落得悲惨的下场——而远在维尔帝那座安全的宫殿里,艾什薇尔只会冷嘲热讽。不,我们应该去找莉莎,提出短暂的结盟,至少直到这些死者被击败。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:616
msgid ""
"Although she is our enemy, I believe that she is trustworthy enough to honor "
"her word if she agrees not to harm us. I ask you to trust my judgement on "
"this, my mentor."
msgstr "尽管她是我们的敌人,但我相信她足够守信,若她答应不伤害我们,就会遵守诺言。导师,请在这事上信任我的判断。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:620
msgid ""
"The last time a king asked me to trust him, things ended rather badly for "
"the both of us. Nevertheless, you are my lord, Konrad, and I know you to be "
"growing wise beyond your years. Let us reach Li’sar and make your offer."
msgstr "上一次一位国王让我去信任他,结果我们俩都落得不太妙。不过,你是我的主人,康拉德,我知道你正日益变得比你的年纪更为睿智。让我们去见莉莎,向她的部队开出你的条件吧。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:629
msgid "Reach Li’sar’s loyalists before they are slain"
msgstr "在莉莎的部下被杀之前赶到他们身边"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:636
#| msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgid "Then, defeat the primary enemy leader"
msgstr "击败敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:644
#| msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgid "Defeat the primary enemy leader"
msgstr "击败敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:653
#| msgid "Defeat Muff Malal"
msgid "Defeat Iliah-Malal"
msgstr "击败玛夫·玛拉尔"

#. [note]
#. because of the low starting gold, companions (who're usually recalled for free) would be overly powerful here
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:677
msgid ""
"Konrad’s forces are exhausted, and have less starting gold than usual. Loyal "
"companions (except Delfador) are not automatically recalled."
msgstr "康拉德的部队已筋疲力尽,起始金币也比平时少。忠诚的同伴(德法多除外)不会自动出现在你的召回名单中。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:694
msgid ""
"These must be the tunnels from whence Li’sar’s soldiers emerged. Out of all "
"the countless exits from the underground, we just so happened to come "
"together here..."
msgstr "这里应该就是莉莎的士兵出现的那些地道出口。地底下有那么多出口,我们偏偏就在这一处碰上了……"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:733
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:739
msgid "We’re in dire straits. Deploy the reserves."
msgstr "我们处境危急。投入预备队。"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:810
msgid ""
"Living soldiers at the perimeter! It’s Konrad and his rebels, intact despite "
"the volcano! And... they’ve taken the princess prisoner?!"
msgstr "警戒圈有活人军队!是康拉德和他的叛军,历经火山仍建制完好!而且……他们把公主擒获了?!"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:814
msgid ""
"I’d been hoping for reinforcements, for we are already hard-pressed, but if "
"we must fight a second foe to rescue our general I shall not shy away!"
msgstr "我正盼着援军,因为我们已捉襟见肘;但若要为了救我们的将军而再战一敌,我也绝不会退缩!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:818
msgid ""
"No, captain, that won’t be necessary. I am a prisoner, but we’ve agreed to a "
"temporary truce — emphasis on temporary. Until these undead are defeated, "
"you are to work together with Konrad against the dead."
msgstr "不必,队长。我虽是阶下囚,但我们已达成临时停战——强调一下,是临时的。在这些亡灵被击败之前,你们要与康拉德联手对抗死者。"

#. [message]: role=leader7
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:822
msgid ""
"You’re certain? You’re not being coerced? Well, in the dire straits we’re in "
"I can hardly say no to an ally."
msgstr "你确定?你并非被胁迫?好吧,以我们眼下的困境,我实在不能拒绝一位盟友。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:841
msgid ""
"Konrad, should we not be concerned about Li’sar’s threats? Prisoner or no, "
"she has been very clear about her intentions to turn her allies against us "
"once these undead are defeated. And perhaps sooner, if she senses in us some "
"weakness!"
msgstr "康拉德,我们难道不该担忧莉莎的威胁吗?无论她是囚是友,她已把意图说得清清楚楚:一旦这些亡灵被击败,她就会让她的盟友转而对付我们。要是她察觉我们有什么弱点,恐怕会更早动手!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:845
msgid ""
"Li’sar is not Eldred. Although she is our enemy, I have come to believe Her "
"Highness cares about her people just as we do, and that she is trustworthy "
"enough to honor her word if she agrees not to harm us. I ask you to trust my "
"judgement on this, my mentor."
msgstr "莉莎不是埃尔德雷德。虽然她与我们为敌,但我已相信,殿下同样像我们一样心系她的子民,若她答应不伤害我们,她是足以信守诺言的。此事,请您相信我的判断,我的导师。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:849
msgid ""
"The last time a king asked me to trust him, things ended rather badly for "
"the both of us. Nevertheless, you are my lord, Konrad, and I know you to be "
"growing wise beyond your years. Let us set aside my worries and direct our "
"efforts against the undead."
msgstr "上一次有国王要求我信任他,结果对我们俩都不太好。不过,你是我的君主,康拉德,我看得出你正在变得比年龄更睿智。让我抛下顾虑,合力对抗亡灵吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:863
msgid ""
"Living soldiers at the perimeter! ...Konrad, you’re here! And with your army "
"too, intact despite the volcano. I intend to have serious words with the "
"queen if we somehow get out of this alive..."
msgstr "警戒圈有活人军队!……康拉德,你在这儿!军队也在,历经火山仍建制完好。如果我们能从这一劫中活着出去,我非得找那位女王好好说几句……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:867
msgid ""
"I am not here to fight you, Li’sar — at least not right now. You are "
"vulnerable, but so are we, and if we war the only winner will be the undead. "
"I propose a truce."
msgstr "我此来不是为了与你开战,莉莎——至少眼下不是。你们处境艰难,我们亦然;若我们开战,唯一的赢家只会是亡灵。我提议停战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:871
msgid ""
"A truce? What ploy is this; are you so cruel that you would give my men hope "
"before snuffing it out? If you are come to slay me, fight me to my face!"
msgstr "停战?这是什么把戏;难道你狠心到要先给我的人希望,再亲手掐灭?你若来取我性命,就明着来打!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:875
msgid ""
"There is no trick! Do not be a fool; surely you can see that if we do not "
"stand together, we shall die alone? It is in both of our interests to work "
"together!"
msgstr "没有诡计!别傻了;难道你看不出来,若我们不并肩而立,就只会各自赴死吗?合作对双方都有利!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:877
msgid ""
"Do you agree to my proposal, Your Highness? Or are we to fight and bleed and "
"die until our bodies both are buried under crimson snow?"
msgstr "你愿意接受我的提议吗,殿下?还是要我们厮杀、流血、倒下,直到两具尸体都埋在血染的雪下?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:885
msgid ""
"Very well, we shall work together for now. But do not forget that once these "
"undead are defeated, you and I have a score to settle."
msgstr "好吧,眼下我们先合作。但别忘了,一旦这些亡灵被击败,你我之间还有一笔旧账要算。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:913
msgid ""
"My men and I are desperately low on gold and supplies, Li’sar. Now we have "
"met with your allies — do they have anything to spare?"
msgstr "我的部下和我已到了缺金少粮的绝境,莉莎。既然我们见到了你的盟友——他们能匀一些吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:918
msgid ""
"My men and I are desperately low on gold and supplies, Li’sar. Now that we "
"are allies, do you have anything to spare?"
msgstr "我的部下和我已到了缺金少粮的绝境,莉莎。既然我们已是盟友,你能匀一些吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:923
msgid ""
"We are allies only of convenience, cousin, and it is not in my best interest "
"for you or your rebels to be too well-supplied."
msgstr "我们不过是权宜之盟,表妹。你和你的叛军补给太过充裕,并不符合我的利益。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:928
msgid ""
"... not that it matters, because I can see that my soldiers have barely "
"enough to outfit themselves as it is. It’s unfortunate that the queen’s "
"orders harmed us as much as they did you, if not more."
msgstr "……不过这也无所谓,我看我的士兵眼下勉强只够自己补给。不幸的是,女王的命令害我们害得跟你一样深,甚至更深。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:933
msgid ""
"... not that it matters, because we have barely enough to outfit ourselves "
"as it is. It’s unfortunate that the queen’s orders harmed us as much as they "
"did you, if not more."
msgstr "……不过这也无所谓,因为我们眼下勉强只够自己补给。不幸的是,女王的命令害我们害得跟你一样深,甚至更深。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:938
msgid ""
"It’s not “unfortunate” — your mother was more than willing to see you killed."
msgstr "别用什么“不幸”——你母亲巴不得看着你去死。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:942
msgid ""
"Asheviere gave Mirya the orders she thought were necessary to prevent you "
"from escaping. Whether they were wise orders or not is immaterial; she acted "
"to ensure that Wesnoth survives, even if I don’t. I cannot fault her for "
"that."
msgstr "艾什薇尔给了米尔娅她认为必要的命令,为的是阻止你逃脱。这些命令是否明智已无关紧要;她这么做,是为了确保韦诺特能够存续,哪怕我自身难保。这一点,我不能责怪她。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:946
msgid ""
"She acted to ensure her power remains unchallenged, you mean. The dark queen "
"cares only for herself."
msgstr "你的意思是,她这么做是为了确保自己的权力无人挑战。那位暗之女王只在乎她自己。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:951
msgid ""
"“<i>The dark queen</i>,” pfft. I’ve heard enough slander; hold your tongue "
"or I shall have my men make an end to our truce and short work of you."
msgstr "“<i>暗之女王</i>”,哼。中伤我听够了;闭上你的嘴,否则我就让我的手下终结我们的停战,好好收拾你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:956
msgid ""
"“<i>The dark queen</i>,” pfft. I’ve heard enough slander; hold your tongue "
"or I shall make an end to our truce and short work of you."
msgstr "“<i>暗之女王</i>”,哼。中伤我听够了;闭上你的嘴,否则我就终结我们的停战,好好收拾你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:998
msgid "Don’t wander around my keep, Konrad. We have a battle to fight."
msgstr "别在我的城堡里闲逛,康拉德。我们有一场仗要打。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1013
msgid ""
"You have no tricks this time, Malal? Your magic is as weak as was your flesh!"
msgstr "马拉尔,这次你没有花招了吗?你的魔法和你当年的肉身一样羸弱!"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#. the same thing he says when fighting Delfador in The Deceiver's Gambait
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1018
msgid "Shadows consume you!"
msgstr "让暗影吞噬你!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1027
msgid "Delfador killed you once! Now it’s my turn!"
msgstr "德法多曾杀过你一次!现在轮到我了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1036
msgid "Time to put you and your lies back in the ground!"
msgstr "是时候把你和你的谎言一起重新埋进土里了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1054
msgid "Eye of elf and bone of beast..."
msgstr "精灵之眼,兽骨为架……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1059
msgid ""
"A lich! So here is the source of the undead. Something about this magic "
"feels familiar... very familiar..."
msgstr "一个巫妖!原来亡灵就出自这里。这股魔法令我觉得熟悉……非常熟悉……"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1064
msgid ""
"Hello, Delfador! Do you remember me? You’ve grown old. Perhaps you regret "
"passing up the temptations of necromancy, so long ago?"
msgstr "你好,德法多!还记得我吗?你老了。也许你后悔当年拒绝了死灵魔法的诱惑吧?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1068
msgid ""
"Iliah-Malal! A name most foul, and one that I have not spoken aloud since "
"our duel so many years ago. You’ll recall that I won. You should be dead and "
"gone."
msgstr "伊利亚·马拉尔!何等肮脏的名字,自多年前我们决斗以来,我再也不肯将它说出口。你该记得,那场决斗是我赢了。你本该死去,就此销声匿迹。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1070
msgid "Iliah-Malal"
msgstr "伊利亚·马拉尔"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1073
msgid ""
"Dead, yes, but not quite gone. You have the good queen to thank for my "
"return. And I have you to thank for finding the Sceptre of Fire! Soon it "
"will be mine."
msgstr "死了,是的,但并未彻底消亡。我的归来,要感谢那位仁慈的女王。而你们找到了火焰权杖,倒让我有得谢了!很快,它就会是我的了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1078
msgid ""
"I know my own mother, lich, and she would never be complicit in the "
"resurrection of an abomination like yourself."
msgstr "我最了解我的母亲,巫妖。她绝不会同谋参与你这种怪物的复生。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1140
msgid ""
"You can’t deny, Li’sar, that th’ queen o’ yours was ready to massacre us "
"smallfolk in Delwyn an’ Dallben jus’ because we refused to swear fealty. An’ "
"she would’ve succeeded too, if we hadn’t fought back an’ fled an’ hid!"
msgstr "你没法否认,莉莎,你们那位女王就因为咱们这些老百姓拒绝宣誓效忠,就准备把咱们赶尽杀绝。要不是咱们拼死反抗、逃散躲藏,她早就得逞了!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1141
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1148
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told that region had always been home to "
"rebels, and that after the destruction of Halstead Mother was regrettably "
"forced to raze the villages."
msgstr "——不,这不对。据我所知,那一带向来是叛军的窝点;哈尔斯特德被毁之后,母亲也是迫不得已,才忍痛焚毁了那些村庄。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1147
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere was ready to massacre the smallfolk "
"in Delwyn and Dallben just because they refused to swear fealty. They told "
"me the story: had they not fought back and fled and hid, they would all be "
"dead now."
msgstr "表妹,你不能否认,艾什薇尔就因为德尔文和达尔本的百姓拒绝宣誓效忠,就准备屠戮他们。他们把经过告诉了我:若不是奋起反抗、逃散躲藏,他们如今都已命丧黄泉。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1155
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere passed control of Elensefar to the "
"orcish hordes when she found she could not bend the populace to her will. I "
"was there — it is only by my sword that the entire city was not enslaved!"
msgstr "表妹,你不能否认,艾什薇尔在发现无法让伊伦斯法尔的民众俯首帖耳时,就把这座城市交给了兽人部落。我当时就在场——正是我的剑才保住了全城百姓免遭奴役!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1156
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told that the city was under the control of "
"royal forces; the orcs were only supposed to aid in the attack."
msgstr "——不,这不对。据我所知,那座城市由王室军队控制;兽人只是协助进攻而已。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1157
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere gave control of Elensefar to the orcish hordes when "
"she found she could not bend the populace to her will? Without my "
"intervention the entire city would have been enslaved!"
msgstr "那艾什薇尔在发现无法让伊伦斯法尔的民众俯首帖耳时,就把这座城市交给了兽人部落,又该怎么说?若非我出手干预,全城百姓都会沦为奴隶!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1162
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere allowed a necromancer to run amuck "
"on the Peninsula of Pearls, to weaken and create chaos in the west. I was "
"there — it is only by my sword that Muff Malal was killed!"
msgstr "表妹,你不能否认,艾什薇尔纵容死灵法师在珍珠半岛横行,削弱西境、制造混乱。我当时就在场——正是我的剑杀死了穆夫·马拉尔!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1163
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told that you rebels were the ones who "
"invited the necromancer in, and that royal forces were beaten back when they "
"came to render aid."
msgstr "——不,这不对。据我所知,是你们这些叛军请来的死灵法师;王室军队前去援助时,反被打得节节败退。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1164
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere allowed a necromancer to run amuck on the Peninsula "
"of Pearls, to weaken and create chaos in the west? Without my intervention "
"the entire coast might have been overrun!"
msgstr "那艾什薇尔纵容死灵法师在珍珠半岛横行,削弱西境、制造混乱,又该怎么说?若非我出手干预,整片海岸都可能沦陷!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1169
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere allowed her orcs to overrun the Bay "
"of Pearls, to enslave the peaceful merfolk and force them to dive for her "
"enrichment. I was there — it is only by my sword that they were freed!"
msgstr "表妹,你不能否认,艾什薇尔放纵她的兽人攻陷了珍珠湾,奴役了和善的海民,强迫他们潜入深海为她搜刮财富。我当时就在场——正是我的剑才让他们获得自由!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1170
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told the orcs were protecting the merfolk "
"against the rebels, not holding them as slaves."
msgstr "——不,这不对。据我所知,兽人是在保护海民免受叛军侵扰,而不是奴役他们。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1171
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere allowed her orcs to overrun the Bay of Pearls, to "
"enslave the peaceful merfolk and force them to dive for her enrichment? "
"Without my intervention they might never have been freed!"
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔任由她的兽人兵强掠珍珠湾,奴役和乐的河族,逼他们潜入海底为她搜刮财富呢?若非我出手干预,他们恐怕永远不得解脱!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1177
msgid ""
"Li’sar, what about how yer gnashgabbin’ Asheviere locked me up jus’ fer a "
"couple o’ insults — an’ high-quality ones too, proper fit fer a queen! Ye "
"even helped keep me an’ my boys from escapin’!"
msgstr "莉莎,你那死缠烂打的艾什薇尔把我关起来的这事呢,就因为几句挖苦话——而且还是高质量的挖苦,正适合送给一位女王!你还帮着把我和我的弟兄们堵了个严严实实,不让我们跑!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1178
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told you dwarves were sentenced for sedition "
"and murder, not mere vulgarity."
msgstr "——不,这不对。我听说你们这些矮人被判的是叛乱罪和谋杀罪,可不是单纯的粗鄙无礼。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1179
msgid ""
"Ach, an’ what about how yer gnashgabbin’ Asheviere locked me up jus’ fer a "
"couple o’ insults — an’ high-quality ones too, proper fit fer a queen! Ye "
"even helped keep me an’ my boys from escapin’!"
msgstr "哎,你那死缠烂打的艾什薇尔把我关起来的这事呢,就因为几句挖苦话——而且还是高质量的挖苦,正适合送给一位女王!你还帮着把我和我的弟兄们堵了个严严实实,不让我们跑!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1184
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere locked up Ulfdain and his miners for "
"no crime but daring to criticise her! You even tried to stop me from freeing "
"them!"
msgstr "你无法否认,堂亲,艾什薇尔把乌尔夫戴恩和他的矿工们投入大牢,罪名不过是胆敢批评她!你甚至想阻止我去解救他们!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1185
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told those dwarves were sentenced for "
"sedition and murder, not mere vulgarity."
msgstr "——不,这不对。我听说那些矮人被判的是叛乱罪和谋杀罪,可不是单纯的粗鄙无礼。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1186
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere locked up Ulfdain and his miners for no crime but "
"daring to criticise her! You even tried to stop me from intervening to free "
"them!"
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔把乌尔夫戴恩和他的矿工们投入大牢,罪名不过是胆敢批评她呢!你甚至想阻止我出手解救他们!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1193
msgid ""
"You can scarcely deny, Li’sar, that after my peoples’ defeat at the "
"Aethenwood, Asheviere sent her armies to take our fleeing civilians as "
"slaves. It is only thanks to Konrad they escaped!"
msgstr "莉莎,你几乎无法否认,我的族人败于艾瑟森林之后,艾什薇尔派她的军队把我们逃难的平民抓去当奴隶。正是多亏了康拉德,他们才得以逃脱!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1194
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. Your Aethenwood elves are dangerous, hardly "
"civilians, but you were all to be afforded a fair trial and a just verdict, "
"not taken as slaves."
msgstr "——不,这不对。你们艾瑟森林的精灵危险得很,称不上平民,但你们本应得到公正的审判和裁决,而不是被抓去当奴隶。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1195
msgid ""
"Or what of how after the elves’ defeat at the Aethenwood, Asheviere sent her "
"armies to take our fleeing civilians as slaves? Without Konrad’s "
"intervention they would be in chains in the mines!"
msgstr "或者精灵在艾瑟森林败北之后,艾什薇尔派她的军队把我们逃难的平民抓去当奴隶呢?若非康拉德出手干预,他们早就被锁在矿坑里了!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1200
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that after the elves’ defeat at the Aethenwood, "
"Asheviere sent her armies to take the fleeing civilians as slaves. I was "
"there — it is only by my sword that they escaped!"
msgstr "你无法否认,堂亲,精灵在艾瑟森林败北之后,艾什薇尔派她的军队把逃难的平民抓去当奴隶。我亲眼在场——正是凭着我的剑,他们才得以逃脱!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1201
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. The Aethenwood elves are dangerous, hardly "
"civilians, but they were to be afforded a fair trial and a just verdict, not "
"taken as slaves."
msgstr "——不,这不对。艾瑟森林的精灵危险得很,称不上平民,但他们本应得到公正的审判和裁决,而不是被抓去当奴隶。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1202
msgid ""
"Or what of how after the elves’ defeat at the Aethenwood, Asheviere sent her "
"armies to take the fleeing civilians as slaves? Without my intervention they "
"would be in chains in the mines!"
msgstr "或者精灵在艾瑟森林败北之后,艾什薇尔派她的军队把逃难的平民抓去当奴隶呢?若非我出手干预,他们早就被锁在矿坑里了!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1209
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay "
"Wesnoth’s wild gryphons and steal their eggs! I was there — it is only by my "
"sword that Gryphon Mountain was not entirely ruined!"
msgstr "你无法否认,堂亲,艾什薇尔派她的矮人爪牙去杀害韦诺特的野生狮鹫、偷走它们的蛋!我亲眼在场——正是凭着我的剑,狮鹫山才没有毁于一旦!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1210
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1216
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. I was told we’d decided against the egg "
"expedition, because of the intelligence of gryphons and the risks to their "
"population."
msgstr "——不,这不对。我记得我们决定过不搞捕蛋远征,因为狮鹫很聪明,而且有危及它们种群的风险。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1211
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay Wesnoth’s wild "
"gryphons and steal their eggs? Without my intervention Gryphon Mountain "
"might have been entirely ruined!"
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔派她的矮人爪牙去杀害韦诺特的野生狮鹫、偷走它们的蛋呢?若非我出手干预,狮鹫山恐怕已毁于一旦!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1215
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay "
"Wesnoth’s wild gryphons and steal their eggs! I may have benefitted from the "
"act, but that does not change Asheviere’s decision to do it."
msgstr "你无法否认,堂亲,艾什薇尔派她的矮人爪牙去杀害韦诺特的野生狮鹫、偷走它们的蛋!我或许从中得了好处,但这并不能改变艾什薇尔作出这一决定的事实。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1217
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere sent her dwarvish lackies to slay Wesnoth’s wild "
"gryphons and steal their eggs? I may have benefitted from the act, but that "
"does not change Asheviere’s decision to do it."
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔派她的矮人爪牙去杀害韦诺特的野生狮鹫、偷走它们的蛋呢?我或许从中得了好处,但这并不能改变艾什薇尔作出这一决定的事实。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1224
msgid ""
"You can scarcely deny, Li’sar, that the dark queen deliberately withheld aid "
"from my home, leaving many of our number to die at the hands of undead. It "
"is only thanks to Konrad that our seal was restored and calamity averted!"
msgstr "莉莎,你几乎无法否认,黑暗女王蓄意扣留了对你家乡的援助,任由你们许多人死于死者之手。正是多亏了康拉德,我们的封印才得以修复,灾祸才得以避免!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1225
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. You and your order are doing important work; it "
"should be the crown’s responsibility to keep you provisioned."
msgstr "——不,这不对。你和你的教团在做重要的工作;保障你们的给养,本应是王室的职责。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1226
msgid ""
"Lo! Or what of how Asheviere deliberately withheld aid from my home, leaving "
"many of our number to die at the hands of undead? Without Konrad’s "
"intervention our seal would never have been restored!"
msgstr "看哪!或者艾什薇尔蓄意扣留对我家乡的援助,任由我们许多人死于死者之手呢?若非康拉德出手干预,我们的封印绝不可能修复!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1231
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere deliberately withheld aid from the "
"Gryphon Mountain monastery, leaving many of their number to die at the hands "
"of undead. It is only by my sword that their seal was restored and calamity "
"averted!"
msgstr "你无法否认,堂亲,艾什薇尔蓄意扣留了对狮鹫山修道院的援助,任由那里许多人死于死者之手。正是凭着我的剑,他们的封印才得以修复,灾祸才得以避免!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1232
msgid ""
"—no, that can’t be right. The monastic mages are doing important work; it "
"should be the crown’s responsibility to keep them provisioned."
msgstr "——不,这不对。修道院的法师们在做重要的工作;保障他们的给养,本应是王室的职责。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1233
msgid ""
"Or what of how Asheviere deliberately withheld aid from the Gryphon Mountain "
"monastery, leaving many of their number to die at the hands of undead? "
"Without my intervention their seal would never have been restored!"
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔蓄意扣留对狮鹫山修道院的援助,任由那里许多人死于死者之手呢?若非我出手干预,他们的封印绝不可能修复!"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1240
msgid ""
"You can scarcely deny, Li’sar, that Asheviere’s quarrel with the Aethenwood "
"was more than just a quest to capture Konrad and Delfador. Asheviere has a "
"lust for control, and anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr "莉莎,你几乎无法否认,艾什薇尔与艾瑟森林的恩怨绝不只是为了抓康拉德和德法多。艾什薇尔贪恋控制权,任何反抗她的人都必须被摧毁。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1242
msgid ""
"Or what of Asheviere’s attack on the Aethenwood? This was more than just a "
"quest to capture Konrad and Delfador. Asheviere has a lust for control, and "
"anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔对艾瑟森林的进攻呢?那绝不只是为了抓康拉德和德法多。艾什薇尔贪恋控制权,任何反抗她的人都必须被摧毁。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1247
msgid ""
"You cannot deny, cousin, that Asheviere’s quarrel with the Aethenwood was "
"more than just a quest to capture me and Delfador. Asheviere has a lust for "
"control, and anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr "你无法否认,堂亲,艾什薇尔与艾瑟森林的恩怨绝不只是为了抓我和德法多。艾什薇尔贪恋控制权,任何反抗她的人都必须被摧毁。"

#. [event]: SPEAKER=Harper, SPEAKER=Ulfdain, SPEAKER=Kalenz, SPEAKER=Moremirmu, SPEAKER=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1249
msgid ""
"Or what of Asheviere’s attack on the Aethenwood? This was more than just a "
"quest to capture me and Delfador. Asheviere has a lust for control, and "
"anyone who resists must be destroyed."
msgstr "或者艾什薇尔对艾瑟森林的进攻呢?那绝不只是为了抓我和德法多。艾什薇尔贪恋控制权,任何反抗她的人都必须被摧毁。"

#. [message]: speaker=Iliah-Malal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1279
msgid "I feel... nothing."
msgstr "我什么也……感觉不到了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1308
msgid ""
"The lich is defeated, Li’sar, and our agreed-upon truce comes to an end. If "
"your soldiers and I are to battle, know that even weakened from the caves "
"they shall still find me a formidable foe."
msgstr "巫妖已被击败,莉莎,我们约定好的休战也随之结束。若你的士兵与我开战,请记着,即便从洞穴里出来时已元气大伤,他们也会发现我是个强硬的对手。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1313
msgid ""
"The lich is defeated, Li’sar, and our agreed-upon truce comes to an end. If "
"we are to battle, know that even weakened from the caves you shall still "
"find me a formidable foe."
msgstr "巫妖已被击败,莉莎,我们约定好的休战也随之结束。若我们开战,请记着,即便从洞穴里出来时已元气大伤,你也会发现我是个强硬的对手。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1318
msgid ""
"But you heard my truths about Asheviere — and Malal’s. The dark queen has "
"already harmed countless lives, and will bring all that we love to ruin if "
"we do not stop her. If you are willing, I would welcome your aid in my fight "
"to make Wesnoth a better place."
msgstr "但你也听到了我亲口说的关于艾什薇尔——以及玛拉尔的真话。黑暗女王已经伤害了无数生命,若我们不停止她,她将毁掉我们所爱的一切。如果你愿意,我欢迎你在让韦诺特变得更美好的征途中相助。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1322
msgid ""
"My mother has her flaws, but the crimes of which you’ve accused her... I "
"spent my entire childhood listening to my mother give orders and commanding "
"armies around. I’d always given her the benefit of the doubt."
msgstr "母亲有她的缺点,可你指控她的那些罪状……我整个童年都是在听母亲发号施令、统率军队中度过的。我向来总是替她找借口。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1326
#| msgid ""
#| "I became my mother’s most trusted aide-de-camp. I was sent to quiet the "
#| "worst of the rebellion. Of course they fought back. I never knew who "
#| "these people were or why they fought my mother. Konrad, you are lucky. "
#| "You do not know what Wesnoth has been like these past many years. There "
#| "is no peace. I have never known peace."
msgid ""
"But I cannot deny there have been signs. I became my mother’s most trusted "
"aide-de-camp. I was sent to quiet the worst of the various rebellions. Of "
"course they fought back. I was never told who most of these people were or "
"why they fought my mother. Now the volcano, and now this lich..."
msgstr ""
"我成为了母后最信任的副官，被派去剿灭最棘手的反叛者。当然，他们反击了。我从不"
"知道他们是谁，也不知道他们为什么对抗母后。科纳德，你是幸运的。你不知道过去的"
"这么多年里韦诺变成了什么样。没有什么和平。我从来都不知道什么是和平。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1339
msgid ""
"Free me from these chains and I will join you, even if it means opposing my "
"own flesh. Perhaps together we can save our country in a way that neither of "
"us could alone."
msgstr "解开我的枷锁,我就会加入你们,哪怕这意味着与我自己的血亲为敌。也许我们联手,能以任何一人单独做不到的方式拯救我们的国家。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1345
msgid ""
"I will join you, even if it means opposing my own flesh. Perhaps together we "
"can save our country in a way that neither of us could alone."
msgstr "我会加入你们,哪怕这意味着与我自己的血亲为敌。也许我们联手,能以任何一人单独做不到的方式拯救我们的国家。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1374
msgid ""
"We’ve come this far together. There is no reason for me to execute an "
"unarmed woman, enemy though she may be!"
msgstr "我们一路走来。我没有理由处决一个手无寸铁的女人,哪怕她是敌人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION defeat}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1393
msgid ""
"I can’t believe it. Bested so far from home.... and in part by the actions "
"of my own mother. Embarrassing..."
msgstr "真不敢相信。离家如此遥远落败……而且部分要归咎于我亲生母亲的行径。丢脸……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1398
msgid ""
"We are beaten! Bested so far from home.... and in part by the actions of the "
"queen..."
msgstr "我们被打败了!离家如此遥远的地方落败……而且部分要归咎于女王的行径……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1409
msgid ""
"Li’sar’s soldiers have fallen, and their camps have become infested with "
"undead! I would rejoice, if we were not surely about to follow them into "
"undeath..."
msgstr "莉莎的士兵倒下了,他们的营地已爬满了死者!若不是我们很快也要步他们后尘、堕入死地,我本该为此欢欣……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1446
msgid ""
"Ugh... I am faint with hunger and exhausted from our long days underground. "
"We must finish these undead before we become too weak to fight!"
msgstr "唉……我饿得头晕,在地下待了太久,筋疲力尽。我们必须在弱到无力战斗之前,收拾掉这些死者!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/32_The_Swamp_of_Dread.cfg:1453
msgid ""
"My heart... my head... our long ordeal has taken a toll on us all. I can "
"barely stand, much less fight, and the army is no better. Even if Li’sar is "
"still able to vanquish these undead without our aid, she will surely do the "
"same to us now that we have become so frail!"
msgstr "我的心……我的头……漫长的磨难让我们每个人都付出了代价。我几乎站都站不起来,更别提战斗了,大军也好不到哪去。即便莉莎还能在不靠我们援助的情况下击败这些死者,以我们如今的衰败,她肯定也会对我们出手!"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:10
#| msgid "scenario name^Blackwater Port"
msgid "scenario name^Snow Plains"
msgstr "黑水港"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=leader2
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:43
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:59
msgid "Clan Fell-Hand"
msgstr "断手部族"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:216
msgid ""
"Your Highness, the Princess of Wesnoth! Can that be you, off in the "
"distance?! ...I’d be elated to see you, if you weren’t so clearly marching "
"in rapport with the traitor prince. This is a surprise."
msgstr "殿下,韦诺特的公主!远处那个是你?!”要是你能让我见到你,我本该欣喜若狂,可惜你分明正与叛逃的王子并肩而行。这倒叫我吃惊了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:220
msgid ""
"Konrad’s not the one who tried to kill his own allies in a flood of lava, "
"Mirya. Yet here I stand alive and free, while you are locked behind bars."
msgstr "试图在熔岩洪流中杀死自己盟友的并非康拉德,米娅。可如今我活着且自由,而你却被关在牢里。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:224
msgid ""
"For over a decade now, you’ve served as my mother’s fastest scout and most "
"reliable courier. You’ve seen every major event in the kingdom firsthand; "
"people and battles I’ve only read about in sanitized reports."
msgstr "十多年来,你一直担任母亲最快的斥候和最可靠的信使。王国的每件大事你都亲眼见证;而我了解的许多人物与战役,只来自那些被删改过的战报。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:228
msgid ""
"Tell me, when did we stop trying to make Wesnoth a better place; a stronger "
"place? Or was it always this way and I was just too blind to see?"
msgstr "告诉我,我们是从哪一刻起,不再试图把韦诺特变成一个更好、更强大的地方?还是说它一直如此,只是我从前太盲目,看不见?"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:236
msgid ""
"Urag-Tifer, you must set me free at once. These soldiers before you are "
"rebels and traitors, orc-haters out for your head. Set me free and I will "
"help you fight."
msgstr "乌拉格-提弗,你必须马上放我走。面前这些士兵是叛军和叛徒,是想要你脑袋的憎恨兽人之人。放我走,我会助你作战。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:240
msgid ""
"Set you free so you can magic yourself away without us getting our ransom? "
"Fat chance. Just ’cause I’m an orc doesn’t mean I’m stupid."
msgstr "放你走,让你用魔法溜走,而我们的赎金打水漂?做梦吧。我虽是兽人,但不傻。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:244
msgid ""
"We’ll handle these soldiers the orcish way. C’mon, boys, grab your swords! "
"We’ve got a battle to win!"
msgstr "这些士兵就按兽人的方式收拾了。来吧,伙计们,抄起你们的剑!我们有一场仗要打赢!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:276
msgid "Defeat Urag-Tifer"
msgstr "击败乌拉戈-提法"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:304
msgid ""
"There’s the mage, but there won’t be time to deal with her until we first "
"defeat these orcs!"
msgstr "法师在那儿,但在我们先击败这些兽人之前,没有工夫去对付她!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:338
msgid "Gah, ah..."
msgstr "呃,啊……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:345
msgid "Hands off!! Not another swing at me, or the mage gets it!"
msgstr "别碰她!!再冲我挥一刀,就让那个法师尝尝!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:353
msgid ""
"Okay, go ahead. We’re fighting to stop Mirya from returning to my mother, "
"not to rescue her or to keep her as prisoner."
msgstr "好吧,随你们去。我们战斗是为了阻止米尔娅回到我母亲身边,不是为了救她,也不是为了把她扣作人质。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:361
msgid "<b><i>That’s</i></b> all you want?!"
msgstr "你们要的就<b><i>只是</i></b>这些?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:365
msgid "Wait—"
msgstr "等一下——"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:370
msgid "There, she’s dead. Better I lose a ransom than my life."
msgstr "好了,她死了。丢一份赎金总好过丢我自己的命。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:374
msgid ""
"Now get out of here. You pinkskins and your politics have caused me enough "
"trouble already..."
msgstr "现在给我滚出去。你们粉皮子和你们的政治,已经给我惹够麻烦了……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:390
msgid ""
"Mirya isn’t the type to leave her fate to chance, Konrad. While we’re busy "
"fighting, she’s certainly planning some kind of escape."
msgstr "米尔娅不是那种把命运交给运气的人,康拉德。趁我们忙于战斗,她肯定在谋划某种脱逃手段。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:394
msgid ""
"If we take too long to defeat these orcs and capture her, she may slip away "
"from us and back to Asheviere."
msgstr "如果歼灭这些兽人、抓获她拖得太久,她可能会溜走,逃回艾什薇尔那里去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/41_Snow_Plains.cfg:401
msgid ""
"Finally, I’ve burned an opening in these bars. And that oaf of an orc has "
"been too preoccupied with Li’sar to notice! Time to slip away..."
msgstr "终于,我把这些栏杆烧开了一个口子。那个愚蠢的兽人光想着莉莎,根本没发现!是时候溜走了……"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:13
msgid "scenario name^A Crisis of Leadership"
msgstr "scenario name^领导危机"

#. [side]: type={TYPE}, id={ID}
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:44
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:68
msgid "Clan Whitefang"
msgstr "白牙部落"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:50
msgid "Chief Khargol"
msgstr "卡戈尔首领"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:51
msgid "Ga-har"
msgstr "嘎-哈尔"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:52
msgid "Aharb"
msgstr "阿哈布"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:53
msgid "Arshag"
msgstr "阿尔沙格"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:54
msgid "Rizgab"
msgstr "里兹加布"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:57
msgid "Muk-har"
msgstr "穆克-哈尔"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:153
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:164
msgid "25 gold"
msgstr "25金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:154
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:155
msgid "50 gold"
msgstr "50金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:156
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:158
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:160
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:210
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:211
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:212
msgid "100 gold"
msgstr "100金币"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:157
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:159
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:161
msgid "200 gold"
msgstr "200金币"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:324
msgid ""
"I have the scheming orc locked up, Konrad. My soldiers and I will guard the "
"camp to make sure he doesn’t escape until you safely return."
msgstr "我已经把那个搞阴谋的兽人关起来了,康拉德。我和我的士兵会守卫营地,确保他不会逃跑,直到你安全归来。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:330
msgid ""
"Yeah yeah, nice cage. Now, prince — recruit three of your best fighters, and "
"my followers’ wagons will sneak you four into the camp."
msgstr "是是是,笼子不错。好了,王子——招募三名你最精锐的战士,我的手下用马车把你们四个偷偷带进营地。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:336
msgid ""
"You haven’t seen our camp before, but as long as you stay hidden in my "
"wagons you should be able to freely explore. Once you find the chief, kill "
"him!"
msgstr "你没见过我们的营地,但只要一直躲在我的马车里,你就可以自由探索。一旦发现首领,就杀了他!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:344
msgid "Recruit three units to help Konrad infiltrate the orcish camp"
msgstr "招募三个单位,协助康拉德潜入兽人营地"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:351
msgid "Find and defeat the Orcish Sovereign"
msgstr "找到并击败兽人大君"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:362
msgid ""
"Konrad can only recruit or recall during this scenario’s first turn. Next "
"turn, Fagh-mok will sneak all your units into the center of the orcish camp."
msgstr "康拉德只能在本场景的第一个回合招募或召回单位。下一回合,法格-莫克会把你的所有单位偷偷带进兽人营地的中心。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:368
msgid ""
"Konrad’s soldiers are disguised. They will be permanently revealed after any "
"soldier moves adjacent to an enemy."
msgstr "康拉德的士兵处于伪装状态。一旦有士兵移动到敌人旁边,所有伪装将永久解除。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:396
msgid ""
"Just you? You’re going alone? ...fine, pick a wagon, get in, and hide under "
"the hay. My goblins will sneak you inside."
msgstr "就你一个人?你一个人去?……好吧,挑一辆马车,进去,躲到干草下面。我的哥布林会把你带进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. Harness your animals to "
"the front. My goblins will sneak you all inside."
msgstr "准备好了吗?挑一辆马车,进去,躲到干草下面。把你们的牲畜拴到车前。我的哥布林会把你们全带进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:415
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. Yes, even that big rock "
"thing. My goblins will sneak you all inside."
msgstr "准备好了吗?挑一辆马车,进去,躲到干草下面。对,连那块大石头也一样。我的哥布林会把你们全带进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:425
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. Err... maybe we can "
"find something less flammable than hay to cover up that fire thing."
msgstr "准备好了吗?挑一辆马车,进去,躲到干草下面。呃……也许我们可以找点比干草不那么易燃的东西,把那火玩意儿盖住。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:434
msgid ""
"Ready? Pick a wagon, get in, and hide under the hay. My goblins will sneak "
"you all inside."
msgstr "准备好了吗?挑一辆马车,进去,躲到干草下面。我的哥布林会混进营地,把你们全带进去。"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:512
msgid "Wagons at the gate!"
msgstr "门前有马车!"

#. [message]: role=gate_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:517
msgid ""
"That you, Razgob? Glad to see you’re bringing pillage with you this time."
msgstr "是你吗,拉兹戈布?看到你这次带回来劫掠来的东西,真不错。"

#. [message]: role=gate_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:522
msgid ""
"That you, Razgob? Big load of pillage you’ve brought with you this time."
msgstr "是你吗,拉兹戈布?这次你带回来不少劫掠来的东西啊。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:527
msgid "Wagon Driver"
msgstr "赶车人"

#. [message]: role=wagon1
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:529
msgid "(shaking) *squeak*"
msgstr "(瑟瑟发抖)*吱吱*"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:533
msgid ""
"Stupid runtling, quit trembling! What’re you so afraid of? Go on through and "
"get everything to the stockpiles."
msgstr "蠢货小杂种,别抖了!怕什么?快点把东西都搬到储藏堆里去。"

#. [hides]: id=disguised
#. ability given to a wagon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:563
msgid "disguised"
msgstr "伪装的"

#. [hides]: id=disguised
#. ability given to a wagon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:565
msgid "This unit’s mundane exterior conceals assassins within."
msgstr "此单位平凡的外表下,藏着刺客。"

#. [message]: speaker=$spotter_id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:618
msgid ""
"Hey, I think there’s someone hiding inside this wagon! Let’s chase away the "
"driver and break it apart!"
msgstr "嘿,我觉得这辆马车里藏了人!赶跑赶车的,把车拆开!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#. this is the same orc who let Konrad's soldiers in
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:634
msgid "It’s a spy! Which one of you grunts let that worm into our camp?!"
msgstr "是间谍!你们这帮废物里是谁放那条虫子进我们营地的?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:638
msgid ""
"We’re under attack! Check the other wagons! Grab your swords and kill "
"anything that looks out of place!"
msgstr "我们被袭击了!检查其他马车!拿起你们的剑,杀光一切可疑的东西!"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#. [event]
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:649
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:856
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:861
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:897
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:912
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:77
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:37
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/unified_characters.cfg:509
msgid "Konrad"
msgstr "科纳德"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:651
msgid ""
"They’re getting ready for battle! We have to defeat the chief before we’re "
"overwhelmed."
msgstr "他们正在备战!我们得在被冲垮之前先干掉那位首领。"

#. [message]: role=arshag_wolf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:687
msgid "Grrrr! Arf!"
msgstr "呜呜!阿呜!"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#. Arshag is talking to his pet wolf, in the same way that a modern human might talk to a dog
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:692
msgid ""
"Who’s a good girl? Are you a good girl? Are you ready to feast on the bones "
"of our enemies?"
msgstr "谁是好姑娘?你是好姑娘吗?准备好大快朵颐我们敌人的骨头了吗?"

#. [message]: role=arshag_wolf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:696
msgid "Arf! Arf! Woof!"
msgstr "阿呜!阿呜!汪汪!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3b
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:711
msgid ""
"Hurry on past, goblin. I don’t want your stench in my nose while I’m trying "
"to eat."
msgstr "快走,别挡路,哥布林。我吃饭的时候不想闻到你的臭味。"

#. [message]: role=nw_gold_guard
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:728
msgid ""
"That last raid was great! I can’t believe the queen is still finding rebel "
"villages for us to plunder!"
msgstr "上次劫掠太棒了!真不敢相信女王还在给我们找可以洗劫的村庄!"

#. [message]: role=nw_gold_guard
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:732
msgid ""
"Just look at this pile of gold I’ve pillaged! I hope nobody steals my loot "
"while I’m not looking..."
msgstr "瞧瞧我抢来的这堆金子!希望我不在的时候没人偷我的战利品……"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:748
msgid ""
"There are caged animals here, many bearing the brand of a chief. They don’t "
"look very well cared for."
msgstr "这里有圈养的牲畜,许多打着部落首领的烙印。看起来照顾得不太好。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:752
msgid ""
"Let us lift the latch on their fence gate, then quietly leave before anybody "
"notices..."
msgstr "我们悄悄打开他们栅栏的门,趁还没人发现就溜走……"

#. [message]: role=boar_speaker
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:770
msgid ""
"Chief! Chief! Someone opened the pasture gate! Your prize pigs are running "
"free!"
msgstr "首领!首领!有人打开了牧场的门!你的爱猪跑光了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:774
msgid ""
"Imbeciles! You three, go guard the pen and find my pigs. When I find out who "
"was responsible..."
msgstr "白痴!你们三个,去守着围栏,把我的猪找回来。等查出来是谁干的……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:824
msgid ""
"Argh, this place is so boring! Why am I stuck guarding this dumb valley "
"instead of going out on raids? I wish something exciting would finally "
"happen..."
msgstr "啊,这鬼地方太无聊了!我为什么被派在这儿守这条蠢谷,而不是出去打劫?我多希望终于能有点刺激的事发生……"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:840
msgid "Hey, what’re you goblins doing back here? Get lost!"
msgstr "嘿,你们这些哥布林在这儿干什么?滚远点!"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:857
msgid "Look at all those weapons! This must be one of their armories."
msgstr "看看这些武器!这里一定是他们的军械库之一。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:862
msgid ""
"If we can sabotage some without waking that goblin guard, we’ll make it "
"harder for their chief to recruit fighters and respond to our attack."
msgstr "要是我们能在不惊动那个哥布林守卫的情况下破坏几件,他们的首领就更难招募打手、应对我们的进攻了。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:872
msgid "The Orcish Sovereign’s gold has been reduced to 0."
msgstr "兽人君主的黄金已降至0。"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:889
msgid ""
"Where’s that useless worm Fagh-Mok? He’s supposed to take orders from me! "
"But he’s been acting suspiciously lately, and now I can’t find him at all."
msgstr "那个没用的软皮虫子法格-莫克在哪儿?他应该听我指挥才对!但他最近行为可疑,现在我怎么都找不到他了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:893
msgid ""
"I’ll be watching him. He’d better not try anything funny or I’ll chop his "
"head off!"
msgstr "我会盯着他。他最好别耍什么花样,不然我就砍了他的脑袋!"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:898
msgid "That must be the orcish chief. He’s the one we need to kill."
msgstr "那一定是兽人首领。他就是我们需要杀死的。"

#. [message]: role=wagon1 {OR id=Konrad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:913
msgid ""
"We have reached an orcish keep, but our army is still outside. Any attempt "
"to bring them in would only give the orcs time to deploy more soldiers "
"against us."
msgstr "我们已到达一座兽人城堡,但大军仍在大门之外。任何试图把他们带进来的举动,只会给兽人时间调集更多士兵对付我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:937
msgid ""
"You idiot! What’re you doing back here?! You’re supposed to be fighting the "
"chief!"
msgstr "你这个蠢货!你回这儿来干什么?!你应该去跟首领作战才对!"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:943
msgid "Get back in there or our deal’s off!"
msgstr "给我滚回去,不然我们的交易作废!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#. referring to the events from the final scenario of Asheviere's Dogs. Khargol wasn't a named character in that campaign, but perhaps he was one of the random grunts
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:959
msgid ""
"You! You’re that wizard from the battle at Dan’Tonk! The one who did the "
"storm and the lightning."
msgstr "你!你就是丹·冬克战役里那个法师!就是搞出风暴和闪电的那个。"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#. Bazur is an orcish warrior, and the main character of Asheviere's Dogs.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:964
msgid ""
"Bazur always said he wanted a chance to kill you. Now I’ll do what he never "
"could!"
msgstr "巴祖尔总说他有机会就宰了你。现在,我要替他完成他没能完成的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:968
msgid ""
"Those were dark days. Today I end your rule as I shall one day end "
"Asheviere’s!"
msgstr "那是段黑暗的日子。今天我终结你们的统治,就像终有一日我要终结艾什薇尔的统治一样!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:979
msgid ""
"Hey! Do you see that? That’s the thing the queen told us to watch out for!"
msgstr "嘿!你看到那个没?那就是女王让我们提防的东西!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:983
#| msgid "The Sceptre of Fire"
msgid "The Sceptre of Fire! Get it!"
msgstr "圣火权杖"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:994
msgid "Weakling invaders! I’ll kill you all!"
msgstr "没用的入侵软皮子!我要把你们全都杀了!"

#. [message]: role=arshag_wolf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1009
msgid "whimper whimper whimper"
msgstr "呜呜呜 呜呜呜 呜呜呜"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1013
msgid "You’ll pay for that!"
msgstr "你们会付出代价的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1021
msgid "These foes are beyond my strength!"
msgstr "这些敌人超出了我的力量!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1029
msgid "Filthy pinkskins!"
msgstr "脏兮兮的粉皮子!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1037
msgid "Curse you all!"
msgstr "都给我去死!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader6
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1045
msgid "Gah!!"
msgstr "嘎!!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khargol
#. Konrad may not have struck the finishing blow, but it'll be either him or one of his soldiers
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1059
msgid ""
"Impossible! Arr, how shameful to die at the hands of some stupid assassins..."
msgstr "不可能!啊,死在一些蠢刺客手里,真是丢人……"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1069
msgid "Gado-har"
msgstr "嘎多-哈尔"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1074
msgid "Khargol’s dead! The assassins killed our chief!"
msgstr "卡戈尔死了!刺客杀了我们的首领!"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1084
msgid ""
"Now is my chance! Set me free, girl, so I can take command of the horde!"
msgstr "现在正是我的机会!放我出去,丫头,让我去接管大军!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1088
msgid ""
"Set you free? Nice try. You’re not getting out of that cage until Konrad "
"returns."
msgstr "放你出去?想得美。康拉德回来之前,你别想出这个笼子。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1094
msgid ""
"Stupid girl, you think the other orcs are just going to let him walk out? I "
"must take command. Set me free or your friends all die!"
msgstr "蠢丫头,你以为其他兽人会让他就这么大摇大摆地走?我必须接管指挥权。放我出去,不然你的朋友都得死!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1098
msgid "Rrr... insufferable. I don’t know how Mother stands working with orcs."
msgstr "呸……忍无可忍。我真不懂母亲怎么受得了跟兽人合作。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1102
msgid ""
"Go. But don’t you dare betray us, or I swear to personally find you and kill "
"you. If you know anything about me, you’ll know that’s a promise I can keep."
msgstr "走。但你要是敢背叛我们,我发誓要亲自找到你,杀了你。要是你了解我,就该知道,这是我能兑现的承诺。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1122
msgid "Assassins! I’ll get them!"
msgstr "刺客!我来收拾他们!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1127
msgid "You?! What??"
msgstr "你?!什么?!"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1133
msgid "Play dead, you idiot."
msgstr "装死啊,蠢货。"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1152
msgid ""
"Look, everyone! I have slain the invaders and avenged the murder of our "
"chief!"
msgstr "大家都看哪!我杀死了入侵者,为我们的首领报了仇!"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1158
msgid ""
"As head of Khargol’s personal guard, is only right that I assume the late "
"chief’s duties! Long live chief Fagh-mok the Amazing!"
msgstr "作为卡戈尔亲卫的首领,由我来接替前任首领的职责,理所当然!伟大的法格-莫克首领万岁!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1166
msgid "Akhir"
msgstr "阿基尔"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1171
msgid ""
"Fagh-mok? You?! You’re weak! You were nothing more than the chief’s sword-"
"carrier!"
msgstr "法格-莫克?你?!你弱得可怜!你不过是首领的剑奴而已!"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1175
msgid ""
"No, I should be chief instead! Khargol respected me most of all! I followed "
"him from the beginning!"
msgstr "不,该当首领的应该是我才对!卡戈尔最看重我!我从一开始就跟着他!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1180
msgid ""
"No, I should be chief! My warriors are the bravest, and I am the strongest "
"warrior of all!"
msgstr "不,该当首领的是我!我的战士最英勇,而我才是最强的战士!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1184
msgid "Bovrir"
msgstr "博弗瑞"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1189
msgid ""
"Strongest?! I could kill both you AND that ingrate Fagh-Mok, with one hand "
"tied behind my back!"
msgstr "最强?!我绑着一只手,照样能把你和忘恩负义的法格-莫克一起宰了!"

#. [message]: speaker=faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1196
msgid "Oh yeah? Come here and try it, you worthless sack of slime!"
msgstr "哦,是吗?过来试试啊,你这堆没用的软皮泥巴!"

#. [message]: speaker=Arshag
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1200
msgid ""
"I say we kill all three of ’em! Warriors, fight to make me chief and I "
"promise to bathe you all in gold and blood!"
msgstr "我说干脆把三个都宰了!战士们,为我而战、让我当首领,我保证让你们泡在黄金和血水里!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1232
msgid "Hail, Li’sar! I return!"
msgstr "莉莎,我回来了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1236
msgid ""
"The orcich camp echoes with shouts and screams. I take it Fagh-Mok’s bid to "
"become chief has not gone according to plan?"
msgstr "兽人营地里到处是嘶喊与尖叫。我猜,法格-莫克争当首领的企图没有按计划进行?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1240
msgid ""
"Not exactly, no. But at least he held up his end of the bargain, and we "
"ours. Chief Khargol is dead, and until the Whitefangs resolve their "
"succession crisis they’ll be of no aid to Asheviere."
msgstr "也算不上完全做到了吧。但至少他履行了约定,我们也履行了我们的。卡戈尔首领已死,在白牙部族解决他们的继承危机之前,他们是无力帮到艾什薇尔的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/42_A_Crisis_of_Leadership.cfg:1244
msgid ""
"Then we’ve accomplished what we set out to do. Onwards to the next battle."
msgstr "那我们便已完成了此行的目标。继续前进,杀向下一场战斗。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:21
msgid "scenario name^Cliffs of Thoria"
msgstr "索丽亚之崖"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:49
msgid "Drakes"
msgstr "龙人"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:124
msgid "There is 80 gold lying in a cove at the bottom of this waterfall!"
msgstr "瀑布下方的水湾里躺着80点黄金!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:207
msgid ""
"All is quiet. Whatever fight was happening here, it ended before we could "
"intervene."
msgstr "一片寂静。无论这里曾发生过什么战斗,都在我们赶到之前结束了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:214
#| msgid ""
#| "One day they saw a gruesome sight — a fleet of boats and rafts sunk or "
#| "shattered among the river islands. Konrad sent some of the merfolk to "
#| "investigate."
msgid ""
"And the outcome is no mystery — there is a small fleet of boats shattered "
"among the river islands! I shall send a scout to investigate."
msgstr ""
"一天，他们看到了可怕的景象——在河中岛间，一大群航船和小舟沉没或是四分五裂了。"
"科纳德派出了一些人鱼前去调查。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:228
#| msgid ""
#| "One day they saw a gruesome sight — a fleet of boats and rafts sunk or "
#| "shattered among the river islands. Konrad sent some of the merfolk to "
#| "investigate."
msgid ""
"And the outcome is no mystery — there is a small fleet of boats shattered "
"among the river islands! I shall send my familiar to investigate."
msgstr ""
"一天，他们看到了可怕的景象——在河中岛间，一大群航船和小舟沉没或是四分五裂了。"
"科纳德派出了一些人鱼前去调查。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:244
#| msgid ""
#| "These are not proper ships, but shallow-draft boats built only recently; "
#| "much of their timber is green. They were sunk in battle, not by a storm. "
#| "Those that were not capsized have been burned. The battle must have taken "
#| "place not long ago, perhaps only a few weeks past. We’ve found no "
#| "survivors. One more thing...all flew the banner of the Crown of Wesnoth."
msgid ""
"Curious. The wrecks are not of proper ships, but of shallow-draft rafts "
"built only recently; much of their timber is green. Those that were not "
"capsized have been burned. And most curious of all — all flew the banner of "
"Wesnoth."
msgstr ""
"这些不是完全意义上的战船，而是最近才草草造出来的小舟，船上的很多木料还是新"
"的。它们是在战斗中沉没的，而不是被风暴击沉的，没有倾覆的船都被烧毁了。这场战"
"斗肯定是在不久前发生的，也许只是几个星期之前。我们没有发现幸存者。还有一件"
"事……这些船上挂的都是韦诺王国的旗帜。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:248
msgid ""
"Wesnoth! There is only one army of Wesnoth in these lands, and it is the one "
"which I led here to fight you. These must be survivors from the volcano!"
msgstr "韦诺特!这片土地上只有一支韦诺特的军队,就是被我引到这里来与你们为敌的那支。这些人一定是火山逃出来的幸存者!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:252
msgid "I’m afraid they don’t seem to be survivors any longer, Li’sar."
msgstr "恐怕他们再也不能算是幸存者了,莉莎。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:261
msgid "Keh Ohn"
msgstr "克·欧亨"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:269
msgid ""
"Interlopers from the Domain of Men!\n"
"Heed this warning for it is the last I shall offer your kind —\n"
"\n"
"Seek no further trespass of our land across this river.\n"
"Lest you reach only that same end as they who did so before you."
msgstr "人类领地的僭越者!\n听好这个警告,这是我会给你们种族的最后一个——\n\n不要再越过这条河,踏入我族的土地。\n否则,你们只会落得与之前那些僭越者同样的下场。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:277
msgid ""
"A drake! So the winged figures we saw fighting were drakes. You are the ones "
"who destroyed this flotilla?"
msgstr "一只龙蜥!原来我们看到的那些带翅膀的身影是龙蜥。是你们毁掉了这支船队?"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:281
msgid ""
"We are.\n"
"\n"
"For in violation of our Ways, they harvested game from our Domain.\n"
"Then... they took the eggs of drakes... our eggs... as prey.\n"
"\n"
"For such an act, I should grant no leniency.\n"
"Yet long ago, my ancestors once made similar transgressions against your "
"kind.\n"
"So I grant you, who were not directly responsible, your lives.\n"
"Now go."
msgstr "正是如此。\n\n因为他们违背了我族的信条,在我族领地内猎取食物。\n之后……他们取走了龙蜥的蛋……我族之蛋……当作猎物。\n\n对于这样的行径,本不该有任何宽容。\n然而许久以前,我的先祖也曾对你们的种族犯下类似的罪过。\n所以,我把性命留给你们这些并非直接肇祸之人。\n现在,走吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:293
msgid ""
"The soldiers consumed drake eggs? I cannot imagine anyone would be fool "
"enough to do such a thing, unless unknowingly or in extreme starvation. I "
"fear this has been a terrible misunderstanding."
msgstr "士兵吃了龙蜥的蛋?我实在想象不出会有人蠢到做这种事,除非是浑然不觉,或者饿得走投无路。恐怕这是一场可怕的误会。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:297
msgid ""
"The men I trained are skilled and tenacious. If it was possible to survive, "
"they will have. We will go, drake, but you will first turn over any "
"prisoners and allow us to search the river for survivors."
msgstr "我训练的士兵技艺精湛、意志坚韧。如果有可能活下来,他们一定活下来了。龙蜥,我们可以走,但你得先交出所有俘虏,并允许我们沿江搜寻幸存者。"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:301
msgid ""
"Their lives are forfeit.\n"
"All who have preyed upon our young, we shall destroy.\n"
"The matter is decided.\n"
"My decision, final."
msgstr "他们的性命已属我族。\n所有捕食我族幼崽者,我族必将毁灭之。\n此事已定。\n我的决定,即是最终。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:308
msgid ""
"Foul dragon, the decision was never yours to make! If but one soldier of "
"Wesnoth has survived then I am coming to his rescue. Stand in my way only if "
"you seek to do battle."
msgstr "可憎的飞龙,这个决定从来都轮不到你做!只要韦诺特的士兵哪怕还有一人幸存,我就会去救他。只有你想开战,才站到我面前来吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:312
msgid "So be it, fellow contender."
msgstr "如此便好,同行者。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:322
msgid "Find the survivor near the southeast corner of the map."
msgstr "在地图东南角附近找到那名幸存者。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:329
msgid "Then, escort him towards the west edge of the map."
msgstr "之后,护送他前往地图西缘。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:337
msgid "Reach Warven, then escort him towards the west edge of the map."
msgstr "找到华芬,然后护送他前往地图西缘。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:346
msgid "Escort Warven west to the marked hexes."
msgstr "护送华芬向西,前往标记的六角格。"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:353
#| msgid "Death of Kalenz"
msgid "Death of Warven"
msgstr "卡雷兹死亡"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:368
msgid ""
"Warven will remain under player control until the end of the scenario, but "
"will join Li’sar’s side in future scenarios."
msgstr "华芬将在本场景结束前由玩家控制,之后将加入莉莎一方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:383
msgid ""
"I don’t see any enemy keep on the river, but it’s littered with crude "
"dwellings. We should break down the drakish villages to stop them rallying "
"more fighters."
msgstr "我在江上没看到任何敌人的城堡,但沿岸散布着简陋的居所。我们应当捣毁龙蜥的村落,阻止它们召集更多战士。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:403
#| msgid ""
#| "There is a cataract ahead. By the thunder of the water and the height of "
#| "the spume, it must drop several hundred feet at least. We must leave the "
#| "river before we are swept into it, or we will surely perish!"
msgid ""
"There is a cataract ahead. By the thunder of the water and the height of the "
"spume, it must drop several hundred feet at least! To try to sail past this "
"would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"前方有一个大瀑布。水像雷霆一般震响，泡沫也飞起很高，看来它的高度至少有几百英"
"尺。我们必须在被卷进去之前远离河道，否则就死定了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Keh Ohn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:417
msgid "GRRROOOOAAAAR!"
msgstr "嘎啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:423
#| msgid "Hurrah! We’ve killed their leader!"
msgid "Huzzah! We’ve killed their leader!"
msgstr "万岁！我们干掉了他们的首领！"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:428
msgid ""
"Our dominant is slain!\n"
"Gliders, send word to the first intendant of his ascension by fate."
msgstr "我们的主宰陨落了!\n滑翔者,去禀报第一执政,他已蒙天命飞升。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:451
msgid ""
"We’ve slain one of the drakes! Their biology is... wow, incredibly strange — "
"yes, I think there must be some magic in them."
msgstr "我们杀了一只龙蜥!它们的生理构造……哇,奇怪得难以置信——没错,我觉得它们身上一定有什么魔力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:455
msgid ""
"With more specimens, I’m sure I could learn something practical. If you "
"could kill, say, err, thirty drakes — not including this one, that is — then "
"I’m sure their fire could show me how to improve my flashpowder."
msgstr "有了更多样本,我相信我能学到些实用的东西。如果你能杀掉,比如说,呃,三十只龙蜥——当然不包括眼前这只——我相信它们的火焰能告诉我如何改良我的闪光火药。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:476
msgid ""
"That’s fifteen drakes you’ve defeated. I’m already learning so much from "
"dissecting the corpses! Fifteen more and I’m sure I’ll learn something "
"practical."
msgstr "你已经击败了十五只龙蜥。解剖它们的尸体,我已经学到了很多东西!再来十五只,我相信我一定能学到些实用的东西。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:486
msgid ""
"Oh, wow, you defeated all thirty drakes I asked for! These are just... "
"absolutely amazing! Such fascinating creatures! Did you know that each wing "
"contains upwards of seven major arteries?"
msgstr "噢,天哪,你把我要求的三十只龙蜥全都击败了!它们简直……太不可思议了!太迷人的生物了!你知道吗,每一只翅膀里都有七条以上的主动脉?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:490
msgid ""
"Err, and, well, of course I’ve extracted some particular reagents that could "
"be useful on the battlefield as well. As promised."
msgstr "呃,还有,当然,我顺便提取了一些特殊的试剂,在战场上也能派上用场。如我所承诺的那样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:522
msgid ""
"Good, we’ve destroyed one drake beacon. Each one we raze will make it more "
"difficult for them to rally their fighters."
msgstr "好,我们摧毁了一座龙蜥信标。我们每摧毁一座,它们召集战士的难度就会增加一分。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:600
#| msgid ""
#| "It is a young human officer, barely more than a boy. He appears badly "
#| "hurt but still alive."
msgid ""
"Look! I see someone at the top of the furthermost cliff! It’s a young human "
"officer, barely more than a boy. He appears badly hurt but still alive."
msgstr "是一位年轻的人类军官，只比小男孩大一点。他看上去受了重伤，但仍然活着。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:613
msgid ""
"I wonder why the drakes haven’t finished him by now? It is strange that "
"there are not any drakes in that area."
msgstr ""
"我很奇怪为什么龙人到现在还没有干掉他？那个区域里竟然一个龙人都没有，真是太奇"
"怪了。"

#. [message]: type=Water Serpent,Kraken
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:636
msgid "Grrroar"
msgstr "嘎啊啊啊啊啊"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:640
msgid "Well... that answers the question."
msgstr "好吧……这就是问题的答案。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:645
msgid ""
"That young officer is Warven, one of my best lieutenants! He might well be "
"the only survivor of this battle! We must reach him and bring him to safety."
msgstr "那位年轻军官就是华芬,我最出色的副官之一!他很可能就是这场战役中唯一的幸存者!我们必须赶到他身边,把他带到安全的地方。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:648
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:649
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:650
msgid ""
"Must I remind you that he, like all the others who fought us underground, "
"once tried his utmost to kill us? Will he follow you, or will he choose to "
"betray us to Asheviere?"
msgstr "我是不是要提醒你,他和所有那些在地底与我们厮杀的敌人一样,曾拼尽全力要置我们于死地?他会跟随你,还是会选择把我们出卖给艾什薇尔?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:651
msgid ""
"I don’t mean to question your judgement, but wasn’t he trying to kill us not "
"so long ago? He’s one of Asheviere’s! Will he follow you, or will he choose "
"to betray us to the dark queen?"
msgstr "我不是要质疑你的判断,但他不久前不就是在追杀我们吗?他是艾什薇尔的人!他会跟随你,还是会选择把我们出卖给暗之女王?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:652
msgid ""
"What honor is there in the heart of a man who has served Asheviere; who "
"pursued us underground and fought to kill us? Will he follow you, or will he "
"choose to betray us to the dark queen?"
msgstr "一个侍奉艾什薇尔、追我们到地底并要杀我们的人,心中还能有什么荣誉?他会跟随你,还是会选择把我们出卖给暗之女王?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:653
msgid ""
"Not so long ago he was fightin’ underground and trying his best to kill "
"Konrad. How do you think he’s going to join our alliance now? What if he "
"betrays us to the queen?"
msgstr "不久前他还在地底下跟我们厮杀,拼命要杀康拉德。你觉得他现在怎么可能会加入我们的同盟?万一他把我们出卖给女王怎么办?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:654
msgid ""
"Forget not that he, like the others who fought us underground, came north "
"with you to kill Konrad. If rescued shall he join our alliance, or shall he "
"betray us to Asheviere?"
msgstr "切记,他与那些在地底与我们为敌者一样,是随你们北上而来杀康拉德的。得救之后,他会加入我们的同盟,还是会把我们出卖给艾什薇尔?"

#. [companion_message]
#. reference to this fable: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Scorpion_and_the_Frog
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:656
msgid ""
"Aye, so said the scorpion to the frog! Dinnae forget, that ninnyhammerin’ "
"cad tried to kill Konrad not so long ago, same as all them other chuckle-"
"heads who fought us underground! He’ll betray us to Asheviere quick as a "
"wink."
msgstr "是啊,蝎子对青蛙也是这么说的!别忘啦,那个榆木脑袋的混蛋不久前还想害康拉德,跟地底下那些跟咱们厮杀的蠢货们一样!眨眼的工夫他就会把我们出卖给艾什薇尔。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:657
msgid ""
"It’s good to save a life and all, of course. But, err, well, you know, "
"wasn’t he fighting underground trying to kill Konrad not too long ago? Is he "
"going to join our alliance? What if he betrays us to Asheviere?"
msgstr "救下一条命当然是好事,呃,我是说,呃,你知道,他不久前不就是躲在地底下想害康拉德吗?他真的要加入我们的同盟?万一把我们出卖给艾什薇尔怎么办?"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:658
msgid ""
"Dosh don’t think dat be so smart. He was unnerground tryin’ to kill Konrad "
"not too long ago, wasn’t he? Now we want to help him? Dosh thinks he’ll run "
"quick as a wink back to dat queen, an’ we’ll be all da worse for it."
msgstr "多什不觉得这有多聪明。他不久前还躲在地底下想害康拉德,不是吗?现在我们还要帮他?多什觉得他眨眼的工夫就会跑回那个女王那里,咱们只会更倒霉。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:659
msgid ""
"Do not forget that he, like all the others who fought us underground, once "
"tried his utmost to kill me. Will he follow you, or will he choose to betray "
"us to Asheviere?"
msgstr "别忘了,他和其他那些与我们在地底厮杀的敌人一样,曾拼尽全力要置我于死地。他会跟随你们,还是会选择把我们出卖给艾什薇尔?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. "you people" refers to the last speaker - one of Konrad's many possible companions. Kalenz, Chantal, Haldiel, Elrian, Seimus, Harper, Moremirmu, Ulfdain, Jeniver, or Dosh.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:667
msgid ""
"Perhaps he did come to kill you, but he’s loyal to me and did so only at my "
"orders. I don’t question you people who Konrad chooses to put his trust in — "
"please don’t question mine."
msgstr "他或许确实是来杀你的,但他对我忠心耿耿,那只是奉我的命令行事。我不会过问康拉德选择信任谁——也请你们不要过问我的判断。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:673
msgid ""
"Perhaps he did come to kill you, but he’s loyal to me and did so only at my "
"orders. You can trust him."
msgstr "他或许确实是来杀你的,但他对我忠心耿耿,那只是奉我的命令行事。你可以信任他。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:694
#| msgid "Who...who are you? A friend or a foe?"
msgid "Who... who are you? A friend or a foe?"
msgstr "谁……你们是谁？是敌是友？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:698
msgid ""
"We are friends. Don’t worry about it and don’t try to fight us — you are in "
"no condition to fight."
msgstr "我们是朋友。不用担心，也别试图和我们战斗——你这副样子可不能战斗啊。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:702
msgid ""
"Welcome back to the fold, young lieutenant. Let’s get you to the healers."
msgstr "欢迎归来,年轻的中尉。我们赶紧带你去找治疗师。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:706
msgid ""
"General Li’sar — here? Praise Haldric, you’re alive! But... what you doing "
"in league with the false prince?"
msgstr "莉莎将军——在这里?赞美哈尔德里克,你还活着!可……你怎么会和那个假王子勾结在一起?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:710
msgid "Call it a change of heart. You swore an oath to me. Will you follow us?"
msgstr "就当是幡然醒悟吧。你曾向我宣誓效忠。你愿意跟随我们吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:714
#| msgid "Princess Li’sar — here? Your Highness, I am yours to command!"
msgid "Your Highness... Highnesses, I am yours to command."
msgstr "莉莎公主——您在这里？殿下，谨遵您的号令！"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:741
msgid ""
"General... Thank you for rescuing me, but the others are in need of help too."
msgstr "将军……感谢您救了我,但其他人也急需救援。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:745
msgid "Others? There are more survivors!?"
msgstr "其他人?还有其他幸存者!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:749
msgid ""
"Yes, Your Highness! We were only the scouts — trying to find a way back "
"home. If I survive this battle, I can lead you upriver to our camp. They’ll "
"be elated to see that you’ve survived."
msgstr "是的,殿下!我们只是斥候——一直在找回家的路。如果我能活过这一战,我可以带您顺流而上回到我们的营地。看到您幸存下来,他们一定会欣喜若狂的。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:770
msgid ""
"Our foe flees.\n"
"We are victorious."
msgstr "敌人溃逃了。\n我们获胜了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:776
msgid "Warven’s made it to safety! Time to leave, everyone."
msgstr "华芬已经脱离危险了!大家,该撤了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:794
msgid ""
"No! Without him we will never find the other survivors. I’ve failed my duty "
"as commander."
msgstr "不!没有他,我们永远找不到其他幸存者。我辜负了作为指挥官的职责。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:812
msgid ""
"Even the best healing we can administer is no substitute for rest. We must "
"get Warven to safety before his wounds become too much to bear."
msgstr "即便我们能施以最好的治疗,也无法替代休养。我们必须在华芬的伤势恶化到无法承受之前,把他送到安全的地方。"

#. [message]: speaker=Warven
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:819
msgid "Argh... I... can’t—"
msgstr "啊……我……我撑不住了——"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/43_Cliffs_of_Thoria.cfg:824
msgid ""
"No! Without him we will never find the other survivors. I’ve failed my men."
msgstr "不!没有他,我们永远找不到其他幸存者。我对不起我的士兵们。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:20
#| msgid "Underground Channels"
msgid "scenario name^Underground Channels"
msgstr "地下通道"

#. [side]: id=leader3, type=Saurian Javelineer
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:117
msgid "Saurians"
msgstr "蜥蜴人"

#. [side]: id=Haralamdum, type=Ancient Wose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:166
msgid "Woses"
msgstr "沃瑟斯"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:241
msgid ""
"Here we are! Whatever evil lurks within these caves, we shall put an end to "
"it."
msgstr "我们到了!无论这些洞穴里潜伏着什么邪恶,我们都将将它终结。"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:253
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:254
msgid "Konrad, do you hear that sound? Look to the north. I wonder if—"
msgstr "康拉德,你听到那声音了吗?看看北方。我在想,是不是——"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:255
msgid "Konrad, listen. Do you hear that? The trees are moving in the north!"
msgstr "康拉德,听。你听到什么了吗?北边的树林里有动静!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:256
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:257
msgid "Konrad, listen. Do you hear that? Look to the north. Woses!"
msgstr "康拉德,听。你听到什么了吗?往北边看。是树人!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:258
msgid "Whoah, did you hear that? Look north! The trees are moving!"
msgstr "哇哦,你听到那声音没?往北边看!那些树在动!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:259
msgid "Hark to the north, Konrad! There is movement among the trees!"
msgstr "听,北边,康拉德!树丛之中有动静!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:260
msgid "Hey, do you hear that? Look north! Th’ trees are moving!"
msgstr "嘿,你听到那声音没?往北边看!那些树在动!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:261
msgid "Do you hear that? Is — yes! Yes, look! A wose!"
msgstr "你听到什么了吗?是——对!对,看哪!一个树人!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:262
msgid "Hey, Konrad, did you hear dat? I tink dem trees are moving!"
msgstr "嘿,康拉德,你听到那声音没?我觉得那些树在动!"

#. [companion_message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:263
msgid "Delfador, do you hear that? Look to the north. Woses!"
msgstr "德法多,你听到什么了吗?往北边看。是树人!"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Well, I say. Is that young Master Delfador?
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:274
#| msgid ""
#| "Well, I say ... hmm dum har ... young Master Delfador? Harum-alam-alam. "
#| "So it is! Hmm hmm alam ... how is your head?"
msgid "Well, I say ... hmm dum har ... young Master Delfador?"
msgstr ""
"那，我得说……呣，达呣，哈……年轻的德法多大师？哈噜姆-啊拉呣-啊啦呣。对了！呣，"
"呣，啊啦呣……你的头怎么样了？"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. So it is! How is the ambassador? He was here just the other day.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:279
msgid ""
"Harum-alam-alam. So it is! Hmm hmm alam ... how is ... hum ... the "
"ambassador? He was here ... hmm ... just the other day."
msgstr "哈-阿拉姆-阿拉姆。原来如此!嗯嗯阿拉姆……那个……嗯……大使怎么样了?他在这儿……嗯……就在前几天。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:283
msgid ""
"That was many years ago, I’m afraid. You are the woses who once resided at "
"the Grey Grove? I see you have learned the language of men."
msgstr "那已经是很多年前的事了,恐怕。你们就是当年居住在灰林树丛的树人们吧?看来你们已经学会了人类的语言。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Hmm, yes. A very useful language. Now these undead... very troubling.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:288
msgid ""
"Hmm ... yes ... alam ... alam dum ... very useful ... language ... yes ... "
"hum ... now these undead ... harum ... very troubling."
msgstr "嗯……是……阿拉姆……阿拉姆-杜姆……很有用……语言……是……嗯……如今这些死者……哈姆……很麻烦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. I am sure you could help rid us of these infernal undead. Afterwards, we could perhaps help you too.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:293
#| msgid ""
#| "If ... hmm dum ... you could help rid us of these ... alam hurum ... "
#| "infernal undead, I would be ... alam alam ... look to the north and "
#| "east ... hmm ... most grateful. Har alam dum."
msgid ""
"I am sure ... dum hum ... you could help rid us of these ... alam hurum ... "
"infernal undead ... yes, harum-alam-alam. Afterwards, we could perhaps... "
"hmm ... help you too. Har alam dum."
msgstr ""
"如果……呣，哒呣……你们能够帮我们消灭这些……啊啦呣，呼噜……地狱里来的亡灵，我就"
"会……啊啦呣，啊啦呣……往北面和东面找找……呣……很感激的。哈，啊啦呣，达姆。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:301
#| msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgid "Defeat the undead leader"
msgstr "击败敌方首领"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:306
#| msgid "Death of Konrad"
msgid "Death of Haralamdum"
msgstr "科纳德死亡"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:327
msgid ""
"Konrad, this entrance is nearly flooded, and is too narrow for both our "
"armies to enter. My soldiers and I will search for another way in."
msgstr "康拉德,这个入口快被淹了,也太窄,容不下我们的两支军队。我和我的士兵会去找另一条路。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:341
msgid ""
"It’s so exciting to finally see woses up close! I hear they have a "
"spectacular resistance to poison! Wose sap... curing — yes, if I could just "
"extract a bucket of wose sap I’m certain I could learn their secrets."
msgstr "能近距离看到树人,实在令人激动!我听说它们对毒素有着惊人的抗性……树人的树脂……治愈——对,只要我能采集到一桶树人树脂,我相信我一定可以破解它们的秘密。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:345
msgid ""
"Now, err, well, of course sap extraction would be problematic from a live "
"specimen, them being our allies and all. But, ah, we are on a battlefield. "
"<b><i>We</i></b> don’t have to be the ones doing the cutting."
msgstr "现在,呃,嗯,当然了,从活生生的标本上采集树脂就说不通了,毕竟它们是我们的盟友。不过,啊,我们现在可是在战场上。<b><i>我们</i></b>不一定要亲自下刀。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:349
msgid ""
"You’re asking me to help you rob the dead. Don’t you think that’s a bit "
"ghoulish, Jeniver?"
msgstr "你是在让我帮你从死人身上刮东西。你不觉得这有点……食尸鬼气吗,詹妮弗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:353
msgid ""
"But just imagine the possibilities! I ask you to help me stand next to a "
"wose when it dies. If I can, I’m sure — yes I’m sure I can gather enough sap "
"to begin curing poisons."
msgstr "可你想想其中的可能!我想请你在我旁边站好,等树人倒下时就在它身边。如果我能做到,我肯定——我肯定能采集到足够的树脂,开始研制解药。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:362
msgid "It’s falling over! Oh, now’s my chance to collect some sap!"
msgstr "它倒下了!哦,现在正是我采树脂的好机会!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:378
msgid "Antivenom"
msgstr "抗毒血清"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:379
msgid "Jeniver has gained the “<i>cures</i>” ability!"
msgstr "詹妮弗获得了“<i>治愈</i>”能力!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:383
msgid ""
"It works! It works! Oh, I knew it! Now, err, I suppose I’d better quickly "
"get back to the battle before the woses wonder what I was doing with their "
"friend."
msgstr "管用!真的管用!我就知道!现在,呃,我最好赶紧回战场,免得树人伙伴们纳闷我刚才在拿他们的朋友干什么。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Everyone ready? Good. Now that Konrad has distracted them from the west, "
"we’ll push in from the east."
msgstr "大家都准备好了吗?好。既然康拉德已经吸引了他们西边的注意力,我们就从东边压上去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:428
msgid ""
"The river is clean and fresh in this direction. There are no undead to hunt "
"this way."
msgstr "这方向的河水清澈而新鲜。这边没有死者需要猎食。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:454
msgid "Look, saurians! What business do you have in these caves?"
msgstr "看,蜥蜴人!你们到这些洞穴里来做什么?"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:458
msgid "Fssssh! Ssslay you! Ssslay you all!"
msgstr "嘶——杀了你们!把你们全都杀了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:462
msgid "I don’t think diplomacy will get us far with these ones."
msgstr "我想外交手段对这些家伙没什么用。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:477
msgid ""
"The aggressive saurians are vanquished, but the undead are the greater evil "
"here. We must not waver!"
msgstr "好斗的蜥蜴人已被击溃,但死者才是这里更大的邪恶。我们绝不能动摇!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:489
msgid "Master. Is away. I guard. I will fight. Until Iliah. Malal returns."
msgstr "主人。不在。我守卫。我要战斗。直到伊利亚。玛拉尔归来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:493
msgid ""
"Your master Malal is gone, you undead fool! Go back to your eternal rest."
msgstr "你的主人玛拉尔已经不在,你这死而复生的蠢货!回到你的长眠去吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:497
msgid ""
"Iliah-Malal? That is the lich we fought in the swamp. What would one of his "
"minions be doing here? And why is it so powerful!?"
msgstr "伊利亚-玛拉尔?那就是我们在沼泽里交手的那位巫妖。他的爪牙怎么会在这儿?而且为什么如此强大!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. reference to Eastern Invasion's "Dark Sanctuary" scenario
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:502
msgid ""
"It speaks of guarding — perhaps Malal has a sanctuary hidden somewhere else "
"in these hills. I do not think we have time to search for it, though. "
"Perhaps a task for another hero, another time."
msgstr "它说的是守护之事——也许玛拉尔在群山别处还藏着一处圣地。不过我们恐怕没有时间去找了。或许这是留给另一位英雄、另一个时日的任务。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:520
msgid ""
"There is an old book here, labeled <i>“Isaac Mallat — Journal.”</i> The "
"running water has washed away most of the ink, but one passage is still "
"readable..."
msgstr "这里有一本旧书,书上写着<i>“艾萨克·马莱特——手记。”</i>流水冲走了大部分墨迹,但还有一段能读……"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:525
msgid ""
"—died in my arms. My own brother! He could have been saved!! This imbecile "
"king’s quarantine will be the end of us all."
msgstr "——死在了我怀里。我的亲弟弟!他本可以得救!!这个昏庸国王的隔离令,会要了我们所有人的命。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:527
msgid ""
"I’m sure I’m not contagious. I’m sure there’s some way to cure it. If I "
"sneak out of the village and make my way north to—"
msgstr "我肯定不是传染病。我肯定有办法治好的。要是我偷偷溜出村子,一路向北到——"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Well done. Very good.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:547
msgid "Har hum har ... hmm ... well ... har alam dum ... good."
msgstr "哈，哈呣，哈……呣……好……哈，啊啦呣，达呣……很好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:551
msgid ""
"Those undead will bother you no more, Sir Wose. Will you join us? We march "
"towards Weldyn, to depose the dark queen Asheviere."
msgstr "这些死者再也骚扰不了你了,沃瑟爵士。你们愿意加入我们吗?我们正开赴维尔帝,去推翻黑暗女王艾什薇尔。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. March? So hasty. No, we are not soldiers, not at all. And we are not many.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:556
msgid ""
"March? So hasty. Harum-alam-alam ... no, we are not soldiers ... harum ... "
"not at all. And we are not ... hum ... not many."
msgstr "行军?这么急。哈-阿拉姆-阿拉姆……不,我们不是士兵……哈姆……完全不是。我们也不是……嗯……人很多的那种。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:560
msgid "Hmm ... but there was something ... something to help ..."
msgstr "嗯……那里有什么东西……什么能帮上忙的……"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Oh, yes. The dust.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:566
#| msgid "Har dum ... oh, yes, the book."
msgid "Har dum ... oh, yes, the dust."
msgstr "哈，达呣……哦，是的，书。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#. Dust carried by a skeleton. Something magical. I put it— where did I put it...
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:571
msgid ""
"Dust carried ... har alam dum ... by a skeleton. Something magical. I put "
"it ... harum ... where did I put it..."
msgstr "尘埃承载着……哈-阿拉姆-杜姆……由一具骷髅拿着。是魔法之物。我把它放在……哈姆……放在哪儿来着……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:578
msgid ""
"I see it — a pouch of powdered sapphire! A valuable component for all kinds "
"of spells. I used the last of my supply in the defense of Elensefar, and "
"have sorely missed it since. Thank you for your gift, Haralamdum."
msgstr "我看到了——一袋蓝色蓝宝石粉末!那是各类法术的珍贵材料。我在保卫艾尔森法尔时用掉了最后一份,此后一直为缺少它而苦恼。谢谢你的馈赠,哈拉拉姆。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:582
msgid ""
"Konrad, with this I can conjure up powerful earthen elementals. Malal must "
"have stashed it away here. Now it is ours."
msgstr "康拉德,凭这个我可以召唤强大的土元素生物。玛拉尔一定是把它藏在了这里。现在它归我们了。"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:588
#| msgid "You can now recruit Thieves!"
msgid "Delfador can now recruit Granite Golems!"
msgstr "你现在可以征募盗贼了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Haralamdum
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:608
msgid "Harum ... huff ..."
msgstr "哈姆……呼……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:614
msgid "The woses have been defeated! The undead have won."
msgstr "树人被击败了!不死者获得了胜利。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:629
msgid ""
"We should hurry, Konrad. There are storm clouds on the horizon. If we take "
"too long to finish our battle and it starts to rain, this entire cave system "
"might flood."
msgstr "我们得抓紧,康拉德。天边已经聚集起风暴云。要是战斗拖得太久开始下雨,整个洞穴系统都可能被洪水淹没。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:640
msgid ""
"It’s starting to rain, and these caves are about to flood! The undead can "
"survive underwater, but I can’t. Even the merfolk must surface often for "
"air! We’ll have to break off the attack."
msgstr "开始下雨了,这些洞穴眼看要被淹!不死生物能在水下生存,我却不能。就连河族也得经常浮出水面换气!我们只能中止进攻了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/44_Underground_Channels.cfg:645
msgid ""
"It’s starting to rain, and these caves are about to flood! The undead can "
"survive underwater, but I can’t. We’ll have to break off the attack."
msgstr "开始下雨了,这些洞穴眼看要被淹!不死生物能在水下生存,我却不能。我们只能中止进攻了。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:8
msgid "scenario name^Test of the Clans"
msgstr "氏族的考验"

#. [side]: type=Grand Knight, id={ID}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:41
msgid "Plainsmen"
msgstr "平原居民"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:203
msgid ""
"The clans are rich and powerful, even under my mother, and their lands are "
"overflowing with stockpiled supplies. We’ll make better use of it than they "
"would."
msgstr "部族富足而强盛——即便在我的母亲治下也是如此,他们的土地上堆满了囤积的物资。我们把这些物资利用起来,会比他们自己用得更妥当。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:258
msgid "Hail, men of the plains! I greet you with a proposal."
msgstr "平原上的勇士们,向你们致意!我带着一个提议而来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Daryn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:262
msgid ""
"What do these intruders want? We did not invite them here, that is certain."
msgstr "这些入侵者想要什么？我们可没有邀请他们来，这是确定无疑的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:266
msgid ""
"You know that my late uncle, King Garard II, was a friend of the clans. Your "
"knights made up the cream of his army, and were venerated for their service. "
"What prestige do you plainsmen hold under Asheviere, queen of the cities and "
"employer of orcs?"
msgstr "你们应该知道,我的堂叔伽拉德二世国王是部族的朋友。你们的骑士曾是他军队中的精华,他们的功勋备受尊崇。而你们这些平原人,在城邦女王、雇佣兽人的艾什薇尔麾下,又有何等的威望?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:270
#| msgid ""
#| "You are for us or against us. If you do not join us to overthrow the evil "
#| "queen, we will strip you of your power, once the throne is rightfully "
#| "reclaimed."
msgid ""
"Join us to overthrow the evil queen, and I will see the clans restored to "
"prominence within the courts of Weldyn. Oppose us, and I will strip you of "
"your power once the throne is rightfully reclaimed."
msgstr ""
"你们要么与我们并肩作战，要么就是我们的敌人。如果你们不协助我们推翻邪恶女王，"
"那一旦夺回王座，我们就会剥夺你们的权力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Alric
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:276
#| msgid ""
#| "We will not join you. You who are led by these youths and this old man."
msgid ""
"Hah! You think you can seize the throne? You who are led by these youths and "
"this old man?"
msgstr "我们不会加入的。你们这群被小孩子和老头子率领的乌合之众。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:280
msgid ""
"He will confront Asheviere, as he claims. Then he will die. And if we have "
"lent our support it will be all the worse for us."
msgstr "他会如他所言去迎战艾什薇尔,然后死去。而如果我们出了力,那只会让我们自食恶果。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:284
msgid ""
"“These youths”, you dare call us? Don’t think me so weak that I cannot prove "
"my worth in pitched battle."
msgstr "“黄口小儿”?你竟敢这么称呼我们?别以为我软弱得不能在阵战中证明自己的价值。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:288
#| msgid ""
#| "Hah! You think you can seize the throne? Defeat us in battle and we will "
#| "join you, or leave now and never return!"
msgid ""
"Hah! You would challenge us? I accept. Rout our clansmen and we will "
"repudiate the queen. Or otherwise leave now and never return!"
msgstr ""
"哈！你们以为自己可以夺得王座？那好吧，来试试，如果你们能在战斗中击败我们，我"
"们便加入，否则马上滚出这里，永远别再回来！"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:292
msgid ""
"If you will not listen to reason, then so be it. Ready your lances, men of "
"the plains!"
msgstr "既然不听劝,那就如此吧。长矛举起来,平原上的勇士们!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ruga
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:298
msgid "Fools! We will run you down like dogs!"
msgstr "蠢货！我们将把你们打得有如丧家之犬！"

#. [message]: speaker=Daryn
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:302
#| msgid "There is no turning back for you now. This is a fight to the death!"
msgid "There is no turning back for you now. You will not break us!"
msgstr "现在你们可不能反悔了。战斗至死吧！"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#. $clansmen_remaining will be between 1 and 60
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:348
msgid ""
"Defeat 30 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 30 名敌人以击溃骏马诸部(还剩 $clansmen_remaining 名)"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:349
msgid ""
"Defeat 40 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 40 名敌人以击溃骏马诸部(还剩 $clansmen_remaining 名)"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:350
msgid ""
"Defeat 50 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 50 名敌人以击溃骏马诸部(还剩 $clansmen_remaining 名)"

#. [objective]: description={ON_DIFFICULTY4, condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:351
msgid ""
"Defeat 60 enemies to rout the Horse Clans ($clansmen_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "击败 60 名敌人以击溃骏马诸部(还剩 $clansmen_remaining 名)"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:357
msgid ""
"Defeat one or more enemy leaders — defeated leaders will join your recall "
"list after this scenario"
msgstr "击败一名或多名敌方领袖——被击败的领袖将在本场景结束后加入你的召回名单"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:365
msgid ""
"Defeat mounted enemies with Haldiel or Simyr — defeated cavalry will join "
"your recall list after this scenario"
msgstr "用哈尔迪尔或西米尔击败骑兵敌人——被击败的骑兵将在本场景结束后加入你的召回名单"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:375
msgid ""
"Defeat mounted enemies with Haldiel — defeated cavalry will join your recall "
"list after this scenario"
msgstr "用哈尔迪尔击败骑兵敌人——被击败的骑兵将在本场景结束后加入你的召回名单"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:385
msgid ""
"Defeat mounted enemies with Simyr — defeated cavalry will join your recall "
"list after this scenario"
msgstr "用西米尔击败骑兵敌人——被击败的骑兵将在本场景结束后加入你的召回名单"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:407
#| msgid ""
#| "Delfador, this is sheer madness. We cannot afford to play games when we "
#| "should be marching against the Queen."
msgid ""
"This is sheer madness. We cannot afford to wage war against these clansmen "
"when we should be marching against the Queen..."
msgstr ""
"德法多，这简直太疯狂了。我们应该大军开进，打倒女王，而不是在这里玩游戏。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:412
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2102
msgid "Lord Bayar, halt this folly! I challenge you to a personal combat."
msgstr "巴亚尔领主，请终止这种愚蠢的做法！我要求与您进行决斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:416
msgid "Ho! You have amused me, young heir. Ho, ho, challenge indeed."
msgstr "哈！您可真有趣，年轻的继承人。哈，哈，真正的决斗。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:420
msgid "Young heir? Then you assent to my claim?"
msgstr "年轻的继承人？这么说您同意我的主张？"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:424
msgid ""
"Impudence. Bah! Do you see orcs on our plains? Did we not grant you a test "
"of your strength?"
msgstr ""
"真是无礼！呸！你看到我们平原上横行的兽人了么？我们难道没有给你一次检验自己力"
"量的机会么？"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:428
msgid ""
"This is hardly a test. Our battle serves only to spill needless blood and "
"weaken us both."
msgstr "这根本算不上什么考验。我们之间的战争只会白白流血,让双方都元气大伤。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:432
msgid "No, whelp. You may be weakened, but the horse clans are eternal."
msgstr "不,崽子。你们或许已元气大伤,但骏马诸部永恒不灭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:434
#| msgid ""
#| "No, whelp. You may be weakened, but the horse clans are eternal. I will "
#| "promise you this, however. If you can defeat me in battle, I myself will "
#| "join your siege of Weldyn."
msgid ""
"I will promise you this, however. If your forces can defeat me personally, I "
"myself will join your cause."
msgstr ""
"不，小崽子，你们也许会被削弱，但马上氏族是永恒的。不过，我可以向你承诺，如果"
"你能够在战斗中击败我，那我个人会加入你对维尔帝的围攻。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ruga
#. [message]: speaker=Daryn
#. [message]: speaker=Alric
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:440
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:444
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:450
msgid "Aye."
msgstr "没错。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:480
msgid ""
"This is my home, Konrad, and Simyr’s too. Although we were barely men when "
"we left, their Horsemen will still recognize us as kin."
msgstr "这是我的家乡,康拉德,也是西米尔的家乡。虽然我们离开时都还是半大孩子,他们的骑手们仍会认我们作亲人。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:486
msgid ""
"This is my home, Konrad. Although I was barely a man when I left, their "
"Horsemen will still recognize me as kin."
msgstr "这是我的家乡,康拉德。虽然我离开时还是个半大孩子,他们的骑手们仍会认我作亲人。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:492
msgid ""
"Now that their leaders have offered to join our cause, I believe I can "
"convince their fighters as well. Help me defeat Cavalrymen and Horsemen in "
"combat, and I believe I can persuade them to follow their leaders and join "
"you."
msgstr "既然他们的领袖已表示愿意加入我们的事业,我相信我也能说服他们的战士。帮我在战斗中击败骑兵和骑手,我相信我能说服他们追随领袖,加入你们。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:521
msgid "I have persuaded this one to join us in the next battle, Konrad."
msgstr "康拉德,我已说服这一位在下一场战斗中加入我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:529
msgid ""
"This fighter is injured now, but he is willing to join us for our next "
"battle."
msgstr "这名战士目前负伤,但他愿意在下一场战斗中加入我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:537
msgid "Konrad, I have convinced this fighter to join us in our next battle."
msgstr "康拉德,我已说服这名战士在下一场战斗中加入我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#. said by either Haldiel or Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:545
msgid ""
"I have spoken with this one, Konrad. He will join us in the next battle."
msgstr "我已经和这位谈过了,康拉德。下一场战斗他会加入我们。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:609
msgid ""
"How can this be?! You have bested me in combat! Impossible... but true. I "
"will honor my pledge to join your army."
msgstr "怎么可能?!你们在战斗中击败了我!不可能……却是事实。我将信守承诺,加入你们的军队。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:610
msgid ""
"I cannot believe this! You have defeated me, despite everything. I pledge my "
"lance into your service, young ones."
msgstr "难以置信!尽管有重重阻碍,你们还是击败了我。我愿意把我的长枪奉献给你们,年轻人们。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:611
msgid ""
"A heroic battle! Yet in the end I am bested — incredible. I will join you, "
"Konrad and Li’sar."
msgstr "好一场酣战!可到头来我还是输了——难以置信。我将与你们同行,康拉德和莉莎。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:612
msgid ""
"Bah, a humiliating defeat! But a defeat nonetheless. Let it not be said that "
"Sir Rugan is without honor — as agreed, I will join your army."
msgstr "呸,何等耻辱的失败!但毕竟输了。别让世人说鲁根爵士不知荣誉——如约,我将加入你的军队。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:648
msgid ""
"We have defeated many foes — the plainsmen’s resolve is shaken! Only a few "
"more and they will surely break."
msgstr "我们已击败众多敌人——平原人的士气已经动摇!再多歼灭几个,他们必然溃散。"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:665
msgid "Stop! Stop! Our armies can bear this no longer."
msgstr "住手!住手!我们的军队再也撑不下去了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:669
#| msgid "So you admit defeat! You will serve me in fighting the evil queen?"
msgid "So you admit defeat! You assent to my claim and repudiate Asheviere?"
msgstr "你们认输了！你们会为我服务，与邪恶女王作战吗？"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:673
msgid ""
"Indeed — you have humbled us, bearers of the Sceptre. His and Her Royal "
"Highnesses fighting in tandem... perhaps you truly do have a chance at "
"defeating the great queen."
msgstr "确实——你们让我们自愧不如了,权杖的持有者们。两位殿下并肩作战……也许你们当真有机会击败那位强大的女王。"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:677
msgid ""
"The Clans cannot risk all by joining you in your attack on Weldyn, but you "
"have proven yourself — neither shall we join Asheviere in opposition."
msgstr "诸部无法冒着倾覆之险与你们一同进攻维尔帝,但你们已经证明了自己——我们也不会加入艾什薇尔一方与你们为敌。"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:679
msgid ""
"And as a gesture of goodwill, I instead offer you our warchest; a vast "
"reserve of supplies and coin to sustain you on your crusade."
msgstr "而作为一种善意的表示,我愿意把我们的战争基金交予你们;那是一笔庞大的物资与金币储备,足以支撑你们的征途。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:684
#| msgid "You have gained 300 gold!"
msgid "Konrad and Li’sar have each gained 300 gold!"
msgstr "你获得了300枚金币！"

#. [message]: role=clanboss
#. "Her" refers to Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:694
msgid ""
"Now go from this place, and fight with courage. Fight Her as ferociously as "
"you have fought us."
msgstr "现在离开这里,勇敢地去战斗吧。像你们与我们厮杀一样,全力以赴地去与她斗。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/47_Test_of_the_Clans.cfg:715
msgid ""
"Bah, the Sceptre is but a magic staff. Steel is the true test of a ruler."
msgstr "呸,权杖不过是根魔法法杖。钢剑才是检验君主的真正标准。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:10
msgid "scenario name^Dan’Tonk"
msgstr "scenario name^丹·冬克"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:289
msgid ""
"Hello, Isolde. I see my mother’s appointed you regent in Dan’Tonk — "
"congratulations. We were comrades, once. I’m sorry we now find ourselves on "
"opposing sides."
msgstr "你好,伊索尔德。看来母亲已指派你为塔恩要塞的摄政——恭喜。我们曾并肩作战,很遗憾如今我们站在了对立面。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:293
msgid ""
"Hello, Li’sar. I’m sorry too. I never saw you as one to turn against your "
"sovereign; your own kin. ...I suppose it runs in the family."
msgstr "你好,莉莎。我也很遗憾。我从没想过你会反叛你的君主,你自己的至亲。……我想,这是家常便饭。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:297
msgid ""
"You are bold to march out from behind your walls and meet us on the open "
"plain. Are you not worried we will defeat you?"
msgstr "竟敢出城,在开阔平原上与我们对阵,你们真是胆大包天。难道不怕被我们击败吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:301
msgid ""
"Hmph. My whole life, I’ve wanted to live a peaceful life. But there’s always "
"someone causing problems. First it was Garard, then the baron. Outlaws on "
"the isles, elves in the Aethenwood. Always one more thing."
msgstr "哼。我这一辈子就想安安静静过日子。可总有人惹事。先是伽拉德,然后是那个男爵。岛上的亡命之徒,艾瑟森林的精灵。永远都有新的麻烦。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:305
msgid ""
"And now it’s you three. At least you had the courtesy to come to my city — "
"your queen’s city — in person. I can vanquish you and your armies all at "
"once."
msgstr "如今轮到你们三个了。至少你们还算有礼,亲自来到我的城市——你们女王的都城——面前。我可以一次解决你们和你们的军队。"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:335
#| msgid "Defeat Asheviere"
msgid "Defeat Isolde"
msgstr "击败艾什薇尔"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:349
msgid ""
"Gryphons will appear periodically near the northwest corner of the map. They "
"aren’t your allies, but will prefer to attack Isolde’s soldiers when given "
"the choice."
msgstr "狮鹫会定期出现在地图西北角附近。它们不是你的盟友,但在可以选择目标时会优先攻击伊索尔德的士兵。"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:368
msgid "Kraww!!"
msgstr "卡哇!!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:372
msgid "Look, gryphons are attacking soldiers inside the city walls!"
msgstr "看,狮鹫正在攻击城墙内的士兵!"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:376
msgid "These vermin again. What did that dwarf do to rile them up so badly?!"
msgstr "又是这些畜生。那个矮人到底干了什么,把它们惹得这么凶?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:380
msgid ""
"I suspect they have a particular grudge against the soldiers of Dan’Tonk, "
"but we should still do our best to stay out of their way — they remain wild "
"animals."
msgstr "我猜它们对塔恩要塞的驻军怀有特别的敌意,但我们仍应尽量避免与它们照面——它们终究是野性难驯的畜生。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:420
msgid ""
"Li’sar, as a general of Wesnoth you were surely familiar with Dan’Tonk’s "
"defenses. Do you have any insight into its weaknesses? Is there anything we "
"can use against the general?"
msgstr "莉莎,作为韦诺特的将领,你一定熟悉塔恩要塞的防御。你对它的弱点有何见解?有没有什么我们可以拿来对付这位将军的?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. reference to Asheviere's Dogs
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:425
msgid ""
"There was a hidden tunnel, once, but I had it collapsed some years ago. "
"Sorry."
msgstr "那里曾有条密道,但几年前我就让人把它堵死了。抱歉。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:453
msgid "Argh! This is going terribly. Retreat! Retreat!"
msgstr "啊!局势糟透了。撤退!撤退!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:478
msgid ""
"Victory is won. As we expected, Isolde has taken refuge behind the city "
"walls. Her army is defeated, but not broken. We lack the supplies or time to "
"besiege the city proper."
msgstr "胜利在望。不出所料,伊索尔德已退守城墙之后。她的军队虽败,却未溃散。我们既无粮草也无时间真正围攻这座城。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:482
msgid ""
"Maybe we don’t need to, Delfador. Power is a fragile thing, and we’ve shown "
"this entire city — a city that once fought against Asheviere — that the "
"queen is not so unbeatable as she once seemed. I do not think Isolde will be "
"able to leave Dan’Tonk again without risking its revolt."
msgstr "也许不必了,德法多。权力是脆弱的东西,而我们已经向这座全城——这座当年曾起兵反对艾什薇尔的城市——证明,女王并非往日看起来那般不可战胜。我想,伊索尔德今后若敢离开塔恩要塞,恐怕得冒全城反叛的风险。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:486
msgid ""
"That, and also I’ll leave a few of my men behind to destroy the roads and "
"harass any sorties. Dan’Tonk won’t pose any problem when we attack Weldyn."
msgstr "除此之外,我还会留下几名手下破坏道路、袭扰出城之敌。等我们进攻维尔帝时,塔恩要塞就不会再是障碍了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:502
msgid ""
"We’re doing well. If we can keep up the fight for a little longer, I suspect "
"Isolde will be forced to give up the fight."
msgstr "战局对我们有利。再坚持一会儿,我估计伊索尔德会被迫收手。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:509
msgid ""
"You are a more skilled fighter than you look, Konrad. I don’t believe I can "
"defeat you today. It’s time to cut our losses and retreat."
msgstr "你的武艺比看上去更高明,康拉德。今日我恐怕胜不了你。是时候止损撤退了。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/48_Dan_Tonk.cfg:514
msgid ""
"That’s a poor choice, soldiers. I hope you weren’t planning on ever seeing "
"retirement."
msgstr "这可真是个糟糕的选择,士兵们。希望你们没指望能安稳退休。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:11
#| msgid "The Battle for Wesnoth"
msgid "scenario name^The Battle for Wesnoth"
msgstr "韦诺之战"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:144
msgid "Orcish Auxiliaries"
msgstr "兽人援军"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:149
msgid "Shnog"
msgstr "什诺格"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:150
msgid "Agnarz"
msgstr "阿格纳兹"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:151
msgid "Arob"
msgstr "阿罗布"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:212
msgid "Royal Guard"
msgstr "皇家卫兵"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:217
msgid "Asheviere"
msgstr "艾什薇尔"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:218
#| msgid "Sir Alric"
msgid "Sir Aeollet"
msgstr "埃里克爵士"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:219
msgid "Sir Gunter"
msgstr "冈特爵士"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:220
msgid "Sir Aebaud"
msgstr "埃博爵士"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:234
msgid "Beastmaster Burlin"
msgstr "驭兽人布凛"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:428
msgid "Raag!"
msgstr "拉格!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:435
msgid ""
"That orc’s keep will make a perfect staging ground for our attack on the "
"city, Konrad. I’ll move forward and recruit from there once it’s clear. "
"You’re welcome to share, of course."
msgstr "那座兽人城堡将是我们攻城作战的完美集结地,康拉德。等它安全了,我就开拔到那里,在那儿征募人手。当然,你们也可以共享。"

#. [event]: id=sapper_ability_object
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1217
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1218
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1219
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1220
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1221
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1222
msgid "Bridge Guard"
msgstr "守桥卫士"

#. [dummy]: id=sapper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1300
msgid "sapper"
msgstr "工兵"

#. [dummy]: id=sapper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1301
msgid ""
"This unit is carrying explosives. When defeated, it will destroy whatever "
"terrain it is standing on."
msgstr "该单位携带着炸药。被击败时,它将摧毁所站立的地形。"

#. [dummy]: id=sapper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1303
msgid ""
"This unit will not detonate if overkilled by 25 hitpoints or more, as long "
"as the vanquishing damage type is not fire."
msgstr "只要该单位被超出25点生命值以上击倒,且制胜的伤害类型不是火焰,它就不会引爆。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1358
msgid "Ack!"
msgstr "嗬!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1364
msgid ""
"That guard was carrying some kind of strange device! Whatever it was, we "
"slew him with such a mighty blow that he had not the chance to use it."
msgstr "那名守卫带着某种古怪的装置!不管那是什么,我们以雷霆一击打倒了他,他根本没机会动用它。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1369
msgid ""
"Well done! We slew this guard with such a mighty blow that he had not a "
"chance to destroy his bridge."
msgstr "干得好!我们以雷霆一击打倒了这名守卫,他根本没机会炸毁他的桥。"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1388
msgid "The fire is getting to the explosive powder! Your Majesty—"
msgstr "火要烧到火药了!陛下——"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1397
msgid "Argh! Your Majesty... it doesn’t even need to walk..."
msgstr "嗬啊!陛下……它压根不用走路……"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1402
msgid "Argh! Your Majesty... the plan..."
msgstr "嗬啊!陛下……计划……"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1407
msgid "Carry out your orders. Do not disappoint me."
msgstr "照命令行事。别让我失望。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1488
msgid "So. After burning half my fields, these rebels come at last to face me."
msgstr "哦。烧了我一半的田地之后,这些反叛者终于肯来见我了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1493
msgid "So, these rebels come at last to face me."
msgstr "哦,这些反叛者终于肯来见我了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1498
#| msgid ""
#| "Surrender, mother. The land’s blood is spent. I have come to take my "
#| "rightful place."
msgid ""
"Surrender, Mother. The land’s blood is spent. I have come to take my "
"rightful place."
msgstr ""
"投降吧，母后。这片土地已经流尽了鲜血。我来到这里，只是为了夺回属于我的位置。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1502
#| msgid ""
#| "Ahh. My own daughter, a turncoat. So it is true. Such treason my reign "
#| "must endure! But endure it will."
msgid ""
"Ahh. My own daughter, a turncoat. Such treason my reign must endure! But "
"endure it will."
msgstr ""
"啊。我的亲生女儿，一个叛徒！这么说传言是真的了。我竟然要忍受这样的背叛么！但"
"我会忍受的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1506
msgid ""
"The walls of Weldyn are strong. And her allies are many. They will arrive in "
"days — and then you will die."
msgstr "维尔帝的城墙坚不可摧。而且她的盟友众多。他们几天之内就会抵达——然后,你就死定了。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1526
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans, footmen from Dan’Tonk, and orcish hordes from "
"the north now swollen even further with your mage Mirya’s new recruits. We "
"know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士、丹·冬克的步兵,加上北方兽人的大军——如今还膨胀了,靠你的法师米娅的新兵。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1528
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans, footmen from Dan’Tonk, and orcish hordes from "
"the north. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士、丹·冬克的步兵,加上北方兽人的大军。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1529
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans, footmen from Dan’Tonk, and your mage Mirya "
"with her newly-recruited grunts. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士、丹·冬克的步兵,还有你的法师米娅和她新招募的兽人喽啰。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1530
msgid ""
"Footmen from Dan’Tonk, orcish hordes from the north, and your mage Mirya "
"with her newly-recruited grunts. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "丹·冬克的步兵、北方兽人的大军,还有你的法师米娅和她新招募的兽人喽啰。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1531
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans and orcish hordes from the north, now swollen "
"even further with your mage Mirya’s new recruits. We know, and we are "
"prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士,加上北方兽人的大军——如今还膨胀了,靠你的法师米娅的新兵。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1533
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans and footmen from Dan’Tonk. We know, and we are "
"prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士,加上丹·冬克的步兵。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1534
msgid ""
"Footmen from Dan’Tonk and orcish hordes from the north. We know, and we are "
"prepared."
msgstr "丹·冬克的步兵,加上北方兽人的大军。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1535
msgid ""
"Knights from Horse Clans and orcish hordes from the north. We know, and we "
"are prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士,加上北方兽人的大军。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1536
msgid ""
"Footmen from Dan’Tonk and your mage Mirya with her newly-recruited orcs. We "
"know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "丹·冬克的步兵,加上你的法师米娅和她新招募的兽人。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1537
msgid ""
"Knights from the Horse Clans and your mage Mirya with her newly-recruited "
"orcs. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "马部族的骑士,加上你的法师米娅和她新招募的兽人。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1538
msgid ""
"Orcish hordes from the north, now swollen even further with your mage "
"Mirya’s new recruits. We know, and we are prepared."
msgstr "来自北方的兽人大军,如今还膨胀了——靠你的法师米娅的新兵。我们心里有数,早有准备。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1540
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only your mage Mirya "
"and her newly-recruited orcs are still ready to aid you. We did not come "
"here unprepared."
msgstr "没有想象中那么多了。在你所有的盟友中,只有你的法师米娅和她新招募的兽人还准备驰援你。我们可不是有备而来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1541
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only the orcish hordes "
"of the north still stand ready to aid you. We did not come here unprepared."
msgstr "没有想象中那么多了。在你所有的盟友中,只有北方兽人的大军还准备驰援你。我们可不是有备而来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1542
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only the Horse Clans "
"still stand ready to aid you. We did not come here unprepared."
msgstr "没有想象中那么多了。在你所有的盟友中,只有马部族还准备驰援你。我们可不是有备而来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1543
msgid ""
"Fewer than there might have been. Of all your allies, only the footmen of "
"Dan’Tonk still stand ready to aid you. We did not come here unprepared."
msgstr "没有想象中那么多了。在你所有的盟友中,只有丹·冬克的步兵还准备驰援你。我们可不是有备而来。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1545
msgid ""
"What allies, Your Grace? The Horse Clans have turned their backs; Dan’Tonk "
"is barricaded; the orcish clans are embroiled in civil war. Even your mage "
"Mirya is gone. You have nothing more than the forces arrayed before us here."
msgstr "盟友?殿下,马部族已经倒向另一边;丹·冬克紧闭城门;兽人诸族正陷入内战。就连你的法师米娅也不见了踪影。你现在只剩摆在我们面前的这点兵力了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1552
#| msgid ""
#| "How long must the people endure your rule? Give the throne to your "
#| "daughter. She is the rightful heir. We even hold the Sceptre to prove it!"
msgid ""
"How long must the people endure your rule, woman? Give the throne to your "
"daughter. She is the rightful heir. We even hold the Sceptre to prove it!"
msgstr ""
"人民还需要再忍受你的统治多久？把王座让给你的女儿。她才是合法的继承人。我们甚"
"至还有圣火权杖来证明这一点！"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1556
msgid ""
"Delfador! My old tormentor! Treason! Men! Seize them! Kill them! Kill them "
"all!"
msgstr ""
"德法多！哀家多年的眼中钉！这是叛国！来人啊，抓住他们！杀掉他们！统统杀掉！！"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1564
msgid "Defeat Asheviere"
msgstr "击败艾什薇尔"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1583
msgid ""
"It’s you! The dwarf from Gryphon Mountain! I thought you were merely "
"delivering eggs to Asheviere, not fighting for her."
msgstr "是你!狮鹫山的矮人!我还以为你只是给艾什薇尔送蛋的,没想到你是替她作战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Burlin
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1587
msgid "Well, you know what they say: money talks. It’s nothing personal."
msgstr "嗯,俗话说得好:有钱能使鬼推磨。别往心里去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1622
msgid ""
"Their initial attack will be especially powerful, but they will continue "
"reinforcing Asheviere every day or two until she is defeated — or we are."
msgstr "他们的首次进攻将格外强大,但每隔一两天,他们就会不断向艾什薇尔增兵,直到她被击败——或者我们被击败。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mentoring}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1626
msgid ""
"Each wave of attackers will be ready to move and fight the instant they "
"arrive, so we should be careful not to leave our soldiers exposed near the "
"attackers’ entry points."
msgstr "每一波来犯的敌军一到就会立刻投入战斗,所以我们要当心,别让士兵暴露在敌军入口附近。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1634
msgid ""
"Konrad, Asheviere’s allies have prepared a follow-up attack! This wave is "
"not especially powerful, but I suspect that each subsequent follow-up will "
"be more deadly than the last."
msgstr "康拉德,艾什薇尔的盟友发动了后续攻势!这一波攻势还不算特别强大,但我怀疑此后每一波后续攻势都会比上一波更凶险。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1784
msgid ""
"Konrad, I sense a current of magic approaching along the north road. I "
"suspect we will soon encounter that teleporting mage of Asheviere’s, along "
"with her orcish allies and mage followers."
msgstr "康拉德,我感觉到一股魔力正沿着北面的道路逼近。我猜我们很快会遇上艾什薇尔那个会传送的法师,以及她的兽人盟军和法师追随者。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1801
msgid "Ah, we’ve arrived at the perfect time."
msgstr "啊,我们来得正是时候。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1828
msgid ""
"Congratulations on your entry into the queen’s service, orcs. To earn your "
"first payment, bring me the heads of the rebel leaders."
msgstr "恭喜你们加入女王麾下,兽人们。想要领到第一笔酬劳?就把反叛军首领们的脑袋给我拿来。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1837
msgid "You’re a good mage, Mirya. It’s a shame you’re a bad person."
msgstr "你是个好法师,米娅。可惜你是个坏人。"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1845
msgid ""
"Ow! I think it’s time to take my leave. No point dying for the cause when I "
"could live for it instead."
msgstr "哎哟!我想我该闪人了。为了主义送命,不如为了主义活着,你说呢。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#. "Morium libre vintis" doesn't mean anything. It's just some gibberish that sounds like a magic spell.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1851
msgid "You will not leave. Morium libre vintis!"
msgstr "你别想离开。Morium libre vintis!"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1859
msgid "My spell is broken!"
msgstr "我的法术被破解了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1886
msgid ""
"Look, to the west! There is a great plume of dust visible just over the "
"horizon."
msgstr "看,西边!地平线上方可见一团巨大的尘柱。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1891
msgid ""
"That road leads to Dan’Tonk — there must be a column of soldiers marching to "
"my mother’s aid. They’ll be here any moment."
msgstr "那条路通向丹·冬克——那里必定有一队士兵正开赴援救我的母亲。他们随时都会赶到。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1905
msgid ""
"Your Majesty! So Konrad has come, just as you said he would. My army will "
"make short work of him."
msgstr "陛下!康拉德果如您所料,来了。我的军队会很快收拾掉他的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1938
msgid "I’m sorry it had to come to this, Isolde. I respected you."
msgstr "很遗憾事情会发展到这一步,伊索尔德。我曾敬重你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1942
msgid "You picked the wrong side, princess. I’ll try to capture you alive."
msgstr "你站错了队,公主。我会尽量把你生擒。"

#. [message]: speaker=Isolde
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1950
msgid "Don’t surrender, my queen! Do not let my death be in vain!"
msgstr "不要投降,我的女王!别让我的死变得毫无意义!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1969
msgid ""
"I hear the rhythmic beat of war-drums. There is a vast orcish host "
"approaching from the northeast, behind us! They must have come a long way to "
"make war."
msgstr "我听到了战鼓有节奏的轰鸣。一支庞大的兽人大军正从东北方,也就是我们身后逼近!他们一定是跋涉了千里来开战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:1985
msgid ""
"Should’ve taken me up on my offer when you had the chance, Konrad. If I "
"can’t kill the chief, maybe I can still win his favor by killing you!"
msgstr "当时你该接受我的提议的,康拉德。既然我杀不了那位首领,也许杀了你也能讨他欢心!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2015
msgid ""
"Coming here was a poor decision, orc. The dark queen’s reign is at an end. "
"You lash yourself to a sinking ship."
msgstr "兽人,你来这里是个糟糕的决定。暗之女王的统治即将走到尽头,你这是把自己绑在了一条沉船上。"

#. [message]: speaker=Faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2019
msgid "Yeah yeah. Let’s get on with the fighting!"
msgstr "行了行了,别废话了,开打吧!"

#. [message]: speaker=Faghmok
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2027
msgid "Arrrgh! What a waste..."
msgstr "啊……真是一点用处都没有……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2046
msgid ""
"There is a thunder of approaching hooves in the south! The Horse Clans have "
"come."
msgstr "南方传来了隆隆的马蹄声!骏马诸部来了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2064
msgid ""
"Hail, good Asheviere! We have taken the long road and come around by the "
"south to surprise the rebels!"
msgstr "向您致敬,贤明的艾什薇尔!我们绕了远路,从南方迂回过来,准备给叛军一个突袭!"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2068
msgid ""
"More likely you took the long road hoping to miss the worst of the fighting. "
"I expected better, Bayar. We will discuss this after the battle."
msgstr "更有可能的是,你走远路是想避开最激烈的交火。我本以为你会更靠谱些,拜亚。战后我们再好好谈谈这件事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2106
#| msgid "Fools! We will run you down like dogs!"
msgid "Ignore him. Run them down like dogs."
msgstr "蠢货！我们将把你们打得有如丧家之犬！"

#. [message]: speaker=Bayar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2114
msgid "No! I am beaten! Perhaps the dark queen truly can be bested..."
msgstr "不!我被击败了!也许暗之女王真的可以被战胜……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2153
msgid "Mother, I swore to end your reign of evil, and now I shall."
msgstr "母后，我发过誓要终结您的邪恶统治，而现在我就要这样做了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2157
msgid "Daughter, I built this kingdom for you. It has all been for you!"
msgstr "女儿，哀家建立这个王国可都是为了你！只是为了你！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2161
#| msgid ""
#| "Even now, can you not tell the truth? Your greed has corrupted your soul. "
#| "You are a monster! A murderess! It pains me to kill you, mother, but you "
#| "have chosen your own fate. For Wesnoth!"
msgid ""
"Even now, can you not tell the truth? Your greed has corrupted your soul. "
"You are a monster! A murderess! It pains me to kill you, Mother, but you "
"have chosen your own fate. For Wesnoth!"
msgstr ""
"都到了这地步，您就不能说实话么？您的贪婪腐蚀了您的灵魂，您现在已经变成了一个"
"怪物！一个杀人狂！要下杀手让我很痛苦，母后，但这是您自己选择的命运。为了韦"
"诺！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2179
msgid ""
"You have hunted me across the countryside, indeed across the years. Here I "
"am, Dark Queen."
msgstr "你四处追捕我，这么多年来一直四处追捕我。现在我来了，黑暗女王。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2183
msgid ""
"I was sure I had killed you, yet you haunt me still. Be gone, demon! I "
"banish you, ghost!"
msgstr "哀家肯定已经把你杀了的！但你还是缠着哀家！滚开，魔鬼！快滚开，幽灵！"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2187
#| msgid ""
#| "Oh, wretched lady, I am very real. The land has suffered from your greed "
#| "and ambition. You will now be held to account for your misdeeds. For the "
#| "young Prince Konrad! For WESNOTH!"
msgid ""
"Oh, wretched lady, I am very real. The land has suffered from your greed and "
"ambition. You will now be held to account for your misdeeds. For the young "
"Prince Konrad! For WESNOTH!"
msgstr ""
"哦，可怜的女士，我可是实实在在的。这片土地在你的贪婪与野心之下苦苦挣扎，而你"
"现在将要为你的罪行负责。为了小王子科纳德！为了<big>韦诺！</big>"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2205
msgid "As I destroyed your son, I now destroy you."
msgstr "现在我将要毁灭你，如同我毁灭了你的儿子一样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2209
msgid ""
"You were always defiant, wizard, and no one has thwarted my plans as "
"determinedly as you."
msgstr "你总是目中无人，巫师，没有人能像你这样顽固地挫败哀家的计划。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2213
msgid ""
"I have always been a humble servant of the Crown, and remain such even now."
msgstr "我一直是国王最谦恭的仆从，甚至到现在也还是如此。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2217
msgid ""
"Delfador! You utterly disgust me, you sniveling worm. How dare you confront "
"me, your queen?"
msgstr "德法多！你真是令我作呕！你这条鼻涕虫！你怎么敢和哀家，你的女王对抗？"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2221
msgid "How dare I? I, High Provost of the Council of Archmagi..."
msgstr "我怎么敢？我，大法师评议会的高等教长……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2223
#| msgid ""
#| "... bearer of the staff of An-Usrukhar, guardian of the Book of "
#| "Crelanu ..."
msgid ""
"... bearer of the staff of An-Usrukhar, guardian of the book of Crelanu ..."
msgstr "……安-乌斯鲁卡法杖的持有者，克雷拉努之书的守护者……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2225
#| msgid ""
#| "... Mage Protector of The Kingdom Of The Peoples Of The West-North, Chief "
#| "Advisor to the <i>Crown</i>..."
msgid ""
"... Mage Protector of The Kingdom Of The Peoples Of The West-North, Chief "
"Advisor to the Crown..."
msgstr "……西北人民之王国的守护法师，<b>王室</b>的首席顾问……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2227
#| msgid ""
#| "... and personal counselor to my King and my <i>friend</i>, Garard the "
#| "Second, whom you most <i>foully</i> betrayed..."
msgid ""
"... and personal counselor to my King and my friend, Garard the Second, whom "
"you most foully betrayed..."
msgstr ""
"……以及吾王的个人参事。吾王，亦吾<b>挚友</b>，伽拉德二世，你<b>无耻地</b>背叛"
"了他……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador {DELFADOR_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2229
msgid "I am Delfador the Great and TODAY YOU MEET YOUR ATONEMENT!"
msgstr "我是德法多大师，而今天，你——必——须——赎——罪！"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2260
msgid "Treason! The evil ones have slain me!"
msgstr "叛国！恶徒杀了我！"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2265
msgid ""
"For too long has your darkness troubled the world, Asheviere. Your time has "
"come!"
msgstr "你的黑暗侵扰世间已经太久,艾什薇尔。你的时刻到了!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2266
msgid "Vengeance for the fallen! Vengeance for Deoran!"
msgstr "为阵亡者复仇!为德欧兰复仇!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2267
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2268
msgid ""
"The hand of the Clans strikes you down, witch! Vengeance for my king! "
"Vengeance for Garard!"
msgstr "部落之手将你击倒,女巫!为我王复仇!为伽拉德复仇!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2269
msgid ""
"Dark queen, your evil ends this day. In the name of the Light, I purge you "
"from this world!"
msgstr "暗之女王,你的邪恶到此为止了。以光明之名,我将你从这个世界上净化出去!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2270
msgid "Here’s for Baldras! Here’s for Delwyn and Dallben!"
msgstr "为巴德拉斯干杯!为德尔文和达尔本干杯!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2271
msgid ""
"Dinnae recognize me, do ye? You sent me to the gibbet, ye milksop, ye "
"coward! Ah’ll cut that lubberworting head right off yer steamin’ corpse!"
msgstr "不认得我了吧?当年把我送上绞刑架的就是你,你这白痴、你这懦夫!我要把那颗榆木脑袋从你这冒烟的尸体上砍下来!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2272
msgid "Sorry about this! Oh, how did I get caught up in all this?"
msgstr "对不起了!噢,我怎么会稀里糊涂被卷进这一切的?"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2273
msgid "For Alduin! For my friends, my apprentices, and my home! Now burn!"
msgstr "为了奥德温!为了我的朋友、我的学徒、我的家园!燃起来吧!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2274
msgid "For Alduin! For my friends, my family, and my home! Now burn!"
msgstr "为了奥德温!为了我的朋友、我的家人、我的家园!燃起来吧!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2275
msgid "Dis not personal, queen. But Dosh gonna squash you like frog."
msgstr "这不是冲着你个人来的,女王。但多什要把你碾成青蛙一样的烂泥。"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere {ASHEVIERE_VARIATION defeated}
#. "struck by some lowborn grunt" hints to the player that there's messages if Konrad/Lisar/Delfador get the kill
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2280
msgid ""
"Oh, such indignity to have the final blow struck by some lowborn grunt..."
msgstr "噢,何等奇耻大辱,竟要死在一个出身卑微的粗兵手刃之下……"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2288
#| msgid "And so passes Asheviere, the dark queen of Wesnoth."
msgid "And so passes Asheviere, queen of Wesnoth."
msgstr "艾什薇尔，韦诺的黑暗女王，就此死去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2292
msgid "We have won at last! Li’sar! You will be queen!"
msgstr "我们终于胜利了！莉莎！你就要成为女王了！"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar {LISAR_VARIATION glad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2296
#| msgid ""
#| "Yes, but I won’t ever forget what you have done for me, Konrad, Delfador, "
#| "and Kalenz."
msgid ""
"Yes, but I won’t ever forget what you have done for me, Konrad. And you, "
"Delfador."
msgstr "恩，但我永远不会忘记你们为我做的一切，科纳德，德法多，还有卡雷兹。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2301
msgid "So much blood. So much death. For what? A title?"
msgstr "如此多的鲜血流淌，如此多的生命消逝。为了什么？一个头衔？"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2305
msgid ""
"For justice, Elf Lord. We fight because if we do not, evil would prevail. "
"But, I implore you to let the dead have their rest. We have taken victory. "
"Tomorrow is a new day, friends... let us build this kingdom anew."
msgstr ""
"为了正义，精灵领主。我们之所以战斗，是因为如若我们不这样做，那邪恶便会取胜。"
"但，我恳求您让逝者安息。我们胜利了。明天将是崭新的一天，朋友们……让我们重建这"
"个王国吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2310
msgid ""
"We have taken victory. Tomorrow is a new day, friends... let us build this "
"kingdom anew."
msgstr "我们胜利了。明天是崭新的一天,朋友们……让我们重新建设这个王国。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2404
msgid "And so the Dark Queen’s reign was ended."
msgstr "于是,暗之女王的统治就此终结。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2408
#| msgid ""
#| "And so the Dark Queen’s reign was ended. Li’sar, daughter of Garard II "
#| "and Heir to the Throne of Wesnoth, was crowned Queen and Bearer of the "
#| "Sceptre of Fire, which she would pass on to all her successors."
msgid ""
"Li’sar, daughter of Garard II and Heir to the Throne of Wesnoth, was crowned "
"Queen and Bearer of the Sceptre of Fire, which she would pass on to all her "
"successors. Her reign was long, and she undid much of the evil deeds of her "
"mother."
msgstr ""
"就这样，黑暗女王的统治结束了。莉莎，伽拉德二世之女，韦诺王座的继承人，加冕为"
"女王，亦为圣火权杖之持有者。她将会把这一切传给自己所有的后代。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2410
msgid ""
"Delfador became Li’sar’s High Counselor, advising her in the most important "
"matters of state. He lived until a ripe old age and was granted a royal "
"funeral, after which he was buried in the Royal Crypt in Weldyn."
msgstr ""
"德法多成为了莉莎的高等参事，在最重要的国事方面提出睿智的建议。他享年很久，去"
"世之后亦得到了皇家葬礼的礼遇，他被安葬在维尔帝的皇家陵寝中。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2415
#| msgid ""
#| "Kalenz returned to his home in the North and never again returned to the "
#| "lands of men."
msgid ""
"Chantal ventured into the palace dungeons, where she found her great-"
"grandfather Kalenz among many other prisoners. Together they returned to "
"their home in the north and never again came to the lands of men."
msgstr "卡雷兹回到了他在北方的家园，之后再也没有回到过人类的土地上。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2416
#| msgid ""
#| "Kalenz returned to his home in the North and never again returned to the "
#| "lands of men."
msgid ""
"Kalenz and Chantal returned to their homes in the north, and never again "
"came to the lands of men."
msgstr "卡雷兹回到了他在北方的家园，之后再也没有回到过人类的土地上。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2417
#| msgid ""
#| "Kalenz returned to his home in the North and never again returned to the "
#| "lands of men."
msgid ""
"Kalenz returned to his home in the north and never again came to the lands "
"of men."
msgstr "卡雷兹回到了他在北方的家园，之后再也没有回到过人类的土地上。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2418
msgid ""
"Haldiel — and Kaylan — returned to the Horse Plains. With the queen defeated "
"and her supporters among the the Horse Lords disgraced, the returnees gained "
"much clout within the Horse Clans, and enacted reform."
msgstr "哈尔迪尔——连同凯兰——返回了骏马平原。女王败亡,她在骏马领主中的拥趸尽数蒙羞,归来的两位在骏马诸部中声望大增,并推行了改革。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2419
msgid ""
"Haldiel returned to the Horse Plains. The queen’s supporters were "
"embarrassed by her defeat, but Kaylan’s death left Konrad’s allies with no "
"one to rally behind. Change would be slow."
msgstr "哈尔迪尔返回了骏马平原。女王的拥趸们因她的失败而颜面尽失,而凯兰之死又使康拉德一方的盟友群龙无首。变革注定要徐徐图之。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2420
msgid ""
"Moremirmu lived the rest of his days as a wandering warrior, bringing light "
"and hope wherever he went. When at last he fell, he was buried with honors "
"and laid to rest among the other heroes of his order."
msgstr "莫瑞米尔穆余生以游侠战士的身份漂泊四方,所到之处皆带来光明与希望。当他最终倒下的时候,人们以最高礼遇为他下葬,使他得以长眠于自己教团的诸位英雄之间。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2421
msgid ""
"Harper returned to the Three Sisters, where she led her people back to the "
"mainland, to reclaim their ruined hometowns. Delwyn and Dallben were "
"rebuilt, and prospered."
msgstr "哈珀回到了三姐妹岛,带领族人重返大陆,收复被毁的故乡。德尔文与达尔本得以重建,并再度繁荣。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2422
msgid ""
"With Konrad’s blessing, Ulfdain rallied a company of soldiers — dwarves and "
"men both — and set out to fight for Knalga. They were never heard from again."
msgstr "在康拉德的赐福下,乌尔夫戴恩召集了一支士兵的队伍——矮人与人类皆有——出发为纳尔迦而战。此后,再无人听到他们的消息。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2423
msgid ""
"Jeniver swallowed her pride and traveled to Alduin. At Delfador’s insistence "
"she was awarded a professorship, and would go on to contribute greatly to "
"the advancement of alchemy and the training of young minds."
msgstr "珍妮弗放下了自尊,前往奥德温。在德法多的力荐下,她获得了教授职位,此后为炼金术的进步与年轻学子的培养作出了巨大贡献。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2424
msgid ""
"Seimus returned to Alduin, where he was hailed as a hero by many (and "
"reviled by a few). He presided over the academy for many years, where he was "
"often visited by his friend Delfador."
msgstr "塞缪斯返回了奥德温,那里许多人视他为英雄(也有人视他为眼中钉)。他执掌学院多年,好友德法多时常前来探望。"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2428
msgid "His grandparents’ loan was repaid in full, plus interest."
msgstr "外祖父母借出的钱,连本带利还清了。"

#. [then]
#. [else]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2428
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2431
msgid ""
"Inspired by Konrad’s leadership, Elrian forwent his study of magic and "
"instead devoted himself to the study of strategy. In time, he would become "
"one of the Crown’s top generals."
msgstr "受康拉德领导风范的启发,埃尔连放弃了魔法研习,转而专心钻研兵法韬略。日久天长,他成为了王室麾下最杰出的统帅之一。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2434
msgid ""
"Dosh returned to the north, where stories of his battle-feats and "
"exceptional intelligence (for a troll) made him a figure of some renown. In "
"time he accrued enough followers to start his own clan, which he ruled "
"wisely as chief."
msgstr "多什回到了北方,那里流传着他战场上的传奇事迹和(对一个巨魔而言)出人意料的聪明才智,让他颇有名气。日久天长,他聚集了足够的追随者,建立了自己的部落,并作为首领英明治理。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2435
msgid ""
"Konrad kept his promise to Merle, channeling gold and attention towards the "
"Dulatus hills. That place became known as a home of great craftsmen."
msgstr "康拉德兑现了对默尔的承诺,将资金与心血投向杜拉图斯山丘。那地方因此声名远扬,成了能工巧匠的聚集地。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2436
msgid ""
"Jotha eventually returned to his home in the north, this time alongside many "
"other merfolk. The Bay of Jotha (so it came to be called) would grow into a "
"prosperous settlement; a rare jewel of civilization in the northern "
"wildlands."
msgstr "若萨最终返回了北境故里,这一次与他同行的还有许多其他海民。若萨湾(此地因此得名)成长为一座繁荣的聚落;那是北方蛮荒之地中罕见的文明瑰宝。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2437
msgid ""
"Warven, now elevated to Grand Marshal, continued to serve Li’sar loyally for "
"many years. He would one day be crippled in battle, and would retire to "
"teach at Weldyn’s military academy."
msgstr "华芬晋升为大元帅,继续忠心耿耿地效忠莉莎多年。有朝一日,他在战场上身负重伤致残,退隐后到维尔帝的军事学院任教。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2438
msgid ""
"Blackwing the raven, already advanced in age, passed away soon after "
"Asheviere’s demise. He was laid to rest at the Royal Library, in a glass "
"ossuary ornamented with all manner of trinkets and baubles."
msgstr "渡鸦黑翼年事已高,在艾什薇尔离世后不久也寿终而逝。他被安葬在皇家图书馆,一座玻璃骸骨匣中,上面装饰着各式各样的小饰物。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2451
msgid ""
"The prisoners Asheviere had threatened were found and freed, none the worse "
"for their ordeal. Most returned to their homes, singing the new Queen’s "
"praises."
msgstr "艾什薇尔曾威胁的那些囚犯被找到并释放,他们经受磨难却毫发无损。大多数人回到了家乡,传唱着新女王的美名。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2457
#| msgid ""
#| "The bones of the young Prince Konrad were retrieved from the elves and "
#| "buried in the Royal Crypt in Weldyn, which Konrad visited to pay homage "
#| "every week."
msgid ""
"The bones of the infant Prince Konrad were retrieved from the elves and "
"buried in the Royal Crypt in Weldyn, which our Konrad visited to pay homage "
"every week."
msgstr ""
"小王子科纳德的尸骨从精灵那里运了回来，安葬在维尔帝的皇家陵寝中。每个星期，科"
"纳德都会前往吊唁。"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2459
msgid ""
"And as for our Konrad himself... the foundling prince became a noble in "
"Li’sar’s court."
msgstr "而我们的康拉德本人呢……那位弃儿王子,成了莉莎宫廷中的贵族。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2466
msgid ""
"The prince and the queen’s mutual respect grew into friendship, trust, and "
"eventually something more. They were married, and together they had two sons "
"and a daughter."
msgstr "王子与女王之间的相互敬重,逐渐化作友谊、信任,最终更升华为别样深情。两人结为夫妇,共育二子一女。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2470
msgid ""
"They ruled wisely, but some wounds are slow to heal. The croplands "
"surrounding Weldyn would never entirely recover from their razing. The "
"people there grew hard and bitter; that land spawned many outlaws."
msgstr "他们治国英明,但有些创伤需要更久才能愈合。维尔帝周围的农田再也没能从战火中彻底恢复过来。那里的人变得粗粝而愤懑,那片土地滋生了许多亡命之徒。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2474
msgid "But such was the cost of victory, wasn’t it?"
msgstr "可这就是胜利的代价,不是吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2482
msgid ""
"The prince and the queen’s mutual respect grew into friendship, trust, and "
"eventually something more. They were married, and together they had two sons "
"and a daughter. The kingdom once more prospered under their rule."
msgstr "王子与女王之间的相互敬重,逐渐化作友谊、信任,最终更升华为别样深情。两人结为夫妇,共育二子一女。王国在他们的治理下再度繁荣昌盛。"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2486
msgid "All was well."
msgstr "一切安好。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50_The_Battle_for_Wesnoth.cfg:2495
msgid ""
"How unfortunate, for both you and your loved ones. I shall have to make an "
"example of you."
msgstr "真不幸啊,对你,也对你所爱的人们。我只得拿你杀一儆百了。"

#. [scenario]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:5
#| msgid "Everlore"
msgid "Overlook"
msgstr "艾芙洛尔"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Konrad’s once-ragged band of refugees had grown to a massive army. The young "
"prince strode among the ranks, visiting and encouraging soldiers: both his "
"and Li’sar’s."
msgstr "康拉德那支曾经衣衫褴褛的难民队伍,已壮大成一支庞大的军队。年轻的王子在队列间行走,探望并鼓舞士兵们——无论他的,还是莉莎的。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Many had left behind the safety and peace of their homes to make war — his "
"war. The weight of that thought bore on him. Much had changed since the "
"flight from the Aethenwood."
msgstr "许多人已抛下家园的安宁与和平,来打这场战争——他的战争。这份重量压在他的心头。自逃离艾瑟森林以来,一切都变了。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:26
msgid ""
"Although once mortal enemies, the prince and princess had forged an uneasy "
"alliance; perhaps even a friendship. But the question of succession "
"remained. Li’sar held the Sceptre, but Konrad’s claim was strong. The matter "
"could not lie unresolved; not so near to the throne."
msgstr "尽管曾经是不共戴天的死敌,王子与公主还是结成了一种勉强维系的同盟;甚至可以说是友谊。但继承权问题依然悬而未决。莉莎手持权杖,但康拉德的继承主张同样强硬。此事绝不能不了了之——他们离王座已经如此之近。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:30
msgid ""
"Although once mortal enemies, the prince and princess had forged an uneasy "
"alliance; perhaps even a friendship. But the question of succession "
"remained. Konrad held the Sceptre, but Li’sar’s claim was strong. The matter "
"could not lie unresolved; not so near to the throne."
msgstr "尽管曾经是不共戴天的死敌,王子与公主还是结成了一种勉强维系的同盟;甚至可以说是友谊。但继承权问题依然悬而未决。康拉德手持权杖,但莉莎的继承主张同样强硬。此事绝不能不了了之——他们离王座已经如此之近。"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:34
#| msgid ""
#| "We should not speak of it now. Instead come with me, Konrad and Li’sar, "
#| "to the top of Mount Elnar. To look at Weldyn. To make plans for the "
#| "battle, and to talk."
msgid ""
"At length, the rebel army came to the northern shore of the river Weldyn, "
"and paused there. To look at the city. To make plans for the battle, and to "
"talk."
msgstr ""
"我们不该在此谈论这件事。跟我来吧，科纳德、莉莎，跟我来艾尔纳山之巅，来远眺维"
"尔帝，来制定作战计划，还有，来谈谈一些事情。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. this is a lead-in to the main conversation, but also explains to the player why we start the battle next to the river, even though we approached from a different direction on the overworld.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:87
msgid ""
"—and the outskirts are barely a day’s march away. We should approach along "
"the river, to make use of our merfolk and to cover our flank. She’ll cut off "
"our supply chain if we give her the chance."
msgstr "——而且她的近郊离我们不过一天的行军距离。我们应该沿河进军,以利用我们的河族水手,并掩护侧翼。只要给她机会,她就会切断我们的补给线。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#. this is a lead-in to the main conversation, but also explains to the player why we start the battle next to the river, even though we approached from a different direction on the overworld.
#. out of character, we start next to the river so that the player has a chance to use their merfolk, if any
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:94
msgid ""
"—and the outskirts are barely a day’s march away. We should approach from "
"the northeast, using the river to cover our flank. She’ll cut off our supply "
"chain if we give her the chance."
msgstr "——而且她的近郊离我们不过一天的行军距离。我们应该从东北方向逼近,借河水掩护侧翼。只要给她机会,她就会切断我们的补给线。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:100
msgid ""
"The prisoners could be a problem, if she threatens them to try to force our "
"surrender. But I don’t think it will come to that. She knows we’re not so "
"foolish as to give in."
msgstr "那些俘虏可能会成为隐患,如果她拿他们威胁我们、想迫使我们投降的话。但我认为不会发展到那一步。她知道我们没那么愚蠢,不会屈服。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:112
msgid "Delfador, what do you think? You’ve been very quiet recently."
msgstr "德法多,你怎么看?你最近一直沉默不语。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:116
#| msgid ""
#| "Here we overlook the city of Weldyn. The great city. The ancient city. "
#| "The city of evil. The city of good. The city of men."
msgid ""
"Weldyn. The great city. The ancient city. The city of evil. The city of "
"good. The city of men."
msgstr ""
"在这儿可以鸟瞰维尔帝城，伟大之城，古老之城，邪恶之城，良善之城，人类之城。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:124
#| msgid ""
#| "I have not looked upon this city for twenty-one years. Twenty-one years "
#| "ago, when I should have been at the height of my power. But my strength "
#| "failed me. I failed, and I cannot atone for it."
msgid ""
"I have not looked upon that city for seventeen years, Konrad. Seventeen "
"years ago, when I should have been at the height of my power. But my "
"strength failed me. I failed, and I cannot atone for it."
msgstr ""
"整整二十一年了，我都没有再望过这座城市一眼。二十一年前, 那本该是我的法力最巅"
"峰的时候。但我的法力还是不够。我战败了，那场失败是无可弥补的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:129
msgid ""
"You could not defeat Asheviere, I know. But you rescued me. That was no "
"failure."
msgstr "我知道你无法击败艾什薇尔。但你救出了我。那绝不是失败。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:133
msgid "You do not understand."
msgstr "你并不明白。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:145
#| msgid ""
#| "The battle had been long and hard. We had been defeated. Eldred was "
#| "slain, but I knew that Asheviere’s wrath would be great. That many "
#| "innocents would be slain. I had to save the monarchy. I had to save the "
#| "princes. I made haste to Weldyn, before the guards of Asheviere could get "
#| "there, to carry out their evil orders."
msgid ""
"The battle had been long and hard. We had been defeated. Eldred was slain, "
"but I knew that Asheviere’s wrath would be great. That many innocents would "
"be slain."
msgstr ""
"那场战斗，漫长而艰苦，我军最终兵败。埃雷德是被杀了，但我知道艾什薇尔的愤怒将"
"会无比恐怖，很多无辜者都将被她杀害。我必须保住这个国家的君主，我必须保住王子"
"们。我必须尽快赶到维尔帝，在艾什薇尔的卫兵赶到那儿并执行他们邪恶的命令之前。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:147
#| msgid ""
#| "The battle had been long and hard. We had been defeated. Eldred was "
#| "slain, but I knew that Asheviere’s wrath would be great. That many "
#| "innocents would be slain. I had to save the monarchy. I had to save the "
#| "princes. I made haste to Weldyn, before the guards of Asheviere could get "
#| "there, to carry out their evil orders."
msgid ""
"I had to save the monarchy. I had to save the princes. I made haste to "
"Weldyn, before the guards of Asheviere could get there, to carry out their "
"evil orders."
msgstr ""
"那场战斗，漫长而艰苦，我军最终兵败。埃雷德是被杀了，但我知道艾什薇尔的愤怒将"
"会无比恐怖，很多无辜者都将被她杀害。我必须保住这个国家的君主，我必须保住王子"
"们。我必须尽快赶到维尔帝，在艾什薇尔的卫兵赶到那儿并执行他们邪恶的命令之前。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:151
#| msgid ""
#| "But I failed. I was too late. I entered the chambers of the youngest "
#| "prince, Prince Konrad, just as one of the evil ones ran him through. All "
#| "was lost. The heirs were slain. Only Asheviere and her daughter had any "
#| "claim to the throne."
msgid ""
"But I failed. I was too late. I entered the chambers of the youngest prince, "
"Prince Konrad, just as one of the evil ones ran him through."
msgstr ""
"但我失败了。太迟了，我冲进了最幼小的王子，科纳德王子的卧室，正是那一刻一个恶"
"徒用剑刺穿了他的心脏。一切都完了。所有的继承人都被杀了。只有艾什薇尔和她的女"
"儿才有资格得到王座了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:153
msgid ""
"All was lost. The heirs were slain. Only Asheviere and her daughter had any "
"claim to the throne."
msgstr "一切都完了。继承人全部遇害。只有艾什薇尔和她的女儿,才对王座拥有继承权。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION concerned}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:157
msgid "I am not dead, Delfador. What is this you’re saying!?"
msgstr "我没有死,德法多。你说的是什么!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:161
msgid ""
"Of course, you are surprised by this, but it is the truth. In haste, I "
"vanquished the evil ones who had committed this foul deed. Then I took the "
"little prince’s broken body, and away I rode. Far away, to the land of the "
"elves."
msgstr ""
"当然，你们会很惊讶，但这就是事实。匆忙之中，我打倒了做出如此卑劣之事的恶徒"
"们。而后我带着小王子的遗体，骑马离开。我逃到了很远的地方，到了精灵们的领地"
"上。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:165
#| msgid ""
#| "By strange and mysterious fortune, the Elf Lady Parandra had come across "
#| "a human child. She knew not where he had come from, only that the orcs "
#| "would have eaten him if it weren’t for her intervention. The elves felt "
#| "that great fortune smiled upon this man-child. Perhaps that is why this "
#| "most truthful of peoples agreed to my plan."
msgid ""
"By strange and mysterious fortune, the Elf Lady Parandra had come across a "
"human child. She knew not where he had come from, only that the orcs would "
"have eaten him if it weren’t for her intervention."
msgstr ""
"造化弄人，那时精灵女领主帕兰德拉偶然救回了一个人类男婴。她也不知道这个孩子来"
"自何方，只知道如果不是因为自己出手相救，他已经被兽人们吃掉了。精灵们觉得命运"
"女神正向着这人类的孩子微笑。也许这就是这些最真诚的人会同意我的计划的原因。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:167
msgid ""
"The elves felt that great fortune smiled upon this nameless child. Perhaps "
"that is why this most truthful of peoples agreed to my plan."
msgstr "精灵们觉得大幸垂青了这个无名孩童。也许正因如此,这个最为诚实的民族才会同意我的计划。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:171
#| msgid ""
#| "After burying the little prince, we agreed never to speak of him again. "
#| "Instead, this orphan child we would call Konrad, and he would be brought "
#| "up to be king. I would say that I had slain the guards before they had "
#| "carried out their evil deed, instead of after. No one would ever have to "
#| "know. And no one did know for certain, until now."
msgid ""
"After burying the little prince, we agreed never to speak of him again. "
"Instead, this orphan child we would call Konrad, and he would be brought up "
"to be king."
msgstr ""
"我们埋葬了小王子的尸体，并约定再也不提起他。取而代之地，我们将把这个孤儿称作"
"科纳德，而他将被抚养成人，成为国王。我将会说，我是在守卫们干出卑劣之事之前杀"
"死了他们，而不是之后。没有人会需要知道真相，也没有人确切地知道真相，直到现在"
"为止。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:173
#| msgid ""
#| "After burying the little prince, we agreed never to speak of him again. "
#| "Instead, this orphan child we would call Konrad, and he would be brought "
#| "up to be king. I would say that I had slain the guards before they had "
#| "carried out their evil deed, instead of after. No one would ever have to "
#| "know. And no one did know for certain, until now."
msgid ""
"I would say that I had slain the guards before they had carried out their "
"evil deed, instead of after. No one would ever have to know. And no one did "
"know for certain, until now."
msgstr ""
"我们埋葬了小王子的尸体，并约定再也不提起他。取而代之地，我们将把这个孤儿称作"
"科纳德，而他将被抚养成人，成为国王。我将会说，我是在守卫们干出卑劣之事之前杀"
"死了他们，而不是之后。没有人会需要知道真相，也没有人确切地知道真相，直到现在"
"为止。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:183
#| msgid ""
#| "I had thought that we could one day make you king, Konrad. But now I see "
#| "that fate has made a different choice. That despite all of Asheviere’s "
#| "evil, this Li’sar is fit for the throne. She is the rightful queen, from "
#| "a long line of kings, stretching all the way back to the seafarers of old "
#| "from the west."
msgid ""
"I had thought that we could one day make you king, Konrad. But now I see "
"that fate has made a different choice. That despite all of Asheviere’s evil, "
"this Li’sar is fit for the throne."
msgstr ""
"我曾经以为总有一天我们可以让你成为国王，科纳德。但现在我知道了，命运之神做出"
"了一个不同的选择。尽管艾什薇尔无比邪恶，但莉莎却有着得到王座所必须的美德。她"
"才是合法的女王，她的血统可以沿着韦诺的历代国王向上追溯，一直追溯到那群来自西"
"方的海上漂泊者们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:188
#| msgid ""
#| "I had thought that we could one day make you king, Konrad. But now I see "
#| "that fate has made a different choice. That despite all of Asheviere’s "
#| "evil, this Li’sar is fit for the throne. She is the rightful queen, from "
#| "a long line of kings, stretching all the way back to the seafarers of old "
#| "from the west."
msgid ""
"Parandra was right. Li’sar... Li’sar is the rightful queen. From a long line "
"of kings, stretching all the way back to the seafarers of old from the west."
msgstr ""
"我曾经以为总有一天我们可以让你成为国王，科纳德。但现在我知道了，命运之神做出"
"了一个不同的选择。尽管艾什薇尔无比邪恶，但莉莎却有着得到王座所必须的美德。她"
"才是合法的女王，她的血统可以沿着韦诺的历代国王向上追溯，一直追溯到那群来自西"
"方的海上漂泊者们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:193
msgid ""
"Li’sar... Li’sar is the rightful queen. From a long line of kings, "
"stretching all the way back to the seafarers of old from the west."
msgstr "莉莎……莉莎才是名正言顺的女王。她出自一个源远流长的王室血脉,一直可以追溯到古代西方那些航海者。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:199
msgid "Li’sar... The rightful queen..."
msgstr "莉莎……名正言顺的女王……"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:203
msgid ""
"Delfador, I am honored. And Konrad... I’m just as surprised by this "
"revelation as are you. In truth, you’d nearly had me convinced we were of "
"one blood. I can’t call you my cousin any more, now."
msgstr "德法多,我深感荣幸。至于你,康拉德……对于这一身世,我与你一样惊讶。说实话,你几乎就要让我相信我们是同族血脉了。我不能再叫你堂弟了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:211
msgid ""
"Then call me a friend. I was ready to be king. But in our time together I "
"have come to agree with Delfador — you will make a good queen."
msgstr "那你就叫我朋友吧。我本已准备好称王。但在与你共度的时日里,我渐渐认同了德法多的看法——你会是一位出色的女王。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:215
msgid "It is decided."
msgstr "就这么定了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/scenarios/50x_Overlook.cfg:220
msgid ""
"Now, let us not tarry here any longer! The dawn breaks! The time has come "
"for the heir to the throne to claim it!"
msgstr ""
"现在，我们不能继续在这里耽搁了！就要破晓了！王座的继承人夺回王座的时刻来临"
"了！"

#. [terrain_type]: id=impassable_fence
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/terrain.cfg:7
msgid "Impassable Fence"
msgstr "无法穿越的围栏"

#. [terrain_type]: id=web
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/terrain.cfg:16
msgid "Spiderweb"
msgstr "蛛网"

#. [terrain_type]: id=dummy_obstacle
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/terrain.cfg:27
msgid "Point of Interest"
msgstr "关注点"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Bloodaxe, race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:18
msgid ""
"According to legend, the mystical bloodaxes were forged at the dawn of time "
"in the great stone-fires of Dhur Darihm, when all Irdya was still drowned in "
"flame and soot. It is with them that the first dwarves made war against the "
"troll-mother, laying low her people and forevermore claiming dominion in the "
"underearth."
msgstr "传说,神秘的血斧锻造于时间之初的杜尔·达林伟大石火之中,那时整个尔迪亚仍淹没在烈焰与浓烟里。初生的矮人正是手持它们向巨魔之母开战,击溃她的子民,从此永久地主宰了地下世界。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dwarvish Bloodaxe, race=dwarf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:20
msgid ""
"While the truth of this legend is a matter of debate, battlefield reports "
"leave no doubt that such weapons exist, and that they confer great "
"resilience upon their wielder. The dwarves’ few remaining bloodaxes are "
"jealously guarded, passed down from father to son and reclaimed from the "
"fallen even at great cost."
msgstr "关于这条传说真假如何尚有争议,但战场上的报告毫无疑问地证明,这样的武器确实存在,并且赋予持有者极大的韧性。矮人仅存的几柄血斧被如奉珍宝,从父亲传给儿子,哪怕付出巨大代价也要从阵亡者手中夺回。"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#. [object]: id=bloodaxe
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Dwarvish_Bloodaxe.cfg:32
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:365
msgid "bloodaxe"
msgstr "血斧"

#. [dummy]: id=march
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elite_Units.cfg:12
msgid "march"
msgstr "行军"

#. [dummy]: id=march
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elite_Units.cfg:13
msgid ""
"This unit has improved movement on forest, cave, hill, mountain, frozen, and "
"water terrain."
msgstr "该单位在森林、洞穴、丘陵、山地、冻土和水面上移动能力增强。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Elvish Civilian, race=elf, gender=male,female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:4
msgid "Elvish Civilian"
msgstr "精灵平民"

#. [unit_type]: id=Elvish Civilian, race=elf, gender=male,female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Although elves are not warlike by nature, their natural grace ensures that "
"even untrained they have talent for swords and bows. However, if you are "
"hurling civilians at your foes, you’re clearly out of superior forces."
msgstr "精灵虽天性不喜战争,但他们天生的优雅确保了即便未经训练,也具备剑与弓的天赋。不过,如果你是把平民往敌人脸上砸,那你显然是兵力不足了。"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:22
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:32
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:30
msgid "sword"
msgstr "剑"

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:31
msgid "bow"
msgstr "弓"

#. [male]: gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:42
msgid "male^Elvish Civilian"
msgstr "精灵平民(男)"

#. [female]: gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Elvish_Civilian.cfg:90
msgid "female^Elvish Civilian"
msgstr "精灵平民(女)"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dark Queen, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:4
msgid "female^Dark Queen"
msgstr "黑暗女王"

#. [unit_type]: id=Dark Queen, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:27
#| msgid ""
#| "The evil queen Asheviere has terrorized Wesnoth for many years. Her "
#| "knowledge of magic makes her a worthy foe in combat, although her power "
#| "is mostly derived from those she commands."
msgid ""
"The evil Queen Asheviere has terrorized Wesnoth for many years. Her "
"knowledge of magic makes her a worthy foe in combat, although her power is "
"mostly derived from those she commands."
msgstr ""
"邪恶的母后艾什薇尔将韦诺陷于恐怖之中已经有很多年了。在战斗中，她的魔法知识使"
"得她成为了一名战斗好手，虽然她的力量最主要地还是来自于她麾下的部队。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:32
msgid "scepter"
msgstr "权杖"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:43
msgid "stiletto"
msgstr "细剑"

#. [attack]: type=cold
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:58
msgid "raging blizzard"
msgstr "狂怒暴雪"

#. [variation]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Dark_Queen.cfg:141
msgid "defeated"
msgstr "败战的"

#. [unit_type]: id=Delfador, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:8
msgid "Elder Mage"
msgstr "大法师"

#. [unit_type]: id=Delfador, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:24
msgid ""
"After years of careful study and hard-won experience, the knowledge and "
"wisdom of an Elder Mage have grown beyond compare. Though the ravages of "
"time have seen their power a little diminished, an Elder Mage nevertheless "
"retains a dominating presence on the battlefield, calling devastating blasts "
"of lightning down upon their foes."
msgstr "经过多年精心的研习与来之不易的经验,大法师的学识与智慧已臻至无可比拟的境界。虽说岁月的侵蚀使他们的力量略有衰减,大法师依然保有战场上无可匹敌的威势,向敌人降下毁天灭地的雷霆。"

#. [dummy]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:71
msgid "levitate"
msgstr "漂浮"

#. [dummy]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:72
msgid ""
"This unit ignores most movement costs, bypasses Zone of Control, and always "
"has at least 50% defense."
msgstr "该单位忽略大部分移动消耗,可无视控制区,且防御力至少为50%。"

#. [leadership]: id=summoner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:84
msgid "summoner"
msgstr "召唤师"

#. [leadership]: id=summoner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:85
msgid ""
"This unit is a skilled summoner. Adjacent allied elementals deal +100% "
"damage and gain +100% experience."
msgstr "该单位是位高明的召唤师。相邻的友方元素生物伤害提高100%,且经验获取提高100%。"

#. [leadership]: id=summoner
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:87
msgid "Recruited elementals dissipate at the end of each scenario."
msgstr "征召来的元素生物在每个情景结束时消散。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:146
msgid "staff"
msgstr "法杖"

#. [attack]: type=fire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:155
msgid "lightning"
msgstr "闪电"

#. [dummy]: id=chain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:163
msgid "chain"
msgstr "锁链"

#. [dummy]: id=chain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Delfador_Elder_Mage.cfg:164
msgid ""
"This attack can be used multiple times on offense, but consecutive uses "
"strike one fewer time."
msgstr "此次攻击在进攻时可多次使用,但连续使用时每次少一击。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Injured Lieutenant
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Injured_Lieutenant.cfg:7
msgid "Injured Lieutenant"
msgstr "负伤尉官"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:264
msgid "smoke"
msgstr "烟雾"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:265
msgid ""
"Hit or miss, this attack creates a cloud of cloying, caustic smoke on the "
"targeted hex. Any unit inside suffers halved chance-to-hit and can no longer "
"enforce a zone of control. The cloud lasts until the start of this unit’s "
"next turn."
msgstr "无论命中与否,此次攻击都会在目标格上生成一片黏稠腐蚀的烟雾。处于烟雾中的任何单位命中概率减半,且无法维持控制区。烟雾将持续到该单位下一回合开始为止。"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:267
msgid "<i>Magical</i> attacks are unaffected by smoke."
msgstr "<i>魔法</i>攻击不受烟雾影响。"

#. [dummy]: id=smoke
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:268
msgid ""
"This unit’s attacks create clouds of caustic smoke, halving chance-to-hit "
"and nullifying zone of control for any unit caught inside."
msgstr "该单位的攻击会生成一片腐蚀烟雾,使被困其中的任何单位命中概率减半,且无法维持控制区。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Alchemist, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:274
msgid "Alchemist"
msgstr "炼金术士"

#. [unit_type]: id=Alchemist, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:290
msgid ""
"In contrast with more overtly magical fields of scholarship, practitioners "
"of alchemy are concerned with the study of physical matter — especially "
"herbs, minerals, and the four humors."
msgstr "与更明显的魔法学术领域不同,炼金术士关注的是对物质本身的研究——尤其是草药、矿物与四大体液。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Alchemist, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:292
msgid ""
"The ultimate aim of such practice is, of course, the transmutation of lead "
"into gold. Though several have claimed to have achieved this milestone in "
"the past, no conclusive evidence has ever been presented, and the practice "
"as a whole is often derided as the pastime of frauds — at least in the eye "
"of the more traditional orders of magery."
msgstr "这种修行法最终的宗旨,当然是将铅点化为金。尽管过去已有人声称达到了这一境界,却从未拿出确凿的证据。整个炼金术常常被人嘲讽为骗子的消遣——至少在更传统的法师组织眼中如此。"

#. [dummy]: id=transmutation
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:299
msgid "transmutation"
msgstr "嬗变"

#. [dummy]: id=transmutation
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:300
msgid "This unit generates 5 gold each turn."
msgstr "该单位每回合产生5点黄金。"

#. [attack]: type=fire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:307
msgid "flashpowder"
msgstr "闪光火药"

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Jeniver.cfg:321
msgid "blowgun"
msgstr "吹箭"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:4
msgid "Fighter"
msgstr "战士"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:21
#| msgid ""
#| "Young and brash, Fighters attack with a sword, and are vulnerable to more "
#| "seasoned enemies. However, they have the potential to become great "
#| "warriors one day."
msgid ""
"Young and brash, Fighters attack with a sword, and are vulnerable to more "
"seasoned enemies. At this early age, their greatest value is their potential."
msgstr ""
"战士年轻而又性急，他们使用剑来攻击，很容易受到更有经验的敌人的伤害。尽管如"
"此，他们仍然拥有在未来某天成为伟大武士的潜力。"

#. [variation]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:87
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:128
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:126
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:138
#| msgid "with sceptre"
msgid "with axe"
msgstr "持有权杖"

#. [variation]
#. [variation]: race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:95
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:137
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:134
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:146
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:62
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:101
msgid "with sceptre"
msgstr "持有权杖"

#. [variation]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1.cfg:103
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:146
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:142
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:154
#| msgid "with sceptre"
msgid "with axe and sceptre"
msgstr "持有权杖"

#. [unit_type]: id=Sleeping_Fighter, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1_Sleeping.cfg:5
#| msgid "Sleeping Gryphon"
msgid "Sleeping Fighter"
msgstr "沉睡狮鹫"

#. [unit_type]: id=Unarmed_Fighter, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L1_Unarmed.cfg:5
#| msgid "Fighter"
msgid "Unarmed Fighter"
msgstr "战士"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:4
msgid "Captain"
msgstr "队长"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L2.cfg:21
msgid ""
"In the elven school of thought, Captains should be trained in navigating "
"small skirmishes rather than large-scale battles, and are often observed to "
"lead through camaraderie rather than coercion. These commanders typically "
"lead small units that remain together for extended periods of time, allowing "
"them to personally mentor and befriend their troops. Honing their mind and "
"body alike, the most capable of these elf-trained leaders complement their "
"improved swordsmanship with an uncanny accuracy at archery."
msgstr "在精灵的军事学说中,队长应从小规模冲突的指挥入手而非大规模会战,他们往往凭借战友情谊而非威逼来鼓舞部属。这些统帅通常率领长期在一起的小队,得以亲自培养士兵并与之结为友伴。他们锤炼身心,其中最优秀者剑术精进,箭术也精准得出奇。"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:4
msgid "Prince"
msgstr "王子"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L3.cfg:22
msgid ""
"The most talented captains undergo extensive training in various military "
"styles, including those of the elves and orcs. Well seasoned in the art of "
"war, they are unorthodox but brilliant strategists who can direct even the "
"freshest recruits to strike strategically against imposing odds and emerge "
"victorious. Outfitted in finely-made weapons and armor, these leaders are a "
"force to be reckoned with in both warfare and single combat."
msgstr "最有天赋的统帅会研习多种军事流派,包括精灵与兽人的兵法。久经战阵的他们在用兵之道上经验丰富,行军不拘一格却才华横溢,能指挥连新兵在内的部队,以奇制胜、以弱抗强。他们装备精良,无论是指挥战役还是单挑对决,都是不可小觑的力量。"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:4
msgid "Warrior Prince"
msgstr "战士王子"

#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Konrad_L4.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Princes bear one of the most esteemed titles in human society. Trained "
"rigorously in the combat arts even in times of peace, a prince in times of "
"war makes for an awe-inspiring sight on the battlefield. These royal "
"commanders have survived many trials by fire, proving both their tactical "
"wit and their considerable mettle at personal combat."
msgstr "王子是人类社会中最尊贵的头衔之一。即使在和平年代,他们也在武道修行上接受严苛训练,战时的王子在战场上更是威风凛凛。这些王室统帅历经无数次战火考验,证明了自己出众的战术头脑与强悍的个人武力。"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:64
msgid "female^Princess"
msgstr "公主"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:30
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess.cfg:88
msgid ""
"A noble by birth, the Princess has learnt swordplay with the greatest "
"generals and battle tactics with the greatest sages, making her both a great "
"combatant and a leader. The units of lower level around the Princess will "
"fight better due to her presence."
msgstr ""
"公主是天生的贵族。她师从于最伟大的将军们，学会了剑术，又从最伟大的贤者那里，"
"学会了战术。这让她成为了一位伟大的战士和领袖。由于公主的存在，在她身周的较低"
"等级的单位将能够更好地战斗。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Bound Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess_Bound.cfg:4
#| msgid "female^Princess"
msgid "female^Bound Princess"
msgstr "公主"

#. [unit_type]: id=Bound Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Princess_Bound.cfg:30
msgid ""
"Asheviere’s fearless princess now marches in chains, a prisoner of Konrad "
"and his rebels."
msgstr "艾什薇尔那无所畏惧的公主如今身陷枷锁,成了康拉德及其叛军的阶下囚。"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:4
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:103
#| msgid "female^Princess"
msgid "female^Warrior Princess"
msgstr "公主"

#. [variation]: race=human
#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior Princess, gender=female, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:29
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Lisar_Warrior_Princess.cfg:126
msgid ""
"A noble by birth, the Princess has learnt swordplay with the greatest "
"generals and battle tactics with the greatest sages, making her both a great "
"combatant and a leader. Now battle-hardened and strong of will, she can aid "
"those around her in the art of combat."
msgstr ""
"公主是天生的贵族。她师从于最伟大的将军们，学会了剑术，又从最伟大的贤者那里，"
"学会了战术。这让她成为了一位伟大的战士和领袖。现在，她历经无数战斗，磨练出了"
"坚强的意志，可以在作战中协助她身边的战友。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Shackled Mage, gender=male, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:7
msgid "Shackled Mage"
msgstr "镣铐法师"

#. [unit_type]: id=Shackled Mage, gender=male, race=human
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:15
msgid ""
"These mages have heavy manacles on their wrists and ankles, slowing their "
"movement and restricting their magic."
msgstr "这些法师的手腕与脚踝上锁着沉重的镣铐,既拖慢了行动,也束缚了魔力。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:26
msgid "kick"
msgstr "踢"

#. [female]: gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Mage_Shackled.cfg:35
msgid "female^Shackled Mage"
msgstr "镣铐法师"

#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior of Light, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:4
msgid "Warrior of Light"
msgstr "光明武士"

#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior of Light, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:21
msgid ""
"After years of experience, the most devout of warriors develop vast "
"spiritual powers. By strict devotion to the path of the light, they can call "
"upon its aid to chase away the shadows of the night."
msgstr "历经多年历练,最虔诚的战士会孕育出强大的灵力。凭借对光明之道的严格信奉,他们能召唤光明的助力,驱散夜幕的暗影。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Warrior of Light, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:23
msgid ""
"No matter how foul the pit from whence darkness crawls, there too will you "
"find these champions of light working tirelessly to cleanse evil from the "
"troubled world in which they live."
msgstr "无论黑暗自多污秽的深渊中爬出,你都会看到这些光明的斗士在那里不知疲倦地涤荡邪恶,守护他们身处其中的纷乱世界。"

#. [attack]: type=arcane
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_Warrior_of_Light.cfg:44
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:42
#| msgid "Fighter"
msgid "lightbeam"
msgstr "战士"

#. [unit_type]: id=White Warrior, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:4
msgid "White Warrior"
msgstr "白袍武士"

#. [unit_type]: id=White Warrior, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Not every white mage is content to merely wander the world, ministering to "
"sickness and injury. Magi of a more martial bent are often driven to seek "
"out villainy wherever it lies, delving into dark places and cleansing them "
"of evil."
msgstr "并非每一位白袍法师都满足于四处游荡、为人诊治伤病。性格偏于征战的法师往往主动去追寻邪恶的巢穴,深入黑暗之地,涤除其中的邪恶。"

#. [unit_type]: id=White Warrior, race=human, gender=male
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Human_Moremirmu_White_Warrior.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Armed with a blessed sword and channeling their light towards the mending of "
"their own wounds, such a warrior proves a potent ally against all things "
"unnatural."
msgstr "手持圣剑,并将光明灌注于自身以疗伤,这样的战士是抵御一切超自然事物的强大盟友。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Caravan, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Caravan.cfg:5
msgid "Caravan"
msgstr "商队"

#. [unit_type]: id=Caravan, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Caravan.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Caravans are used to carry gold or supplies across long distances. Because "
"of the immense weight of the cargo this caravan carries, it is not nimble, "
"but the driver can still try to drive off attackers with his whip."
msgstr "商队用于长途运送黄金或物资。由于所载货物极为沉重,这支商队行动迟缓,但赶车人仍可以皮鞭驱赶来犯者。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Caravan.cfg:29
msgid "whip"
msgstr "鞭"

#. [unit_type]: id=Granite Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Granite Golem"
msgstr "花岗岩魔像"

#. [unit_type]: id=Granite Golem, race=monster
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Golem.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Towering over the battlefield, these enormous earthen constructs represent "
"the pinnacle of elemental magic. Though painfully clumsy and impossible to "
"transport across long distances, their vast bulk renders them nigh-immune to "
"most forms of damage."
msgstr "矗立于战场之上,这些巨大的土石构造体代表了元素魔法的巅峰。尽管笨拙得令人心痛,更无法长途迁徙,但庞大的身躯使它们几乎免疫大多数伤害。"

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Golem.cfg:63
msgid "fist"
msgstr "拳"

#. [unit_type]: id=Quintain, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Quintain.cfg:4
msgid "Quintain"
msgstr "剑术假人"

#. [unit_type]: id=Quintain, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Quintain.cfg:15
msgid "Quintains are used to practice swordplay and jousting on."
msgstr "剑术假人用于练习剑术与马上枪术。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Wagon, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wagon.cfg:5
msgid "Wagon"
msgstr "马车"

#. [unit_type]: id=Wagon, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wagon.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Caravans are used to carry gold or supplies across long distances. This one "
"is laden only lightly with hay, instead concealing Konrad and his soldiers."
msgstr "商队用于长途运送黄金或物资。这一辆只载了少许干草,真正藏匿其中的,是康拉德和他的士兵。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Cave Wall, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wall.cfg:5
msgid "Cave Wall"
msgstr "洞壁"

#. [unit_type]: id=Cave Wall, race=mechanical
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Mechanical_Wall.cfg:17
msgid ""
"A crudely hewn cave wall, weakened by recent cave-ins. Experience gathered "
"from mining is of little use on the battlefield."
msgstr "一堵粗凿的洞壁,近来因塌方而变得脆弱。采矿经验在战场上用处不大。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Gryphlet, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Gryphlet.cfg:4
#| msgid "Gryphons"
msgid "Gryphlet"
msgstr "狮鹫"

#. [unit_type]: id=Gryphlet, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Gryphlet.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Juvenile gryphon are covered with white and gray feathers, softer and more "
"luxurious than those of their adult relatives. By the time they learn to "
"fly, most have already grown larger than a wolf, and are more than capable "
"of defending their nests from intruders."
msgstr "幼年狮鹫覆着白色与灰色的羽毛,比成年近亲的羽毛更柔软、更丰盈。等它们学会飞翔时,大多数已长得比狼还大,完全有能力抵御来犯者、保卫巢穴。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Sleeping Gryphon, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Sleeping_Gryphon.cfg:4
msgid "Sleeping Gryphon"
msgstr "沉睡狮鹫"

#. [unit_type]: id=Sleeping Gryphon, race=gryphon
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Monster_Sleeping_Gryphon.cfg:20
msgid "Shhhh! The gryphon is sleeping! You’d better not wake it up!"
msgstr "嘘！这只狮鹫睡着了！您最好还是不要吵醒它！"

#. [unit_type]: id=Barrow Wight, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:4
msgid "Barrow Wight"
msgstr "墓冢怨灵"

#. [unit_type]: id=Barrow Wight, race=undead
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Perpetually haunted by the fading memory of its former life, a Barrow Wight "
"wanders aimlessly in a delirium of darkness and despair. Their chill essence "
"is shrouded behind cloak and bone, shielding them from most magic."
msgstr "萦绕着前生记忆的余烬,墓冢怨灵终日在黑暗与绝望的谵妄中漫无目的地游荡。它们冰冷的气息被斗篷与骨骼遮蔽,因此大多数魔法对其无效。"

#. [resistance]: id=shroud
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:33
msgid "shroud"
msgstr "遮蔽"

#. [resistance]: id=shroud
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Horse_Barrow_Wight.cfg:34
msgid "While defending, this unit has 50% fire and arcane resistance."
msgstr "防御时,此单位拥有 50% 的火系与奥术抗性。"

#. [unit_type]: id=Vampire Lady, gender=female, race=undead, description=
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Vampire_Lady.cfg:4
msgid "female^Vampire Lady"
msgstr "吸血妖女"

#. [attack]: type=blade
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/units/Undead_Vampire_Lady.cfg:27
msgid "blood kiss"
msgstr "血之亲吻"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:22
msgid "It is spring; the next scenario will have normal days and nights."
msgstr "时值春季;下一场景的昼夜长短正常。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:28
msgid "It is summer; the next scenario will have unusually long days."
msgstr "时值夏季;下一场景的白天将异常漫长。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:34
msgid "It is autumn; the next scenario will have normal days and nights."
msgstr "时值秋季;下一场景的昼夜长短正常。"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:40
msgid "It is winter; the next scenario will have unusually short days."
msgstr "时值冬季;下一场景的白天将异常短暂。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/bigmap.cfg:67
msgid ""
"This port has many small boats for us to use! I won’t be able to travel "
"through deep water, but I can certainly reach the coastal islands and reef."
msgstr "这个港口有许多小舟可供我们使用!我虽无法在深水中航行,但到达近海的岛屿和礁石肯定没问题。"

#. [time]: id=spring{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:176
msgid "Spring"
msgstr "春"

#. [time]: id=summer{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:188
msgid "Summer"
msgstr "夏"

#. [time]: id=autumn{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:201
msgid "Autumn"
msgstr "秋"

#. [time]: id=winter{NOWEATHER}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/schedule.cfg:213
msgid "Winter"
msgstr "冬"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:50
msgid ""
"I hope Delfador is well. We could have used his help in this battle, but I "
"know what he’s doing is important."
msgstr "希望德法多一切安好。这一战本可以用上他的帮助,但我知道他所做的事十分重要。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:54
msgid ""
"The attack on the Aethenwood was bad enough. Elensefar must surely be even "
"more fierce..."
msgstr "艾瑟森林遭袭已经够糟的了。伊伦斯法尔想必会更加凶险……"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:71
msgid ""
"I hope our rewards from this battle are worth the time we’re spending to "
"fight it. We may have plenty of time to roam the Great Continent right now, "
"but we won’t always. We should make every battle count."
msgstr "希望这场战役的回报对得起我们投入的时间。眼下我们也许有大把时间在大陆上游历,但不会一直如此。每一战都应有所收获。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:86
msgid "My hand tingles with power... Burn in the name of the kings of Wesnoth!"
msgstr "我的手掌里涌动着力量……以韦诺特诸王之名,燃烧吧!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:102
msgid ""
"I am glad to see that you have been taking good care of my familiar, Konrad. "
"Blackwing and I have been through many trials together."
msgstr "看到你把我的使魔照顾得这么好,我很欣慰,康拉德。黑翼和我一同经历过许多磨难。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:106
msgid ""
"Thank you for entrusting me with him! He has become a valuable member of our "
"team."
msgstr "谢谢你把它托付给我!它已经成为我们队伍中不可或缺的成员了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:119
msgid ""
"Seimus, I am glad that you still stand with us. I fear you would have gone "
"down a dark path had Konrad and I not come to Alduin that day."
msgstr "塞穆斯,我很欣慰你还与我们站在一起。我担心,若不是那天康拉德和我来到阿尔德温,你早就走上歧途了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:123
msgid ""
"Oh yes, don’t remind me. I’m trying not to think too much about all that."
msgstr "哦,是呀,别提醒我了。我尽量不去想那些事。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:141
msgid "Fool girl! You shall meet the same fate as did your brother!"
msgstr "愚蠢的丫头!你也步上你兄长后尘,落得同样的下场吧!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:162
msgid ""
"Lord Kalenz, I am grateful for your help. But when you made your journey to "
"come join me, could you not have brought an elvish army along with you? I "
"know you’re a powerful lord and greatly loved by your people."
msgstr "卡兰兹大人,我很感激你的援手。可你此番跋涉前来投奔我,难道不能带一支精灵大军同行吗?我知道你是位实力强大的领主,深受族人爱戴。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:166
msgid ""
"Even only a few elvish warriors could have made a great difference in our "
"quest! Your kin are many, and I know firsthand their great skill at sword "
"and bow."
msgstr "哪怕只是几名精灵战士,也足以给我们的征程带来巨大改变!你的族人众多,我亲眼见过他们高超的剑术与弓术。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:170
msgid ""
"Not so many as we once were, Konrad. And one elf alone can quietly travel "
"through human lands far easier than can an army or war-band."
msgstr "已不像从前那样多了,康拉德。而且单个精灵悄无声息地穿行于人类领地,要比一支军队或一支卫队容易得多。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. this is a hint that there's a special reward if you bringing Kalenz to Lintanir forest
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:175
msgid ""
"But should we ever make our way east back to my home in the Lintanir, my "
"subjects will certainly be ready to offer gold and supplies. Especially "
"after Asheviere’s crimes in the Aethenwood. A victory for you is a victory "
"for all elves."
msgstr "但若有一天我们东归林塔尼尔回到我的家乡,我的子民一定会慷慨提供黄金与补给。尤其是在艾什薇尔于艾瑟森林犯下那些罪行之后。你的胜利,便是所有精灵的胜利。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:189
msgid ""
"Kalenz, did you ever know my father? Delfador has told me many things about "
"Prince Arand, and Delfador’s regrets regarding him. I feel I would very much "
"have liked to have met him."
msgstr "卡兰兹,你认得我的父亲吗?德法多告诉过我许多关于阿兰德王子的事,还有他对其中的遗憾。我很想能有机会见过他。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz knows that Arand is not Konrad's father. Konrad does not. Technically, everything Kalenz says here is true.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:194
msgid ""
"Your father? No, I did not know your father, nor any of your family. "
"Delfador and I have spoken about your parentage, and there is nothing for me "
"to add."
msgstr "令尊?不,我不认识你的父亲,也不认识你们家的任何人。德法多和我谈起过你的身世,我没什么可补充的了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:213
msgid ""
"It is sad to see what Wesnoth has fallen to, Konrad. Do not make the same "
"mistakes as did my people."
msgstr "看到韦诺特沦落到这般田地,真令人悲哀,康拉德。别再重蹈我们族人的覆辙。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Konrad speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:218
msgid ""
"I know something of the history of the elves. Delfador says that you once "
"lived as if in a dream, untroubled by even the rumor of strife. That sounds "
"an envious life."
msgstr "我对精灵的历史略有所知。德法多说,你们曾经如活在梦境一般,连纷争的传闻都未曾惊扰。那倒真是令人艳羡的生活。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:224
msgid ""
"Indeed. But then man came. And with man came the orcs, chasing after the "
"very sceptre that your cousin now holds."
msgstr "确实。但后来人类来了。随着人类而来的还有兽人,他们追赶的,正是你堂兄弟如今握在手中的那根权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:230
msgid ""
"Indeed. But then man came. And with man came the orcs, chasing after that "
"very sceptre you now hold."
msgstr "确实。但后来人类来了。随着人类而来的还有兽人,他们追赶的,正是你如今握在手中的那根权杖。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:236
msgid ""
"In those days we fought battles great and terrible. Armies of elves marched "
"across the open plain to make war, first against the orcs, then against each "
"other. Now so few of us remain."
msgstr "在那些年月里,我们打过许多伟大而惨烈的战役。精灵大军穿过开阔的原野征伐,先是对抗兽人,而后互相攻伐。如今,留存者已寥寥无几。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:242
msgid ""
"The Aethenwood is younger; I am glad that many of their number walk with "
"you, Konrad. But some scars do not heal. I hope your civil war will end "
"better than did mine."
msgstr "艾瑟森林的历史要短一些;我很高兴他们中许多人都与你并肩同行,康拉德。但有些伤痕无法愈合。希望你的内战能比我的那场内战收尾得更好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. Kalenz speaks about the events of LoW
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:248
msgid ""
"The Aethenwood is younger; I am glad that you were raised among them, "
"Konrad. But some scars do not heal. I hope your civil war will end better "
"than did mine."
msgstr "艾瑟森林的历史要短一些;我很高兴你能在他们中间长大,康拉德。但有些伤痕无法愈合。希望你的内战能比我的那场内战收尾得更好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador and Chantal first met in The Deceiver's Gambit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:266
msgid ""
"Chantal, it has been a long time since we first met in the Lintanir. I have "
"grown old. You are as young as ever."
msgstr "香颂,自我们当年在林塔尼尔初次相见以来,已经过去很久了。我老了,你却依然青春如故。"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:270
msgid ""
"I am young in body, at least. Do I detect a hint of jealousy in the voice of "
"Delfador the Great? Hah — I am glad to have your company once again."
msgstr "至少我的身体还很年轻。我怎么听得出大法师德法多的话语里有一丝嫉妒?哈哈——我很高兴能再次与你同行。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:274
msgid ""
"Jealousy? Banish the thought. It is good to travel with you as well. I am "
"sure you will enjoy getting to know our lively band of warriors."
msgstr "嫉妒?收起这种念头。能与你同行也是好事。我相信你会喜欢我们这群生龙活虎的战士的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:290
msgid ""
"Haldiel, you fought in Garard’s war against the orcs. Did you know my father?"
msgstr "哈迪艾尔,你参加了伽拉德对兽人的战争。你认得我的父亲吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Haldiel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:294
msgid "Prince Arand? No, I was a member of King Garard’s Royal Cavalry."
msgstr "阿兰德王子?不,我是伽拉德国王的皇家骑兵之一。"

#. [message]: speaker=Haldiel
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:298
msgid ""
"I was but a young man when your father fell, barely come of age. Garard "
"bestowed much favor upon the Horse Clans, but only so long as we trained "
"ever-greater numbers of young men for his cavalry."
msgstr "令尊战死时,我还只是个血气方刚的年轻人,刚刚成年。伽拉德曾给马部族很多恩惠,但前提是我们源源不断地为他训练越来越多的年轻骑兵。"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:317
msgid "Sir Kaylan sends his regards, Lords of the Clans."
msgstr "凯兰大人让我向各位部族领主致意。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:321
msgid ""
"We do not send ours. Kaylan defies the will of the Horse Clans by supporting "
"the upstart prince. What of his duty to his kin?"
msgstr "我们可不会派出人手。凯兰支持那位新崛起的王子,是在违抗马部族的意志。他对部族亲人的责任呢?"

#. [message]: id=Haldiel,Simyr
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:325
msgid ""
"What of justice for Garard? What of our honor? Once, the Clans stood for "
"those ideals. How far you have fallen."
msgstr "那伽拉德的公道何在?我们的荣誉何在?曾经,部族正是为这些理想而战。你堕落到了何等地步。"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:329
msgid "Bah! Impudence! We have nothing more to speak about."
msgstr "哼!大逆不道!我们没什么好谈的了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:349
msgid ""
"I’m grateful for your commitment, Elrian. Few are accepted into Alduin, and "
"even fewer choose to leave it. You gave up everything to fight alongside me."
msgstr "埃尔瑞安,感谢你的坚定承诺。能被阿尔德温录取的人很少,主动离开的更是少之又少。你放弃了一切,与我并肩作战。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#. this is a hint that there's a special event if Konrad brings Elrian to Tath
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:357
msgid ""
"To be honest, studying magic was more my family’s dream than mine. My "
"grandparents are “new money”; wealthy merchants from the east side of Tath. "
"(As an aside — we should visit them if we’re ever in the area.)"
msgstr "说实话,研习魔法更多是我家人的梦想,而不是我自己的梦想。我的祖父母是“新贵”——塔斯城东边的富商。(对了——要是哪天我们经过那片地方,应该去拜访他们一下。)"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:363
msgid ""
"To be honest, studying magic was more my family’s dream than mine. My "
"grandparents are “new money”; wealthy merchants from the east side of Tath. "
"You’ve already been there and met them."
msgstr "说实话,研习魔法更多是我家人的梦想,而不是我自己的梦想。我的祖父母是“新贵”——塔斯城东边的富商。你去过那里,也见过他们了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:369
msgid ""
"They sent their eldest grandson — me — to Alduin in the hopes of building "
"connections and making inroads with Wesnoth’s more established elites. I "
"suppose that hasn’t really worked out, seeing as I’m now a rebel and all."
msgstr "他们把长孙——也就是我——送到阿尔德温,希望借此建立人脉,打入韦诺特更成熟的精英圈子。我想这事多半没成,毕竟我现在都成反叛军头子了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:386
msgid ""
"That “Provost Seimus” we fought at Alduin seemed like a powerful mage. It’s "
"a shame he decided to side with Asheviere instead of joining us as you did, "
"Elrian."
msgstr "我们在阿尔德温交手的那个“院长塞穆斯”,看起来像是位强大的法师。可惜他选择站在艾什薇尔一边,而没有像埃尔瑞安那样加入我们。"

#. [message]: speaker=Elrian
#. this is a hint that Konrad can recruit Seimus if he brings Delfador to speak with him. That can't happen in this playthrough anymore; only on a future playthrough.
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:391
msgid ""
"I think Seimus is a good man, deep down. But he’s convinced himself that the "
"only way Alduin can survive is by bending the knee. It would probably take a "
"talking-to from Delfador himself to convince him otherwise..."
msgstr "我想塞穆斯骨子里是个好人。但他已自我说服,唯有屈膝臣服才是阿尔德温的活路。恐怕非得德法多亲自出马说教一番,才能让他改变想法……"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:407
msgid ""
"Hello Seimus, my old master. I’ll bet you regret expelling me now, don’t you!"
msgstr "你好啊,塞穆斯,我的旧日导师。我打赌你现在一定后悔当初把我赶出去了,对不对!"

#. [message]: speaker=Seimus
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:411
msgid ""
"Err, are you— who are you again? Many aspire to join the ranks of the magi, "
"but few have the skill."
msgstr "呃,你是……我怎么把你给忘了?想加入法师行列的人很多,但少有具备这份天赋的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:434
msgid ""
"Moremirmu, I’ve met White Mages before, but never someone quite like you. "
"Where do you hail from?"
msgstr "莫里姆,我从前也见过白袍法师,但从没见过你这样的一位。你来自哪里?"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#. this is a hint that there's a special event for bringing Moremirmu to the monastery in the Gryphon Mountains
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:439
msgid ""
"From the great monastery of the seal, good Konrad! It is by the grace of the "
"Light that I was rescued and raised there, high in the Gryphon Mountains. We "
"ought to visit there someday."
msgstr "康拉德,你好!我来自封印修道院那座伟大的学院!多亏了光明的恩佑,我在那里获救并长大,就在高高在上的狮鹫山。我们哪天应该去那里走一趟。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:443
msgid ""
"Now, I have taken up the sword and ventured forth in search of evil to "
"smite. And lo! You and I united, and lo! Now we quest together against the "
"evils of Asheviere."
msgstr "如今,我已重拾长剑,踏上征途,四处搜寻邪恶、将其诛灭。看哪!你我走到了一起,看哪!如今我们并肩讨伐艾什薇尔的邪恶。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:459
msgid ""
"What strange magic you wield, Kalenz. It is light, yet it is not of the "
"Light! What manner of unhallowed spells do you weave?"
msgstr "你施展的竟是何等奇异的魔法,卡兰兹!它是光,却不是光明之光!你究竟在编织什么不祥的咒术?"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:463
msgid ""
"This is magic of the faerie. It is similar in some ways to your Light, but "
"it is natural to the elves. Few are the male elves permitted to learn it. "
"And no outsiders, for it is an art inherited only by my kind."
msgstr "这是精灵的魔法。它在某些方面与你们的光明相似,但对精灵来说,它是天生之物。很少有雄性精灵被允许研习它。更不用说外人了,因为这是只有我们一族才能传承的技艺。"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. this is a reference to the events of LoW, where Kalenz gained his magic after drinking an invisibility potion brewed by Crelanu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:468
msgid ""
"Although I gained my magic in a different manner than do most of my kind, it "
"is now as much a part of me as is my blood."
msgstr "虽说我获得魔法的方式与多数同类不同,但如今它已如同我的血液一般,是我身体的一部分。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:481
msgid ""
"You wield your lightning with a nigh-supernatural skill, Delfador. Truly you "
"have been blessed by the Light."
msgstr "你运用闪电的技巧几近出神入化,德法多。你当真蒙受了光明的恩佑。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:485
msgid ""
"But what of your skill with the sword? Our foes are not content to loiter at "
"a distance and await their destruction. Enemies of evil must stand ready to "
"fight with steel!"
msgstr "可你的剑术又如何呢?我们的敌人可不会满足于远远徘徊、坐等灭亡。邪恶的敌人必须时刻准备好用钢铁应战!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:490
msgid ""
"I need little strength of body, Moremirmu, for I wield the magical flaming "
"sword of the Lintanir. A mighty boon, and one I am well grateful for."
msgstr "我需要的体力不多,莫里姆,因为我挥动的是林塔尼尔的魔法烈焰之剑。那是莫大的福祉,我深怀感激。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:495
msgid ""
"I am an old man, Moremirmu. My magic serves me where my body has failed. I "
"shall trust in you, Konrad, and our allies to carry the steel."
msgstr "我是个老头子,莫里姆。身体不行了,但我的魔法还在。康拉德,我把剑与钢铁的担当,托付给你和我们的盟友吧。"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:514
msgid ""
"Accede not your souls to the unclean, my fellow warriors! We shall cleanse "
"these dead in holy fire!"
msgstr "别让你们宝贵的灵魂堕入污秽,我的战友同胞们!我们将用圣火净化这些亡魂!"

#. [message]: speaker=Moremirmu
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:533
msgid ""
"You have turned from the Light, men of Wesnoth! Hark to my words! Atone for "
"your crimes! Return to the Light, or soon shall come the black soot over "
"Weldyn and the death of all men!"
msgstr "你们背离了光明,韦诺特的人们啊!听我的忠告!为你们的罪行赎罪吧!重返光明,否则黑烟将很快笼罩维尔帝,所有人都会死去!"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#. Harper and Konrad discuss the events of Liberty
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:552
msgid ""
"Konrad, how come you never asked me just how we all came to live on the "
"Three Sisters? It be a powerful story, an’ one that matters for how you’re "
"fightin’ Asheviere too! I’ve been excited to tell you!"
msgstr "康拉德,你咋就没问过我,咱们大伙儿是怎么落到三姐妹岛上住下的呢?那可是个了不得的故事,而且跟你怎么对付艾什薇尔也有关系!我可惦记着讲给你听好久了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#. Harper and Konrad discuss the events of Liberty
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:557
msgid ""
"Oh, the others already explained it to me! Asheviere took over, you ran from "
"your homes, destroyed Halstead, and ended up on the islands. Just like that, "
"right?"
msgstr "噢,别人都已经告诉我了!艾什薇尔篡了权,你们逃出了家园,哈尔斯特德被毁,最后跑到了三姐妹岛上。是这样没错吧?"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:561
msgid ""
"... err, but you can still tell me again. Your parts especially, Harper! I’d "
"always be happy to listen."
msgstr "……呃,不过你可以再给我讲讲。尤其是你那部分,哈珀!我永远乐意听。"

#. [message]: speaker=Somf
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:574
msgid ""
"You ne’er seemed one for princes or kings, Harper. We fought pretty hard t’ "
"get away from th’ queen. Why’re you fightin’ for this “Konrad” now, an’ "
"draggin’ me into it too?"
msgstr "你从来就不是那种会为王子或国王卖命的人,哈珀。我们拼命才摆脱了那位女王,怎么现在又为这个“康拉德”打仗,还把我拖下水了?"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:578
msgid ""
"We never fought just to get away. Baldras fought fer a better life fer all "
"of us, an’ fer everyone!"
msgstr "我们战斗从来都不只是为了逃命。巴德拉斯是为了我们所有人、为了每一个人的美好生活而战!"

#. [message]: speaker=Harper
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:582
msgid ""
"Konrad’s a good person. He wants what’s best fer everyone too. And he saved "
"my life from a lich! That’s gotta be worth somethin’."
msgstr "康拉德是个好人。他为大家着想的,想给每个人最好的。而且他还把我从一个巫妖手里救了回来!光这一点就值不少了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. stay in your graves, you rotting heaps of bones
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:603
msgid "Stay in yer graves, ye rottin’ heaps o’ bones!"
msgstr "给我滚回坟墓里去,你们这堆烂骨头!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. ah, insulting these dead ones is just no fun. They can't understand me...
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:610
msgid ""
"Ah, insultin’ these dead’uns is jus’ no fun. They cannae understand me..."
msgstr "唉,骂这些死人了半天,一点也不解气。它们又听不懂我的……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. And stay down!
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:629
msgid "An’ stay down!"
msgstr "给我趴下!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:641
msgid ""
"Ulfdain, how did you find yourself in Wesnoth? Delfador always told me that "
"the dwarves preferred to keep their own company in Knalga, except for their "
"human friends at the Doors."
msgstr "乌尔夫戴恩,你怎么会来到韦诺特的?德法多总跟我说,矮人们更喜欢留在纳尔迦与同伴为伍,除了驻守在矮人之门的那些人类朋友。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:645
msgid ""
"Aye, tha’s true. Not the most outgoin’ o’ folks, we dwarves ain’t. Heads "
"harder than a’ troll’s half th’ time, and more stubborn too! But t’ tell ye "
"the truth, there ain’t much hope left in Knalga, least not that I’ve heard "
"about."
msgstr "是啊,没错。我们矮人可不是最外向的种族,脑瓜比巨魔还硬上一半,还更固执!但说实话,纳尔迦已经没什么希望了,至少据我所知是这样。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:649
msgid ""
"Ah’m ashamed to admit it, Konrad, but I left. An Ulfserker ain’t afeared o’ "
"no troll or orc, but watchin’ my home slowly fall to pieces around me? My "
"friends dyin’ one by one? I fled our dyin’ home in search o’ a better life "
"elsewhere."
msgstr "我不忍心对你说,康拉德,但我确实离开了。乌尔弗雷克不怕什么巨魔或兽人,可看着我的家园在眼前一点点崩塌?看着朋友们一个接一个死去?我逃离了那座垂死的家园,去别处寻找更好的生活。"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:653
msgid ""
"An ye see how that ended up. A great galumphing gallow-fool I’ve been. If ye "
"hadn’t helped me miners and I when ye did..."
msgstr "你自己也看到了,事情闹成了什么样子。我真是个大傻帽,一头的莽夫。要不是你们当时帮我和我的矿工们……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:666
msgid ""
"This fight’s good an’ all, but when’re we getting t’ Weldyn? Ah cannae wait "
"to show tha’ dew-beatin’ gobermouch excuse for a queen exactly what I think "
"o’ her!"
msgstr "这场仗打得不错,但我们什么时候能到维尔帝?我恨不得现在就让那个泥腿子、满嘴喷粪的女王见识见识我是怎么看待她的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:671
msgid ""
"We shall find ourselves in Weldyn sooner rather than later, I suspect. We "
"have come a long way together since you first joined us, Ulfdain — now even "
"the princess is on our side!"
msgstr "我想用不了多久,我们就会抵达维尔帝。自从你第一次加入我们,我们已共同走过漫长的路途,乌尔夫戴恩——如今连公主都站在我们这边了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:676
msgid ""
"I appreciate the enthusiasm, but we’re in no state to confront Asheviere "
"anytime soon! For now we should focus on surviving and building up our "
"strength."
msgstr "你的热情我心领了,但眼下我们根本没有实力和艾什薇尔正面交锋!眼下我们应该专注于活下去,积蓄力量。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:693
msgid ""
"You are an alchemist, Jeniver? That is a brave choice, for your craft is not "
"looked kindly upon by Alduin. There are some who think it hogwash and "
"superstition."
msgstr "你是一名炼金术士,珍妮弗?那可真是勇敢的选择,因为你的这门手艺并不受奥德温的待见。有些人认为那不过是胡说八道和迷信罢了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:697
msgid ""
"Superstition?! No, no, no! That’s a common misconception, born of— of— dumb "
"ignorance! Alchemy is just— it’s the future! There’s so much for us to "
"learn, it’s—"
msgstr "迷信?!不不不!那是常见的误解,源于——源于——无知的蒙昧!炼金术就是——就是未来!还有那么多东西等着我们去学,它——"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:701
msgid ""
"No offense meant, my lady. Perhaps we can discuss your studies in more depth "
"at another time."
msgstr "无意冒犯,女士。或许改天我们可以更深入地谈谈你的研究。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:731
msgid ""
"Oh! Is that another giant spider? I could use some more spider poison, err, "
"venom — I suppose it’s not really poison — for my blowdarts. Can you kill "
"one for me?"
msgstr "噢!又是一只巨型蜘蛛?我的毒吹箭还需要一些蜘蛛毒,呃,毒液——应该不能叫毒——能帮我杀一只吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:739
msgid "Wonderful, the spider is dead! Just, ah, just give me a moment here..."
msgstr "太好了,蜘蛛死了!就,呃,容我缓一下……"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:821
msgid "Improved Blowgun"
msgstr "强化吹箭"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:822
msgid "Jeniver’s “<i>blowgun</i>” attack can now be used twice each turn!"
msgstr "珍妮弗的“<i>吹箭</i>”攻击现在每回合可以使用两次了!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:842
msgid "Improved Flashpowder"
msgstr "强化闪光火药"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:843
msgid "Jeniver’s “<i>flashpowder</i>” attack can now be used twice each turn!"
msgstr "珍妮弗的“<i>闪光火药</i>”攻击现在每回合可以使用两次了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:860
msgid ""
"Konrad, I had no idea you had a troll with you! What was his name? Dosh? "
"Dosh, CAN. YOU. UNDERSTAND. ME?"
msgstr "康拉德,我完全不知道你还带着一只巨魔!它叫什么名字?多什?多什,你、听、得、懂、我、说、话、吗?"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:864
msgid "Dere sometin’ wrong wit’ your head, girl? You talkin’ real funny."
msgstr "小姑娘,你脑袋是不是出了什么问题?你说话怪怪的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:868
msgid ""
"Oh! Oh, well then, Dosh, can I trouble you for a few pieces of your flesh? "
"It’ll grow back, I’m sure. I have this, err, theory I want to try with "
"regeneration, you see..."
msgstr "噢!噢,那么,多什,能不能麻烦你切几块你的肉给我?肯定会长回来的,我敢肯定。我有个,呃,关于再生的理论想验证一下,你懂的……"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:872
msgid ""
"You want some pieces of Dosh? Dere definitely sometin’ wrong wit’ your head. "
"But okay. Here you go."
msgstr "你想要多什的几块肉?你脑袋肯定是坏掉了。不过行吧,拿去。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:896
msgid ""
"Oh, a troll! Err, Konrad, you know, they say trolls have amazing powers of "
"regeneration... in fact, I have something of a theory about the curative "
"properties of troll-flesh..."
msgstr "噢,一只巨魔!呃,康拉德,你知道吗,人们都说巨魔有惊人的再生能力……事实上,我正好有个关于巨魔血肉药用价值的理论……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:907
msgid ""
"The troll’s dead? Oh, wonderful— yes, yes there’s something I’ve been "
"meaning to try with regeneration..."
msgstr "巨魔死了?噢,太好了——对了对了,我正想找个机会试试再生……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:922
msgid ""
"Mix with one vial of frostbone... infusion of boar... heat over an open "
"flame..."
msgstr "加上一小瓶霜骨……野猪浸剂……在明火上加热……"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:935
msgid "Oh! Oh Light, that’s foul! That stings! It blew up in my face!"
msgstr "哎呀!光明啊,好恶心!好疼!它在我脸上炸开了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:939
msgid ""
"I was— well, I was <b><i>trying</i></b> to unlock the secrets of the rapid "
"curation of venoms; the curing of poison and bolstering of the body and so-"
"on. But trollish regeneration seems, err, well— incompatible with my methods."
msgstr "我——嗯,我<b><i>正在尝试</i></b>揭开快速解毒的秘密;中和毒素、强健体魄之类。可巨魔的再生能力似乎,呃,嗯——和我的研究路子不太兼容。"

#. [message]: speaker=Jeniver
#. this is a hint that Jeniver will get a bonus if you bring her to Underground Channels (with Woses)
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:944
msgid ""
"Although, if you could someday find some other species of regenerating "
"creature for me to take a sample of..."
msgstr "不过,如果哪天你能帮我找到另一种会再生的生物,让我取个样本……"

#. [message]: speaker=Ulfdain
#. "from below" implying that dwarves believe that they end up in some underworld after death
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:974
msgid ""
"Ah can’t believe yer expecting me to fight side-by-side with some half-wit, "
"bog-handed, mumblecrest o’ a troll, Konrad. I kin feel my ancestors laughin’ "
"at me from below!"
msgstr "我真不敢相信,康拉德,你居然指望我跟一个半吊子、泥手爪、哼哧喘气的巨魔并肩作战。我都快能感觉到祖先在地下嘲笑我了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:978
msgid ""
"Hey, who you calling... uhh... thing. Not like Dosh been killin’ hundred "
"dwarves or nothin’ like that."
msgstr "嘿,你叫谁……呃……东西呢?又没听说多什杀过一百个矮人什么的。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:982
msgid ""
"Dosh only ever kill two, small ones, an’ dey not even fight back. Dwarves "
"not hard to kill. You probably not hard either."
msgstr "多什只杀过两个,都是小的,而且还不会还手。杀矮人并不容易。你大概也不容易。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:986
msgid ""
"Enough, both of you! Behave, or you’ll find yourselves needing to fight me, "
"too."
msgstr "够了,你两个都给我收敛点!再这样,我可就要跟你们两个都动刀了。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:999
msgid ""
"I am not well-accustomed to fighting alongside trolls, Dosh. In the past I "
"have fought against your kind instead. I hope there will be no tension "
"between us."
msgstr "说实话,多什,我并不习惯和巨魔并肩作战。过去我反而是站在你们的对立面。希望我们之间不会有什么矛盾。"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1003
msgid ""
"Nah, Dosh excited to be fightin’ with Delfador. Da orcs and trolls all be "
"telling stories about all da big battles you fought back when. Now soon dey "
"telling stories about Dosh too!"
msgstr "不,多什很兴奋能和德法多一起战斗。那些兽人和巨魔都在讲古,讲你当年打过的所有大战。很快他们也会讲多什的故事了!"

#. [message]: speaker=Dosh
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1018
msgid "You bad troll, bad! Bad trolls be getting hit with big sticks!"
msgstr "你这只坏巨魔,坏!坏巨魔是要被大棍子打的!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1035
msgid ""
"I never thought I’d be fighting alongside the very wizard who killed my "
"brother. I never had a chance to meet him. Thanks to you."
msgstr "我从没想过自己竟要与亲手杀了我哥哥的那位法师并肩作战。我连他长什么样都没见过——这可都多亏了你。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1039
msgid ""
"You never had a chance to meet your father, either. I think Garard would be "
"proud of you. You have his skill with the sword."
msgstr "你同样也没能有机会认识你的父亲。我想伽拉德会为你感到骄傲,你继承了他在剑术上的才华。"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1043
msgid ""
"But as for your brother... I have no doubt that Asheviere puffed Eldred up "
"with flattery and lies, but it was his hand and his hand alone that slew the "
"old king. Your brother sealed his own fate that day, Li’sar."
msgstr "至于你哥哥……艾什薇尔用谄媚和谎言把埃尔德雷德吹得膨胀起来,我毫不怀疑;但杀掉老国王的,是他一只手,也只有他一只手。那一天,你的哥哥就注定了自己的命运,莉莎。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1047
msgid ""
"Save your breath. You’re not making this any easier. Let’s just do what "
"needs to be done."
msgstr "省省吧。你这番话并不会让事情变容易。我们照章办事就好。"

#. [message]: speaker=Lisar
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1062
msgid "A powerful magic awakens in my hands. Behold the Sceptre of Fire!"
msgstr "强大的魔力在我手中苏醒。看啊,火焰权杖!"

#. [message]: id=$defector1.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1177
#| msgid "The Sceptre of Fire"
msgid "Is that... the Sceptre of Fire?! Ye gods, it’s real!"
msgstr "圣火权杖"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1184
msgid "The legends are true! The true queen has come!"
msgstr "传说成真了!真正的女王驾临!"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1185
#| msgid "Greetings, young master. I pledge myself to your service."
msgid "Spare me, madam, and I will pledge myself into your service!"
msgstr "幸会，年轻的主人。我发誓效忠于您。"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1187
msgid "The legends are true! The true king has come!"
msgstr "传说成真了!真正的国王驾临!"

#. [then]
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1188
#| msgid "Greetings, young master. I pledge myself to your service."
msgid "Spare me, sir, and I will pledge myself into your service!"
msgstr "幸会，年轻的主人。我发誓效忠于您。"

#. [message]: id=$defector2.id
#. [message]: id=$defector1.id
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1206
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/smalltalk.cfg:1211
msgid "And I!"
msgstr "还有我!"

#. [dummy]: id=exacting
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:9
msgid "exacting"
msgstr "严苛的"

#. [dummy]: id=exacting
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:10
msgid ""
"Li’sar has drilled her infantry to perfection. Though few in number, each of "
"her soldiers possesses skills not usually seen on others of their type."
msgstr "莉莎把她的步兵训练得炉火纯青。虽说人数不多,但她的每名士兵都拥有同兵种中少见的特殊能力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:62
msgid ""
"I studied Li’sar back in the Aethenwood. Though her personal company is not "
"large in number, they are exactingly trained — each of them possesses one "
"ability not usually seen on others of their type."
msgstr "我早在艾瑟森林就研究过莉莎了。虽说她的亲卫队人数不多,但训练得极为严苛——他们每个人都拥有一项同兵种中少见的特殊能力。"

#. [message]: speaker=Konrad {KONRAD_VARIATION mad}
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:77
msgid ""
"Look there: one of Li’sar’s personal company! I studied them back in the "
"Aethenwood. Though not large in number, they are exactingly trained — each "
"of them possesses one ability not usually seen on others of their type."
msgstr "瞧那边:那是莉莎的亲卫队之一!我早在艾瑟森林就研究过他们了。虽说人数不多,但训练得极为严苛——他们每个人都拥有一项同兵种中少见的特殊能力。"

#. [dummy]: id=rejuvenate
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:92
msgid "rejuvenates"
msgstr "回春"

#. [dummy]: id=rejuvenate
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:93
msgid ""
"This unit will heal itself and adjacent allied units for 4 HP each turn. "
"This ability cannot cure poison, however, only delay its effect."
msgstr "该单位每回合为自己及相邻的友军回复4点生命值。不过此能力无法治愈中毒,只能延缓其发作。"

#. [dummy]: id=smite
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:160
msgid "smite"
msgstr "制裁"

#. [dummy]: id=smite
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:161
msgid ""
"Each time this unit strikes a finishing blow, it deals 30 arcane damage to "
"adjacent enemies."
msgstr "该单位每完成一次致命一击,都会对相邻的敌人造成30点神秘伤害。"

#. [object]: id=sceptre_of_fire, type=fire, type=fire, type=fire, type=fire
#: data/campaigns/Heir_To_The_Throne/utils/specials_and_abilities.cfg:197
msgid ""
"Forged by the dwarves of Knalga at the behest of King Haldric II, the magic "
"at the heart of this sceptre dates as far back as the mysterious Old "
"Continent. Among its many powers is the ability to hurl fireballs of great "
"size."
msgstr "这根权杖由纳尔迦的矮人根据国王哈德里克二世的吩咐锻造,其中的魔法可追溯到神秘而古老的旧大陆。它的众多能力之一,便是能投掷硕大的火球。"

